ntext","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#常用命令","content":"`/ps`","locale":"zh-CN"},"47":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-45","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#常用命令","content":"列出当前会话的后台终端","locale":"zh-CN"},"48":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-46","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#常用命令","content":"`/stop`","locale":"zh-CN"},"49":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-47","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#常用命令","content":"停止并清理当前会话的后台终端","locale":"zh-CN"},"50":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-48","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#常用命令","content":"可用键盘在候选项中选择命令。未知命令和不支持的参数会显示错误。如果要发送一条以路径开头的单行消息，在路径前写一句说明，例如“请检查 /tmp/result.txt”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"51":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-49","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#模型和推理强度","content":"`/providers` 打开提供方列表，`/providers policy` 直接进入默认模型设置。`/role` 可以为当前空闲会话选择角色。要让另一个模型提供意见，先通过 `/advisor-settings` 配置顾问，再用 `/advisor` 在当前会话启用、`/advisor-off` 停用。`/advisor-manual 问题` 发起一次咨询，`/advisor-stats` 显示已保留的反馈统计。","locale":"zh-CN"},"52":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-50","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#模型和推理强度","content":"`/model` 与输入框旁的模型按钮打开同一个选择器。选择器会查询所有已启用 Provider，并分别显示加载错误；目录中没有目标模型时可以输入自定义模型 ID。","locale":"zh-CN"},"53":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-51","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#模型和推理强度","content":"`/effort` 打开当前会话的推理强度选择面板。在 Responses 会话中可以恢复默认、选择预设或输入自定义档位。其他协议的默认配置见提供商与模型。使用选择面板前先等会话空闲。","locale":"zh-CN"},"54":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-52","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#查看状态","content":"执行 `/status` 可以查看：","locale":"zh-CN"},"55":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-53","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#查看状态","content":"当前会话标识。","locale":"zh-CN"},"56":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-54","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#查看状态","content":"已消耗与剩余的上下文比例；Provider 未报告时可能显示未知。","locale":"zh-CN"},"57":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-55","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#查看状态","content":"输入、输出和总 Token 用量，以及数据来自 Provider 报告还是估算。","locale":"zh-CN"},"58":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-56","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#查看状态","content":"当前轮次和累计工作时长。","locale":"zh-CN"},"59":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-57","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#查看状态","content":"长会话已经经过的上下文窗口与压缩信息。","locale":"zh-CN"},"60":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-58","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#查看状态","content":"这些数据用于判断是否需要拆分任务或压缩上下文，不代表账单金额；实际计费仍以模型服务商为准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"61":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-59","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#自动和手动压缩","content":"启用自动压缩后，应用会在接近配置阈值或触发运行预算时整理发送给模型的历史。也可以在会话允许时执行 `/compact` 主动压缩。","locale":"zh-CN"},"62":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-60","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#自动和手动压缩","content":"压缩可能使用本地摘要或 Provider 声明支持的 Responses 远程压缩。实现方式由会话的模型协议和冻结能力决定，不会在运行中猜测服务端接口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"63":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-61","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#自动和手动压缩","content":"消息和工具记录仍保留在界面中；压缩改变的是下一次模型请求使用的上下文。多次压缩会逐渐概括较早内容，重要约束应在新消息中重新明确。","locale":"zh-CN"},"64":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-62","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#自动和手动压缩","content":"如果模型在输出任何内容前明确返回上下文不足，应用可以先压缩再重试；一旦已经产生输出，不会自动重放整轮请求，以免重复工具调用或外部操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"65":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-63","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#工作区审查和目标","content":"在 Git 工作区中，`/diff` 显示改动。`/review` 可以选择未提交的改动、相对于某分支的变化或指定提交，完成后在命令卡片查看审查结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"66":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-64","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#工作区审查和目标","content":"想并行尝试不同修改时，打开 `/worktree`，选择将会话分叉到新工作树。卡片还可打开现有工作树所关联的会话，或在确认后移除选定的工作树。","locale":"zh-CN"},"67":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-65","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#工作区审查和目标","content":"输入 `/goal 目标描述` 设置持续目标。需要限制用量时，例如输入 `/goal --tokens 50k 核对文档链接`。再次输入 `/goal` 可以查看、编辑、暂停、恢复或清除目标。替换尚未完成的目标前需要确认。","locale":"zh-CN"},"68":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-66","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#工作区审查和目标","content":"`/recap` 可以回顾会话进展。`/copy` 复制当前选中的文字，未选中文字时复制最近一条助手消息。`/raw` 查看可复制的文字记录，`/export` 可复制或保存 Markdown。","locale":"zh-CN"},"69":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-67","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#命令使用限制","content":"`/model`、`/effort` 和 `/fork` 需要当前会话空闲。","locale":"zh-CN"},"70":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-68","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#命令使用限制","content":"`/compact` 只在会话存在可压缩内容且没有冲突操作时可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"71":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-69","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#命令使用限制","content":"`/memories` 的“污染”状态不可切回启用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"72":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-70","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#命令使用限制","content":"`/ps` 和 `/stop` 只处理当前 Agent 会话的后台终端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"73":{"id":"/docs/agent-commands-context-71","page_id":"/docs/agent-commands-context","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-commands-context#命令使用限制","content":"`/mcp` 展示运行态；完整服务器配置仍在“设置 → Agent → MCP”中完成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"74":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","type":"page","content":"会话管理","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","Agent"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-conversations","locale":"zh-CN"},"75":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-0","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations","content":"新建、切换、归档、恢复、删除和分叉 Agent 会话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"76":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-1","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-conversations#新建和切换","content":"新建和切换","locale":"zh-CN"},"77":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-2","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-conversations#项目与工作区","content":"项目与工作区","locale":"zh-CN"},"78":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-3","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-conversations#侧聊与子代理","content":"侧聊与子代理","locale":"zh-CN"},"79":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-4","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-conversations#对话标题","content":"对话标题","locale":"zh-CN"},"80":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-5","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-conversations#归档和恢复","content":"归档和恢复","locale":"zh-CN"},"81":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-6","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-conversations#永久删除","content":"永久删除","locale":"zh-CN"},"82":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-7","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-conversations#分叉会话","content":"分叉会话","locale":"zh-CN"},"83":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-8","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-conversations#会话命令","content":"会话命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"84":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-9","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-conversations#会话配置的生效范围","content":"会话配置的生效范围","locale":"zh-CN"},"85":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-10","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations","content":"一个 Agent 会话保存消息、工具调用、审批、模型选择和上下文状态。切换页面或重新打开应用后，可以继续查看已经持久化的记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"86":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-11","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#新建和切换","content":"点击左侧会话列表顶部的“新建”，或执行 `/new` 创建会话。应用会根据当前界面附加相关上下文，并使用当时的默认模型策略和可用能力。","locale":"zh-CN"},"87":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-12","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#新建和切换","content":"会话列表会标记正在运行的会话和 Plan 模式会话。选择另一个会话不会自动停止当前任务；切换前应先确认是否仍有回答、压缩或后台终端在运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"88":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-13","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#新建和切换","content":"将左侧列表滚动到底部可自动加载更多会话。阅读长会话时，向上滚动到记录顶部会加载更早的消息。会话行的“…”菜单可收藏会话、查看其工作区、移动分组或重命名。","locale":"zh-CN"},"89":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-14","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#项目与工作区","content":"在侧栏选择“新建项目”，可以组合默认工作区、实例目录或自己选择的文件夹。第一项是主工作区。在项目中新建的对话使用创建时选定的这些目录。`/pwd` 显示当前工作目录；需要更改时，等会话空闲后用 `/cd` 选择目录，或输入 `/cd 路径`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"90":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-15","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#项目与工作区","content":"“移至项目…”只改变已有对话在侧栏的分组。修改项目的文件夹会作用于之后新建的对话。移除项目会将对话移回“最近”，已有对话保留各自的工作区和消息。","locale":"zh-CN"},"91":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-16","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#项目与工作区","content":"项目行的“…”菜单可以在项目内新建对话、置顶、编辑或归档项目。收起暂时不用的整个项目时，选择“归档项目”；之后在项目分组展开已归档项目即可恢复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"92":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-17","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#侧聊与子代理","content":"主对话已有消息后，可以用 `/side` 打开侧聊，或用 `/btw 问题` 直接提问。侧聊使用主对话的上下文，回答出现在自己的面板中；主对话可以继续运行。用 `/close` 关闭侧聊。要查看主代理委派的工作，使用 `/subagents` 切换到对应子代理的对话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"93":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-18","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#对话标题","content":"首条消息提交成功后，应用会立即根据消息显示一个短标题，并在后台请当前会话模型进一步精炼。标题生成不会向对话中添加消息或工具调用；如果生成失败，最初的短标题会继续保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"94":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-19","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#对话标题","content":"在会话行的“…”菜单中选择“重命名”。按 Enter 或点击勾选按钮保存，按 Escape 或点击取消按钮放弃修改。手动保存的标题具有最终优先级，不会被延迟返回的自动生成结果覆盖。标题随会话持久化，重启应用后仍会保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"95":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-20","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#归档和恢复","content":"归档用于隐藏暂时不用、但仍需要保留的会话：","locale":"zh-CN"},"96":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-21","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#归档和恢复","content":"归档不会删除消息、工具历史或记忆来源关系，也不会把仍在运行的后台进程视为已停止。","locale":"zh-CN"},"97":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-22","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#永久删除","content":"永久删除不可恢复。删除按钮需要再次确认，避免误触。","locale":"zh-CN"},"98":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-23","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#永久删除","content":"删除前先检查：","locale":"zh-CN"},"99":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-24","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#永久删除","content":"当前回答和压缩已经结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"100":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-25","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#永久删除","content":"`/ps` 不再显示该会话的后台终端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"101":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-26","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#永久删除","content":"不再需要其中的消息、工具输出或记忆来源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"102":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-27","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#永久删除","content":"没有依赖该会话历史的分叉关系或待清理资源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"103":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-28","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#永久删除","content":"如果进程清理或会话关系尚未满足要求，后端会拒绝删除并保留数据。应先处理提示中的清理义务，再重试；不要把删除失败理解为记录已经部分移除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"104":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-29","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#分叉会话","content":"分叉适合保留现有路线，同时从某个历史位置尝试另一种方案。","locale":"zh-CN"},"105":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-30","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#分叉会话","content":"操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"106":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-31","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#分叉会话","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"107":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-32","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#分叉会话","content":"`/fork`","locale":"zh-CN"},"108":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-33","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#分叉会话","content":"从当前已经提交的会话末端创建分叉","locale":"zh-CN"},"109":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-34","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#分叉会话","content":"编辑历史用户消息","locale":"zh-CN"},"110":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-35","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#分叉会话","content":"在该消息之前创建分叉，并把原消息恢复到输入框供修改","locale":"zh-CN"},"111":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-36","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#分叉会话","content":"分叉不会覆盖或改写原会话。编辑历史消息也不会立即提交新请求：先检查恢复到输入框的内容，再发送修改后的任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"112":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-37","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#分叉会话","content":"子会话可以复用分叉点之前的历史，但之后的消息分别保存。记忆贡献也按各自会话处理，子会话不会把父会话后续内容复制为自己的来源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"113":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-38","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#会话命令","content":"`/agents` 或 `/resume` 显示已归档的会话。知道会话编号时，`/resume 编号` 可直接切换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"114":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-39","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#会话命令","content":"`/rename 新名称` 重命名当前会话，`/archive` 归档它。`/delete` 需要确认后才会永久删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"115":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-40","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#会话命令","content":"`/clear` 清空面板当前显示的记录，历史仍保存在会话中。`/exit` 关闭面板。","locale":"zh-CN"},"116":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-41","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#会话配置的生效范围","content":"当前会话记录自己的模型和推理强度；修改全局默认值不会自动替换它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"117":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-42","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#会话配置的生效范围","content":"每个 user turn 都会捕获最新的已启用、可用 Skill catalog；所选会话的待处理变更按界面提示从下一 turn 生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"118":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-43","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#会话配置的生效范围","content":"MCP 连接和工具目录会变化，但每个模型采样步骤使用开始时冻结的工具计划。","locale":"zh-CN"},"119":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-44","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#会话配置的生效范围","content":"记忆是否允许从该会话生成，在创建或分叉时按当时设置确定，也可以通过 `/memories` 查看。","locale":"zh-CN"},"120":{"id":"/docs/agent-conversations-45","page_id":"/docs/agent-conversations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-conversations#会话配置的生效范围","content":"只是想整理列表时使用归档；只有在确定不再需要历史、输出和记忆来源时才永久删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"121":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","type":"page","content":"MCP","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","Agent"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-mcp","locale":"zh-CN"},"122":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-0","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp","content":"配置 MCP 服务器、连接运行时并控制工具暴露和审批策略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"123":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-1","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-mcp#选择传输方式","content":"选择传输方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"124":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-2","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-mcp#添加并连接服务器","content":"添加并连接服务器","locale":"zh-CN"},"125":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-3","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-mcp#应用自带的服务器","content":"应用自带的服务器","locale":"zh-CN"},"126":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-4","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"工具策略","locale":"zh-CN"},"127":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-5","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-mcp#在会话中检查-mcp","content":"在会话中检查 MCP","locale":"zh-CN"},"128":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-6","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-mcp#常见问题","content":"常见问题","locale":"zh-CN"},"129":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-7","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp","content":"MCP 可以把本地程序或远程服务的工具提供给 Agent。服务器可能访问文件、网络、数据库和第三方账号，因此配置连接和授予工具权限是两个都需要检查的步骤。","locale":"zh-CN"},"130":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-8","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#选择传输方式","content":"适合由应用启动的本地 MCP 程序。配置可执行程序、参数、工作目录、公开环境变量和凭据环境变量引用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"131":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-9","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#选择传输方式","content":"程序必须能在当前系统找到并正常启动。相对命令、缺少运行时或错误工作目录通常会在启动阶段失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"132":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-10","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#选择传输方式","content":"适合已经运行的远程或本地 HTTP 服务。配置 `http`/`https` URL、公开请求头、凭据请求头引用和 OAuth 策略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"133":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-11","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#选择传输方式","content":"OAuth 可以设为禁用、可选或必需；需要登录时按界面打开浏览器并完成回调。","locale":"zh-CN"},"134":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-12","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#选择传输方式","content":"MCP 凭据值会按原文保存在设置中。运行状态、诊断和 `/mcp verbose` 只应显示凭据是否存在，不应显示实际内容；仍不要公开分享 MCP 设置文件或包含凭据输入框的截图。","locale":"zh-CN"},"135":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-13","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#添加并连接服务器","content":"“启用”是持久配置，“连接”是当前运行状态。服务器可能处于已禁用、启动中、就绪、刷新中、停止中或失败。修改配置后应查看运行态是否已经使用新的连接和目录版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"136":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-14","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#应用自带的服务器","content":"列表中名为 `hanafubuki` 的服务器由应用自行添加。它把 Agent 连接到应用的管理 MCP 服务器，其工具可以安装、启动、停止、更新和配置 WebUI 实例，并读取任务中心：Agent 正是通过它管理你的实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"137":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-15","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#应用自带的服务器","content":"**名称。** Agent 看到的每个工具名为 `mcp__hanafubuki__<工具>`，例如 `mcp__hanafubuki__start_instance`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"138":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-16","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#应用自带的服务器","content":"**暴露。** 默认直接提供常用工具，如 `list_instances`、`list_tasks`、`read_task_log`，以及启动、停止和重启实例的工具。其他工具按需通过工具搜索发现，包括部分只读工具。","locale":"zh-CN"},"139":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-17","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#应用自带的服务器","content":"**审批。** 应用给内置只读工具预设“允许”，给会修改内容的工具预设“询问”。可以在 MCP 设置中单独调整每个工具。需要确认时，审批卡片会显示工具名称和参数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"140":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-18","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#应用自带的服务器","content":"**记忆。** 内置服务器的工具与其他 MCP 工具遵循相同的外部上下文设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"141":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-19","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#应用自带的服务器","content":"**应用会自动更新的内容。** Agent 每次启动或服务器每次重启时，应用都会改写这一项的地址和凭据，并为还没有策略的工具设置默认策略。其他设置都归你所有，会保持你设定的样子：“启用”开关、你修改过的单个工具策略、启用和停用的工具列表、超时以及并发限制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"142":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-20","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#应用自带的服务器","content":"**关闭它。** 用这一项的“启用”开关关闭它。如果改为删除它，Agent 下次启动时应用会以默认策略重新添加。在“模块”页面关闭 **management-mcp** 模块会停止服务器本身：这一项随后显示为失败，模块再次运行后会重新连接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"143":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-21","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#应用自带的服务器","content":"随这一项一起安装的 `hanafubuki-webui-management` Skill 说明了 Agent 如何使用这些工具（见 Skills）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"144":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-22","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"策略","locale":"zh-CN"},"145":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-23","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"可选值","locale":"zh-CN"},"146":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-24","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"147":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-25","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"审批","locale":"zh-CN"},"148":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-26","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"允许、询问、拒绝","locale":"zh-CN"},"149":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-27","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"决定工具调用是否直接允许、进入审批或完全禁止","locale":"zh-CN"},"150":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-28","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"暴露","locale":"zh-CN"},"151":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-29","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"直接、延迟、隐藏","locale":"zh-CN"},"152":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-30","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"决定工具是否直接进入模型工具列表、按需提供或不提供","locale":"zh-CN"},"153":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-31","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"启停过滤","locale":"zh-CN"},"154":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-32","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"启用/禁用工具列表","locale":"zh-CN"},"155":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-33","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"只开放服务器中的指定工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"156":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-34","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"并发","locale":"zh-CN"},"157":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-35","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"服务器和单工具上限","locale":"zh-CN"},"158":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-36","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"限制同时进行的 MCP 调用数量","locale":"zh-CN"},"159":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-37","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"可以设置服务器默认策略，并为单个工具覆盖。写入、删除、发送消息或修改外部系统的工具建议保留“询问”；不使用的工具直接隐藏或禁用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"160":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-38","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#工具策略","content":"每个模型采样步骤会冻结当时的工具计划。连接刷新或策略修改可以立即改变运行态，但正在进行的采样步骤仍使用原来的计划，下一步才会看到变化。","locale":"zh-CN"},"161":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-39","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#在会话中检查-mcp","content":"`/mcp`：查看服务器数量、连接状态、错误和当前工具数量，并执行连接、刷新或断开操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"162":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-40","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#在会话中检查-mcp","content":"`/mcp verbose`：查看传输目标、连接代次、能力、工具策略、当前冻结计划、凭据存在状态和有界诊断。","locale":"zh-CN"},"163":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-41","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#在会话中检查-mcp","content":"运行态面板适合排查和重连；新增、删除、修改服务器及凭据仍应在设置页面完成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"164":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-42","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#常见问题","content":"症状","locale":"zh-CN"},"165":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-43","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#常见问题","content":"检查内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"166":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-44","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#常见问题","content":"stdio 无法启动","locale":"zh-CN"},"167":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-45","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#常见问题","content":"程序路径、参数、工作目录、运行时和环境变量","locale":"zh-CN"},"168":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-46","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#常见问题","content":"HTTP 无法连接","locale":"zh-CN"},"169":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-47","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#常见问题","content":"URL、代理、证书、请求头和服务端状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"170":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-48","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#常见问题","content":"OAuth 失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"171":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-49","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#常见问题","content":"OAuth 策略、浏览器回调、账号授权和服务端配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"172":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-50","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#常见问题","content":"已连接但没有工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"173":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-51","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#常见问题","content":"工具目录刷新、启停过滤、暴露策略和服务端能力","locale":"zh-CN"},"174":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-52","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#常见问题","content":"工具一直等待","locale":"zh-CN"},"175":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-53","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#常见问题","content":"调用超时、并发上限、审批卡片和服务端响应","locale":"zh-CN"},"176":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-54","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#常见问题","content":"停止后仍提示清理","locale":"zh-CN"},"177":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-55","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#常见问题","content":"使用运行态面板重试断开，不要立即删除配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"178":{"id":"/docs/agent-mcp-56","page_id":"/docs/agent-mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-mcp#常见问题","content":"使用 MCP 后仍可贡献记忆，除非已开启“排除外部上下文”。要检查当前会话的资格，在输入框运行 `/memories`。见记忆。","locale":"zh-CN"},"179":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","type":"page","content":"记忆","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","Agent"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-memory","locale":"zh-CN"},"180":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-0","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory","content":"控制跨会话记忆的读取、生成、贡献和重置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"181":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-1","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-memory#全局设置","content":"全局设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"182":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-2","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-memory#当前会话的贡献状态","content":"当前会话的贡献状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"183":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-3","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-memory#使用与生成的区别","content":"使用与生成的区别","locale":"zh-CN"},"184":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-4","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-memory#agent-能对记忆做什么","content":"Agent 能对记忆做什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"185":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-5","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-memory#归档删除和分叉","content":"归档、删除和分叉","locale":"zh-CN"},"186":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-6","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-memory#重置记忆","content":"重置记忆","locale":"zh-CN"},"187":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-7","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory","content":"记忆是从会话中整理出的项目知识，用于后续相关任务。它与会话历史不同：历史是原始消息和工具记录，记忆是派生上下文，也不会授予任何文件或工具权限。","locale":"zh-CN"},"188":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-8","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#全局设置","content":"打开“设置 → Agent”中的“记忆”，先启用记忆，再选择读取、生成及来源策略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"189":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-9","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#全局设置","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"190":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-10","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#全局设置","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"191":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-11","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#全局设置","content":"使用记忆","locale":"zh-CN"},"192":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-12","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#全局设置","content":"在模型请求中加入检索到的相关知识","locale":"zh-CN"},"193":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-13","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#全局设置","content":"生成记忆","locale":"zh-CN"},"194":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-14","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#全局设置","content":"允许后台从符合条件的会话整理新记忆","locale":"zh-CN"},"195":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-15","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#全局设置","content":"排除外部上下文","locale":"zh-CN"},"196":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-16","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#全局设置","content":"启用后，使用外部工具结果的会话会失去贡献资格","locale":"zh-CN"},"197":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-17","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#全局设置","content":"记忆和“排除外部上下文”默认都关闭。启用记忆后，使用记忆和生成记忆默认开启。后台提取还需要已启用的默认 Provider；默认会话需空闲至少 6 小时才进入筛选。","locale":"zh-CN"},"198":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-18","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#当前会话的贡献状态","content":"执行 `/memories` 可以查看当前会话是否允许贡献记忆，并在允许时切换状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"199":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-19","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#当前会话的贡献状态","content":"状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"200":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-20","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#当前会话的贡献状态","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"201":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-21","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#当前会话的贡献状态","content":"已启用","locale":"zh-CN"},"202":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-22","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#当前会话的贡献状态","content":"会话满足其他条件时可以作为记忆来源","locale":"zh-CN"},"203":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-23","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#当前会话的贡献状态","content":"已禁用","locale":"zh-CN"},"204":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-24","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#当前会话的贡献状态","content":"保留会话历史，但不从它生成记忆","locale":"zh-CN"},"205":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-25","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#当前会话的贡献状态","content":"已污染","locale":"zh-CN"},"206":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-26","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#当前会话的贡献状态","content":"会话已触发外部上下文排除规则，永久失去贡献资格","locale":"zh-CN"},"207":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-27","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#当前会话的贡献状态","content":"启用“排除外部上下文”后，原本可以贡献记忆的会话一旦收到成功的 Web 或 MCP 工具结果，整段会话就会永久失去贡献资格。工具搜索成功选中这类工具时也会触发，即使还未调用它。仅连接服务器、调用被拒绝或返回错误都不会触发。会话历史仍可查阅，读取已有记忆由“使用记忆”单独控制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"208":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-28","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#当前会话的贡献状态","content":"会话创建或分叉时，会记录当时是否允许生成记忆。之后可以使用 `/memories` 管理当前会话，但全局关闭记忆时不会进行读取或生成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"209":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-29","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#使用与生成的区别","content":"“使用记忆”控制当前模型能否读取已有记忆。","locale":"zh-CN"},"210":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-30","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#使用与生成的区别","content":"“生成记忆”控制符合条件的会话能否成为新记忆来源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"211":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-31","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#使用与生成的区别","content":"关闭当前会话贡献不会删除已经生成的旧记忆。","locale":"zh-CN"},"212":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-32","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#使用与生成的区别","content":"压缩会话不会把动态检索到的记忆写入可见消息历史。","locale":"zh-CN"},"213":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-33","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#使用与生成的区别","content":"Agent 会在每个模型采样步骤重新取得记忆，因此新生成或重置的结果从后续步骤开始生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"214":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-34","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#agent-能对记忆做什么","content":"检索分为两部分：每个采样步骤都会带上一份精简摘要作为索引，其余内容按需通过记忆自己的工具读取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"215":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-35","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#agent-能对记忆做什么","content":"工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"216":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-36","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#agent-能对记忆做什么","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"217":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-37","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#agent-能对记忆做什么","content":"`list_agent_memories`","locale":"zh-CN"},"218":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-38","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#agent-能对记忆做什么","content":"列出可读的记忆资源及其 id","locale":"zh-CN"},"219":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-39","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#agent-能对记忆做什么","content":"`search_agent_memories`","locale":"zh-CN"},"220":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-40","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#agent-能对记忆做什么","content":"按关键词检索，返回 id 和行号","locale":"zh-CN"},"221":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-41","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#agent-能对记忆做什么","content":"`read_agent_memory`","locale":"zh-CN"},"222":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-42","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#agent-能对记忆做什么","content":"读取某个资源的指定行范围","locale":"zh-CN"},"223":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-43","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#agent-能对记忆做什么","content":"`append_agent_memory_note`","locale":"zh-CN"},"224":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-44","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#agent-能对记忆做什么","content":"记录一条记住、忘记或更新的指令","locale":"zh-CN"},"225":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-45","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#agent-能对记忆做什么","content":"记忆只能通过这些工具访问，它不在任何文件或命令工具可以打开的路径上，因此 Agent 无法直接读取或修改记忆文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"226":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-46","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#agent-能对记忆做什么","content":"读取以已发布的内容为准。即使还有新的会话等待整理，已有记忆仍然可读，所以让 Agent 记住新内容不会让你原本的记忆消失。新内容会先排队：Agent 记录一条笔记，由后续的整理流程合并。","locale":"zh-CN"},"227":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-47","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#agent-能对记忆做什么","content":"只有在你明确要求记住、忘记或更新时，Agent 才会写入笔记，它不会自行判断某段对话值得保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"228":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-48","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#agent-能对记忆做什么","content":"当回答实质依赖记忆时，Agent 会引用它读取的资源。应用会核对这些引用与记忆实际记录的来源是否一致，并在该轮提交后从可见回答中移除引用块。","locale":"zh-CN"},"229":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-49","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#归档删除和分叉","content":"会话操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"230":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-50","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#归档删除和分叉","content":"对记忆来源的影响","locale":"zh-CN"},"231":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-51","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#归档删除和分叉","content":"归档/恢复","locale":"zh-CN"},"232":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-52","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#归档删除和分叉","content":"保留来源关系，只改变会话列表中的可见状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"233":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-53","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#归档删除和分叉","content":"永久删除","locale":"zh-CN"},"234":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-54","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#归档删除和分叉","content":"撤销该会话作为后续记忆来源的资格","locale":"zh-CN"},"235":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-55","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#归档删除和分叉","content":"分叉","locale":"zh-CN"},"236":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-56","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#归档删除和分叉","content":"子会话只贡献分叉后由自己产生的内容，父会话仍独立处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"237":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-57","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#重置记忆","content":"设置页面会显示当前记忆条目数和来源数。重置需要再次确认，执行后会清除派生记忆并开始新的记忆代次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"238":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-58","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#重置记忆","content":"重置不会删除 Agent 会话及其原始历史。以后如果继续启用生成，符合条件的会话仍可能产生新的记忆；如果希望某个会话不再贡献，应先通过 `/memories` 禁用或永久删除该会话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"239":{"id":"/docs/agent-memory-59","page_id":"/docs/agent-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-memory#重置记忆","content":"不要依靠“排除外部上下文”或重置来保护凭据。敏感内容一开始就不应进入提示、附件和项目文档；需要分享诊断或会话记录时仍要人工检查并脱敏。","locale":"zh-CN"},"240":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","type":"page","content":"消息与附件","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","Agent"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","locale":"zh-CN"},"241":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-0","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","content":"编写消息、引用项目文件、添加图片并引导正在进行的任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"242":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-1","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#编写和发送","content":"编写和发送","locale":"zh-CN"},"243":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-2","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#当前界面上下文","content":"当前界面上下文","locale":"zh-CN"},"244":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-3","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#引用文件和目录","content":"引用文件和目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"245":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-4","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#添加图片","content":"添加图片","locale":"zh-CN"},"246":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-5","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#agent-工作时追加消息","content":"Agent 工作时追加消息","locale":"zh-CN"},"247":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-6","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","content":"输入框可以发送文字、项目路径、图片和本轮 Skill 选择。应用还会自动附加当前界面位置，帮助 Agent 理解你正在查看哪个实例或设置区域。","locale":"zh-CN"},"248":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-7","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#编写和发送","content":"`Enter` 发送消息，`Shift + Enter` 插入换行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"249":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-8","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#编写和发送","content":"可以只发送图片；文字和图片也可以一起发送。","locale":"zh-CN"},"250":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-9","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#编写和发送","content":"当前没有模型时，先点击模型按钮或执行 `/model`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"251":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-10","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#编写和发送","content":"审批、阻塞式提问和提议计划会在输入区显示对应操作。“可选问题”出现时，Agent 会继续工作。展开后可选择一个选项或填写自己的回答，提交后作为补充消息送入当前轮次。也可以跳过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"252":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-11","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#编写和发送","content":"提示中优先写清目标、范围和验收条件。路径、实例名称或命令参数容易混淆时，应给出准确文本，不要只写“这个”“上一个”或“默认的”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"253":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-12","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#当前界面上下文","content":"输入框会显示当前上下文标签。根据所在位置，Agent 可以收到实例选择页、实例创建步骤、实例工作区、嵌入式 WebUI、设置分区或实例管理分区等界面信息。","locale":"zh-CN"},"254":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-13","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#当前界面上下文","content":"这是辅助上下文，不是文件权限或执行授权。Agent 仍需要通过工具读取真实状态，并遵守当前权限模式和后端路径规则。","locale":"zh-CN"},"255":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-14","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#引用文件和目录","content":"在输入框中键入 `@`，或用 `/mention` 开始搜索。候选项来自当前会话工作区内的文件，搜索遵循工作区的忽略规则。附件菜单的“添加文件”可以从系统选择器一次选取多个文件，路径会插入消息正文。需要引用目录时，直接输入或粘贴目录路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"256":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-15","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#引用文件和目录","content":"Agent 会按当前会话的权限读取或写入引用的位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"257":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-16","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#添加图片","content":"可以从附件菜单选择“添加图片”，也可以把剪贴板里的图片直接粘贴到输入框。单条消息最多添加 8 张，可以移除或调整顺序。后端会在发送前解码、校验并规范化图片：","locale":"zh-CN"},"258":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-17","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#添加图片","content":"限制","locale":"zh-CN"},"259":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-18","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#添加图片","content":"数值","locale":"zh-CN"},"260":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-19","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#添加图片","content":"单个源文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"261":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-20","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#添加图片","content":"最大 20 MiB","locale":"zh-CN"},"262":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-21","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#添加图片","content":"所有源图片合计","locale":"zh-CN"},"263":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-22","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#添加图片","content":"最大 64 MiB","locale":"zh-CN"},"264":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-23","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#添加图片","content":"解码后像素","locale":"zh-CN"},"265":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-24","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#添加图片","content":"最大 4000 万像素","locale":"zh-CN"},"266":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-25","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#添加图片","content":"规范化最长边","locale":"zh-CN"},"267":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-26","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#添加图片","content":"最大 2048 像素","locale":"zh-CN"},"268":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-27","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#添加图片","content":"单张规范化结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"269":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-28","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#添加图片","content":"最大 8 MiB","locale":"zh-CN"},"270":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-29","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#添加图片","content":"图片会去除元数据，动画图片只使用静态画面。模型策略为“自动”时，应用会按已知能力发送图片；模型明确拒绝图片且尚未产生输出时，可以自动移除图片重试一次。模型策略为“禁用”时不能发送图片。","locale":"zh-CN"},"271":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-30","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#添加图片","content":"如果图片读取、解码或请求准入失败，输入文字和附件草稿会保留，修正问题后可以再次发送。","locale":"zh-CN"},"272":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-31","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#agent-工作时追加消息","content":"Agent 正在回答时，输入新内容并点击主按钮不会立即开始第二轮，而是把内容放入当前面板的消息队列。","locale":"zh-CN"},"273":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-32","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#agent-工作时追加消息","content":"队列操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"274":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-33","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#agent-工作时追加消息","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"275":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-34","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#agent-工作时追加消息","content":"引导","locale":"zh-CN"},"276":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-35","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#agent-工作时追加消息","content":"把消息发送到正在进行的同一轮，调整接下来的方向","locale":"zh-CN"},"277":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-36","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#agent-工作时追加消息","content":"编辑","locale":"zh-CN"},"278":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-37","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#agent-工作时追加消息","content":"把消息和图片恢复到输入框继续修改","locale":"zh-CN"},"279":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-38","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#agent-工作时追加消息","content":"丢弃","locale":"zh-CN"},"280":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-39","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#agent-工作时追加消息","content":"从本地队列移除，不发送给 Agent","locale":"zh-CN"},"281":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-40","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#agent-工作时追加消息","content":"引导适合补充刚发现的约束，例如“不要修改数据库结构”。如果当前工作可以自然完成，保留为下一轮消息通常更清晰。队列仅属于当前打开面板的草稿状态，不应把它当作已经持久化的会话记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"282":{"id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments-41","page_id":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-messages-attachments#agent-工作时追加消息","content":"提交图片和文件前检查其