"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-9","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#默认模式和-plan-模式","content":"默认","locale":"zh-CN"},"294":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-10","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#默认模式和-plan-模式","content":"目标和范围明确，希望直接完成任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"295":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-11","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#默认模式和-plan-模式","content":"可以在授权范围内运行命令、修改文件，并使用任务计划追踪执行","locale":"zh-CN"},"296":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-12","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#默认模式和-plan-模式","content":"Plan","locale":"zh-CN"},"297":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-13","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#默认模式和-plan-模式","content":"需求复杂，需要先调查和确认设计","locale":"zh-CN"},"298":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-14","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#默认模式和-plan-模式","content":"只允许调查、读取、提问和输出方案，不执行仓库修改","locale":"zh-CN"},"299":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-15","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#默认模式和-plan-模式","content":"Plan 模式会隐藏写入、补丁和其他变更工具，选择“完全开放”权限预设时也一样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"300":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-16","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#默认模式和-plan-模式","content":"会话空闲时，打开输入框的“+”菜单，点击“计划”即可开启或关闭；也可以输入 `/mode` 在两个模式间选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"301":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-17","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#在-plan-模式中工作","content":"需要立即决定的问题会暂时取代普通输入框。选一项、填写自己的答案或跳过后，当前规划轮次继续。若输入框旁显示“可选问题”，Agent 已在继续处理任务，可以稍后回答。","locale":"zh-CN"},"302":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-18","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#两种计划不是同一件事","content":"名称","locale":"zh-CN"},"303":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-19","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#两种计划不是同一件事","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"304":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-20","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#两种计划不是同一件事","content":"生命周期","locale":"zh-CN"},"305":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-21","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#两种计划不是同一件事","content":"提议计划","locale":"zh-CN"},"306":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-22","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#两种计划不是同一件事","content":"Plan 模式最终交付的、可审阅的完整实施方案","locale":"zh-CN"},"307":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-23","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#两种计划不是同一件事","content":"由用户决定实施或继续修改","locale":"zh-CN"},"308":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-24","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#两种计划不是同一件事","content":"任务计划","locale":"zh-CN"},"309":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-25","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#两种计划不是同一件事","content":"默认模式执行期间显示的步骤与状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"310":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-26","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#两种计划不是同一件事","content":"用于汇报进度，不构成授权","locale":"zh-CN"},"311":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-27","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#两种计划不是同一件事","content":"提议计划应当让执行者不再需要决定关键实现细节。任务计划只表示当前工作进度，即使某一步显示“进行中”，也不代表命令已成功或风险操作已获批准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"312":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-28","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#何时切换模式","content":"不清楚代码边界、数据结构或交互方式时，先使用 Plan 模式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"313":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-29","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#何时切换模式","content":"只是需要检查一个错误原因，而且不希望修改代码时，也适合 Plan 模式，并在任务中明确写“只分析”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"314":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-30","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#何时切换模式","content":"已有明确方案并希望落地时，切到默认模式或使用“实施计划”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"315":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-31","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#何时切换模式","content":"当前回答、压缩或阻塞决定尚未结束时，先处理当前状态再切换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"316":{"id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans-32","page_id":"/docs/agent-modes-plans","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-modes-plans#何时切换模式","content":"接受方案只决定后续工作方向。执行阶段遇到需要审批的命令、写入、删除或外部操作时，仍按照当前权限模式处理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"317":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","type":"page","content":"权限与审批","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","Agent"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-permissions","locale":"zh-CN"},"318":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-0","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions","content":"选择 Agent 权限模式，并安全处理每一次工具审批。","locale":"zh-CN"},"319":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-1","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-permissions#权限模式","content":"权限模式","locale":"zh-CN"},"320":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-2","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-permissions#处理人工审批","content":"处理人工审批","locale":"zh-CN"},"321":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-3","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-permissions#自动审查怎么看","content":"自动审查怎么看","locale":"zh-CN"},"322":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-4","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-permissions#高风险操作","content":"高风险操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"323":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-5","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","type":"headi