":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#权限模式","content":"自动审批","locale":"zh-CN"},"335":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-17","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#权限模式","content":"使用工作区写入沙箱","locale":"zh-CN"},"336":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-18","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#权限模式","content":"由模型审查并显示理由","locale":"zh-CN"},"337":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-19","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#权限模式","content":"完全开放","locale":"zh-CN"},"338":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-20","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#权限模式","content":"以当前系统用户权限运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"339":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-21","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#权限模式","content":"常规审批自动放行","locale":"zh-CN"},"340":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-22","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#权限模式","content":"需要沙箱的预设不可用时，菜单会显示原因。Windows 上若出现“初始化 Windows 沙箱”，可直接点击并完成系统的管理员授权。也可用 `/setup-default-sandbox` 打开沙箱维护设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"341":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-23","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#权限模式","content":"有些操作会被后端直接禁止，不能通过切换权限模式覆盖。路径规则、实例生命周期、进程所有权、操作系统账号权限等约束也始终有效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"342":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-24","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#权限模式","content":"选择“完全开放”后，命令可以直接修改当前用户有权访问的项目、实例或外部服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"343":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-25","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#处理人工审批","content":"审批出现时，普通输入框会切换为审批卡片。批准前逐项核对：","locale":"zh-CN"},"344":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-26","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#处理人工审批","content":"操作类型：命令、文件写入、删除、MCP 管理或外部工具调用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"345":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-27","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#处理人工审批","content":"风险等级：低、中、高或严重。","locale":"zh-CN"},"346":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-28","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#处理人工审批","content":"操作摘要和来源：用户请求、模型判断或某个 Skill。","locale":"zh-CN"},"347":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-29","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#处理人工审批","content":"准确目标：程序、参数、工作目录、文件路径或服务标识。","locale":"zh-CN"},"348":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-30","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#处理人工审批","content":"这项操作是否确实是完成当前任务所必需。","locale":"zh-CN"},"349":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-31","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#处理人工审批","content":"“允许一次”只授权当前请求。部分工具还提供“在此对话中允许”，这会让同一工具在该对话中后续执行时免于再次询问，直至 Agent 重启。始终要求人工决定的请求只提供单次选择。选择“拒绝”后，Agent 会收到拒绝结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"350":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-32","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#自动审查怎么看","content":"自动审查会在工具记录中显示审查状态、风险判断、用户授权线索和理由。它仍然只针对当前调用，不代表整个任务已经被授权。","locale":"zh-CN"},"351":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-33","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#自动审查怎么看","content":"自动审查拒绝后，展开工具记录核对理由和目标。如果你确认要让 Agent 重试这项操作，可以输入 `/approve` 并选择对应的拒绝记录，授权一次重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"352":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-34","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#高风险操作","content":"以下操作即使目标看起来合理，也应人工确认范围和可恢复方式：","locale":"zh-CN"},"353":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-35","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#高风险操作","content":"删除、覆盖或移动项目和实例数据。","locale":"zh-CN"},"354":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-36","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#高风险操作","content":"重置 Git、发布版本、推送代码或触发远程工作流。","locale":"zh-CN"},"355":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-37","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#高风险操作","content":"安装来源不明的 Skill、执行其脚本或修改 MCP 配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"356":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-38","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#高风险操作","content":"使用 MCP 操作账号、数据库、消息、支付或其他外部系统。","locale":"zh-CN"},"357":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-39","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#高风险操作","content":"读取或发送凭据、隐私数据和未公开内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"358":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-40","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#高风险操作","content":"涉及删除时先确认备份或快照；涉及外部系统时确认账号、环境和目标对象；涉及命令时确认工作目录和完整参数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"359":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-41","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#权限模式与其他控制","content":"Plan 模式下，即使选择“完全开放”，变更工具也会保持隐藏。","locale":"zh-CN"},"360":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-42","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#权限模式与其他控制","content":"MCP 工具还有自己的“允许、询问、拒绝”策略，两层规则都会生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"361":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-43","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#权限模式与其他控制","content":"Skill 可以建议或调用工具，但不会继承超出当前权限的能力。","locale":"zh-CN"},"362":{"id":"/docs/agent-permissions-44","page_id":"/docs/agent-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-permissions#权限模式与其他控制","content":"记忆只提供上下文，不授予文件、命令或外部服务权限。","locale":"zh-CN"},"363":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","type":"page","content":"提供商与模型","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","Agent"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-providers-models","locale":"zh-CN"},"364":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-0","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models","content":"配置 Agent 的服务端连接、模型能力和上下文策略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"365":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-1","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#添加-provider","content":"添加 Provider","locale":"zh-CN"},"366":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-2","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#选择默认模型","content":"选择默认模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"367":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-3","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#模型能力","content":"模型能力","locale":"zh-CN"},"368":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-4","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#当前会话的模型","content":"当前会话的模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"369":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-5","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#验证与排查","content":"验证与排查","locale":"zh-CN"},"370":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-6","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models","content":"Agent 将“如何连接服务端”和“如何使用模型”分开配置：Provider 保存协议、API 地址和凭据；模型策略保存默认模型、推理强度、图片输入和上下文规则。","locale":"zh-CN"},"371":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-7","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#添加-provider","content":"进入“设置 → Agent → 模型 → 模型提供方”，或在聊天中输入 `/providers`，然后添加 Provider。","locale":"zh-CN"},"372":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-8","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#添加-provider","content":"配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"373":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-9","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-model