:"自定义请求头","locale":"zh-CN"},"383":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-19","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#添加-provider","content":"网关或兼容服务要求的附加头","locale":"zh-CN"},"384":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-20","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#添加-provider","content":"启用","locale":"zh-CN"},"385":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-21","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#添加-provider","content":"决定它能否用于新选择和模型请求","locale":"zh-CN"},"386":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-22","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#添加-provider","content":"协议必须与服务端实际实现一致。修改 API 地址不会把 Chat Completions 服务转换为 Responses 服务；兼容服务也可能只实现协议的一部分能力。","locale":"zh-CN"},"387":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-23","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#添加-provider","content":"API Token 默认遮盖，点击眼睛图标可查看或再次隐藏。自定义请求头每行一个：输入 `名称=值`\n新增或替换，保留已有名称即可沿用保存的值。分享截图前请先隐藏密钥。","locale":"zh-CN"},"388":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-24","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#添加-provider","content":"保存后可在提供方详情中选择“测试连接”，用已保存的配置检查能否取得模型列表。“获取模型列表”可查看目录，“设为默认”可更改默认提供方。","locale":"zh-CN"},"389":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-25","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#选择默认模型","content":"保存并启用 Provider 后，在模型策略中选择默认 Provider 和模型。模型列表是服务端返回的辅助目录，也可以填写服务端接受的自定义模型 ID。","locale":"zh-CN"},"390":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-26","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#选择默认模型","content":"没有默认模型时仍可创建空闲会话，但不能发送模型请求。点击输入框旁的模型名称或执行 `/model`，可为当前空闲会话选择模型。全局默认值发生变化时，已有会话不会被静默切换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"391":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-27","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#模型能力","content":"需要给同一提供方的某个模型单独配置时，打开“模型 → 提供方模型”，添加一条 `提供方ID/模型ID` 记录。可覆盖上下文窗口、最大输出、图片支持和推理档位。若服务端已调整模型能力，“清除已知信息”会清除 Agent 记住的探测结果，保留手动覆盖值。在模型详情执行只影响该模型，在提供方详情执行则作用于其所有模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"392":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-28","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#模型能力","content":"配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"393":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-29","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#模型能力","content":"使用建议","locale":"zh-CN"},"394":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-30","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#模型能力","content":"推理强度","locale":"zh-CN"},"395":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-31","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#模型能力","content":"在“默认模型”中选模型已知的档位、输入自定义值，或留空由服务端决定。实际支持的档位取决于模型及接口","locale":"zh-CN"},"396":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-32","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#模型能力","content":"图片输入","locale":"zh-CN"},"397":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-33","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#模型能力","content":"“自动”会在模型支持时发送图片；“禁用”会阻止图片输入","locale":"zh-CN"},"398":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-34","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#模型能力","content":"上下文窗口","locale":"zh-CN"},"399":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-35","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#模型能力","content":"填写模型实际可用的 Token 数；留空时依赖 Provider 和运行时信息","locale":"zh-CN"},"400":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-36","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#模型能力","content":"自动压缩","locale":"zh-CN"},"401":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-37","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#模型能力","content":"在接近阈值时整理模型上下文，默认阈值为窗口的 80%","locale":"zh-CN"},"402":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-38","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#模型能力","content":"远程压缩","locale":"zh-CN"},"403":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-39","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#模型能力","content":"仅用于声明支持相应能力的 Responses Provider","locale":"zh-CN"},"404":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-40","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#模型能力","content":"上下文窗口设置过高，服务端可能先拒绝请求；设置过低则会更早触发压缩。压缩只改变下一轮发送给模型的上下文，不会删除界面中已经保存的消息和工具记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"405":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-41","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#当前会话的模型","content":"会话会记录自己的 Provider、协议、模型和推理强度。需要临时更换时：","locale":"zh-CN"},"406":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-42","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#当前会话的模型","content":"等待当前回答和压缩结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"407":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-43","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#当前会话的模型","content":"点击输入框旁的模型按钮，或执行 `/model`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"408":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-44","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#当前会话的模型","content":"选择已启用的 Provider 和模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"409":{"id":"/docs/agent-providers-models-45","page_id":"/docs/agent-providers-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-providers-models#当前会话的模型","content":"如需调整推理强度，再执行 