t-skills","content":"Skill 可以指导 Agent 处理特定任务，但不会绕过会话模式、工具策略和权限审批。","locale":"zh-CN"},"430":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-10","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"Agent 从下列位置发现 Skill：","locale":"zh-CN"},"431":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-11","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"归属","locale":"zh-CN"},"432":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-12","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"433":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-13","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"可编辑","locale":"zh-CN"},"434":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-14","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"Repo","locale":"zh-CN"},"435":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-15","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"工作区内的 `.agents/skills`","locale":"zh-CN"},"436":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-16","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"否","locale":"zh-CN"},"437":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-17","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"User","locale":"zh-CN"},"438":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-18","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"受管理的 Skills 根目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"439":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-19","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"440":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-20","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"System","locale":"zh-CN"},"441":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-21","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"随应用程序捆绑","locale":"zh-CN"},"442":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-22","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"否","locale":"zh-CN"},"443":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-23","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"Plugin","locale":"zh-CN"},"444":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-24","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"已启用的 Agent 插件包提供的 Skill，包括桌面扩展向 Agent 提供的 Skill","locale":"zh-CN"},"445":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-25","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"否","locale":"zh-CN"},"446":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-26","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#skill-来自哪里","content":"加载失败的目录会与目录列表一并报告并跳过，因此一个格式错误的包不会让你失去其余的 Skill。","locale":"zh-CN"},"447":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-27","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#安装和检查","content":"在“设置 → Agent → Skills”中，可以从文件夹安装 Skill，也可以编写、复制、编辑其文件或删除它。只有受管理的 user 根目录中的 Skill 可以修改；repo 和捆绑的 Skill 是只读的，需要先复制一份。","locale":"zh-CN"},"448":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-28","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#安装和检查","content":"**创建或安装**。打开“添加 Skill”。创建时填写名称和用途。选择“安装文件夹”后，先核对预览的名称、目标文件夹和资源数。目标已有同名文件夹时，按钮会变为“替换”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"449":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-29","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#安装和检查","content":"**查找和编辑**。可按名称、说明或目录搜索。打开条目后，“概览”显示来源目录、所需 MCP 服务器和不可用原因。左侧文件列表可查看 `SKILL.md` 和资源。用户副本可添加、保存、删除资源文件；`SKILL.md` 需随整个 Skill 一起删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"450":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-30","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#安装和检查","content":"安装前检查：","locale":"zh-CN"},"451":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-31","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#安装和检查","content":"包名称、用途、版本和来源是否符合预期。","locale":"zh-CN"},"452":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-32","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#安装和检查","content":"`SKILL.md` 中声明的操作步骤和触发条件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"453":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-33","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#安装和检查","content":"引用资料、资源文件和脚本内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"454":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-34","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#安装和检查","content":"需要的 MCP 服务、传输方式和外部地址。","locale":"zh-CN"},"455":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-35","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#安装和检查","content":"是否允许 Agent 在未点名时隐式使用该 Skill。","locale":"zh-CN"},"456":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-36","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#安装和检查","content":"Skill 中的说明和脚本可以引导 Agent\n执行命令、修改文件或调用外部工具。只安装可信来源，并在更新后重新检查差异和依赖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"457":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-37","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#启用状态与当前-turn","content":"被发现的 Skill 默认是开启的，直到你关闭它。启用状态决定 Skill 是否会提供给每个新接纳的 user turn。会话不保留自己的 catalog：turn admission 会捕获最新的只读 catalog，而已经运行的 turn 保持其冻结的 catalog 和 Skill context。","locale":"zh-CN"},"458":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-38","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#启用状态与当前-turn","content":"打开设置时若有当前会话，Skill 详情还会显示它在该会话中的状态：","locale":"zh-CN"},"459":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-39","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#启用状态与当前-turn","content":"**当前可用**——已启用，会提供给下一个 turn。","locale":"zh-CN"},"460":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-40","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#启用状态与当前-turn","content":"**本 turn 已采用**——运行中的 turn 已读取并正在遵循它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"461":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-41","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#启用状态与当前-turn","content":"启用或停用从下一个 turn 开始生效。任何操作都不会改变正在运行的模型请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"462":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-42","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#为下一条消息选择-skill","content":"执行 `/skills` 查看当前会话的可用项和不可用原因，点击条目可切换下一条消息要使用的 Skill。也可在输入框键入 `$` 和名称，从候选中选择。若草稿只包含这段名称，且 Skill 提供默认提示，选中后会将默认提示填入输入框，仍可编辑后再发送。","locale":"zh-CN"},"463":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-43","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#为下一条消息选择-skill","content":"提示中明确点名 Skill 可以减少歧义，例如：","locale":"zh-CN"},"464":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-44","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#为下一条消息选择-skill","content":"如果 Skill 允许隐式调用，它的名称和描述会进入模型 catalog；任务明确匹配时 Agent 必须使用它。仅允许显式调用的 Skill 不进入该 catalog，但仍可通过点名选中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"465":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-45","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#agent-能对-skill-做什么","content":"Agent 通过 `skills_list` 和 `skills_read` 读取 Skill，并可在你批准后使用 `enable_skill` 和 `disable_skill` 开启或关闭某个 Skill。编写、安装和删除 Skill 包使用普通的文件系统与命令工具——Skill 目录就是一个普通目录——因此这些操作与其他文件写入走同样的审批流程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"466":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-46","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#agent-能对-skill-做什么","content":"捆绑的 **Skill Creator** 和 **Skill Manager** 向 Agent 说明了这些工作流程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"467":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-47","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#应用的管理-skill","content":"用户根目录中还有 `hanafubuki-webui-management`，由应用自行安装：它教 Agent 通过应用的 `hanafubuki` MCP 服务器（见 MCP）管理你的 WebUI 实例，包括什么情况下用哪个工具，以及如何跟踪耗时操作。它只负责说明；工具及其审批由服务器提供。","locale":"zh-CN"},"468":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-48","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#应用的管理-skill","content":"Agent 每次启动时，除非已安装的副本与应用自带的完全相同，否则应用都会重新安装它，因此你对它的修改会被替换。若要修改，请先以其他名称复制一份。","locale":"zh-CN"},"469":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-49","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#应用的管理-skill","content":"关闭它的选择会被保留：重新安装不会改变你的选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"470":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-50","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#应用的管理-skill","content":"它声明需要 `hanafubuki` 服务器，因此在该服务器未连接时会显示为不可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"471":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-51","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#应用的管理-skill","content":"连接到该服务器的其他 AI 工具可以以 MCP 资源的形式读取同一份指南（见 MCP 服务器）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"472":{"id":"/docs/agent-skills-52","page_id":"/docs/agent-skills","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-skills#删除","content":"删除只移除已安装的包。历史记录会保留早期 turn 实际采用的 Skill context，删除也不会改写正在运行的 turn。应先等待当前任务结束，再整理能力。","locale":"zh-CN"},"473":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","type":"page","content":"工具与后台终端","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","Agent"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","locale":"zh-CN"},"474":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-0","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","content":"阅读工具调用、检查输出，并管理 Agent 启动的后台命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"475":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-1","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#阅读工具卡片","content":"阅读工具卡片","locale":"zh-CN"},"476":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-2","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#停止当前回答","content":"停止当前回答","locale":"zh-CN"},"477":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-3","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#后台终端","content":"后台终端","locale":"zh-CN"},"478":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-4","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#安全清理后台命令","content":"安全清理后台命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"479":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-5","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#判断任务是否完成","content":"判断任务是否完成","locale":"zh-CN"},"480":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-6","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","content":"Agent 通过工具读取文件、修改代码、运行命令或调用应用功能。每次调用都会在消息记录中形成工具卡片，工具状态和最终回答共同构成任务结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"481":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-7","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#阅读工具卡片","content":"工具运行时会显示当前状态和实时输出；完成后卡片通常折叠，以保持会话可读。展开后可以查看：","locale":"zh-CN"},"482":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-8","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#阅读工具卡片","content":"工具名称和模型提交的参数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"483":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-9","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#阅读工具卡片","content":"命令、工作目录和退出状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"484":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-10","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#阅读工具卡片","content":"文件补丁及新增、修改、删除摘要。","locale":"zh-CN"},"485":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-11","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#阅读工具卡片","content":"自动权限审查的结论和理由。","locale":"zh-CN"},"486":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-12","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#阅读工具卡片","content":"标准输出、错误输出，以及被截断或省略的提示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"487":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-13","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#阅读工具卡片","content":"展开命令卡片后先显示最近的输出。可逐批展开更早的行，或一次显示所有仍保留的行。向上滚动阅读时，新的输出不会把你拉回底部；滚回底部即可继续跟随。读文件、列目录和搜索的结果也能逐批展开，文件结果显示行号，搜索结果按文件列出命中位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"488":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-14","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#阅读工具卡片","content":"工具可能处于运行、等待审批、等待用户、等待清理、成功、失败、取消或中断等状态。只有进入明确终态后，才能判断该次调用是否结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"489":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-15","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#阅读工具卡片","content":"实时输出和持久化历史都会控制体积。看到截断标记时，应让 Agent\n使用更精确的过滤命令或读取指定区段，而不是假设未显示的内容不存在。","locale":"zh-CN"},"490":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-16","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#停止当前回答","content":"输入框为空且当前回答可取消时，主按钮会变为停止按钮。它用于取消正在进行的 Agent 回答或独立压缩。","locale":"zh-CN"},"491":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-17","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#停止当前回答","content":"停止请求发出后，应用仍需要确认工具和进程已经进入终态。界面显示等待清理时，不要立即创建替代任务；先等待或按错误提示重试清理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"492":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-18","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#后台终端","content":"长时间运行的命令可以进入后台，并获得一个终端会话标识。它们属于创建它们的 Agent 会话，不会因为折叠工具卡片、切换会话或关闭 Agent 窗口而自动结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"493":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-19","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#后台终端","content":"命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"494":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-20","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#后台终端","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"495":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-21","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#后台终端","content":"`/ps`","locale":"zh-CN"},"496":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-22","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#后台终端","content":"列出当前 Agent 会话保留的后台终端及状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"497":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-23","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#后台终端","content":"`/stop`","locale":"zh-CN"},"498":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-24","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#后台终端","content":"请求停止并清理当前会话的全部后台终端","locale":"zh-CN"},"499":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-25","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#后台终端","content":"`/stop` 与停止当前回答不是同一个操作。前者处理后台终端，后者取消当前模型轮次或压缩。","locale":"zh-CN"},"500":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-26","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#安全清理后台命令","content":"执行\n`/ps`，查看每个终端的命令、工作目录、运行时长和近期输出。用卡片顶部的刷新按钮更新状态；已退出的命令还会列出退出码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"501":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-27","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#安全清理后台命令","content":"后台开发服务器、文件监听器和交互式命令可能持续占用端口或文件。任务完成前应明确说明哪些进程被保留、哪些已经停止。","locale":"zh-CN"},"502":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-28","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#判断任务是否完成","content":"工具调用显示成功，只证明该操作成功，不等于整个目标已经实现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"503":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-29","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#判断任务是否完成","content":"测试命令需要检查退出状态和失败用例，而不只是看到部分输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"504":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-30","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#判断任务是否完成","content":"Agent 最终回答应说明修改内容、验证结果和仍未完成的事项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"505":{"id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals-31","page_id":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent-tools-terminals#判断任务是否完成","content":"如果最终回答声称完成，但工具仍在运行或等待清理，应以后端状态为准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"506":{"id":"/docs/agent","page_id":"/docs/agent","type":"page","content":"Agent 快速开始","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","Agent"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent","locale":"zh-CN"},"507":{"id":"/docs/agent-0","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent","content":"配置模型并完成第一个 Agent 会话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"508":{"id":"/docs/agent-1","page_id":"/docs/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent#第一次使用","content":"第一次使用","locale":"zh-CN"},"509":{"id":"/docs/agent-2","page_id":"/docs/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent#配置提供商","content":"配置提供商","locale":"zh-CN"},"510":{"id":"/docs/agent-3","page_id":"/docs/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent#打开-agent","content":"打开 Agent","locale":"zh-CN"},"511":{"id":"/docs/agent-4","page_id":"/docs/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent#新建会话","content":"新建会话","locale":"zh-CN"},"512":{"id":"/docs/agent-5","page_id":"/docs/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent#选择模式和权限","content":"选择模式和权限","locale":"zh-CN"},"513":{"id":"/docs/agent-6","page_id":"/docs/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent#发送任务","content":"发送任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"514":{"id":"/docs/agent-7","page_id":"/docs/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent#推荐的任务写法","content":"推荐的任务写法","locale":"zh-CN"},"515":{"id":"/docs/agent-8","page_id":"/docs/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent#执行过程中看什么","content":"执行过程中看什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"516":{"id":"/docs/agent-9","page_id":"/docs/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent#recover-agent","content":"助手打不开或部分工具消失","locale":"zh-CN"},"517":{"id":"/docs/agent-10","page_id":"/docs/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/agent#继续阅读","content":"继续阅读","locale":"zh-CN"},"518":{"id":"/docs/agent-11","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent","content":"Agent 可以读取项目上下文、调用应用工具、运行命令并协助修改文件。它能做什么取决于当前模型、权限模式、MCP、Skills 和会话状态；开始前至少需要配置一个已启用的模型提供商。","locale":"zh-CN"},"519":{"id":"/docs/agent-12","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#配置提供商","content":"打开“设置 → Agent”，在模型提供商区域添加 Provider。选择服务端实际支持的协议，填写 API 地址和凭据并保存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"520":{"id":"/docs/agent-13","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#配置提供商","content":"Provider 只描述服务端连接；模型在单独的模型策略中选择。保存 Provider 后，再选择默认 Provider 和模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"521":{"id":"/docs/agent-14","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#打开-agent","content":"点击标题栏中的 Agent 按钮。Agent 默认作为浮动面板打开，也可以通过窗口操作将其分离为独立窗口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"522":{"id":"/docs/agent-15","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#打开-agent","content":"左侧是会话列表，右侧依次显示当前会话、消息记录、工具调用和输入框。","locale":"zh-CN"},"523":{"id":"/docs/agent-16","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#新建会话","content":"点击会话列表上方的“新建”按钮，或者在输入框执行 `/new`。如果没有配置默认模型，仍可创建会话，但需要点击输入框旁的模型按钮或执行 `/model` 后才能发送消息。","locale":"zh-CN"},"524":{"id":"/docs/agent-17","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#新建会话","content":"普通新会话使用默认工作区。在项目中新建对话可以使用该项目指定的文件夹。输入 `/pwd` 可检查当前工作目录。项目与工作区","locale":"zh-CN"},"525":{"id":"/docs/agent-18","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#选择模式和权限","content":"“默认”模式适合直接分析和执行；“Plan”模式只进行调查、提问和方案设计。权限模式决定工具操作是直接执行、自动审查还是等待人工审批。","locale":"zh-CN"},"526":{"id":"/docs/agent-19","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#选择模式和权限","content":"输入 `/permissions` 或打开输入框旁的权限菜单，选择本次会话的沙箱和审批预设。","locale":"zh-CN"},"527":{"id":"/docs/agent-20","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#发送任务","content":"写明目标、允许修改的范围和验收方式，然后按 `Enter` 发送。需要换行时使用 `Shift + Enter`。也可以附加图片、引用文件或为本轮选择 Skill。","locale":"zh-CN"},"528":{"id":"/docs/agent-21","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#推荐的任务写法","content":"一个容易验证的任务通常包含：目标、范围限制、需要保留的行为以及验证命令。涉及发布、删除、外部消息或账号操作时，还应写明准确目标。","locale":"zh-CN"},"529":{"id":"/docs/agent-22","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#执行过程中看什么","content":"Agent 的说明文字用于汇报当前判断和下一步动作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"530":{"id":"/docs/agent-23","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#执行过程中看什么","content":"模型在回答前思考时，会出现一个默认折叠的思考块：思考中显示“思考中”和已用时间，结束后显示“思考了 12s”。点击即可阅读模型输出的思考内容；重新打开会话后仍然保留。输出末尾的工作状态行只说明 Agent 正在做什么（运行工具、生成回答、等待）以及本轮已用时间，不显示模型的思考内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"531":{"id":"/docs/agent-24","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#执行过程中看什么","content":"工具卡片显示命令、文件操作、审批结果和输出；展开卡片可以查看详细内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"532":{"id":"/docs/agent-25","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#执行过程中看什么","content":"输入框为空时，主按钮可停止当前回答；输入了新内容时，消息会先加入队列，不会自动打断正在进行的回答。","locale":"zh-CN"},"533":{"id":"/docs/agent-26","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#执行过程中看什么","content":"长时间命令可能转为后台终端。关闭 Agent 面板不代表进程已经停止，应使用 `/ps` 检查、使用 `/stop` 清理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"534":{"id":"/docs/agent-27","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#执行过程中看什么","content":"最终回答和工具的终态共同说明任务是否完成；不要把“工具已经开始运行”当作成功。","locale":"zh-CN"},"535":{"id":"/docs/agent-28","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#执行过程中看什么","content":"更高权限只会减少审批步骤，不代表命令、文件修改或外部操作自动安全。允许操作前应核对目标、参数和风险提示，完成后仍需检查差异和测试结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"536":{"id":"/docs/agent-29","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#recover-agent","content":"如果提示“助手面板停止工作”，选择“重新加载助手面板”即可重新打开会话视图。如果是助手进程停止，状态页会显示失败原因以及是否会自动重启。重复启动失败时，可选择“以安全模式启动”，只加载核心插件；排查后点击“正常重启”恢复原有插件选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"537":{"id":"/docs/agent-30","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#recover-agent","content":"如果仍能聊天但横幅提示有插件停止工作，“打开插件”可进入 Agent 设置检查故障插件。若提示某个请求因助手重启而中断，核对最后几条工具记录，再决定是否重发。","locale":"zh-CN"},"538":{"id":"/docs/agent-31","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#recover-agent","content":"如果提示对话无法恢复，原文件会被单独保留。可以先“打开诊断”查看报告。界面提供“重建历史索引”时，确认后会停止正在进行的回复、重启助手，并从已保存的对话文件重新生成索引。","locale":"zh-CN"},"539":{"id":"/docs/agent-32","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"提供商与模型\" href=\"/docs/agent-providers-models\" description=\"配置连接、模型能力和上下文策略。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"540":{"id":"/docs/agent-33","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"会话管理\" href=\"/docs/agent-conversations\" description=\"管理历史、归档、删除和分叉。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"541":{"id":"/docs/agent-34","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"消息与附件\" href=\"/docs/agent-messages-attachments\" description=\"引用文件、添加图片并引导正在进行的任务。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"542":{"id":"/docs/agent-35","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"模式与计划\" href=\"/docs/agent-modes-plans\" description=\"理解默认模式、Plan 模式和两类计划。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"543":{"id":"/docs/agent-36","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"权限与审批\" href=\"/docs/agent-permissions\" description=\"核对审批内容并选择合适的权限模式。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"544":{"id":"/docs/agent-37","page_id":"/docs/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"命令与上下文\" href=\"/docs/agent-commands-context\" description=\"使用斜杠命令、查看用量和压缩会话。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"545":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","type":"page","content":"后端","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","扩展开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","locale":"zh-CN"},"546":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-0","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","content":"原生与 Python 后端、进程环境与生命周期、协议概要、宿主接口及其权限、钩子、提供者回调和扩展之间的服务调用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"547":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-1","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#两种后端","content":"两种后端","locale":"zh-CN"},"548":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-2","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#进程与环境","content":"进程与环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"549":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-3","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#生命周期","content":"生命周期","locale":"zh-CN"},"550":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-4","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#故障","content":"故障","locale":"zh-CN"},"551":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-5","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#协议概要","content":"协议概要","locale":"zh-CN"},"552":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-6","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#钩子","content":"钩子","locale":"zh-CN"},"553":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-7","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"宿主接口","locale":"zh-CN"},"554":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-8","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"提供者回调","locale":"zh-CN"},"555":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-9","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#在管理-mcp-端点发布工具","content":"在管理 MCP 端点发布工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"556":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-10","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#扩展之间的服务","content":"扩展之间的服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"557":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-11","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主偏好只读快照","content":"宿主偏好只读快照","locale":"zh-CN"},"558":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-12","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#运行时工具与诊断文档","content":"运行时工具与诊断文档","locale":"zh-CN"},"559":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-13","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#后台询问用户","content":"后台询问用户","locale":"zh-CN"},"560":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-14","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","content":"后端是扩展在开启期间运行的程序。它与应用通过自己的标准输入和标准输出通信，可以调用应用的宿主接口，并回答应用对它的调用：钩子、实例类型的提供者回调、面板与视图的调用，以及其他扩展的服务调用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"561":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-15","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","content":"本页概述后端需要了解的内容。每个方法的参数、结果、权限和限制见接口参考，各方法的语义见扩展后端协议参考。用 SDK 编写后端见 SDK。","locale":"zh-CN"},"562":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-16","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#两种后端","content":"每个操作系统一个可执行文件，路径相对于软件包根目录。没有当前系统的程序时，扩展显示“无法运行”。在 Linux 和 macOS 上，打包时保留程序的可执行权限。","locale":"zh-CN"},"563":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-17","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#两种后端","content":"应用等待托管 Python 和启动器代码资源就绪，然后执行 `<python> <版本目录>/backend.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"564":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-18","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#两种后端","content":"声明了 `requirements` 的扩展在应用启动、启用、更新、回滚和重试时，宿主会根据当前 Python 版本，在扩展自己的依赖目录（如 `data/python-packages/cp315/`）中检查声明与已安装包的元数据。首次使用该目录、缺包或版本不符时才运行 pip。安装任务可在任务中心取消。检查或安装出错时，宿主会显示原因并阻止后端启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"565":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-19","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#两种后端","content":"依赖要适配用户的托管解释器。缺少兼容 wheel 的依赖可能需要用户本机的编译器。可选依赖可以在 requirements 文件中使用环境标记（例如 `py7zr; python_version < \"3.15\"`），并在其他版本上处理缺少该模块的情况。依赖安装使用应用的代理与 PyPI 镜像设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"566":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-20","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#两种后端","content":"`PYTHONPATH` 依次包含应用自带的 Python SDK 和上面的依赖目录，因此脚本可以直接 `import hanafubuki_extension`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"567":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-21","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#两种后端","content":"`sdWebuiAllInOne = true`（可选）把应用自己的 `sd_webui_all_in_one` 库放在 SDK 和依赖目录之间，脚本因此可以 `import sd_webui_all_in_one`（使用它的下载器、解压等功能）。这个库是应用的集成代码，不是稳定的 SDK：请用 `engines.hanafubuki` 限定测试过的应用版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"568":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-22","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#两种后端","content":"额外设置 `PYTHONUTF8=1`、`PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1`、`PYTHONNOUSERSITE=1` 和 `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1`（已安装的版本目录从不被写入）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"569":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-23","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#进程与环境","content":"**工作目录**为扩展包根目录。安装副本位于 `extensions/<id>/<version>/`，开发链接则使用用户选中的源目录。按包根目录读取随包资源，通过 `HANAFUBUKI_EXTENSION_DATA` 或 `storage.path` 获取持久化文件的写入目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"570":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-24","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#进程与环境","content":"**环境变量**：从干净的环境开始，只传入应用环境中以下存在且为文本的变量：`PATH`、`HOME`、`USER`、`LOGNAME`、`SHELL`、`TMPDIR`、`LANG`、`LANGUAGE`、`LC_*`、`TZ`、`XDG_RUNTIME_DIR`，以及 Windows 上的 `USERPROFILE`、`SYSTEMROOT`、`SYSTEMDRIVE`、`WINDIR`、`COMSPEC`、`PATHEXT`、`TEMP`、`TMP`、`APPDATA`、`LOCALAPPDATA`、`PROGRAMDATA`、`PROGRAMFILES`、`NUMBER_OF_PROCESSORS`、`PROCESSOR_ARCHITECTURE`。另外设置：","locale":"zh-CN"},"571":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-25","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#进程与环境","content":"`HANAFUBUKI_EXTENSION_ID`：扩展 ID；","locale":"zh-CN"},"572":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-26","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#进程与环境","content":"`HANAFUBUKI_EXTENSION_DATA`：扩展的数据目录 `extensions/<id>/data/`，更新时保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"573":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-27","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#进程与环境","content":"应用的令牌、密钥和代理设置都不会传给后端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"574":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-28","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#进程与环境","content":"**输出**：标准输出只用于协议，不能写入其他内容。标准错误写入扩展的日志 `backend.log`（超过 1 MiB 时轮转），`log.write` 也写入这里。用户在扩展卡片上点击“查看日志”可以看到最后 256 KiB。","locale":"zh-CN"},"575":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-29","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#进程与环境","content":"后端以用户的权限运行。清单中的权限只限制它能调用哪些宿主接口，原生程序仍可以直接访问网络和文件系统。不要依赖权限来约束自己的代码，也不要让用户以为它们能做到这一点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"576":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-30","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#生命周期","content":"阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"577":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-31","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#生命周期","content":"发生什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"578":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-32","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#生命周期","content":"启动","locale":"zh-CN"},"579":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-33","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#生命周期","content":"扩展开启时启动进程，发送 `initialize`（10 秒内回答）；更新后若声明了 `migrate` 则调用它；声明了 `activate` 则调用它。三者合计须在 16 秒内完成，否则启动失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"580":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-34","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#生命周期","content":"运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"581":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-35","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#生命周期","content":"每 10 秒发送一次 `ping`，须在 5 秒内回答","locale":"zh-CN"},"582":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-36","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#生命周期","content":"停止","locale":"zh-CN"},"583":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-37","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#生命周期","content":"声明了 `deactivate` 则调用它，然后发送 `shutdown`，各最多 1 秒；随后关闭标准输入，再给进程 1 秒退出，之后强制结束。它通过 `process.run` 启动的进程也一并停止","locale":"zh-CN"},"584":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-38","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#生命周期","content":"在 `initialize` 中回答的协议版本必须为 `1`，否则启动失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"585":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-39","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#故障","content":"以下情况视为后端故障：进程退出、输出关闭、发送不是协议帧或不是 JSON-RPC 消息的内容、帧大于 4 MiB、标准输入不再接收、错过一次 `ping`，或连续三次调用超时（普通调用 30 秒，钩子 10 秒）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"586":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-40","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#故障","content":"发生故障时，等待中的调用全部失败，扩展进入“失败”，并按重启策略在 2、10、30 秒后自动重启（10 分钟内最多 3 次）。应用正常退出期间后端结束不算故障。","locale":"zh-CN"},"587":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-41","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#故障","content":"**反复崩溃**：每次启动前计数加一；后端稳定运行 30 秒、被正常停止或用户点击“重试”后清零。计数达到 3 时，扩展显示“因反复崩溃已停止”，在本次运行和之后的运行中都不再启动，直到用户点击“重试”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"588":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-42","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#协议概要","content":"**传输**：JSON-RPC 2.0，应用写入后端的标准输入，后端写入标准输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"589":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-43","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#协议概要","content":"**分帧**：与 Language Server Protocol 相同：若干 `Name: value` 头部行（以 `\\r\\n` 结尾），一个空行，然后是恰好 `Content-Length` 字节的 UTF-8 JSON。`Content-Length` 必填，名称不区分大小写，其他头部被忽略。头部最多 1 KiB，消息体最多 4 MiB。","locale":"zh-CN"},"590":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-44","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#协议概要","content":"**版本**：协议版本 `1`，由 `initialize` 双向确认。","locale":"zh-CN"},"591":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-45","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#协议概要","content":"**双向调用**：双方都可以随时调用对方。后端处理某个调用时可以调用宿主接口并等待结果。参数中未知的成员会被忽略，缺失的成员取默认值；参数无法读取时调用以 `INVALID_PARAMS` 失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"592":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-46","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#协议概要","content":"**并发**：应用同时最多回答同一后端的 16 个调用，超出的以 `BUSY` 失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"593":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-47","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#协议概要","content":"**时限**：应用对后端的调用（钩子除外）时限为 30 秒，单次超时只影响该调用，连续三次超时视为故障。","locale":"zh-CN"},"594":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-48","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#协议概要","content":"错误码","locale":"zh-CN"},"595":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-49","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#协议概要","content":"名称","locale":"zh-CN"},"596":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-50","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#协议概要","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"597":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-51","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#协议概要","content":"-32700","locale":"zh-CN"},"598":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-52","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#协议概要","content":"`PARSE_ERROR`","locale":"zh-CN"},"599":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-53","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#协议概要","content":"JSON-RPC 定义","locale":"zh-CN"},"600":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-54","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#协议概要","content":"-32600","locale":"zh-CN"},"601":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-55","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#协议概要","content":"`INVALID_REQUEST`","locale":"zh-CN"},"602":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-56","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#协议概要","content":"JSON-RPC 定义","locale":"zh-CN"},"603":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-57","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#协议概要","content":"-32601","locale":"zh-CN"},"604":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-58","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#协议概要","content":"`METHOD_NOT_FOUND`","locale":"zh-CN"},"605":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-59","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#协议概要","content":"没有该方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"606":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-60","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#协议概要","content":"-32602","locale":"zh-CN"},"607":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-61","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-