s","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#钩子","content":"停止时，`shutdown` 之前","locale":"zh-CN"},"639":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-93","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#钩子","content":"1 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"640":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-94","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#钩子","content":"`uninstall`","locale":"zh-CN"},"641":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-95","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#钩子","content":"卸载前（后端正在运行时）；失败只记录日志，不阻止卸载","locale":"zh-CN"},"642":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-96","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#钩子","content":"10 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"643":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-97","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#钩子","content":"`ui`","locale":"zh-CN"},"644":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-98","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#钩子","content":"不是一次调用：表示后端有界面状态（`ui.state`、`ui.call`、`ui.emit`，见界面）","locale":"zh-CN"},"645":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-99","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#钩子","content":"每次调用 10 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"646":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-100","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#钩子","content":"`diagnostics`","locale":"zh-CN"},"647":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-101","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#钩子","content":"用户收集诊断时，通过 `diagnostics.collect` 提供文档","locale":"zh-CN"},"648":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-102","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#钩子","content":"30 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"649":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-103","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#钩子","content":"不声明 `migrate` 的后端更新时不会收到迁移调用：声明它就是表示数据需要迁移。被替换的版本只在内存中保留到新版本第一次启动，若在此之前应用重启，迁移调用会丢失。","locale":"zh-CN"},"650":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-104","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"后端可以调用的方法。需要权限的方法会根据安装时授予的权限检查，被拒绝时返回 `PERMISSION_DENIED`。这些方法是独立的一组接口，不能访问应用自身的命令。访问应用自身功能的唯一途径是管理目录（`tools.list`、`tools.call`）：与内置 Agent 和 MCP 客户端相同的工具，受 `management` 权限限制，每次修改都需等待用户确认。","locale":"zh-CN"},"651":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-105","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"652":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-106","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"需要","locale":"zh-CN"},"653":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-107","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`host.info`、`host.preferences`、`runtime.status`、`log.write`、`settings.get`、`settings.patch`、`storage.path`、`ui.notify`、`ui.progress`、`ui.prompt`，以及通知 `ui.frame.emit` 和 `ui.emit`","locale":"zh-CN"},"654":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-108","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"655":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-109","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`instances.list`、`instances.get`","locale":"zh-CN"},"656":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-110","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`instances = \"read\"` 或 `\"all\"`","locale":"zh-CN"},"657":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-111","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`instances.ofType`、`instances.configuration`、`servers.status`","locale":"zh-CN"},"658":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-112","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`instances = \"own-types\"` 或 `\"all\"`；只涉及自己类型的实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"659":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-113","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`runtime.resolve`","locale":"zh-CN"},"660":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-114","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`processes = true`","locale":"zh-CN"},"661":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-115","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`process.run`、`process.cancel`","locale":"zh-CN"},"662":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-116","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`processes = true`；工作目录在数据目录内，或在 `filesystem = \"own-instances\"` 时也可以是自己类型实例的目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"663":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-117","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`http.request`、`download.fetch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"664":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-118","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"两者都要求 URL 主机匹配 `network`，并使用应用的代理。下载文件的目标必须在扩展数据目录内。","locale":"zh-CN"},"665":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-119","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`events.subscribe`","locale":"zh-CN"},"666":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-120","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`settings`、`preferences` 无需额外权限。`instance` 要求 `instances` 不为 `none`（`own-types` 只接收自己类型的实例）。`server` 要求 `own-types` 或 `all`。`task` 要求 `management = \"confirm\"`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"667":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-121","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`python.ensure`","locale":"zh-CN"},"668":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-122","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`processes = true`；目标严格位于数据目录之下，或在 `own-instances` 时位于自己类型实例的目录中","locale":"zh-CN"},"669":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-123","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`git.clone`、`git.pull`","locale":"zh-CN"},"670":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-124","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`processes = true`；远程主机匹配 `network`，或是可用范围内仓库的 `file` URL；目标或目录的范围同上","locale":"zh-CN"},"671":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-125","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`services.call`","locale":"zh-CN"},"672":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-126","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"清单中声明了对目标扩展的依赖，且方法在目标的 `exports` 中","locale":"zh-CN"},"673":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-127","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`instances.scan`","locale":"zh-CN"},"674":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-128","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`registerInstances = true`","locale":"zh-CN"},"675":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-129","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`instances.import`","locale":"zh-CN"},"676":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-130","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`registerInstances = true`，并且 `instances = \"own-types\"`（只能是自己的类型）或 `\"all\"`（任意类型）；为 `none` 或 `read` 时拒绝","locale":"zh-CN"},"677":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-131","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`tools.list`、`tools.call`","locale":"zh-CN"},"678":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-132","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`management = \"read\"`（只读工具）或 `\"confirm\"`（所有工具，每次修改都需用户允许）","locale":"zh-CN"},"679":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-133","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"要点：","locale":"zh-CN"},"680":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-134","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`host.info` 返回应用版本、协议版本、语言、平台（`linux`、`macos`、`windows`）、`instancesDir`（新实例默认所在的文件夹）和 `mirrors`（用户当前在设置中选择的下载镜像）：`automatic`（用户将镜像交给 `sd_webui_all_in_one` 自动检测，即其 `auto_mirror`，下面的开关作为它的输入）以及 `pypi`、`github`、`huggingface`，每项为 `{ enabled, custom }`（`custom` 为用户自己的镜像地址或 `null`；PyPI 没有自定义镜像）。通过 `download.fetch` 的显式 `source` 使用宿主镜像策略；`direct` 保留原始 URL。自行联网的脚本仍需自行应用策略。`settings.get` 返回扩展的设置值；`settings.patch {patch}` 只修改自身已声明字段并返回 canonical `{values}`；`storage.path` 返回数据目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"681":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-135","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`log.write` 可以作为调用或通知发送，级别为 `error`、`warn`、`info`（默认）或 `debug`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"682":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-136","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`instances.list`、`instances.get` 返回只读的实例信息：`id`、`name`、`type`、`path`、`running` 和 `components`（按组件名，每个为 `{ path, external }`：平台原生形式的文件夹，以及它是否为用户自己的文件夹；实例的组件无法解析时为空）。框架或面板的调用只带实例 id，请在其中通过 `instances.get` 读取组件：它们会跟随用户在“路径”中的修改。`servers.status` 返回每个服务器角色的 `instanceId`、`role`、`status`（`stopped`、`starting`、`running`、`restarting`、`stopping`、`failed`）和 `endpoint`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"683":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-137","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`process.run` 接收 `argv`（不经过 shell）、`cwd` 和追加到干净环境中的 `env`，立即返回 `taskId`；输出通过 `process.output` 通知发送，结束时发送 `process.exit`。`process.cancel` 停止它。这些进程随后端一起停止。`useHostProxy: true` 显式给这个子进程注入当前宿主代理环境，并覆盖 `env` 中的同名值；默认为 `false`。主动选择后，该子进程可读取这些代理值及其中可能含有的凭据。 任务详情保留标准输出和错误输出，可查看、复制或导出。指定自有类型的 `instanceId` 可以从其管理窗口找到这条进程任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"684":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-138","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`download.fetch` 接收 `url`、可选的 `sha256` 和 `destination`，返回 `{path, sha256}`。可选 `source` 为 `direct`（默认）、`github` 或 `huggingface`；显式来源必须匹配 URL，并应用当前宿主镜像策略。`cache: true` 仅在提供 `sha256` 时复用经过摘要校验的内容；无摘要时正常下载。命中后复制到扩展的目标文件，不暴露缓存路径或写权限。下载失败不替换原目标文件。 任务中心记录传输的字节数，响应缺少总长度时使用不定进度条。","locale":"zh-CN"},"685":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-139","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`http.request` 通过宿主代理执行有界 UTF-8 HTTP。参数为 `url`、`method`（默认 `GET`，另支持 `HEAD`、`POST`、`PUT`、`PATCH`、`DELETE`、`OPTIONS`）、可重复的 `{name, value}` headers 列表、可选文本 `body`、`maxBytes` 和 `timeoutMs`。限额只能缩小生成参考中展示的宿主默认值。返回 `{status, headers, body}`；HTTP 404/500 也正常返回状态。无效输入为 `INVALID_PARAMS`，未授权主机为 `PERMISSION_DENIED`，网络、大小或 UTF-8 失败为 `REQUEST_FAILED`。二进制文件使用 `download.fetch`；请求不会自动注入宿主凭据。","locale":"zh-CN"},"686":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-140","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`python.ensure` 在指定位置安装应用支持的 Python 版本；`git.clone`（目标不能已存在）和 `git.pull`（只快进）使用应用的 Git，不会弹出凭据提示，并经过应用的代理。三者都立即返回 `taskId`（首次运行时若应用仍在准备 Git，`git.*` 会先等它就绪），作为任务出现在任务中心，以 `process.exit` 结束，可用 `process.cancel` 停止。","locale":"zh-CN"},"687":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-141","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`instances.scan` 接收绝对路径 `path`，像“扫描”一样对这个文件夹运行应用的实例发现：识别应用已知的 WebUI 布局和所有已注册类型的发现签名并添加为实例，返回 `attached`（新实例的 id）和 `warnings`（除完整新实例外的所有结果，例如已经是实例的文件夹，或找到但缺少 Python 的 WebUI——它已被添加但仍需安装；请宽松地读取）。`instances.import` 接收 `type`、绝对路径 `path`，以及可选的 `name`、`componentPaths`（绝对路径或相对于 `path`）和 `values`，把该文件夹导入为该类型的就绪实例并返回 `id`；该文件夹和每个组件文件夹都必须存在，已被实例使用的文件夹会被拒绝。两者都在完成后才返回，不是任务中心中的活动：扫描大文件夹可能需要一段时间，所以请先回答视图或面板的调用，在自己的线程中扫描，并用 `ui.progress` 报告进度。停止后端会取消扫描。","locale":"zh-CN"},"688":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-142","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`ui.notify`（`info`、`warning`、`error`）和 `ui.progress`（相同 `id` 更新同一项）显示为任务中心中的活动。`ui.progress` 可传入本扩展类型的 `instanceId`，在该实例管理页显示进度，此时 `id` 的范围是该实例。 在上报进度时指定 `showOnHome: true`，运行中的任务也会显示在首页状态区。","locale":"zh-CN"},"689":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-143","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`tools.list` 列出管理工具及每个工具所需的 `management` 级别；`tools.call` 接受工具的 `name` 和 `arguments`，回答工具本身的结果（全部工具见接口参考）。修改会在应用窗口中以扩展的名义询问用户（最长一分钟），并记录到任务中心，因此请在自己的线程中调用，不要在应用等待的视图或面板调用中调用。它不能重启扩展自己的行或其依赖的扩展。按工具的 `builtInOnly` 标记判断适用范围。扩展实例类型采用内置管理能力并声明相应分区后，也能使用版本、扩展、模型和环境分区的工具。`install_extension` 给 WebUI 实例安装插件，`list_host_extensions` 列出 Hanafubuki 已安装的桌面扩展。","locale":"zh-CN"},"690":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-144","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"`events.subscribe` 会整体替换订阅。每次传入全部需要的主题，传 `{\"topics\":[]}` 可取消订阅。宿主每 2 秒检查一次实例和服务器状态的变化。从设置页、视图或后端成功写入扩展设置后，`settings` 事件在 `event.params.data.values` 中带回保存后的有效值。`task` 主题为此扩展通过 `tools.call` 启动的任务中心活动发送 `{phase, activity}`，阶段为 `start`、`progress`、`end`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"691":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-145","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"如果扩展要使用可选接口，先在 `host.info` 的 `capabilities.methods` 或 `capabilities.topics` 中查找名称。扩展实际获授的权限可从 `initialize.permissions` 读取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"692":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-146","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主接口","content":"**发给后端的通知**：`event`（`topic` 和 `data`）、`process.output`（`taskId`、`stream`、`data`）和 `process.exit`（`taskId`、`status` 为 `exited`、`failed` 或 `cancelled`、`exitCode`、`error`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"693":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-147","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"声明 `provider = \"backend\"` 的类型通过回调校验参数、生成安装和启动计划。带后端的声明式类型也可提供按实例加载的启动选项，也可单独接入更新检查或自定义维护操作，继续使用静态安装和启动计划。每个回调的时限为 30 秒。详见实例类型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"694":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-148","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"695":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-149","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"696":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-150","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"返回","locale":"zh-CN"},"697":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-151","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"`provider.validateSpec`","locale":"zh-CN"},"698":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-152","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"`type`、`values`（应用完成表单检查后的参数值）、可选的 `instance`","locale":"zh-CN"},"699":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-153","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"`issues`：按参数给出的问题，没有问题时为 `{}`","locale":"zh-CN"},"700":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-154","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"`provider.installPlan`","locale":"zh-CN"},"701":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-155","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"`type`、`kind`（`install`：首次安装或重试；`reinstall`：重新执行安装；`update`：已就绪实例的更新）、`recreateComponents`（本次选中的组件名）、`values`、`instance`","locale":"zh-CN"},"702":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-156","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"`steps`：步骤列表，写法与描述文件中的 `install.steps` 相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"703":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-157","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"`provider.launchOptions`","locale":"zh-CN"},"704":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-158","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"`type`、`instance`","locale":"zh-CN"},"705":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-159","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"`options` 将启动字段的 `optionsSource` 映射为该实例可选的字符串数组。","locale":"zh-CN"},"706":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-160","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"`provider.launchPlan`","locale":"zh-CN"},"707":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-161","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"`type`、`role`、`port`、`values`、`launchValues`、`instance`","locale":"zh-CN"},"708":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-162","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"`argv`、`env`，可以使用占位符和 `{port}`","locale":"zh-CN"},"709":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-163","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"`provider.checkUpdate`","locale":"zh-CN"},"710":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-164","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"`type`、`values`（实例的参数值）、`instance`","locale":"zh-CN"},"711":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-165","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"`hasUpdate`：是否有适用的更新（参数值固定了版本的实例为 `false`）；可选的 `current`、`latest`（面向用户的版本文字）和 `notes`。可选的 `components` 列出各组件的 `{name, current?, latest?, hasUpdate}`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"712":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-166","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"`provider.manage.<operation>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"713":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-167","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"`type`、`operation`、`instance`、`values`（已校验的表单值，含默认值）","locale":"zh-CN"},"714":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-168","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"可选的 `notice` 和 `steps`，步骤格式与安装计划一致","locale":"zh-CN"},"715":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-169","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"回调中的 `instance` 包含 `id` 和按名称索引的 `components`。例如 `instance.components.core.path` 是 `core` 当前的本机路径，`external: true` 表示这是用户拥有的目录。检查组件时读取该路径，返回计划时使用 `{component.core}`。已有实例使用新参数重装时，`provider.validateSpec` 会收到这个对象；创建时还没有实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"716":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-170","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"只有声明了 `update-check` 的类型才会被调用 `provider.checkUpdate`：卡片上的“检查更新”和每日更新检查都会调用它，每日检查对每个实例依次调用一次。它是只读的：实例可能正在运行，检查不能改变任何内容。请尽快回答：在实例之间缓存或共享获取到的内容（例如发布列表），因为超过 30 秒的调用会失败，连续三次超时会结束通道。返回的错误会显示为该实例这次检查的错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"717":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-171","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"自定义操作在实例停止时运行，期间实例处于独占维护状态；实例正在运行或另有维护进行时会被拒绝。除了实例的管理页面，MCP 客户端和内置助手也可以通过管理 MCP 服务器的 `run_instance_operation` 工具运行它，外部客户端需要“完全访问”权限才能免确认调用（管理 MCP 服务器）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"718":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-172","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"通过 `instances.configuration` 传入 `{ id }`，可以读取自己类型的单个实例。`values` 和 `launchValues` 分别返回已声明的非秘密安装字段和启动字段，包括默认值。凭据会被遮盖。`valuesTruncated` 和 `launchValuesTruncated` 标明结果是否被截断。","locale":"zh-CN"},"719":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-173","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#提供者回调","content":"面板和视图的调用（`ui.panel.query`、`ui.panel.action`、`ui.frame.call`）、界面状态的 `ui.state` 和 `ui.call`，以及 `ui.frame.emit` 和 `ui.emit` 通知见界面。这两个只能作为通知发送：作为请求发送时，应用回答 `METHOD_NOT_FOUND`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"720":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-174","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#在管理-mcp-端点发布工具","content":"对带后端的扩展，在清单中声明工具及其参数。例如，`com.example.greeter` 可以声明：","locale":"zh-CN"},"721":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-175","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#在管理-mcp-端点发布工具","content":"启用扩展后，内置助手和外部客户端都可以通过 `hanafubuki` 发现 `ext_com_example_greeter__greet`。后端通过 `service.greet` 处理调用，Python SDK 对应 `Backend.service`。管理端点传入的 `caller` 为 `mcp:hanafubuki`，`params` 是客户端提供的参数对象。后端验证参数并返回 JSON 结果。停用扩展会撤回它发布的工具。","locale":"zh-CN"},"722":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-176","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#在管理-mcp-端点发布工具","content":"发布 MCP 工具需要清单声明和对应的后端处理方法。`management` 权限用于后端主动调用宿主管理工具。若也要让依赖此扩展的其他扩展通过 `services.call` 调用同一方法，再将它加入 `backend.exports`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"723":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-177","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#扩展之间的服务","content":"扩展可以在 `[backend] exports` 中列出允许其他扩展调用的方法。依赖它的扩展调用：","locale":"zh-CN"},"724":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-178","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#扩展之间的服务","content":"应用把它转发给目标扩展的后端，作为 `service.models.list` 调用，参数为 `{ \"caller\": \"<调用方 ID>\", \"params\": … }`，并把目标的回答返回给调用方。","locale":"zh-CN"},"725":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-179","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#扩展之间的服务","content":"调用方的清单没有依赖目标，或方法不在目标的 `exports` 中，返回 `PERMISSION_DENIED`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"726":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-180","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#扩展之间的服务","content":"目标的后端没有运行，返回 `UNAVAILABLE`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"727":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-181","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#扩展之间的服务","content":"目标出错或在调用中途结束，只使该调用失败；目标的故障只影响目标自己。","locale":"zh-CN"},"728":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-182","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主偏好只读快照","content":"需要查询模型下载来源或 Micromamba 镜像开关时，具有管理读取权限的后端可通过 `tools.call` 调用 `get_app_runtime_status`，传入 `{\"runtime\":\"mirrors\"}`，读取 `modelSource` 和 `useMicromamba`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"729":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-183","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主偏好只读快照","content":"`host.preferences {}` 无需额外权限，返回 `{locale, instancesDir, mirrors, network}`。语言、native 实例目录与镜像沿用 `host.info` 的含义及 null 默认值；`network` 仅包含 `proxyMode`（`system`、`manual`、`disabled`）和 `proxyConfigured`。已配置不代表代理有效或可达。快照不含代理 URL 或凭据，也不能修改应用设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"730":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-184","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主偏好只读快照","content":"用 `events.subscribe` 订阅 `preferences`，再通过 `host.preferences` 读取当前快照。每条对应的 `event` 在 `params.data` 中携带同型完整快照。相关宿主设置成功保存后发布；代理地址改变时即使公开字段不变也会发布。无关设置或保存失败不发布。后端重启后重新订阅并读取，没有事件重放。`settings` 仍只表示扩展自己的设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"731":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-185","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#宿主偏好只读快照","content":"生成的事件主题参考 从协议 registry 直接展示 payload 字段及权限。","locale":"zh-CN"},"732":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-186","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#运行时工具与诊断文档","content":"`runtime.status {tool?}` 读取现有 readiness 快照，不启动准备。不传 `tool` 时列出 `python`、`git` 和 `micromamba`。每项包含 `tool`、`status`（`notReady`、`preparing`、`ready`、`failed`、`unavailable`），以及可选的 native `path`、已验证的版本或版本命令输出 `version`、`error`。读取无需额外权限，`version` 不保证是语义化版本字符串。","locale":"zh-CN"},"733":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-187","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#运行时工具与诊断文档","content":"`runtime.resolve {tool}` 要求 `processes = true`。它等待宿主已有的准备流程，返回 `{tool, path, version}`；模块不可用或准备失败时返回实际原因。后端停止会取消等待。SDK 不用较短的客户端计时器截断准备。将返回的 native 可执行文件路径传给 `process.run` 即可使用工具；不开放删除工具或修改运行时配置的接口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"734":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-188","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#运行时工具与诊断文档","content":"要提供单个实例的诊断文档，声明 `diagnostics.collectInstance`。宿主传入该扩展所属类型的实例 `{id}`，将文档写入实例诊断目录下的 `extensions/<id>/`。Rust 实现 `InstanceDiagnostics` 并从 `Handler::instance_diagnostics` 返回，Python 覆盖 `diagnostics_collect_instance(host, instance_id)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"735":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-189","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#运行时工具与诊断文档","content":"后端在 `initialize.hooks` 声明 `diagnostics`，以 `{documents: [{name, text}]}` 回答 `diagnostics.collect {}`。name 是单个文件名，不是路径；text 可为普通文本或序列化 JSON。宿主写入诊断 workspace 的 `app/extensions/<id>/`，内容不得包含凭据。扩展停用或卸载后移除贡献；采集失败或超时记为 bundle issue，其他贡献继续。生成的方法参考直接展示实际调用时限、最大文档数和总字节限制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"736":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-190","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#运行时工具与诊断文档","content":"上面的 Python 清单直接来自完整 `configuration-python` 包，实际 `backend.py` 使用 SDK 的 initialize/ping/shutdown 协议循环。包验证只检查文件，不准备托管 Python 或启动后端；单独的本地协议 smoke 不代表桌面验收。原生命令映射片段说明如何选择可执行文件，不是可直接安装的完整包；该路径应构建并打包 greeter 示例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"737":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends-191","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-backends","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-backends#后台询问用户","content":"后台操作需要用户选择时，调用 `ui.prompt`，例如 Python 的\n`host.ui_prompt({\"id\": \"model-name\", \"kind\": \"text\", \"message\": \"模型名称？\"})`。\n每个问题使用新的本地 ID。方法在问题受理后返回，主窗口以扩展 ID 标明来源。\n在后端的通知回调中处理 `ui.prompt.result`，按 `id` 关联操作：\n`accepted` 表示确认，`text` 是提交的文本，允许为空字符串；取消和确认类问题的\n`text` 是 null。每个后端可保留一个待答问题，再次询问会得到 `BUSY`。\n后端停用或重启时撤回待答问题。管理操作仍使用宿主自己的确认。","locale":"zh-CN"},"738":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","type":"page","content":"实例类型","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","扩展开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","locale":"zh-CN"},"739":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-0","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","content":"用描述文件声明实例类型：组件、运行时、安装参数、安装与更新步骤、占位符、服务器角色、管理操作、发现，以及由后端提供的类型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"740":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-1","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#完整示例","content":"完整示例","locale":"zh-CN"},"741":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-2","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#顶层字段","content":"顶层字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"742":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-3","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#组件","content":"组件","locale":"zh-CN"},"743":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-4","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#运行时","content":"运行时","locale":"zh-CN"},"744":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-5","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#文本","content":"文本","locale":"zh-CN"},"745":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-6","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#安装参数","content":"安装参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"746":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-7","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#占位符","content":"占位符","locale":"zh-CN"},"747":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-8","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"步骤","locale":"zh-CN"},"748":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-9","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"服务器","locale":"zh-CN"},"749":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-10","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#管理-api","content":"管理 API","locale":"zh-CN"},"750":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-11","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#环境","content":"环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"751":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-12","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#管理操作","content":"管理操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"752":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-13","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#只读模型组件","content":"只读模型组件","locale":"zh-CN"},"753":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-14","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"采用内置类型的管理功能","locale":"zh-CN"},"754":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-15","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#发现","content":"发现","locale":"zh-CN"},"755":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-16","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"由后端提供的类型","locale":"zh-CN"},"756":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-17","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#预设","content":"预设","locale":"zh-CN"},"757":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-18","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","content":"扩展通过描述文件为应用添加实例类型。清单中 `contributes.instanceTypes` 的 glob 匹配的每个 `.toml` 或 `.json` 文件都是一个类型，其 ID 为 `<扩展 ID>:<name>`，例如 `com.example.llama:llama-server`。用户新建安装时可以选择这些类型，应用根据描述完成安装、启动和管理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"758":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-19","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","content":"描述文件按宽松方式解码，未知字段会被忽略；但未知的步骤类型、就绪检查或运行时会被拒绝。所有检查在注册时进行，任何问题都会带着位置（如 `servers[1].command[0]`，或行列号）报告，类型不会被注册，扩展也无法安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"759":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-20","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#完整示例","content":"JSON 描述使用相同的键名，例如 `\"displayName\"`、`\"install\": { \"parameters\": [...], \"steps\": [...] }`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"760":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-21","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#顶层字段","content":"键","locale":"zh-CN"},"761":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-22","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#顶层字段","content":"必填","locale":"zh-CN"},"762":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-23","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#顶层字段","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"763":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-24","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#顶层字段","content":"`name`","locale":"zh-CN"},"764":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-25","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#顶层字段","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"765":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-26","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#顶层字段","content":"类型名，由 `a-z`、`0-9`、`.`、`-` 组成；类型 ID 为 `<扩展 ID>:<name>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"766":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-27","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#顶层字段","content":"`provider`","locale":"zh-CN"},"767":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-28","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#顶层字段","content":"否","locale":"zh-CN"},"768":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-29","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#顶层字段","content":"`declarative`（默认）或 `backend`（见由后端提供的类型）","locale":"zh-CN"},"769":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-30","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#顶层字段","content":"`displayName`","locale":"zh-CN"},"770":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-31","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#顶层字段","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"771":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-32","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#顶层字段","content":"显示名称，见文本","locale":"zh-CN"},"772":{"id":"/docs/exte