pes-146","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#占位符","content":"扩展的包目录（开发链接时为其文件夹）","locale":"zh-CN"},"886":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-147","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#占位符","content":"步骤、服务器命令与环境变量","locale":"zh-CN"},"887":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-148","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#占位符","content":"`{host.python}`","locale":"zh-CN"},"888":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-149","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#占位符","content":"应用托管的 Python，即 Python 后端所用的解释器","locale":"zh-CN"},"889":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-150","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#占位符","content":"步骤、服务器命令与环境变量","locale":"zh-CN"},"890":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-151","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#占位符","content":"写 `{{` 和 `}}` 表示字面的花括号。引用未声明的组件或参数、在别处使用 `{port}`、未闭合的 `{` 都会在注册时报错。","locale":"zh-CN"},"891":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-152","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#占位符","content":"`{extension.root}` 用来定位包内文件，步骤的输出写到组件路径。`run` 步骤或服务器的程序是 `{host.python}` 时，它可以导入应用的 `sd_webui_all_in_one`（启动器代码位于 `PYTHONPATH` 最前），并设置 `PYTHONUTF8`、`PYTHONUNBUFFERED`、`PYTHONNOUSERSITE` 为 `1`。应用运行时正在准备解释器时，解析该占位符会等待；如果准备已失败，操作会返回运行时的错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"892":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-153","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#占位符","content":"**步骤的路径字段**（`to`、`unpackTo`、`archive`、`into`、`dir`、`cwd`、`path`）以 `{component.<name>}` 开头，之后可以用 `/` 接组件内的路径，例如 `{component.core}/bin/server`。如果解析后的路径会离开组件，该步骤会被拒绝。`environment.path` 的条目还可以从 `{instance.root}` 开始。","locale":"zh-CN"},"893":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-154","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"首次安装和重试执行 `[[install.steps]]`。显式重装可以用 `[[reinstall.steps]]` 指定另外一组步骤，省略时沿用安装计划。步骤可以带本地化标题，例如 `title = { zh = \"生成模型索引\", en = \"Build model index\" }`。工作区会显示当前步骤标题，失败后也能查看。对于静态类型，`[[update.steps]]` 是已就绪实例更新时执行的步骤（没有声明时使用 `install.steps`）。步骤按顺序执行，第一个失败的步骤使整个操作失败。安装进度会显示当前步骤和已完成的数量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"894":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-155","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"`kind`","locale":"zh-CN"},"895":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-156","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"键","locale":"zh-CN"},"896":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-157","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"897":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-158","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"`download`","locale":"zh-CN"},"898":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-159","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"`url`、`sha256`，以及 `to` 或 `unpackTo` 之一","locale":"zh-CN"},"899":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-160","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"经应用代理下载，`https://github.com/...` 会先尝试配置的 GitHub 镜像。`sha256` 必填：64 位十六进制，或引用一个参数；摘要不符时不替换任何内容。`to` 保存为文件，`unpackTo` 解压到目录，可同 `unpack` 一样指定 `strip`","locale":"zh-CN"},"900":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-161","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"`unpack`","locale":"zh-CN"},"901":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-162","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"`archive`、`into`，可选 `strip`","locale":"zh-CN"},"902":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-163","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"解压 zip 或 tar（gz、xz、bz2）；会离开目标目录的条目或链接会被拒绝；已有目录时逐项替换同名条目并保留其他内容。`strip = N` 去掉每个条目路径的前 `N` 段（`1` 即去掉压缩包的顶层目录）；去掉后不剩内容的文件、或去掉后同名的两个条目会被拒绝。tar 中的符号链接可以用开头的 `..` 指向上层（如 Node.js 的 `bin/npm -> ../lib/...`），但不能指出 `strip` 保留的部分","locale":"zh-CN"},"903":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-164","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"`git-clone`","locale":"zh-CN"},"904":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-165","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"`url`、`into`，可选 `branch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"905":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-166","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"使用应用的 Git 克隆；目标处已有仓库时跳过，交给 `git-pull`","locale":"zh-CN"},"906":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-167","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"`git-pull`","locale":"zh-CN"},"907":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-168","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"`dir`","locale":"zh-CN"},"908":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-169","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"拉取已有仓库","locale":"zh-CN"},"909":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-170","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"`run`","locale":"zh-CN"},"910":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-171","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"`command`，可选 `cwd`（默认 `{component.core}`）和 `env`","locale":"zh-CN"},"911":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-172","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"直接执行程序（不经过 shell），`command` 第一项是程序；输出记入任务，失败时附带最后 4 KiB 输出","locale":"zh-CN"},"912":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-173","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"`python-env`","locale":"zh-CN"},"913":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-174","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"914":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-175","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"在 `python` 组件中准备应用管理的 Python；之后的 `run` 步骤会优先在 `PATH` 中找到它。仅用于 Python 运行时","locale":"zh-CN"},"915":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-176","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"`write-file`","locale":"zh-CN"},"916":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-177","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"`path`、`content`","locale":"zh-CN"},"917":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-178","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"写入文件；目标目录解析到组件之外时被拒绝","locale":"zh-CN"},"918":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-179","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"`probe`","locale":"zh-CN"},"919":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-180","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"`url`，可选 `timeoutSeconds`（默认 60）","locale":"zh-CN"},"920":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-181","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"等待本机 `http://` 地址（`127.0.0.1`、`localhost` 或 `[::1]`）返回 2xx","locale":"zh-CN"},"921":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-182","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#步骤","content":"`unpack` 和指定 `unpackTo` 的 `download` 还支持 `replace = true`。当更新需要清除旧版本独有的文件时，可以使用该选项。宿主先在目标目录旁完成解包，再整体替换目标目录。如果其中包含实例的其他组件，宿主会拒绝替换。省略 `replace` 时，解包到已有目录会保留与本次解包无关的条目。","locale":"zh-CN"},"922":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-183","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"每个 `[[servers]]` 是一个服务器角色。声明式类型的启动就是按顺序启动它的所有服务器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"923":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-184","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"键","locale":"zh-CN"},"924":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-185","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"925":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-186","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"`role`","locale":"zh-CN"},"926":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-187","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"必填：1 到 64 个 `a-z`、`0-9`、`-` 字符；`control` 是管理 API（见下文）","locale":"zh-CN"},"927":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-188","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"`command`","locale":"zh-CN"},"928":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-189","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"程序及参数，第一项是程序。后端类型可省略此项，由 `provider.launchPlan` 规划该角色","locale":"zh-CN"},"929":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-190","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"`env`","locale":"zh-CN"},"930":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-191","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"环境变量，值可以使用占位符","locale":"zh-CN"},"931":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-192","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"`port`","locale":"zh-CN"},"932":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-193","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"`{ allocate = true }`（默认，自动分配）、`{ fixed = 8080 }`、`{ param = \"<数值安装字段>\" }` 或 `{ launch = \"<数值启动字段>\" }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"933":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-194","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"`readiness`","locale":"zh-CN"},"934":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-195","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"除 `control` 外必填。从 `{ http = \"/health\" }`（绝对路径）、`{ tcp = true }`、`{ stdout = \"<正则表达式>\" }`、`{ captured = true }` 中选一种。可选的 `timeoutSeconds` 默认为 120。","locale":"zh-CN"},"935":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-196","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"`after`","locale":"zh-CN"},"936":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-197","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"在哪些角色之后启动；不能引用未声明的角色，不能形成循环","locale":"zh-CN"},"937":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-198","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"`restart`","locale":"zh-CN"},"938":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-199","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"`never`（默认）或 `on-failure`（失败后在限额内自动重启）","locale":"zh-CN"},"939":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-200","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"`webview`","locale":"zh-CN"},"940":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-201","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"为 `true` 时，该角色运行后其地址会作为页面出现在 WebUI 标签页中；默认 `false`","locale":"zh-CN"},"941":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-202","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"`required`","locale":"zh-CN"},"942":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-203","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"默认 `true`。必需角色失败会使启动失败；非必需角色失败时实例以降级状态继续运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"943":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-204","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"服务器进程以 `core` 组件为工作目录。`env` 中的变量与实例的环境变量合并，同名时以实例的为准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"944":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-205","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"界面位于子路径时，可以设置 `webview = true`、`webviewPath = \"/dashboard/\"`，健康检查仍可使用独立路径。用 `externalBrowserPath = \"/studio\"` 可以为顶部栏的浏览器按钮单独指定同源页面。\n声明 `after = [\"api\"]` 的角色可在命令和环境中使用 `{endpoint.api}`。宿主在启动时填入本实例已就绪的 API 服务地址，含实际分配的端口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"945":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-206","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#服务器","content":"如果服务自行决定浏览器打开的地址，例如 URL 中带有会话令牌，可以用 `readiness = { captured = true }`。宿主每次启动时分配新的运行时代理会话，程序通过 `browser.open` 事件上报本机回环 HTTP(S) 地址。使用 `sd_webui_all_in_one` 时，可用 `DesktopBrokerClient.from_env()` 创建客户端，再调用它的 `emit_event(\"browser.open\", {\"url\": url})`。宿主收到第一个有效地址后将角色标为就绪；配置 `webview = true` 时，页面会保留 URL 中的查询参数。只向标准输出打印地址会让这种探测一直等到超时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"946":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-207","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#管理-api","content":"使用 Python 运行时的类型还可以在实例自己的 Python 上运行应用的管理 API，即每个内置 WebUI 都运行的控制服务器。声明 `control` 角色（只能写 `after` 和 `required`），并让自己的角色在它之后启动：","locale":"zh-CN"},"947":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-208","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#管理-api","content":"应用会先启动它，再启动你的角色；实例信息和“设置 → API 服务器”中会显示该实例的管理 API，实例被管理或启动期间它保持运行。停止或重启它不会停止你的角色。没有 Python 运行时的类型不能声明 `control`，错误信息会说明原因。仅声明这个角色不会增加任何管理页；类型通过采用内置类型的管理功能获得内置 WebUI 的版本、扩展、模型和 PyTorch 管理页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"948":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-209","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#管理-api","content":"用 `[[launch.parameters]]` 声明每个实例的启动字段，写法与安装参数相同。用户在「启动」页修改，下次启动服务时生效，无需重装。服务命令和环境变量可引用 `{launch.name}`。服务可用 `cwd = \"{component.core}/service\"` 指定工作目录，默认使用 core。后端启动计划同时收到安装参数 `values` 和启动参数 `launchValues`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"949":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-210","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#管理-api","content":"在 `[launch]` 设置 `preflight = true` 后，宿主在启动整组服务前调用一次 `provider.launchPreflight`，传入 `type`、`instance`、安装参数 `values` 和已应用默认值的 `launchValues`。只读检查成功时返回 `{}`，失败时返回带原因的 RPC 错误。例如，greeter 在启动前检查所选问候语文件是否仍然存在。单独重启服务角色时不会重复检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"950":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-211","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#管理-api","content":"扩展有后端时，`kind = \"select\"` 的启动字段可以声明 `optionsSource = \"models\"`。用户打开某个实例的「启动」页时，宿主调用 `provider.launchOptions`。例如，返回 `{ \"options\": { \"models\": [\"a.gguf\", \"b.gguf\"] } }` 即可列出这个实例的模型。管理工具 `get_instance_launch_options` 按字段名列出该实例可选的非秘密候选。静态选项仍然可选。保存新选中的动态值时，宿主会核对该值。后端离线或旧模型已经移除时，可以保留已保存的值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"951":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-212","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#管理-api","content":"类型顶层可写 `quickPaths = [{ name = \"输出\", component = \"core\", path = \"output\" }]`，在创建、导入或扫描纳管时生成概览中的初始快捷目录。之后由用户重命名、排序或删除。迁移时指向原实例根目录内的快捷路径同步移动，其他快捷路径保持原目标。可以在类型顶层声明本地化 `migrationNotice`，在迁移预览中提示用户软件配置中可能需要更新的绝对路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"952":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-213","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#环境","content":"`[environment]` 作用于类型的 `run` 步骤、服务器和终端：","locale":"zh-CN"},"953":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-214","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#环境","content":"`unset` 按完整名称或带末尾 `*` 的前缀移除继承的变量。Windows 匹配变量名时忽略大小写。显式设置的同名变量仍会生效，实例自己的环境变量优先于 `vars` 以及步骤或服务器的 `env`。`path` 的每一项都从组件或实例根目录开始。`{port}` 仅用于服务器角色的命令或环境变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"954":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-215","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#管理操作","content":"`[management] operations` 列出实例提供的标准操作之外的管理操作。声明式类型可以声明 `update` 和 `terminal`。声明 `update` 后，已就绪实例的“更新”会执行 `update.steps`（或 `install.steps`）；不声明则不能更新。声明 `terminal` 后，实例提供以 `core` 为目录、带有类型环境的终端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"955":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-216","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#只读模型组件","content":"在 `components` 中声明组件（例如 `weights`），再在 `[management]` 下设置 `modelComponent = \"weights\"`。用户即可在「模型」页浏览此实例该组件的文件和文件夹，包括位于实例目录之外的组件。MCP 也可通过 `list_model_entries` 和 `list_model_directories` 浏览。此功能无需控制服务器，且只允许读取。只读模型组件与从内置类型采用的 `models` 操作只能选用其中一个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"956":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-217","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"类型可以采用一个内置类型，按需选择应用提供的管理功能：","locale":"zh-CN"},"957":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-218","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"在 `[management]` 中使用 `allowedMutations = []` 可提供只读分区，也可列出允许的写操作，如 `[\"model.download\", \"extension.update\"]`。模型库安装和 PyTorch 重装分别使用 `model.library_install` 和 `pytorch.reinstall`。省略此项时沿用该类型原有的操作范围。","locale":"zh-CN"},"958":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-219","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"`adopts` 用类型 id 指定一个内置类型：`builtin:sd-webui`、`builtin:comfyui`、`builtin:invokeai`、`builtin:fooocus`、`builtin:sd-trainer`、`builtin:qwen-tts-webui`、`builtin:rvc-next-webui` 或 `builtin:mizuoto-tts-webui`。类型需要满足：","locale":"zh-CN"},"959":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-220","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"`runtime = { kind = \"python\" }` 并声明 `control` 角色：这些管理页由管理 API 提供；","locale":"zh-CN"},"960":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-221","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"`core` 是实例自己的目录。`core` 声明了 `external = \"allowed\"` 的类型不能采用，因为这些管理页会修改 `core` 中的内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"961":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-222","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"列出的每个操作为实例的管理页面增加一个管理页：","locale":"zh-CN"},"962":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-223","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"963":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-224","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"管理页及其功能","locale":"zh-CN"},"964":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-225","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"你对实例作出的保证","locale":"zh-CN"},"965":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-226","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"`versions`","locale":"zh-CN"},"966":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-227","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"版本：检出的状态、分支和提交，切换分支或提交。没有“更新”按钮","locale":"zh-CN"},"967":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-228","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"`core` 是一个 Git 检出","locale":"zh-CN"},"968":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-229","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"`extensions`","locale":"zh-CN"},"969":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-230","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"扩展：被采用类型的扩展（`core/extensions`，ComfyUI 为 `core/custom_nodes`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"970":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-231","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"`core` 的目录结构与被采用类型的安装一致","locale":"zh-CN"},"971":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-232","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"`models`","locale":"zh-CN"},"972":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-233","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"模型：`core/models`（SD Trainer 为 `core/sd-models`）下的文件，以及被采用类型的模型库","locale":"zh-CN"},"973":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-234","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"`core` 的目录结构与被采用类型的安装一致","locale":"zh-CN"},"974":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-235","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"`environment`","locale":"zh-CN"},"975":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-236","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"管理工具读取的环境报告","locale":"zh-CN"},"976":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-237","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"实例的 `python` 是程序运行的环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"977":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-238","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"`pytorch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"978":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-239","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"PyTorch 目录与重装","locale":"zh-CN"},"979":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-240","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"实例的 `python` 是程序运行的环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"980":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-241","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"类型可以只为 `versions` 和 `environment` 采用，这两项不要求特定的目录结构。被采用的类型是否支持某个管理页由该类型决定：采用 `builtin:fooocus` 没有扩展管理，对应的管理页会显示为不支持。采用 `builtin:invokeai` 只有扩展管理和环境报告：它的版本、模型和 PyTorch 重装属于它自己的软件包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"981":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-242","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"以下功能仍是内置类型专有的，对你的类型会被拒绝：","locale":"zh-CN"},"982":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-243","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"**内核更新及其更新摘要。** 类型自己的 `update` 就是它的更新，`update-check` 就是它的检查。发现的更新显示在“维护”中“更新”操作旁边。","locale":"zh-CN"},"983":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-244","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"**快照**，包括从快照创建实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"984":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-245","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"**热补丁、启动参数和启动检查。** 你的服务器由你自己的命令启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"985":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-246","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"**分支变体。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"986":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-247","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"编写类型时需要知道两点：","locale":"zh-CN"},"987":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-248","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"切换到某个提交后，`core` 处于分离状态。如果 `update.steps` 是 `git-pull`，它会报告这一点；请为这种情况编写你想要的步骤。","locale":"zh-CN"},"988":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-249","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"实例启动期间不能重装 PyTorch。从“设置 → API 服务器”启动的角色不算启动，因此重装 PyTorch 前请先停止这样的角色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"989":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-250","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#采用内置类型的管理功能","content":"示例 adopted-webui 是一个完整的此类类型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"990":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-251","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#发现","content":"应用的发现功能（扫描实例，以及把文件夹拖到应用上）按目录结构识别内置 WebUI。你的类型用 `[[discovery]]` 特征识别它自己的已有安装；没有特征的类型不会被发现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"991":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-252","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#发现","content":"扫描访问每个目录时，先尝试内置结构；再在已发现的安装之外，按顺序尝试已注册类型的特征。被特征匹配的目录不再继续向下扫描。","locale":"zh-CN"},"992":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-253","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#发现","content":"标记必须是普通文件或目录，且途中不经过链接。路径为相对路径，以 `/` 分隔，只包含普通名称：`..`、开头的 `/`、反斜杠或盘符在注册时被拒绝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"993":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-254","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#发现","content":"`components` 只能写类型声明的组件。其他组件为 `<根目录>/<name>`，且每个组件都必须存在：导入只接纳已有的目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"994":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-255","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#发现","content":"`values` 在注册时按安装参数检查：未知参数，或既无值也无默认值的必填参数，都会在 `discovery[<序号>].values` 处报告问题。其余参数取默认值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"995":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-256","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#发现","content":"匹配到的目录作为你的类型的就绪实例导入。已被管理的目录只会被报告，不会重复导入。若类型此时拒绝这些值（由后端提供的类型会调用 `provider.validateSpec`），或某个组件在磁盘上不存在，它会成为一条警告而不是实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"996":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-257","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#发现","content":"`external = [\"core\", \"node\"]` 把接入的安装的这些组件记录为外部组件（每个都须声明 `external = \"allowed\"`）：删除或重装实例都不会删除它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"997":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-258","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#发现","content":"顶层的 `attachOnly = true` 让发现成为得到实例的唯一途径，适用于用户自己装好的安装，例如 npm 全局前缀：创建页面不列出该类型，手动创建或导入会被拒绝。设置它的类型必须声明特征。","locale":"zh-CN"},"998":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-259","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#发现","content":"特征随类型一起离开：扩展关闭后，它的类型不再被发现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"999":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-260","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"写 `provider = \"backend\"` 的类型保留描述中的静态部分（ID、文本、组件、运行时、参数、服务器、操作），把动态部分交给扩展的后端：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1000":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-261","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"扩展必须有 `[backend]`，否则安装时报错。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1001":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-262","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"可用 `install.steps` 声明安装步骤（包括空列表），用 `[reinstall]` 覆盖显式重装步骤，用 `[update]` 声明更新步骤。省略的阶段由后端规划。每个服务角色可以声明静态 `command`，也可以省略并调用后端获取命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1002":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-263","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"`operations` 除 `update` 和 `terminal` 外还可以有 `update-check` 和自己的操作，名称由 `a-z`、`0-9`、`-` 组成，不能是内置类型的标准操作名（`launch-arguments`、`snapshots`、`hotpatch`、`diagnostics`；`versions`、`extensions`、`models`、`environment`、`pytorch` 只能通过采用内置类型的管理功能声明）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1003":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-264","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"`update-check` 让实例参与应用的更新检查：卡片上的“检查更新”和每日检查会调用后端的 `provider.checkUpdate`（实例运行时也会调用），发现的更新显示在卡片上，以及实例管理的“维护”页。它不是自己的操作：实例管理中不会为它列出按钮。有后端的扩展可以单独声明这项能力，同时可以保留静态安装步骤和服务命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1004":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-265","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"自定义维护操作可以在操作页收集参数、显示确认文案。表单复用安装参数的写法。后端收到宿主校验后的 `values`，管理工具 `run_instance_operation` 也接受相同的参数对象。\n管理面板的列表动作可指定 `operation = \"refresh-index\"` 和 `rowField = \"target\"`，由宿主把所选行 ID 填入操作的文本字段。\n耗时操作可以返回 `steps`。宿主持有独占维护权并执行步骤，调用者通过活动 ID 在任务中心跟踪和取消。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1005":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-266","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"后端通过以下回调参与（详见后端）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1006":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-267","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"时机","locale":"zh-CN"},"1007":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-268","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"回调","locale":"zh-CN"},"1008":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-269","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"后端返回","locale":"zh-CN"},"1009":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-270","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"检查参数值","locale":"zh-CN"},"1010":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-271","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"`provider.validateSpec`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1011":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-272","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"按参数列出的问题；应用先完成自己的表单检查再询问后端","locale":"zh-CN"},"1012":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-273","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"安装、重试、重装、更新","locale":"zh-CN"},"1013":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-274","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"`provider.installPlan`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1014":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-275","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"步骤列表，写法与 `install.steps` 相同，包括占位符","locale":"zh-CN"},"1015":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-276","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"启动一个角色","locale":"zh-CN"},"1016":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-277","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"`provider.launchPlan`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1017":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-278","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"`argv` 和 `env`，写法与服务器的 `command`、`env` 相同，可以使用 `{port}`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1018":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-279","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"检查更新（`update-check`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1019":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-280","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"`provider.checkUpdate`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1020":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-281","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"是否有适用的更新，以及当前版本和最新版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"1021":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-282","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"读取该实例的动态启动选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"1022":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-283","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"`provider.launchOptions`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1023":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-284","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"按字段的 `optionsSource` 分组的选项值","locale":"zh-CN"},"1024":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-285","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"执行自己的操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"1025":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-286","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"`provider.manage.<operation>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1026":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-287","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"可选的提示文字及维护步骤计划","locale":"zh-CN"},"1027":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-288","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"应用会像检查描述中的步骤一样检查后端返回的计划：引用未声明的占位符、路径不以已声明的组件开头、未知的步骤类型，或值会离开组件，都会使整个计划在执行前被拒绝。后端只命名组件，从不给出路径；步骤由应用执行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1028":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-289","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#由后端提供的类型","content":"读取已有实例记录从不询问后端，因此后端停止时实例仍能列出。后端出错或重启期间，这些类型保持注册，但需要后端的操作会失败并提示扩展后端不可用；扩展关闭、更新或卸载时类型才会移除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1029":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-290","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#预设","content":"预设是某个实例类型的一组默认值，全新安装页面会把它列在该类型下：选择后会填写表单，用户仍可修改每个值。清单中 `contributes.presets` 的 glob 匹配到的每个 `.toml` 或 `.json` 文件都是一个预设，其 ID 为 `<扩展 ID>:<id>`，如 `com.example.greeter:morning`。其基础类型可以是本扩展的类型、其他扩展的类型或内置类型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1030":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-291","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#预设","content":"`[install]` 设置基础类型安装表单的字段，用户的修改优先。预设未设置的字段保留类型的默认值，其余必填字段由用户填写。`secret` 字段留给用户输入。预设中填入这类字段会让该预设不可用，“另存为预设”也会跳过这类字段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1031":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-292","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#预设","content":"`[launch.values]` 为新实例指定非秘密的启动字段，例如 `threads = 4`。更改预设只影响之后创建的实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1032":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-293","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#预设","content":"`[launch] arguments` 会替换类型中同名的默认参数（`true` 只传入该选项，数字或文本会连同该值一起传入，`false` 会移除它），其他参数追加在后面。只有内置类型接受启动参数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1033":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-294","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#预设","content":"应用每次列出预设时都会按其基础类型检查：基础类型未安装、设置了表单中没有的字段，或字段不接受的值，都会使预设显示为不可用并说明原因，但不会导致扩展失败。无法读取的文件，或格式错误的 id、base 或参数，会像类型描述一样导致安装失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1034":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-295","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#预设","content":"实例保存创建时的预设启动参数。之后编辑或删除预设都会保留已有实例的配置。实例能否使用由基础类型决定。如果基础类型也来自同一扩展，关闭扩展会使实例暂时不可用，重新注册类型后恢复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1035":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-296","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#预设","content":"示例扩展在自己的类型上提供了 `package/presets/morning.toml`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1036":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-297","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#预设","content":"预设 schema 针对扩展文件，包含其必需的 `id`。Catalog 注解说明结构正确的预设为什么仍可能暂不可用。上面的完整示例直接读取已验证源包；文档检查不会执行安装步骤或访问网络端点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1037":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types-298","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types#预设","content":"描述文件的字段默认值、条件要求和验证阶段见实例类型描述参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1038":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","type":"page","content":"接口参考","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","扩展开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","locale":"zh-CN"},"1039":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-0","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","content":"扩展可用的全部接口：视图协议、界面套件的类、面板块与表单字段、组件，以及宿主接口、应用对后端的调用、清单和实例类型描述的键，以及管理工具。内容由应用导出的接口定义生成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1040":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-1","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#versions","content":"版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"1041":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-2","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#frontend","content":"前端","locale":"zh-CN"},"1042":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-3","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#frame-messages","content":"视图消息","locale":"zh-CN"},"1043":{"id