e","content":"本页逐项列出扩展可以使用的接口，每一项都有可以直接链接的锚点和简短示例。内容在构建本站时从应用仓库中提交的接口导出 `sdk/interfaces/` 读取（由 `bun run export:backend-interfaces` 和 `bun run export:frontend-interfaces` 生成，过期时检查会失败），因此始终与应用的代码一致。各项的用法和语义见后端、实例类型和界面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1063":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-24","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","content":"方法摘要、参数、权限、类和字段的说明直接取自导出，与应用代码中的注释相同，因此为英文。本页自身的文字为中文。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1064":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-25","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#versions","content":"`api` 是后端协议的版本，即清单 `engines.api` 声明的版本。同一版本内只会增加方法和可选字段；删除或重命名会提升版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1065":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-26","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#versions","content":"`kitVersion` 是界面套件的类 API 版本，规则相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1066":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-27","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#versions","content":"`uiApiVersion` 是视图可用组件（组件包，UI API）的版本。同一版本内只会增加组件和可选属性；删除或重命名会提升版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1067":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-28","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#versions","content":"`exportVersion` 是导出文件本身的格式版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1068":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-29","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#frame-messages","content":"视图页面与应用之间通过 `postMessage` 交换的消息。页面通常不直接发送这些消息，而是使用视图客户端，它封装了下面的全部消息。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1069":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-30","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#frame-theme","content":"应用随 `theme` 消息发送的颜色方案、CSS 变量和语言，以及视图高度和各项时限。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1070":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-31","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#frame-client","content":"应用在每个扩展包根目录的保留路径提供的 ES 模块及其函数和类型。用法见界面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1071":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-32","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#ui-kit","content":"`__hanafubuki/ui.css` 提供的类，按组列出，并给出修饰类、属性和示例标记。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1072":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-33","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#panel-blocks","content":"面板（`kind = \"schema\"` 的 `ui` 项）中的块。每种块列出应用如何渲染它、块在面板文件中的写法，以及渲染时读取的数据。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1073":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-34","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#form-fields","content":"扩展设置和面板操作表单中的字段类型，以及每种类型使用的控件、值类型和读取的键。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1074":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-35","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#components","content":"视图可以使用的应用组件：组件包 `__hanafubuki/ui.js`，Vue 位于 `__hanafubuki/vue.js`，组件样式位于 `__hanafubuki/ui-components.css`。页面在每个 Vue 应用上安装 `frameUi(frame)`，并用 `h()` 渲染组件，因为提供的 Vue 不含模板编译器。类型声明是 `sdk/ui/ui.d.ts`。用法见界面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1075":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-36","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#host-api","content":"后端调用应用的方法，按名称的第一段分组。每个方法列出方向、是请求还是通知、需要的权限、限制、示例消息，以及参数和结果的结构。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1076":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-37","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#host-api","content":"有界 UTF-8 请求、宿主镜像下载和单次进程代理的用法见 SDK 网络示例。下方直接从 Rust 契约展示可选字段与默认值；HTTP 状态码属于返回结果，网络及权限失败使用 RPC 错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1077":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-38","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#host-api","content":"设置接口只修改调用扩展自身：`settings.patch` 返回 canonical values，`null` 取消覆盖。视图使用上方生成的 `getSettings` / `patchSettings` 客户端签名，没有后端也可调用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1078":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-39","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#backend-calls","content":"应用发给后端的请求和通知：生命周期、提供者回调、面板和视图的调用、界面状态、扩展之间的服务，以及事件和进程输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1079":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-40","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#backend-calls","content":"`initialize` 结果中的已知 hooks 从方法 registry 自动收集，包含 `diagnostics`。展开 `diagnostics.collect` 可查看文档字段及调用时限、数量和字节限制；运行时工具方法位于上方宿主接口。用法见 SDK 示例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1080":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-41","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#event-topics","content":"`events.subscribe` 替换订阅。每条 `event` 通知包含 `topic` 及承载下方结构的 `data`。结构来自协议 topic registry；`preferences` 与 `host.preferences` 使用同一完整快照，`settings` 仍只表示扩展自身设置。启动或重新订阅时主动读取当前偏好；通知不重放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1081":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-42","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#manifest","content":"`hanafubuki-extension.toml` 的键。展开一个键可以查看它包含的结构。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1082":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-43","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#manifest","content":"下方 `contributes.agent` 嵌套 schema 展示 Skills、MCP transport、command 来源和设置引用；权限、命名空间所有权与生命周期见 Agent 贡献。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1083":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-44","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#instance-type","content":"声明式实例类型描述文件的键。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1084":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-45","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#steps","content":"`install.steps` 和 `update.steps` 中每种步骤的键。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1085":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-46","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#management-tools","content":"后端用 `tools.list` 列出管理目录工具，用 `tools.call` 调用。下表中的 `read` 表示只读工具，修改操作需要 `management = \"confirm\"` 并由用户在主窗口逐次确认。标为“仅内置实例”的工具会拒绝扩展提供的实例类型。启动任务的工具返回 `activityId`，后端可订阅 `task` 事件跟踪进度。见后端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1086":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-47","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#management-tools","content":"按操作对象选择工具。例如，`install_extension` 给指定 WebUI 实例安装插件；`list_host_extensions` 列出 Hanafubuki 本身已安装的扩展，`browse_host_extension_marketplace` 查询桌面扩展市场。用户在设置中确认桌面扩展的安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1087":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-48","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#design-tokens","content":"按名称或用途检索，选择分组并展开变量，即可查看每条源码声明、选择器与条件。值按 cascade 顺序保留 CSS 表达式，不是某台机器的 computed style 快照。`root` 表示共享变量；`local` 用于组件或区域；`internal` 是实现细节，不承诺公开覆盖；`runtime` 由宿主投影。完整字典不会扩大 frame 的主题消息，也不会授权修改应用设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1088":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-49","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#utilities","content":"这些签名与 `sdk/ui/ui.d.ts` 来自同一公开出口，只操作 frame 内 DOM 和 Vue scope，不提供 Tauri、原生窗口或宿主全局外观权限。timing 工具读取实际解析的 CSS，未解析时耗时为零。组件通常消费 motion role，duration steps 与 curves 用于共享实现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1089":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-50","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#motion-examples","content":"下载 frame-components，作为链接的文件夹安装，打开其页面或设置分区。示例与现有组件 gallery 并排运行，使用宿主的 Vue runtime 和 UI bundle。下面代码直接导出自实际挂载的完整模块，没有另一份手写片段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1090":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-51","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#preset","content":"此 schema 描述扩展贡献文件，不是用户预设存储中的 entry。结构默认值是 JSON 事实，TOML 没有 `null` 字面量；领域注解另行说明省略行为、有效默认和 catalog 可用性。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1091":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference-52","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-reference#configuration-examples","content":"这些完整文件直接导出自受控源包，并经过实际 loader、包内容读取器和 catalog 检查。关联文件属于同一完整包。验证不会执行安装步骤、下载软件、准备 Python 或启动服务器。配置键、源码注释和领域规则说明保留源语言。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1092":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","type":"page","content":"SDK","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","扩展开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","locale":"zh-CN"},"1093":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-0","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","content":"用 Rust SDK（hanafubuki-extension-sdk）或 Python SDK（hanafubuki_extension）编写扩展后端，附最小示例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1094":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-1","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#下载","content":"下载","locale":"zh-CN"},"1095":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-2","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#rust","content":"Rust","locale":"zh-CN"},"1096":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-3","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api","content":"API","locale":"zh-CN"},"1097":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-4","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#最小示例","content":"最小示例","locale":"zh-CN"},"1098":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-5","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#界面状态","content":"界面状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"1099":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-6","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#python","content":"Python","locale":"zh-CN"},"1100":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-7","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api-1","content":"API","locale":"zh-CN"},"1101":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-8","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#最小示例-1","content":"最小示例","locale":"zh-CN"},"1102":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-9","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#不使用-sdk","content":"不使用 SDK","locale":"zh-CN"},"1103":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-10","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#网络调用与单次进程代理","content":"网络调用与单次进程代理","locale":"zh-CN"},"1104":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-11","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#自身设置","content":"自身设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"1105":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-12","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#宿主偏好快照","content":"宿主偏好快照","locale":"zh-CN"},"1106":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-13","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#运行时工具与诊断","content":"运行时工具与诊断","locale":"zh-CN"},"1107":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-14","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#frame-宿主操作与声明式-agent-内容","content":"Frame 宿主操作与声明式 Agent 内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"1108":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-15","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","content":"两个 SDK 都实现了后端协议的通信部分：读写帧、回答 `initialize` 和 `ping`、在工作线程中处理常规请求，并提供调用宿主接口的 `Host`。后端只需要实现自己关心的方法。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1109":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-16","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","content":"后端不能向标准输出写入协议以外的内容。Rust 中用 `eprintln!` 输出日志；Python SDK 会把 `sys.stdout`\n重定向到标准错误，因此 `print` 会写入日志而不会破坏协议帧。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1110":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-17","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#下载","content":"SDK 与视图类型声明，可直接放进自己的仓库。每个压缩包内含 README，说明如何引用其中的内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1111":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-18","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#rust","content":"`hanafubuki-extension-sdk` 没有发布到 crates.io，应用仓库也不公开，因此没有可以依赖的 Git 地址。请解压上面的 Rust SDK 到自己的项目中，再以路径依赖引用它：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1112":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-19","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api","content":"项","locale":"zh-CN"},"1113":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-20","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"1114":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-21","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api","content":"`run(handler)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1115":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-22","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api","content":"在标准输入输出上运行，直到应用发送 `shutdown` 或关闭标准输入；返回 `Result<(), String>`，错误表示收到的内容不是协议","locale":"zh-CN"},"1116":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-23","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api","content":"`run_on(handler, reader, writer)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1117":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-24","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api","content":"与 `run` 相同，但使用任意读写流，便于测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"1118":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-25","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api","content":"`Handler`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1119":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-26","page_id":"/docs/ex