和启动计划都是模板，`{` 和 `}`\n会被当作占位符。路径、设置值等不是自己写的文本，放入计划前要把花括号加倍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1147":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-54","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#界面状态","content":"有界面状态的后端从 `Handler::ui` 返回它的 `Ui`，并用 `Host::emit_state` 推送每个新状态：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1148":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-55","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#python","content":"Python SDK `hanafubuki_extension` 只使用标准库，需要 Python 3.10 或更高版本。它随应用一起分发，并已在 Python 后端的 `PYTHONPATH` 中，后端直接 `import` 即可，不需要放进软件包或写进 `requirements`。需要离线阅读 SDK 或在应用之外运行后端时，请用上面列表中的压缩包，其中的 `tests/` 展示了协议的用法。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1149":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-56","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api-1","content":"项","locale":"zh-CN"},"1150":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-57","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api-1","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"1151":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-58","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api-1","content":"`run(handler)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1152":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-59","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api-1","content":"运行直到 `shutdown` 或标准输入结束；把 `sys.stdout` 重定向到标准错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"1153":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-60","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api-1","content":"`Handler`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1154":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-61","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api-1","content":"子类化并覆盖需要的方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"1155":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-62","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api-1","content":"`Host.call(method, params)