-CN"},"1204":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-111","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api-1","content":"返回给调用方的结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"1205":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-112","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api-1","content":"`request(host, method, params)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1206":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-113","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api-1","content":"其他请求","locale":"zh-CN"},"1207":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-114","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api-1","content":"任意","locale":"zh-CN"},"1208":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-115","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api-1","content":"`notification(host, method, params)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1209":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-116","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api-1","content":"通知；在读取循环的线程上运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"1210":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-117","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api-1","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"1211":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-118","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api-1","content":"`shutdown(host)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1212":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-119","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api-1","content":"在读取线程中调用，返回后 SDK 回复宿主并退出","locale":"zh-CN"},"1213":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-120","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api-1","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"1214":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-121","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#api-1","content":"校验已有实例的新参数时，SDK 通过关键字参数 `instance` 传入实例。创建时省略该参数，因此签名中可用 `None` 作为默认值。如果覆写 `initialize`，可返回 `super().initialize(host, params)` 的结果，保留 SDK 从处理方法识别出的钩子，包括 `ui` 和 `diagnostics`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1215":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-122","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#最小示例-1","content":"`launch_plan` 用后端自己的解释器（应用受管的 Python）在实例的 `core` 组件中运行标准库的 `http.server`，`install_plan` 写入的页面就是它提供的内容。`frame_call` 中的 `servers.status` 需要 `permissions.instances = \"own-types\"`。`ui_state` 就是界面状态：写了 `\"source\": \"state\"` 和 `\"path\": \"visits\"` 的面板块显示它，每次点击面板操作都会推送新状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1216":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-123","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#不使用-sdk","content":"后端也可以用任何语言直接实现协议：按 协议概要 的分帧读写 JSON-RPC 消息，回答 `initialize`（`protocolVersion` 为 `1`，`hooks` 为实现的钩子）、`ping` 和 `shutdown`。每个方法及其参数见接口参考和后端协议参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1217":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-124","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#网络调用与单次进程代理","content":"Rust 使用 `Host::http_request(&HttpRequestParams)`、`download_fetch(&DownloadFetchParams)`、`process_run(&ProcessRunParams)`；类型由 `protocol` 重导出。Python 的同名方法使用 `hanafubuki_extension.protocol` 中的 typed dict 参数和结果。省略可选字段可使用宿主默认值；SDK 不复制宿主校验。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1218":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-125","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#网络调用与单次进程代理","content":"例子要求 manifest 声明源主机的 `network` 权限及 `processes = true`。HTTP 错误状态由调用者处理；RPC 错误通过 `RpcError` 返回。下载的 `sha256` 不应从同一次不可信下载中反推；无摘要时 `cache` 不产生可复用命中。方法字段、默认值、权限及限制见生成接口参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1219":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-126","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#自身设置","content":"Rust 用 `host.settings()` 读取，用 `host.settings_patch(&SettingsPatchParams { patch })` 写入。Python 用 `host.settings_get()` 和 `host.settings_patch({\"patch\": {...}})`。两者都返回 `{values}`。不接受扩展 ID，也不需要额外权限：宿主将调用者绑定到自己的设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1220":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-127","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#自身设置","content":"`None`（传输中的 `null`）取消保存的覆盖，恢复声明的默认值。未知设置 key 或无效值使整个 patch 失败；保存失败不发布成功事件。成功后返回 canonical values，若本后端订阅了 `settings`，则收到一次设置事件。应用设置页、后端与自定义 frame 使用同一套 Rust 校验和存储。值可能包含密钥，不要记录到日志。自定义 frame 使用 `getSettings()` 与 `patchSettings(patch)`，没有后端也可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1221":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-128","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#宿主偏好快照","content":"Rust 使用 `host.host_preferences() -> Result<HostPreferences, RpcError>`；Python 使用 `host.host_preferences() -> HostPreferences`。`HostPreferences` 也是 `preferences` 事件的 data 类型。这是只读投影；自定义 frame 继续使用已有 theme/locale 通知。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1222":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-129","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#宿主偏好快照","content":"通知 handler 应快速返回，不在其中调用宿主。代理配置变化可能发出公开内容相同的快照；后续宿主网络调用使用最新策略。Python SDK 的 `hanafubuki_extension.protocol` 还提供 `PreferencesEvent`、`HostNetworkPreferences` 和镜像类型。可选 `instancesDir` 与 `mirrors` 可能为 `None`；快照不提供代理凭据。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1223":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-130","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#运行时工具与诊断","content":"Rust 提供 `host.runtime_status(&RuntimeStatusParams { tool: None })` 与 `host.runtime_resolve(&RuntimeResolveParams { tool: RuntimeTool::Python })`，结果分别为 `RuntimeStatusResult` 和 `RuntimeResolveResult`。Python 使用对应的 typed 方法：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1224":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-131","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#运行时工具与诊断","content":"解析并运行要求清单声明 `processes = true`。status 只读；resolve 等待宿主已有的准备流程，后端停止会取消。可选 `version` 是已验证的版本或版本输出，不保证是 semver。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1225":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-132","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#运行时工具与诊断","content":"Python handler 覆写 `diagnostics_collect`，SDK 自动声明 `diagnostics` hook：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1226":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-133","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#运行时工具与诊断","content":"Rust 实现 `Diagnostics::collect(&self, host) -> Result<DiagnosticsCollectResult, RpcError>`，并从 `Handler::diagnostics()` 返回 `Some(self)`。即使自定义 initialize 结果，SDK 也会加入该 hook，并把采集交给 trait；没有 provider 时仍交给普通 request handler。文档名只能是单个文件名，只返回自己的诊断文本，不含凭据。宿主执行生成参考展示的限制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1227":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-134","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#frame-宿主操作与声明式-agent-内容","content":"frame SDK 提供 `openSettings(section: string): Promise<void>` 与 `openExternal(url: string): Promise<void>`，分别封装 `open-settings` 和 `open-external` 宿主请求。未知 section、无效 URL 或宿主错误都会以 `FrameError` 结束 Promise，见 frame 示例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1228":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-135","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#frame-宿主操作与声明式-agent-内容","content":"Agent Skills/MCP 属于 manifest 贡献，不是写 Agent 配置的后端 SDK 方法。宿主把声明适配为带命名空间的 linked Agent package，并让其生命周期跟随扩展，见 Agent 贡献。Rust/Python 后端可通过 `settings.patch` 修改 `{setting: \"key\"}` 引用的自身已声明字符串设置；成功保存会刷新宿主管理的贡献。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1229":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks-136","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-sdks#frame-宿主操作与声明式-agent-内容","content":"生成的 UI 声明还包含 frame 安全动效工具及关联类型。使用 Vue `h` 渲染泛型组件时，应显式实例化组件，例如 `NavList<Item>`，以保留条目 props、事件值和 slot payload 之间的类型关系；不要假设 `h` 能自动推断所有泛型关联。可执行动效示例 严格对照 `sdk/ui/ui.d.ts`（见上面的视图类型声明）检查，网站展示的正是 linked gallery 运行的同一份源码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1230":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","type":"page","content":"测试与打包","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","扩展开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","locale":"zh-CN"},"1231":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-0","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","content":"以示例扩展 Greeter 为例，了解扩展的构建、测试、打包、安装调试和迁出到独立仓库的流程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1232":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-1","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#first-extension","content":"先试一个无需编译的扩展","locale":"zh-CN"},"1233":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-2","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"示例的结构","locale":"zh-CN"},"1234":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-3","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#它是如何工作的","content":"它是如何工作的","locale":"zh-CN"},"1235":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-4","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#构建与打包","content":"构建与打包","locale":"zh-CN"},"1236":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-5","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#测试","content":"测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"1237":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-6","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#单独测试程序","content":"单独测试程序","locale":"zh-CN"},"1238":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-7","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#在应用的测试中端到端运行","content":"在应用的测试中端到端运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"1239":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-8","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#在应用中手动测试","content":"在应用中手动测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"1240":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-9","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#开发时链接文件夹","content":"开发时链接文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"1241":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-10","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#调试与迭代","content":"调试与迭代","locale":"zh-CN"},"1242":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-11","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#迁出到独立仓库","content":"迁出到独立仓库","locale":"zh-CN"},"1243":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-12","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","content":"Greeter 是一个完整的示例扩展，可以下载。它很小，但覆盖了扩展的主要路径：基于 Rust SDK 的原生后端、由后端提供的实例类型、安装参数、填写该参数的预设、在内置浏览器中打开的服务器角色、扩展设置、视图、跟随后端推送状态的面板，以及中英文文字。应用自己的测试会构建、安装并运行它；它本身就是一个独立仓库，可以直接作为新扩展的起点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1244":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-13","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#first-extension","content":"下载并解压下面的配置示例，然后在“设置 → 扩展 → 安装扩展”选择“链接的文件夹”，选中解压出的 `configuration-guide/`。点击“检查”，确认安装后开启扩展。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1245":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-14","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#first-extension","content":"在全新安装页面选择“本地笔记”类型和“欢迎笔记”预设，把“内容”改为一行容易辨认的文字，然后创建并安装实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1246":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-15","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#first-extension","content":"打开实例的 `core` 组件目录，检查 `notes.txt`。它应包含刚才填写的文字。`presets/welcome.toml` 提供表单的初始值，`types/notes.toml` 中的 `write-file` 步骤写入最终值。这个类型无需下载文件或启动服务器。查看这组完整配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"1247":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-16","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#first-extension","content":"要试用 Python 后端，解压并链接 `configuration-python/`；要试用宿主的 Vue 组件和主题，链接 `frame-components/`。下文使用 Greeter 演示需要编译原生程序的流程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1248":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-17","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"1249":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-18","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"1250":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-19","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"`package/hanafubuki-extension.toml`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1251":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-20","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"清单：ID `com.example.greeter`，每个系统的后端程序，`instances = \"own-types\"` 权限，以及贡献的内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"1252":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-21","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"`package/types/greeter.toml`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1253":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-22","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"`greeter` 类型：`provider = \"backend\"`，只有 `core` 组件，无运行时，参数 `greeting`，一个 `ui` 服务器角色","locale":"zh-CN"},"1254":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-23","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"`package/presets/morning.toml`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1255":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-24","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"`greeter` 类型的预设：全新安装页面把它列在“问候”类型下，并用它填写问候语","locale":"zh-CN"},"1256":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-25","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"`package/schemas/settings.json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1257":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-26","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"设置分区：`signature` 字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"1258":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-27","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"`package/locales/en.json`、`zh.json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1259":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-28","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"文字，合并到 `ext['com.example.greeter']` 下","locale":"zh-CN"},"1260":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-29","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"`package/ui/status.html`、`status.js`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1261":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-30","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"实例管理页面中的视图，显示实例的服务器状态，以及来自界面状态的已发送问候数","locale":"zh-CN"},"1262":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-31","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"`package/ui/greetings.json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1263":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-32","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"设置窗口中的面板：“问候”操作和已发送问候的表格，表格来自界面状态（`\"source\": \"state\"`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1264":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-33","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"`src/main.rs`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1265":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-34","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"一个程序，两种模式：无参数时是后端，`serve` 时是实例的服务器","locale":"zh-CN"},"1266":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-35","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"`src/backend.rs`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1267":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-36","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"后端：`provider.validateSpec`、`provider.installPlan`、`provider.launchPlan`、视图的 `status` 调用、面板的 `greet` 操作，以及界面状态（`Ui`、`Host::emit_state`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1268":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-37","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"`src/server.rs`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1269":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-38","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"实例的 HTTP 服务器：`/` 显示问候语，`/health` 用于就绪检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"1270":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-39","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"`tests/greeter.rs`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1271":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-40","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"单独测试程序：通过标准输入输出测试后端，通过 HTTP 测试服务器","locale":"zh-CN"},"1272":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-41","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"`Cargo.toml`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1273":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-42","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#示例的结构","content":"crate `greeter-extension`，二进制 `greeter`，`publish = false`；SDK 与协议 crate 在同目录的 `vendor/` 中","locale":"zh-CN"},"1274":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-43","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#它是如何工作的","content":"Greeter 用同一个程序运行扩展后端和实例服务器。启动实例时，后端读取用户保存的署名，用 `std::env::current_exe()` 找到当前程序，再返回带有 `serve` 参数的启动命令。对于命令固定的服务器，声明式类型也可以用 `{extension.root}` 引用软件包中的程序或脚本。见占位符。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1275":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-44","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#它是如何工作的","content":"**新建**：应用先用类型的表单检查参数值，再调用 `provider.validateSpec`，后端拒绝超过 200 个字符的问候语。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1276":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-45","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#它是如何工作的","content":"**安装**：`provider.installPlan` 返回一个 `write-file` 步骤，把 `{param.greeting}` 写入 `{component.core}/greeting.txt`。应用替换占位符，并把步骤限制在 `core` 组件内。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1277":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-46","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#它是如何工作的","content":"**启动**：`provider.launchPlan` 返回 `[<程序路径>, \"serve\", \"--port\", \"{port}\", \"--signature\", <设置值>]`，其中签名是用 `settings.get` 读到的扩展设置。计划是模板，后端会把非自己写的文本中的花括号加倍。应用在 `core` 中以分配的端口启动它，`/health` 返回 200 后在内置浏览器中打开该角色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1278":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-47","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#它是如何工作的","content":"**视图**：`ui/status.html` 调用 `status`，后端用 `servers.status` 查询该实例的服务器并返回（因此需要 `permissions.instances = \"own-types\"`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1279":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-48","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#它是如何工作的","content":"**界面状态**：后端的状态是已发送的问候，`{ \"greetings\": { \"rows\": [...] } }`。在“问候记录”面板中点击“问候”会发送 `ui.panel.action`；后端记下这条问候并用 `emit_state` 推送新状态，面板中写了 `\"source\": \"state\"` 和 `\"path\": \"greetings\"` 的表格随之更新，无需查询。视图用 `state()` 和 `onState()` 跟随同一份状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1280":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-49","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#构建与打包","content":"在解压出的 `greeter/` 中为当前操作系统构建程序：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1281":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-50","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#构建与打包","content":"`target/release/greeter`（Windows 上为 `greeter.exe`）既是后端，也是实例服务器。软件包是 `package/`：把程序复制到 `package/bin/`，再把 `package/` 的内容打包，使清单 `hanafubuki-extension.toml` 位于压缩包根目录或唯一的一层目录中。文件夹形式和压缩包都可以在设置窗口的“扩展”分区中安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1282":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-51","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#构建与打包","content":"这里只有当前平台的二进制文件。发布原生后端时，为每个受支持的操作系统和架构提供匹配的程序。`latest.json` 的平台和架构字段使用宿主的名称，例如 Windows x64 填 `windows` 和 `x86_64`，macOS ARM64 填 `macos` 和 `aarch64`；下载地址按实际文件名填写。见发布更新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1283":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-52","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#构建与打包","content":"打包自己的扩展时检查：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1284":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-53","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#构建与打包","content":"清单写了 `engines.api = 1`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1285":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-54","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#构建与打包","content":"`[backend].command` 中每个系统的路径都有对应的程序，Linux 和 macOS 上的程序保留可执行权限；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1286":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-55","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#构建与打包","content":"压缩包为 `.zip`、`.tar`、`.tar.gz`、`.tar.xz` 或 `.tar.bz2`，清单位于根目录或唯一的一层目录中，包内没有符号链接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1287":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-56","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#单独测试程序","content":"运行 `tests/greeter.rs`：启动 `greeter` 程序，按协议分帧发送 `initialize`、`provider.validateSpec` 和 `provider.installPlan` 并检查回答；再以 `serve` 模式在空闲端口启动它，检查 `/health`、问候页面和 404。这类测试不需要应用，适合放在扩展自己的仓库中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1288":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-57","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#单独测试程序","content":"用 Rust SDK 编写的后端也可以不启动进程，直接用 `run_on(handler, reader, writer)` 在内存中的流上测试。Python 后端可以把 Python SDK 压缩包解压出的目录加入 `PYTHONPATH`，用子进程运行脚本并按协议收发消息。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1289":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-58","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#在应用的测试中端到端运行","content":"应用的测试套件包含 `src-tauri/src/api_server/declared/tests/greeter.rs`，它以 `bun run example:extension` 的布局组装软件包，然后：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1290":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-59","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#在应用的测试中端到端运行","content":"从文件夹通过扩展存储准备并安装，开启并加载；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1291":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-60","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#在应用的测试中端到端运行","content":"写入 `signature` 设置，启动后端，然后点击面板的“问候”，检查后端推送了新的界面状态（另一个测试像应用一样加载扩展，检查经由应用读取的面板表格会跟随这次推送）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1292":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-61","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#在应用的测试中端到端运行","content":"用超长的问候语新建实例，确认被后端拒绝；再用正常的问候语新建、安装并启动实例；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1293":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-62","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#在应用的测试中端到端运行","content":"检查 `ui` 角色运行中，`/health` 和问候页面（含签名）返回正确；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1294":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-63","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#在应用的测试中端到端运行","content":"检查视图页面和视图客户端由软件包提供，视图的 `status` 调用返回该角色；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1295":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-64","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#在应用的测试中端到端运行","content":"停止实例，停止后端，卸载扩展并删除数据。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1296":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-65","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#在应用的测试中端到端运行","content":"它随 `bun run test:rust` 运行（会一并构建工作区中的 `greeter`）。首次构建应用测试前，先在仓库根目录准备受管资源、MCP 辅助程序和视图组件包。单独运行此测试还需先构建 Greeter：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1297":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-66","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#在应用的测试中端到端运行","content":"`editing_the_linked_greeters_panel_shows_on_reload_with_no_reinstall`（位于 `src-tauri/src/extensions/tests/link.rs`）改为链接同一软件包的临时副本，在文件夹中修改其面板，并检查扩展提供的面板在“重新加载”后才改变，之前不变。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1298":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-67","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#在应用中手动测试","content":"打开设置窗口的“扩展”分区，点击“安装扩展”，选择 `package/` 文件夹（程序已放进\n`package/bin/`）或打包好的压缩包，点击“检查”，确认后点击“安装”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1299":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-68","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#在应用中手动测试","content":"新建一个“问候”类型（英文界面中为 Greeter）的实例，安装并启动它，问候页面会在 WebUI\n标签页中打开。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1300":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-69","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#在应用中手动测试","content":"在实例管理页面的“扩展”分组中打开“问候状态”视图；在设置窗口的“问候”分区中修改“署名”，下次启动实例时生效；在“问候记录”分区中点击“问候”，表格随之更新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1301":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-70","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#开发时链接文件夹","content":"已安装的扩展是一份副本：修改源文件不会改变它，除非重新安装。开发扩展时，可以改为链接它的文件夹：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1302":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-71","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#开发时链接文件夹","content":"打开设置窗口的“扩展”分区，点击“安装扩展”，选择“链接的文件夹”，选取包含清单的文件夹。对示例来说是\n`package/`，因为命令后端需要 `package/bin/` 中的程序；纯数据扩展可以直接链接其源文件夹。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1303":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-72","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#开发时链接文件夹","content":"点击“检查”，再点击“安装”：文件夹会像从文件夹安装时一样被检查，并像任何软件包一样需要确认，但不会被复制。它的卡片显示“开发\n· 链接到”该文件夹。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1304":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-73","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#开发时链接文件夹","content":"开启它。修改文件夹中的文件（面板、文字、类型、清单，或在 `bin/`\n中重新构建的程序）后，在其卡片上点击“重新加载”：应用会重新读取文件夹并挂载扩展，同时重启其后端，无需重新安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1305":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-74","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#开发时链接文件夹","content":"重新加载时还要留意以下几点：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1306":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-75","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#开发时链接文件夹","content":"文件夹中任何位置的符号链接都会被拒绝，链接时和每次重新加载时都是如此，与从文件夹安装时相同。会留下链接的构建产物（例如 `node_modules/.bin`）应放在所链接的文件夹之外。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1307":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-76","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#开发时链接文件夹","content":"不再能读取的文件，例如有拼写错误的清单或只保存了一半的文件，会使重新加载失败，卡片上会列出其问题；修正后再次点击“重新加载”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1308":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-77","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#开发时链接文件夹","content":"修改清单和贡献文件时可以保留原版本号，但必须保留原扩展 ID。要改 ID，需将文件夹作为新扩展安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1309":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-78","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#开发时链接文件夹","content":"如果扩展处于运行状态，而且有属于该扩展类型的实例正在运行，重新加载会列出实例名称。先停止这些实例，再点击“重新加载”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1310":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-79","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#开发时链接文件夹","content":"它的设置和数据与任何扩展一样由应用保存，重新加载后仍然保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1311":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-80","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#开发时链接文件夹","content":"链接的扩展不会被更新；以副本安装的 ID 不能再被链接，反之亦然：卸载其中一个才能安装另一个。卸载链接只移除应用记录的内容，你的文件夹保持原样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1312":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-81","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#开发时链接文件夹","content":"链接的文件夹已在 Linux 上验证；在 Windows 和 macOS 上其路径尚未验证。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1313":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-82","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#调试与迭代","content":"**看日志**：后端写到标准错误的内容和 `log.write` 都进入扩展的日志，在扩展卡片上点击“查看日志”。不要写到标准输出，那会破坏协议帧并使后端被判定为故障。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1314":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-83","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#调试与迭代","content":"**安装失败**：错误信息列出每个问题的位置，如 `types/greeter.toml: servers[0].readiness`，对照清单字段和实例类型修改。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1315":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-84","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#调试与迭代","content":"**无法运行**：卡片上显示原因，常见的是缺少 `engines.api` 或没有当前系统的程序。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1316":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-85","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#调试与迭代","content":"**反复崩溃**：后端连续 3 次在稳定运行 30 秒前退出后不再自动启动。修复后点击“重试”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1317":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-86","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#调试与迭代","content":"**更新已安装的版本**：扩展安装时被复制到应用的存储中，修改源文件不会影响已安装的副本。更新到相同版本号会被拒绝，因此要么提高 `version` 后使用“更新”，要么卸载（保留设置和数据）后重新安装。迭代时可以改为链接文件夹，然后点击“重新加载”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1318":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-87","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#调试与迭代","content":"**链接的扩展反复崩溃**：“重新加载”与“重试”一样会清除崩溃标记，因此仍然崩溃的后端在启动三次后会再次停止。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1319":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing-88","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-testing#迁出到独立仓库","content":"把各处的 `com.example.greeter`（清单的 `id`、`types/` 和 `schemas/` 中的文字键）替换为你自己的\nID。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1320":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","type":"page","content":"界面","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","扩展开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","locale":"zh-CN"},"1321":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-0","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","content":"扩展的设置表单、面板（info、table、log、actions、progress、status、list、markdown、empty、loading）、推送给面板和视图的界面状态、视图（frame）的加载方式、客户端接口、主题变量与安全限制，以及文字与多语言。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1322":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-1","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#文本的写法","content":"文本的写法","locale":"zh-CN"},"1323":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-2","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"1324":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-3","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"面板","locale":"zh-CN"},"1325":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-4","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"界面状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"1326":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-5","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#来自界面状态的块","content":"来自界面状态的块","locale":"zh-CN"},"1327":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-6","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图frame","content":"视图（frame）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1328":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-7","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#页面如何加载","content":"页面如何加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"1329":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-8","