"url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"帮助文本","locale":"zh-CN"},"1373":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-52","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"`options`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1374":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-53","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"`select` 和 `multiselect` 必填：`{ \"value\": \"…\", \"label\": 文本 }` 的列表","locale":"zh-CN"},"1375":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-54","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"`min`、`max`、`step`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1376":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-55","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"数字范围与步长；`slider` 必须同时有 `min` 和 `max`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1377":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-56","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"`pathKind`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1378":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-57","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"`path` 字段：`directory` 或 `file`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1379":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-58","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"`nullable`、`unsetLabel`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1380":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-59","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"允许“未设置”作为一个可选值，`unsetLabel` 为它的文本","locale":"zh-CN"},"1381":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-60","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"`required`、`default`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1382":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-61","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"是否必填；默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"1383":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-62","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"`visibleWhen`、`requiredWhen`、`disabledWhen`、`disabledReason`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1384":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-63","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"条件，写法与实例类型的参数相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"1385":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-64","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"`advanced`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1386":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-65","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"有可用默认值的次要字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"1387":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-66","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"`commit`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1388":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-67","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"`change`、`blur` 或 `manual`；`manual` 的字段需要点击保存才提交","locale":"zh-CN"},"1389":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-68","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"`patchGroup`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1390":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-69","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"同组字段一起提交","locale":"zh-CN"},"1391":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-70","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"`optionsSource` 不能使用，它只用于应用自己的表单。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1392":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-71","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"设置值保存在扩展自己的存储中（`extensions/<id>/settings.json`），不属于应用设置。只有扩展处于运行状态时设置分区才能读取和保存；应用会用整个表单检查修改，任何字段不通过都不会写入。后端用 `settings.get` 读取这些值；订阅 `settings` 事件后，用户每次保存都会收到通知。字段被删除或不再接受某个已保存的值时，该值会被忽略，分区显示默认值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1393":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-72","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#设置","content":"使用 `[[contributes.settingsGroups]]` 按显示顺序列出本扩展的字段键。每组提供本地化标题，可选填内置设置分类，如 `automation` 或 `runtime`。可用分类为 `language`、`paths`、`network`、`mirrors`、`runtime`、`environmentTools`、`logs`、`webview`、`automation` 和 `about`；`modules` 和 `extensions` 使用固定布局的页面，不接受分组，填写其他值会在安装时指出位置。扩展自己的设置页也显示所有组及未分组字段。两个入口都保存到所属扩展的配置。后端或其他窗口保存后，已打开的表单会刷新，并保留用户尚未提交的编辑。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1394":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-73","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"在清单的 `contributes.ui` 中选择 `slot = \"home.sections\"`，可以在首页实例网格下方展示 schema 面板。选择 `slot = \"taskCenter.tabs\"`，面板会作为任务中心的标签显示，停用扩展时会回到任务列表。这两个位置收到的实例上下文均为空。独立页面可在 `slot = \"pages\"` 的 frame 清单项加 `home = true`，首页快捷卡和标题栏入口会打开同一页面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1395":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-74","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"管理或诊断面板以及 `actions` 中的独立按钮支持 `\"cardMenu\": true`。在匹配类型的实例卡片上打开菜单即可使用同一份表单、确认和维护操作。可同时声明 `toolbar`，把同一动作放在两个位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1396":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-75","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"把 schema 面板声明到 `slot = \"management.overview\"`，即可在实例概览中显示只读的 `info`、`status`、`table` 和 `progress`。可用 `types` 限定实例类型，数据支持查询和状态推送。在 `management.sections` 的 `actions` 块内，按钮可声明 `{\"id\":\"repair\",\"operation\":\"repair-index\",\"label\":{\"kind\":\"literal\",\"text\":{\"zh\":\"重建索引\"}}}`，它使用当前类型的 `management.forms.repair-index` 表单和确认文案，在独占维护期间执行。当前类型没有该操作时，按钮会隐藏。重新加载开发链接会刷新同版本扩展的面板和翻译。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1397":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-76","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"把检查面板的 slot 设置为 `management.diagnostics`，就能在实例诊断页显示检查结果。可用状态或列表展示结果，行上的修复按钮引用已有维护操作。需要随诊断包导出的文件继续由 `diagnostics.collectInstance` 提供。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1398":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-77","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"在管理或诊断 schema 面板上添加 `\"toolbar\": \"button\"`，就能从该实例的顶部栏直接打开它。也可以把这个属性写在 `actions` 块的独立按钮上，使用该动作的名称和确认。设置 `\"toolbar\": \"externalBrowser\"` 后，WebUI 显示时会用该快捷动作替换浏览器按钮。WebUI 标签管理器的右键菜单仍可打开当前页面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1399":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-78","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"在清单的 `[contributes]` 中选择面板的显示位置，用 `source` 指向包内的面板 JSON 文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1400":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-79","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"面板有 `id`、`title` 和 `blocks`。同一扩展的面板和视图共用一组 ID，即使放在不同位置也要分别命名。每个块有 `kind`、在面板内唯一的 `id`（`A-Z`、`a-z`、`0-9`、`_`、`-`）和可选的 `title`。同一面板中所有 `actions` 块和 `list` 块也共用一组操作 ID。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1401":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-80","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`kind`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1402":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-81","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"额外的键","locale":"zh-CN"},"1403":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-82","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"后端为 `ui.panel.query` 返回","locale":"zh-CN"},"1404":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-83","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`info`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1405":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-84","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"1406":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-85","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`{ \"rows\": [{ \"label\": …, \"value\": … }] }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1407":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-86","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`table`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1408":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-87","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`columns`：至少一列，每列 `key`（唯一）和 `label`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1409":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-88","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`{ \"rows\": [{ \"<列 key>\": 值 }] }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1410":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-89","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`log`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1411":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-90","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`follow`：为 `true` 时随新行到达停在末尾，直到用户向上滚动","locale":"zh-CN"},"1412":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-91","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`{ \"lines\": [\"…\"] }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1413":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-92","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`actions`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1414":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-93","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`actions`：至少一个，每个有 `id`（唯一）、`label`，可选 `confirm`（执行前确认的文字）和 `fields`（表单，写法与设置相同）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1415":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-94","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"无数据","locale":"zh-CN"},"1416":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-95","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`progress`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1417":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-96","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"1418":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-97","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`{ \"value\": 0.42, \"label\": \"…\" }`：`value` 从 0 到 1；不是数字时进度条显示为不确定","locale":"zh-CN"},"1419":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-98","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`status`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1420":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-99","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`inline`：为 `true` 时在消息旁显示徽标，而不是消息条","locale":"zh-CN"},"1421":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-100","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`{ \"severity\": \"warning\", \"title\": \"…\", \"message\": \"…\" }`：`info`、`success`、`warning` 或 `error`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1422":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-101","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`list`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1423":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-102","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`actions`：每行可提供的按钮，写法与 actions 块相同，但没有 `fields`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1424":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-103","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`{ \"rows\": [{ \"id\": \"…\", \"title\": \"…\", \"description\": \"…\", \"status\": { \"label\": \"…\", \"severity\": \"success\" }, \"actions\": [\"<操作 id>\"] }] }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1425":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-104","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`markdown`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1426":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-105","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"1427":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-106","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`{ \"text\": \"## Markdown\" }`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1428":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-107","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`empty`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1429":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-108","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"1430":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-109","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`{ \"title\": \"…\", \"text\": \"…\" }`：“暂无内容”状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"1431":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-110","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`loading`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1432":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-111","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"1433":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-112","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`{ \"text\": \"…\" }`：加载指示","locale":"zh-CN"},"1434":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-113","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"一个模型列表，每行带有状态和它提供的按钮：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1435":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-114","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`info` 只保留含 `label` 的行，`list` 只保留含 `title` 的行。`table` 接受对象行，按声明的列取值，缺列留空。每块最多保留前 500 行，日志保留最后 500 行。单元格中的 `null` 显示为空白，其他非文本值显示为 JSON，每格最多 2048 个字符。Markdown 最多 65536 个字符。进度值会限制到 0–1，非数字显示为不确定进度。未知的 severity 按 `info` 显示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1436":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-115","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"列表的行提供其 `actions` 列出的操作；不写时提供块的全部操作；没有 `id` 的行不提供操作。点击后（若有 `confirm` 则先确认）调用 `ui.panel.action`，并以 `row` 传入该行的 `id`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1437":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-116","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`progress`、`status`、`markdown`、`empty`、`loading` 块在回答不是对象时（`null`，或状态中的路径不存在）不显示，因此后端可以用数据来显示或隐藏它们：扫描时显示 `loading` 块，没有内容时显示 `empty` 块。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1438":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-117","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"Markdown 渲染时不保留其中的 HTML：文字中的标签按原样显示为文字，链接（http、https、mailto）在浏览器中打开，代码块带有复制按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1439":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-118","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"应用当前版本不认识的块类型会在原处说明无法显示，面板的其余部分照常工作；面板需要较新的块类型时，请提高 `engines`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1440":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-119","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"点击操作按钮时，应用先用该操作的表单检查输入，再调用 `ui.panel.action`，参数为 `panel`、`action`、`values`、`context` 和 `row`。普通按钮的 `row` 为 `null`，列表按钮的 `values` 为 `{}`。后端可以返回 `{ \"notice\": \"…\" }` 显示给用户。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1441":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-120","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"`context` 在实例管理中为 `{ \"instanceId\": \"…\" }`，在设置中为 `{ \"instanceId\": null }`。`management.sections` 中的面板只为扩展自己类型的实例显示和回答。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1442":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-121","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"面板打开、用户点击刷新，或一次操作结束时，应用并发查询所有使用 `ui.panel.query` 的块。每次调用的时限为 30 秒。任何一个块查询失败，整个面板都会显示重试入口。操作失败会在面板内显示原因，然后照常刷新查询块。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1443":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-122","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"除 `actions` 外的块都可以写 `\"source\": \"state\"` 和 `\"path\"`：这样的块改为显示后端的界面状态，不再查询（见来自界面状态的块）。跟随的 `log` 或来自状态的 `progress` 会随每次推送更新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1444":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-123","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#面板","content":"面板操作不会停止实例，也不持有实例的维护锁，因此不能修改实例的文件。需要修改时，应为实例类型声明一个自定义操作（见由后端提供的类型）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1445":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-124","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"在 `initialize` 的 `hooks` 中列出 `ui` 钩子的后端拥有一份界面状态：一个 JSON 值，由它的面板和视图显示，状态变化时由后端主动推送，无需轮询。不列出 `ui` 的后端不受影响。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1446":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-125","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"方向","locale":"zh-CN"},"1447":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-126","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"1448":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-127","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"1449":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-128","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"1450":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-129","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"应用 → 后端","locale":"zh-CN"},"1451":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-130","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"`ui.state`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1452":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-131","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"`context`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1453":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-132","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"1454":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-133","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"应用 → 后端","locale":"zh-CN"},"1455":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-134","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"`ui.call`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1456":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-135","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"`action`、`args`、`context`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1457":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-136","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"任意值，只返回给调用方","locale":"zh-CN"},"1458":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-137","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"后端 → 应用","locale":"zh-CN"},"1459":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-138","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"`ui.emit`（通知）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1460":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-139","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"`state`、可选的 `instanceId`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1461":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-140","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"1462":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-141","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"`context` 在实例管理中为 `{ \"instanceId\": \"…\" }`（仅限扩展自己类型的实例），其他地方为 `{ \"instanceId\": null }`。推送状态时传入可选的 `instanceId`，只有该实例的面板和视图会收到状态。省略则广播给所有订阅者。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1463":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-142","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"含状态块的面板会在打开、后端重启以及每次推送后读取 `ui.state`，因此该方法应尽量轻量。视图页面自行调用 `state()` 读取初始值，用 `onState(listener)` 接收后续推送。`ready()` 只启动页面握手和高度报告。`ui.state` 和 `ui.call` 的时限各为 10 秒。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1464":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-143","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"错误保留其类别：`INVALID_PARAMS` 为 `invalid`，`PERMISSION_DENIED` 为 `forbidden`，其他为 `failed`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1465":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-144","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"推送会合并：第一次立即发送，之后 100 毫秒内保留最近一次广播和该广播之后各实例的最新状态。序列化为 JSON 后超过 256 KiB 的状态不会发送。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1466":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-145","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"`ui.emit` 只能作为通知发送：作为请求发送时，应用回答 `METHOD_NOT_FOUND`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1467":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-146","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"后端界面就绪之前（例如在 `activate` 期间）发送的 `ui.emit` 会被丢弃。后端应将最新快照保留给 `ui.state`，供稍后打开的面板和视图读取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1468":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-147","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面状态","content":"SDK：Rust 中从 `Handler::ui` 返回一个 `Ui`，用 `Host::emit_state` 推送；Python 中覆盖 `ui_state`（以及 `ui_call`），用 `host.emit_state` 推送（见 SDK）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1469":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-148","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#来自界面状态的块","content":"面板中的块可以指定数据来源：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1470":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-149","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#来自界面状态的块","content":"`\"source\": \"state\"` 表示块来自界面状态；不写（或写默认值 `\"query\"`）时块通过 `ui.panel.query` 查询。其他值会在安装时报错。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1471":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-150","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#来自界面状态的块","content":"`path` 是状态中以点分隔的对象键路径（`\"greetings\"`、`\"queue.jobs\"`）；不写时块显示整个状态。没有 `\"source\": \"state\"` 却写了 `path` 会在安装时报错。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1472":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-151","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#来自界面状态的块","content":"路径处的内容按 `ui.panel.query` 对该块的回答来写（`{ \"rows\": [...] }`、`{ \"lines\": [...] }`），由应用以同样宽松的方式读取，限制也相同。上例的状态为 `{ \"greetings\": { \"rows\": [{ \"to\": \"world\" }] } }`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1473":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-152","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#来自界面状态的块","content":"块会跟随每次推送更新，无需查询：应用会再次读取 `ui.state`，显示路径处的内容。状态无法读取时，块会在原处说明原因，直到收到新的状态；后端未运行或未列出 `ui` 时，块不显示任何行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1474":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-153","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图frame","content":"清单中 `kind = \"frame\"` 的 `ui` 项是一个视图，`entry` 是软件包中的 HTML 页面。设置窗口中的视图以它的 `title`（或扩展名称）为分区名；`management.sections` 中的视图只在扩展自己类型的实例中显示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1475":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-154","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图frame","content":"`pages` 中的视图是应用中单独的页面而不是分区，适合不属于任何实例、又比设置分区大的界面（下载器、模型库等）。这里只能放视图。它的调用和状态与设置中的视图相同：没有实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1476":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-155","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图frame","content":"只要有扩展提供页面，标题栏就会显示“扩展页面”按钮；其菜单按 `title`（没有时为扩展名称）列出每个页面，选择后在 `/extensions/<扩展 id>/<视图 id>` 打开。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1477":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-156","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图frame","content":"页面占满标题栏下方的内容区域，标题栏显示它的标题。它没有标题头，也没有自己的高度：无论页面报告多高，视图都占满整个区域，因此页面应自行滚动内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1478":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-157","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图frame","content":"扩展关闭或失败时，页面会在原处说明原因。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1479":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-158","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#页面如何加载","content":"视图页面通过应用注册的 `hfext` 协议从扩展**当前启用版本**的目录中只读加载：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1480":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-159","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#页面如何加载","content":"平台","locale":"zh-CN"},"1481":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-160","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#页面如何加载","content":"页面地址","locale":"zh-CN"},"1482":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-161","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#页面如何加载","content":"Linux、macOS","locale":"zh-CN"},"1483":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-162","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#页面如何加载","content":"`hfext://<扩展 ID>/<路径>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1484":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-163","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#页面如何加载","content":"Windows","locale":"zh-CN"},"1485":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-164","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#页面如何加载","content":"`http://hfext.localhost/<扩展 ID>/<路径>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1486":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-165","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#页面如何加载","content":"在 Windows 上，软件包根目录是 `/<扩展 ID>/` 而不是 `/`。以 `/` 开头的绝对路径在 Windows 上会指向错误的位置，页面中的脚本、样式、图片都应使用相对 URL（如 `./status.js`、`../__hanafubuki/frame.js`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1487":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-166","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#页面如何加载","content":"只有软件包中的普通文件可以加载；`..`、反斜杠、指向包外的链接、目录或不存在的文件都返回 404，扩展未运行时也返回 404。内容类型由文件扩展名决定（`html`、`js`/`mjs`、`css`、`json`、`svg`、`png`、`jpg`、`gif`、`webp`、`avif`、`ico`、`woff`/`woff2`、`ttf`、`otf` 等）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1488":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-167","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"应用在每个软件包根目录的保留路径 `__hanafubuki/frame.js` 提供视图客户端（软件包中同名的文件会被它取代）。它是一个 ES 模块，用相对 URL 导入：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1489":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-168","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"函数","locale":"zh-CN"},"1490":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-169","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"1491":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-170","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"`ready()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1492":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-171","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"通知应用页面已就绪。之后应用发送主题、跟随页面高度并定期 ping。10 秒内不调用，视图会显示“不可用”","locale":"zh-CN"},"1493":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-172","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"`call(method, params)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1494":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-173","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"调用后端，后端收到 `ui.frame.call`，参数为 `frame`、`method`、`params` 和 `context`（实例管理中为 `{instanceId}`，设置和单独页面中 `instanceId` 为 `null`）；返回的 Promise 以后端的回答完成，失败时以 `FrameError` 拒绝","locale":"zh-CN"},"1495":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-174","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"`on(event, listener)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1496":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-175","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"监听后端通过 `ui.frame.emit` 发给这个视图的事件，返回取消监听的函数","locale":"zh-CN"},"1497":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-176","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"`state()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1498":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-177","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"读取界面状态（带视图上下文的 `ui.state`）；以状态完成，失败时以 `FrameError` 拒绝（没有 `ui` 钩子时为 `unavailable`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1499":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-178","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"`onState(listener)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1500":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-179","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"监听后端推送的每个状态（`ui.emit`），返回取消监听的函数。开始监听前推送的状态不会补发，因此也要调用一次 `state()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1501":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-180","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"`getSettings()`、`patchSettings(patch)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1502":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-181","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"通过宿主读写扩展自己的设置，纯数据扩展也可使用。设置示例","locale":"zh-CN"},"1503":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-182","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"`openSettings(section)`、`openExternal(url)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1504":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-183","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"打开已注册的设置分区或 HTTP(S) 链接。导航示例","locale":"zh-CN"},"1505":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-184","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"`pickDirectory({ title }?)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1506":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-185","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"打开应用的文件夹对话框（`title` 超过 200 个字符会被截断），以用户选择的本机路径完成，取消时为 `null`。页面只得到路径，无法读取该文件夹：把它交给后端处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"1507":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-186","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"`updateInstance(values, mode?)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1508":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-187","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"仅在管理视图内使用。提交安装参数（最多 64 项），确认后执行 `\"update\"` 或原地 `\"reinstall\"`。省略时，就绪且提供更新的类型执行更新，其余执行原地重装。原地重装时用户可在宿主确认框中勾选要删除并重建的组件，默认均不勾选。更新保留全部组件目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1509":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-188","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"`navigateInstance(instanceId)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1510":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-189","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"打开某个实例的页面，例如下载器在注册实例之后；应用开始前往时完成，视图可能随之关闭","locale":"zh-CN"},"1511":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-190","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"`locale()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1512":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-191","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"应用的语言（`en`、`zh`）；`ready()` 之后第一次收到主题之前为 `null`。客户端也会把它设为根元素的 `lang`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1513":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-192","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"`onLocale(listener)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1514":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-193","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"监听应用的语言：第一次收到时以及每次变化时调用，返回取消监听的函数","locale":"zh-CN"},"1515":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-194","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"客户端的类型声明是 `sdk/frame/frame.d.ts`，与组件包的类型声明一起放在下面的「视图类型声明」压缩包中。页面用相对 URL 导入运行时的 `__hanafubuki/frame.js`，而 `paths` 不解析这类相对导入：请在自己的仓库中为这两个 URL 各写一条声明，再把声明导出的名字映射到压缩包里的文件。不要自己另写一份类型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1516":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-195","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"压缩包中的 README 给出了声明文件和 `tsconfig.json` 的完整写法，组件包的类型声明需要从 `vue` 解析 Vue 的类型，也要在那里指向应用所用的 Vue 版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1517":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-196","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"`FrameError` 的 `kind` 为：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1518":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-197","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"`kind`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1519":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-198","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"1520":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-199","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"`unavailable`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1521":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-200","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"没有后端（纯数据扩展），或后端未运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"1522":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-201","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"`timeout`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1523":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-202","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"后端未在 30 秒内回答（`state()` 为 10 秒）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1524":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-203","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"`invalid`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1525":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-204","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"调用本身无效，例如实例不属于该扩展的类型，或在实例管理之外调用 `updateInstance`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1526":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-205","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"`forbidden`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1527":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-206","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"仅 `state()`：后端拒绝（`PERMISSION_DENIED`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1528":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-207","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"`failed`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1529":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-208","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"后端返回了错误；对 `updateInstance` 而言，是用户拒绝、已有更新在等待回答，或应用拒绝（附原因）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1530":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-209","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"后端发送通知 `ui.frame.emit`（参数 `frame`、`event`、`payload`）时，该扩展所有打开的、ID 为 `frame` 的视图中订阅了 `event` 的监听器都会收到 `payload`；其他扩展的视图收不到。它只能作为通知发送：作为请求发送时，应用回答 `METHOD_NOT_FOUND`。传入可选的 `instanceId` 时，只有该实例的视图会收到事件。Rust 使用 `emit_frame_for(Some(id), frame, event, payload)`，Python 在 `emit_frame` 中传入 `instance_id=id`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1531":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-210","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"客户端还会：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1532":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-211","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"用 `ResizeObserver` 报告根元素（`<html>`）的高度，视图高度跟随它，限制在 96 到 4096 像素之间（就绪前为 240）；页面不应把根元素高度设为视图高度（`pages` 中的页面忽略它，占满整个区域）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1533":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-212","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"在页面中按 Escape（且页面没有阻止该事件）时把焦点移出视图。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1534":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-213","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#视图客户端","content":"自动回答应用的 ping；12 秒没有回答的视图显示“不可用”，“重新加载”会重建它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1535":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-214","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面套件","content":"应用还会把自己的外观提供给每个视图：视图客户端旁的 `__hanafubuki/ui.css`，以及它加载的字体（位于 `__hanafubuki/fonts/`）。像上面的示例那样用相对 URL 引入即可。它由应用自己的样式表生成，引入后页面就有与应用一致的按钮、输入框、卡片、列表、标签页、提示条、进度条、滚动条和字体，两种主题都适用，并跟随用户选择的强调色。它设置正文的字体和颜色，但不改变页面高度，视图仍然跟随页面内容的高度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1536":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-215","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面套件","content":"它的类名是**类 API 1**：之后的版本可能新增类名，重命名或删除类名则是新版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1537":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-216","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面套件","content":"类别","locale":"zh-CN"},"1538":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-217","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面套件","content":"类名","locale":"zh-CN"},"1539":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-218","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面套件","content":"按钮","locale":"zh-CN"},"1540":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-219","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面套件","content":"`btn`（默认）、`btn-primary`（每个视图最多一个）、`btn-subtle`、`btn-danger`（仅用于确认破坏性操作）；尺寸 `btn-sm`（24px）、默认（32px）、`btn-lg`（40px）；`btn-icon` 为方形图标按钮。不可用时用 `disabled`，需要保持可聚焦时用 `aria-disabled=\"true\"`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1541":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-220","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面套件","content":"输入","locale":"zh-CN"},"1542":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-221","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面套件","content":"`text-input`（用于 `<input>`、`<textarea>` 或包裹它们的容器）、`form-grid`（整行用 `span-all`）、`field-help`、`field-error`、`panel-actions`（表单底部的按钮行）、`checkbox`（用于 `<input type=\"checkbox\">`），与说明文字一起放在 `check-row` 中","locale":"zh-CN"},"1543":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-222","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面套件","content":"容器","locale":"zh-CN"},"1544":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-223","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面套件","content":"`surface-card`、`surface-well`、`surface-floating`、`surface-layer`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1545":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-224","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面套件","content":"列表与导航","locale":"zh-CN"},"1546":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-225","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面套件","content":"由 `card-row` 组成的 `card-list`，每行可含 `card-row__icon`、`card-row__text`（`card-row__title`、`card-row__description`）和 `card-row__control`；`menu-item`（`is-active`、`is-danger`）；由 `tab` 按钮组成的 `tabs`，选中项是 `aria-selected`（标签页）或 `aria-checked`（单选组）为 `true` 的那个","locale":"zh-CN"},"1547":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-226","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面套件","content":"提示与进度","locale":"zh-CN"},"1548":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-227","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面套件","content":"`info-bar`，用 `data-severity` 取 `error`、`warning`、`success`，不设则为信息，内含 `info-bar__icon`（自备的 20px 图标）、`info-bar__text`（`info-bar__title`、`info-bar__message`）、`info-bar__action` 和 `info-bar__dismiss`；`progress-bar`（`role=\"progressbar\"`），内含 `progress-bar__fill`，其 `width` 为百分比，可加 `data-size=\"lg\"`、`data-tone`（`success`、`warning`、`danger`、`muted`）、`indeterminate` 和 `stepped`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1549":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-228","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面套件","content":"辅助","locale":"zh-CN"},"1550":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-229","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面套件","content":"`focus-inset`、`spin`、`pulse`、`text-secondary`、`mono`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1551":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-230","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#界面套件","content":"套件不含脚本。菜单、下拉框、提示框和对话框都无法超出视图的范围；应用自己的这些组件在下面的组件包中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1552":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-231","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"应用还会把自己的 Vue 组件提供给每个视图。它们与应用由同一份源码构建，因此总是与所运行的应用版本一致：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1553":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-232","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"`__hanafubuki/vue.js`：Vue 运行时。它不含模板编译器，视图的安全策略也不允许 `eval`，因此请用 `h()` 渲染，或提供由你自己的构建编译好的模板。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1554":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-233","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"`__hanafubuki/ui.js`：组件。它只导入 `./vue.js`，因此你的页面也从 `../__hanafubuki/vue.js` 导入 Vue，页面中就只有一个 Vue。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1555":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-234","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"`__hanafubuki/ui-components.css`：组件自己的样式，在 `ui.css` 之后引入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1556":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-235","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"在每个 Vue 应用上安装 `frameUi(frame)`，参数是视图客户端模块：它让组件使用应用的语言（并跟随切换），浏览按钮使用应用的文件夹对话框。`useUiStrings().t(key)` 让你的页面使用同样的文字。`frameUi(frame, { teleportTo, openLink })` 接受两个选项：菜单和提示框放置的位置（默认是 `body`），以及点击 `MarkdownDocument` 中的链接时如何处理它的地址。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1557":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-236","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"组件及其属性、事件和插槽列在接口参考中；类型声明是 `sdk/ui/ui.d.ts`，在视图类型声明压缩包里。它由组件包的源码生成，覆盖每个组件的属性、事件和插槽，以及 `frameUi` 和动效工具。这些组件属于 **UI API 1**（`UI_API_VERSION`）：之后的版本可能新增组件和可选属性，删除或重命名则是新版本。请把 `engines.hanafubuki` 提高到新增了你所用内容的应用版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1558":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-237","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"组件在视图中的行为与在应用中相同，只是限于视图之内。`PathInput` 只能选择文件夹（`kind: \"file\"` 的字段不会打开对话框）。菜单在以下情况关闭：在菜单外按下（页面中或应用中）、Escape、Tab、触发器所在区域滚动，以及视图大小改变。在设置分区中，视图跟随页面高度，因此菜单可能打开时请保持页面高度不变（不断增长的日志应放在固定高度的容器中）。视图中任何滚动都会隐藏提示框，并关闭标签页的溢出菜单。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1559":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-238","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"组件包包含应用中所有能在视图里运行的共享组件：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1560":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-239","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"分组","locale":"zh-CN"},"1561":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-240","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"组件","locale":"zh-CN"},"1562":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-241","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"输入","locale":"zh-CN"},"1563":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-242","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"`BaseInput`、`BaseTextarea`、`BaseDropdown`、`BaseSwitch`、`BaseSlider`、`BaseSelectableList`、`ChoiceCard`、`RadioMarker`、`PathInput`、`BaseColorPicker`、`BaseColorPickerPopover`、`TokenListInput`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1564":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-243","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"表单","locale":"zh-CN"},"1565":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-244","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"`FormField`、`FormSection`、`FormPage`、`SchemaFormFields`、`SchemaFieldControl`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1566":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-245","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"设置行","locale":"zh-CN"},"1567":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-246","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"`SettingsGroup`、`SettingsRow`、`SettingsSwitch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1568":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-247","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"结构","locale":"zh-CN"},"1569":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-248","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"`PanelHeader`、`CardHeader`、`DetailSummary`、`BaseTabs`、`BaseCollapsible`、`NavList`、`ToolbarSlot`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1570":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-249","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"菜单与提示","locale":"zh-CN"},"1571":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-250","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"`ContextMenu`、`Tooltip`、`TooltipBubble`、`InfoTooltip`、`NativeTooltipHost`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1572":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-251","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"状态与反馈","locale":"zh-CN"},"1573":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-252","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"`InfoBar`、`InfoBarDetails`、`StatusBadge`、`ProgressBar`、`CornerStatusStack`、`RemovableTokenGroups`、`UpdateDot`、`UpdateHint`、`IconSwap`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1574":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-253","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"1575":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-254","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"`AsyncRegion`、`LoadingState`、`EmptyState`、`Skeleton`、`LoadMoreSentinel`、`RefreshButton`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1576":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-255","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"文本","locale":"zh-CN"},"1577":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-256","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"`MarkdownDocument`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1578":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-257","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"设置行、模式表单、`NavList`、`ContextMenu`、`CornerStatusStack`、`AsyncRegion`、`MarkdownDocument` 需要应用 0.3.35。编辑字符串列表的 `TokenListInput` 和展示详情摘要的 `DetailSummary` 已包含在 0.3.36 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1579":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-258","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"**与应用外观一致的设置分区**是由 `SettingsRow` 组成的 `SettingsGroup`，每行带一个控件（布尔值用 `SettingsSwitch`）。当名为 `panel` 的容器窄于 480px 时，行会把控件放到文字下方：请在包含这些行的元素上声明 `container: panel / inline-size`。`PanelHeader` 和 `BaseTabs` 在你声明的任意容器内也会同样收窄。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1580":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-259","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"**模式表单。** `SchemaFormFields` 把模式面板声明的同一种字段排成 `FormField`，放在你的 `.form-grid` 中，并计算 `visibleWhen` 和 `disabledWhen`。文字请写成 `{ kind: \"literal\", text: { en, zh } }`：`{ kind: \"key\" }` 的文字只能找到应用的 `common` 消息。值由你的后端校验。`path` 字段只能选择文件夹。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1581":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-260","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"**链接。** 点击 `MarkdownDocument` 中的链接不会让视图跳转，本身也不会打开任何东西：向 `frameUi` 传入 `openLink` 即可处理地址（http、https 或 mailto）。HTTP(S) 链接可交给视图客户端的 `openExternal(url)`，由系统浏览器打开。Markdown 源文本中的 HTML 会显示为文字。代码块上的复制按钮写入剪贴板，沙盒视图可能被拒绝，此时按钮保持不变。源文本中的图片不会加载：视图的策略只加载你的包内的图片。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1582":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-261","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"**`CornerStatusStack`** 停靠在最近的已定位祖先元素的右下角：请给它所报告的区域设置 `position: relative`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1583":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-262","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"**`NativeTooltipHost`** 每个页面挂载一次；此后页面中所有 `title` 属性都会显示为应用的提示框。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1584":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-263","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"**`ContextMenu` 和 `BaseColorPickerPopover`** 保持挂载，通过 `open` 控制；菜单的位置由你用 `x` 和 `y` 给出（`contextmenu` 事件的 `clientX` 和 `clientY`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1585":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-264","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"**图标。** 组件包不导出图标。`icon` 属性接受你自己的组件：它渲染一个 `<svg>` 并接受 `size`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1586":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-265","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#组件包","content":"组件包中没有对话框：应用的对话框属于它的窗口。请在你的页面内询问，或使用会在应用中确认的宿主请求（`updateInstance`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1587":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-266","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#主题变量","content":"页面就绪后以及应用主题或语言每次变化时，客户端会在页面根元素上设置 `data-theme`（`light` 或 `dark`）、`color-scheme`、`lang`，以及以下 CSS 变量，还有应用运行时设置的所有变量（完整的强调色系列，例如 `--accent-indicator`、`--accent-text-hover`，以及界面透明度和滚动条箭头）。引入了套件的页面从一开始就有全部变量；没有引入的页面只有这些：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1588":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-267","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#主题变量","content":"类别","locale":"zh-CN"},"1589":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-268","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#主题变量","content":"变量","locale":"zh-CN"},"1590":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-269","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#主题变量","content":"文字","locale":"zh-CN"},"1591":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-270","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#主题变量","content":"`--text-primary`、`--text-secondary`、`--text-tertiary`、`--text-disabled`、`--text-on-accent`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1592":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-271","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#主题变量","content":"强调色","locale":"zh-CN"},"1593":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-272","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#主题变量","content":"`--accent-fill`、`--accent-fill-hover`、`--accent-fill-pressed`、`--accent-text`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1594":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-273","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#主题变量","content":"填充","locale":"zh-CN"},"1595":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-274","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#主题变量","content":"`--fill-card`、`--fill-layer`、`--fill-control`、`--fill-control-hover`、`--fill-control-pressed`、`--fill-subtle-hover`、`--fill-well`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1596":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-275","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#主题变量","content":"描边","locale":"zh-CN"},"1597":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-276","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#主题变量","content":"`--stroke-card`、`--stroke-control`、`--stroke-divider`、`--focus-stroke-outer`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1598":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-277","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#主题变量","content":"状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"1599":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui-278","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev-ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev-ui#主题变量","content":"`--dange