ext","url":"/docs/extension-dev#软件包结构","content":"清单中的每个路径都相对于软件包根目录，使用 `/` 分隔，不能包含 `..`、反斜杠或以根目录开头。软件包中的符号链接不会被跟随。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1685":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-57","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#软件包结构","content":"以副本安装时，每个版本放在应用数据目录的 `extensions/<id>/<version>/` 中；开发链接直接使用选定的源目录。两种安装方式都将持久数据放在 `extensions/<id>/data/`，设置值放在 `extensions/<id>/settings.json`。更新或重新加载时两者都会保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1686":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-58","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#清单字段","content":"清单按宽松方式解码：当前版本不认识的字段会被忽略，因此为新版应用编写、但没有用到新功能的清单仍能读取。每个字段的值则会被严格检查，有问题时安装会被拒绝，并在对应键名（如 `dependencies.\"com.example.base\"`）或行列位置报告原因。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1687":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-59","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#基本信息","content":"键","locale":"zh-CN"},"1688":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-60","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#基本信息","content":"必填","locale":"zh-CN"},"1689":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-61","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#基本信息","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"1690":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-62","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#基本信息","content":"`schema`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1691":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-63","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#基本信息","content":"否","locale":"zh-CN"},"1692":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-64","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#基本信息","content":"清单格式版本，省略时为 `1`；当前只接受 `1`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1693":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-65","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#基本信息","content":"`id`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1694":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-66","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ex