rl":"/docs/extension-dev#安装时检查什么","content":"任何一项不通过，安装都会被拒绝，并列出每个问题的位置，形式为 `<文件>: <文件中的位置>`。扩展每次开启时会再次检查这些文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1801":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-173","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#什么情况会显示无法运行","content":"以下情况不会阻止安装，但扩展会被列为“无法运行”并附上原因：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1802":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-174","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#什么情况会显示无法运行","content":"后端声明了 `command`，但没有当前操作系统的程序；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1803":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-175","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#什么情况会显示无法运行","content":"`engines.api` 不是 `1`，或没有声明；","locale":"zh-CN"},"1804":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-176","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#什么情况会显示无法运行","content":"`engines.hanafubuki` 的范围不包含当前应用版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1805":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-177","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#什么情况会显示无法运行","content":"开启后，依赖未安装、版本不在范围内、依赖已关闭或无法运行，以及依赖形成循环，也会使扩展无法运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1806":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-178","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#发布更新","content":"应用每天会检查一次声明了 `[update] url` 的已安装扩展（用户点击“检查更新”时也会检查）。它读取该地址的 `latest.json`，当其中适合用户系统的最新条目高于已安装版本时，提示有可用更新。应用从不自动安装：用户在卡片上点击“更新”（或“更新到 …”），应用会重新检查，用户确认后才会更新，与其他更新相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1807":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-179","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#发布更新","content":"`latest.json` 是条目的列表，也可以只是一个条目：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1808":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-180","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#发布更新","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"1809":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-181","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#发布更新","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"1810":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-182","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#发布更新","content":"`version`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1811":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-183","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#发布更新","content":"软件包的语义化版本号，与其清单中的一致","locale":"zh-CN"},"1812":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-184","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#发布更新","content":"`download_url`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1813":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-185","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#发布更新","content":"软件包压缩包（`.zip`、`.tar`、`.tar.gz`、`.tar.xz` 或 `.tar.bz2`），使用 `http` 或 `https`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1814":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-186","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#发布更新","content":"`sha256`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1815":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-187","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#发布更新","content":"可选：压缩包的 SHA-256。给出时，下载内容不一致会被拒绝","locale":"zh-CN"},"1816":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-188","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#发布更新","content":"`platform`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1817":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-189","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#发布更新","content":"`windows`、`linux`、`macos` 或 `any`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1818":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-190","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#发布更新","content":"`architecture`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1819":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-191","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#发布更新","content":"`x86_64`、`aarch64` 或 `any`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1820":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-192","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#发布更新","content":"平台和架构必须分别与用户设备一致或为 `any`。应用先取兼容条目中的最高版本，再按精确匹配的字段数量选择同版本的软件包。例如在 Linux x86-64 上，依次优先选 `linux`/`x86_64`、`linux`/`any`、`any`/`any`。跨平台通用的压缩包只需一个条目，两项都设为 `any`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1821":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-193","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#发布更新","content":"无法读取的条目（缺少字段、版本号不是语义化版本、URL 或摘要无效）会被跳过，其余条目照常使用；卡片的提示会列出被跳过的内容。文件不是 JSON 或没有可用条目时，会显示“检查失败”及原因。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1822":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-194","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#发布更新","content":"应用会忽略未知字段。更新清单的读取上限为 1 MiB，列出当前提供的软件包即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1823":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-195","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#通过-github-releases-发布","content":"GitHub 仓库可以把所有文件作为 Release 的附件发布。GitHub 会在固定地址提供最新 Release 中名为 `latest.json` 的附件，因此清单只需写一次：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1824":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-196","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#通过-github-releases-发布","content":"每次发布时：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1825":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-197","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#通过-github-releases-发布","content":"计算每个压缩包的 SHA-256（Linux 上用 `sha256sum llama-0.3.0.zip`，macOS 上用 `shasum -a 256`，PowerShell 中用\n`Get-FileHash -Algorithm SHA256`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1826":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-198","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#通过-github-releases-发布","content":"编写 `latest.json`，每个压缩包一个条目，`download_url` 为该压缩包的 Release 附件地址：`https://github.com/<owner>/<repo>/releases/download/<tag>/<file>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1827":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-199","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#通过-github-releases-发布","content":"之前 Release 中的 `latest.json` 会留在原处，应用只读取最新 Release 中的那一份。草稿和预发布版本不算“最新”，发布它们不会提示更新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1828":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-200","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"应用的“扩展市场”列出扩展注册表 licyk/hanafubuki-extension 中的扩展，注册表就是其中的一个文件 `extensions.json`。要让扩展出现在市场中，请通过拉取请求（pull request）为它添加一个条目；仓库的 README 说明了拉取请求需要通过的检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1829":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-201","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"1830":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-202","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"必填","locale":"zh-CN"},"1831":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-203","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"1832":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-204","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"`id`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1833":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-205","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"1834":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-206","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"清单中的 `id`。从该条目安装的软件包必须是这个 ID，否则安装会被拒绝","locale":"zh-CN"},"1835":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-207","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"`name`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1836":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-208","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"1837":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-209","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"文本，或语言到文本的对象（`{ \"en\": \"…\", \"zh\": \"…\" }`），与清单相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"1838":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-210","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"`author`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1839":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-211","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"1840":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-212","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"文本","locale":"zh-CN"},"1841":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-213","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"`reference`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1842":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-214","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"1843":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-215","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"源代码仓库的地址，`http` 或 `https`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1844":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-216","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"`description`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1845":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-217","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"否","locale":"zh-CN"},"1846":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-218","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"文本，或语言到文本的对象","locale":"zh-CN"},"1847":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-219","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"`download_url`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1848":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-220","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"否","locale":"zh-CN"},"1849":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-221","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"可安装的压缩包（`.zip`、`.tar`、`.tar.gz`、`.tar.xz` 或 `.tar.bz2`），`http` 或 `https`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1850":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-222","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"`update_url`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1851":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-223","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"否","locale":"zh-CN"},"1852":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-224","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"扩展的 `latest.json`（见发布更新），通常与其 `[update] url` 是同一个地址","locale":"zh-CN"},"1853":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-225","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"**随发布版本更新**。将 `update_url` 指向最新发布版的 `latest.json`，即可省略市场条目中的 `download_url`。安装时会从中选择适合当前平台和架构的最高版本，使用该版本的下载地址，并在提供 `sha256` 时校验压缩包。即使市场条目中还留着旧地址，安装也只使用 `latest.json`。读取失败或没有兼容包时会显示错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1854":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-226","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"**固定版本或仅展示源码**。只填 `download_url` 时，市场直接下载该地址的压缩包。两个地址都省略时，条目只显示源码链接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1855":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-227","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"**注册表格式。** 发布的文档使用 `schema: 1`。应用读取 `extensions` 数组，忽略其他顶层字段，包括 `schema`。无效条目会被跳过，同一 ID 保留首个通过检查的条目。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1856":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-228","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#加入注册表","content":"**注册表不会用来更新已安装的扩展**：扩展的更新只来自其清单中的 `[update] url`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1857":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-229","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"实例类型\" href=\"/docs/extension-dev-instance-types\" description=\"编写描述文件：参数、步骤、占位符和服务器角色。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1858":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-230","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"后端\" href=\"/docs/extension-dev-backends\" description=\"后端进程、协议、宿主接口和回调。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1859":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-231","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"SDK\" href=\"/docs/extension-dev-sdks\" description=\"用 Rust 或 Python 编写后端。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1860":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-232","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"界面\" href=\"/docs/extension-dev-ui\" description=\"设置表单、面板、视图和文字。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1861":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-233","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"接口参考\" href=\"/docs/extension-dev-reference\" description=\"由应用导出生成的全部方法、类、面板块与清单键。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1862":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-234","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"测试与打包\" href=\"/docs/extension-dev-testing\" description=\"以示例扩展为例，构建、测试并打包扩展。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1863":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-235","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#agent-contributions","content":"扩展可在 `contributes.agent` 声明 Skills 和 MCP 服务器。安装审阅会展示这些声明及请求的权限。它们组成应用管理的 linked package，不开放任意 Agent 配置写入或动态 Rust plugin。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1864":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-236","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#agent-contributions","content":"这是 manifest 片段，需补充正常的扩展身份与 engine 字段。Skill path 指向含 `SKILL.md` 的包内目录。stdio command 为包内程序 `{kind=\"package\", path=\"bin/server\"}`，或已声明运行时 `{kind=\"runtime\", tool=\"python\"}`（另支持 `git`、`micromamba`）。stdio 要求 `processes = true`；HTTP 要求固定 URL 的主机在 `network` 中。args、env 与 HTTP header value 接受字符串或 `{setting=\"key\"}`，引用扩展自身声明的字符串设置。本例需在 `schemas/settings.json` 声明 `authorization`，例如 `secret` 字段，由用户填写完整 header value，如 `Bearer …`。不会注入宿主 token；权限与引用由 Rust 校验。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1865":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-237","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#agent-contributions","content":"stdio 服务器以扩展包根目录为工作目录，所以上例中的 `server.py` 与清单位于同一目录。宿主会把引用的设置值写入生成包的本地 `.mcp.json`，包括作为请求头使用的完整密钥。如果某个引用缺少字符串值，宿主会停用托管的 Agent 包并清除旧的 MCP 配置。填好设置后会重新生成包，扩展的其他功能仍可使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1866":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-238","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#agent-contributions","content":"Skill 和服务器的 ID 由 ASCII 字母、数字、点、下划线或连字符组成，各自在同类贡献中唯一。`.` 和 `..` 不可用，Skill ID 的首字符也不能是点。宿主在扩展托管的 `agent-package` 目录生成链接包。包 ID 为 `hanafubuki-extension-<extension-id>@hanafubuki-extensions`，MCP 服务器 ID 为 `hanafubuki-extension-<extension-id>-<local-id>`，完整服务器 ID 最长 128 字节。遇到用户拥有的同名包会拒绝覆盖。Agent 原有的工具审批和可见性规则继续生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1867":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-239","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#agent-contributions","content":"启用扩展后发布贡献，停止、停用或 fault 时撤销。更新及引用设置成功保存后重新生成内容并 reload。用户独立禁用的 package 保持禁用，宿主仅恢复自己执行的禁用。卸载移除托管 Agent package，不删除用户数据。Agent 不可用时扩展的其他能力继续工作，下次 ready 按当前扩展 owner 对齐，不触碰普通用户 package。嵌套字段以生成的 manifest 参考为准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1868":{"id":"/docs/extension-dev-240","page_id":"/docs/extension-dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/extension-dev#agent-contributions","content":"字段默认值、条件要求和验证阶段以生成的配置参考为准。JSON Schema 中的 `null` 描述 JSON 表示或省略语义；TOML 没有 `null` 字面量，不能照写 `field = null`。Schema 默认与领域有效默认分别展示，网站不会从 nullable 字段猜测运行时值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1869":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","type":"page","content":"主页与窗口","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","工作区"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/home-workspace","locale":"zh-CN"},"1870":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-0","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/home-workspace","content":"从实例卡片打开工作区，在标题栏找到管理工具，把常用面板放到另一块屏幕。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1871":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-1","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/home-workspace#在主页找到实例","content":"在主页找到实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"1872":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-2","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/home-workspace#标题栏与独立窗口","content":"标题栏与独立窗口","locale":"zh-CN"},"1873":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-3","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/home-workspace#在主页找到实例","content":"搜索框可以按实例名称、类型 ID 或安装路径的一部分筛选，忽略大小写。例如，输入 `comfyui` 就能找到类型为 `builtin:comfyui` 的实例。用 `Tab` 将焦点移入卡片区，再用方向键移动，`Home` 和 `End` 可跳至首尾。按 `Enter` 或空格打开选中的卡片。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1874":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-4","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/home-workspace#在主页找到实例","content":"想做什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"1875":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-5","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/home-workspace#在主页找到实例","content":"从哪里操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"1876":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-6","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/home-workspace#在主页找到实例","content":"运行实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"1877":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-7","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/home-workspace#在主页找到实例","content":"点击已就绪的实例卡片。已在启动或运行的实例会打开现有工作区。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1878":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-8","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/home-workspace#在主页找到实例","content":"只查看配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"1879":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-9","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/home-workspace#在主页找到实例","content":"右键卡片或点“更多操作”，选择“管理…”。也可点标题栏的“实例管理”，在列表中选择实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1880":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-10","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/home-workspace#在主页找到实例","content":"继续未完成的安装","locale":"zh-CN"},"1881":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-11","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/home-workspace#在主页找到实例","content":"打开卡片查看安装进度，或在卡片菜单中选择可用的“开始安装”或“重试安装”。安装进度与故障处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"1882":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-12","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/home-workspace#在主页找到实例","content":"检查单个实例的更新","locale":"zh-CN"},"1883":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-13","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/home-workspace#在主页找到实例","content":"点就绪卡片上的“检查更新”。卡片显示检查进度或可用更新；如果该类型未提供检查，主页会提示原因。版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"1884":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-14","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/home-workspace#在主页找到实例","content":"添加已有 WebUI","locale":"zh-CN"},"1885":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-15","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/home-workspace#在主页找到实例","content":"把目录拖到主页，或点“添加实例”选择导入或扫描。第一次使用时也可能看到扫描本机的提示。扫描系统","locale":"zh-CN"},"1886":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-16","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/home-workspace#在主页找到实例","content":"如果卡片显示类型不可用，实例记录仍然保留。请到扩展检查提供该类型的扩展，或从卡片菜单打开管理查看记录。主页的“Hanafubuki 文档”卡片会在系统浏览器中打开指南。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1887":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-17","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/home-workspace#标题栏与独立窗口","content":"实例管理用于维护实例。要打开正在运行的页面或在多个实例之间切换，用 WebUI 标签页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1888":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-18","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/home-workspace#标题栏与独立窗口","content":"任务中心汇集后台活动和 WebUI 下载；Agent打开对话；设置管理应用和运行环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1889":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-19","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/home-workspace#标题栏与独立窗口","content":"安装并启用了提供页面的桌面扩展后，标题栏会出现“扩展页面”菜单。选择页面后，用标题栏的返回按钮回到主页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1890":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-20","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/home-workspace#标题栏与独立窗口","content":"“问题反馈”会在系统浏览器打开项目的问题列表。需要附日志时，先按日志、诊断与求助保存相关输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1891":{"id":"/docs/home-workspace-21","page_id":"/docs/home-workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/home-workspace#标题栏与独立窗口","content":"在设置、实例管理、Agent、任务中心或 WebUI 标签页面板的标题栏选择“在独立窗口中打开”，即可把它放在另一块屏幕上。比如把任务中心移出去，就可以一边查看安装日志，一边在主窗口管理实例。再次点击主窗口的对应入口会将独立窗口带到前台。要收回面板，点独立窗口中的“返回主窗口”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1892":{"id":"/docs","page_id":"/docs","type":"page","content":"Hanafubuki","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","开始"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs","locale":"zh-CN"},"1893":{"id":"/docs-0","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"一站式安装、运行和管理本地生成式 AI WebUI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1894":{"id":"/docs-1","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"Hanafubuki 是一个基于 Tauri 的桌面管理器，用来安装、导入、运行和维护本地生成式 AI WebUI。它统一管理 Python、Git、运行参数、模型、扩展、快照和诊断信息，并提供可连接本地工具的 Agent。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1895":{"id":"/docs-2","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"内置类型包括 Stable Diffusion WebUI、ComfyUI、InvokeAI、Fooocus、SD Trainer、Qwen TTS WebUI、RVC Next WebUI 和 Mizuoto TTS WebUI。启用桌面扩展还可以添加实例类型。每种类型提供的安装方式和管理功能见实例安装和实例管理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1896":{"id":"/docs-3","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"主页与窗口\" href=\"/docs/home-workspace\" description=\"查找实例、使用卡片菜单，或把工具面板移到另一块屏幕。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1897":{"id":"/docs-4","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"第一次使用\" href=\"/docs/quick-start\" description=\"从安装应用到启动第一个 WebUI。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1898":{"id":"/docs-5","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"安装应用\" href=\"/docs/installation\" description=\"选择安装包或便携版并完成首次启动。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1899":{"id":"/docs-6","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"使用 Agent\" href=\"/docs/agent\" description=\"配置模型并在项目环境中开始会话。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1900":{"id":"/docs-7","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"故障排查\" href=\"/docs/troubleshooting\" description=\"从任务输出、日志和诊断包定位问题。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1901":{"id":"/docs-8","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"Hanafubuki 仍在开发和测试中。重要实例和配置建议定期创建快照或自行备份。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1902":{"id":"/docs/installation","page_id":"/docs/installation","type":"page","content":"安装 Hanafubuki","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","开始"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/installation","locale":"zh-CN"},"1903":{"id":"/docs/installation-0","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation","content":"在下载页选择安装包或便携版，并完成首次启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1904":{"id":"/docs/installation-1","page_id":"/docs/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/installation#先选择一种","content":"先选择一种","locale":"zh-CN"},"1905":{"id":"/docs/installation-2","page_id":"/docs/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/installation#在下载页获取","content":"在下载页获取","locale":"zh-CN"},"1906":{"id":"/docs/installation-3","page_id":"/docs/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/installation#安装包格式","content":"安装包格式","locale":"zh-CN"},"1907":{"id":"/docs/installation-4","page_id":"/docs/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/installation#按平台安装","content":"按平台安装","locale":"zh-CN"},"1908":{"id":"/docs/installation-5","page_id":"/docs/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"便携版","locale":"zh-CN"},"1909":{"id":"/docs/installation-6","page_id":"/docs/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/installation#首次启动","content":"首次启动","locale":"zh-CN"},"1910":{"id":"/docs/installation-7","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation","content":"Hanafubuki 提供两种获取方式：**安装包**把应用装进系统，**便携版**是一个解压即用的 Launcher。两者都在下载页提供，并且都会自动识别当前系统。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1911":{"id":"/docs/installation-8","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#先选择一种","content":"安装包","locale":"zh-CN"},"1912":{"id":"/docs/installation-9","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#先选择一种","content":"便携版","locale":"zh-CN"},"1913":{"id":"/docs/installation-10","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#先选择一种","content":"使用方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"19