stallation#按平台安装","content":"下载安装程序并按提示完成安装，随后从桌面或开始菜单启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1961":{"id":"/docs/installation-58","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#按平台安装","content":"选择免安装压缩包时，解压到有写入权限的目录再运行其中的可执行文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1962":{"id":"/docs/installation-59","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#按平台安装","content":"当前 Windows 安装包尚未签名。启动安装程序或免安装版时如果出现 `Windows 已保护你的电脑。Microsoft Defender SmartScreen 阻止了无法识别的应用启动。运行此应用可能会导致你的电脑存在风险。`，请先确认文件来自本站，再点击提示中的“更多信息”，然后点击“仍然运行”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1963":{"id":"/docs/installation-60","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#按平台安装","content":"打开磁盘映像，把 Hanafubuki 拖入“应用程序”。应用归档解压后得到同一个 `.app`，同样放入“应用程序”即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1964":{"id":"/docs/installation-61","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#按平台安装","content":"当前 macOS 安装包尚未签名。若首次运行出现 `“Hanafubuki” is damaged and can't be opened. You should move it to the Trash.`，请确认安装包来自本站，然后打开“终端”并移除应用的隔离属性：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1965":{"id":"/docs/installation-62","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#按平台安装","content":"输入 macOS 密码时终端不会显示字符；完成后重新打开 Hanafubuki。若系统显示的是其他安全确认提示，再前往“系统设置 → 隐私与安全性”确认打开。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1966":{"id":"/docs/installation-63","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#按平台安装","content":"AppImage 赋予执行权限后直接运行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1967":{"id":"/docs/installation-64","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#按平台安装","content":"也可以使用系统包管理器安装 `.deb` 或 `.rpm`，安装后从应用菜单启动：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1968":{"id":"/docs/installation-65","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#按平台安装","content":"Windows\n的免安装压缩包只是省去安装步骤，数据仍然写入系统的应用数据目录。需要数据跟着程序走时，请使用下面的便携版\nLauncher。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1969":{"id":"/docs/installation-66","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"便携版由独立的 Launcher 启动。它把应用本体放在旁边的 `.hanafubuki-launcher/core/`，应用设置和默认实例目录位于 `.hanafubuki-launcher/data/` 下，Launcher 自己的日志位于 `.hanafubuki-launcher/logs/`。首次扫描登记的现有 WebUI 仍使用原目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1970":{"id":"/docs/installation-67","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"下载对应平台的 Launcher 压缩包，解压到有写入权限的目录；不要放在只读介质或系统目录中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1971":{"id":"/docs/installation-68","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"需要迁移时，退出应用，把 Launcher、`.hanafubuki-launcher` 和首次扫描登记的 WebUI\n目录一起复制，保留它们之间的相对位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1972":{"id":"/docs/installation-69","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"当前 Windows 便携版同样尚未签名。首次运行 Launcher 时如果 Microsoft Defender SmartScreen 显示\n`Windows 已保护你的电脑`，请先确认压缩包来自本站，然后点击“更多信息”，再点击出现的“仍然运行”按钮。\n“仍然运行”只会在展开“更多信息”后显示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1973":{"id":"/docs/installation-70","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"当前 macOS 便携版同样尚未签名。确认压缩包来自本站后，在“终端”输入\n`xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine` 并加一个空格，将解压得到的 `Hanafubuki Launcher.app`\n从“访达”拖入终端窗口，再按回车。完整命令类似：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1974":{"id":"/docs/installation-71","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"完成后重新打开 Launcher。命令必须指向实际的 `.app`；不要直接照抄示例中的“实际路径”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1975":{"id":"/docs/installation-72","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"Launcher 还会处理这些情况：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1976":{"id":"/docs/installation-73","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"首次运行时扫描所在目录，按内置 WebUI 布局登记实例。只找到 Core 时也会登记，需在应用中完成安装。以后才放进来的 WebUI 可从“添加实例”进入扫描系统。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1977":{"id":"/docs/installation-74","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"每次启动都会把制品缓存、默认实例安装目录和内嵌 WebUI 下载目录设回便携工作区内的默认位置。已经登记的实例继续使用各自的目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1978":{"id":"/docs/installation-75","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"在线校验时会清除 `core/` 中不在清单内的文件，并从发布包修复缺失或损坏的文件。模型和个人文件请放在实例目录或自己的数据目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1979":{"id":"/docs/installation-76","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"发布源不可用时，Launcher 会尝试直接启动已安装的本体。首次安装或本体已无法启动时仍需恢复网络。准备失败时可在 Launcher 中打开本次日志。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1980":{"id":"/docs/installation-77","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"读取系统代理配置，用于自身的下载请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1981":{"id":"/docs/installation-78","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#便携版","content":"Launcher 在 Windows 上需要长路径支持和 Visual C++\n运行库。缺少时会各请求一次管理员权限来写入注册表或安装运行库，之后仍以普通用户身份运行。取消授权会停在重试界面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1982":{"id":"/docs/installation-79","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#首次启动","content":"应用会准备 Python、Micromamba 和 Git 等运行组件。保持网络连接并等待准备完成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1983":{"id":"/docs/installation-80","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#首次启动","content":"若准备失败，前往“设置 → 运行环境”重试或调整下载来源，也可以参考运行环境故障排查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1984":{"id":"/docs/installation-81","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#首次启动","content":"准备完成后，继续阅读快速开始安装或导入第一个 WebUI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1985":{"id":"/docs/installation-82","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#首次启动","content":"<Card title=\"快速开始\" href=\"/docs/quick-start\" description=\"创建并启动第一个 WebUI 实例。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1986":{"id":"/docs/installation-83","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#首次启动","content":"<Card title=\"关于与更新\" href=\"/docs/settings-about-updates\" description=\"查看版本、检查更新并安装新版本。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1987":{"id":"/docs/installation-84","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#首次启动","content":"<Card title=\"运行环境\" href=\"/docs/settings-runtime\" description=\"调整 Python、Git 与下载来源。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1988":{"id":"/docs/installation-85","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#首次启动","content":"<Card title=\"运行环境故障排查\" href=\"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime\" description=\"准备失败或组件缺失时的处理步骤。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"1989":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","type":"page","content":"实例诊断","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","locale":"zh-CN"},"1990":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","content":"收集当前实例的环境、任务、日志和配置，并安全地导出诊断包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1991":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#收集诊断包","content":"收集诊断包","locale":"zh-CN"},"1992":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#复现并记录问题","content":"复现并记录问题","locale":"zh-CN"},"1993":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#启动收集","content":"启动收集","locale":"zh-CN"},"1994":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#检查完成状态","content":"检查完成状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"1995":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#检查并导出","content":"检查并导出","locale":"zh-CN"},"1996":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#诊断包可能包含什么","content":"诊断包可能包含什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"1997":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#分享前检查","content":"分享前检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"1998":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","content":"实例诊断用于把一次问题相关的环境和运行信息收集到 ZIP 中。它不会自动修复实例，适合在启动、扩展、热补丁或环境问题已经复现后提供排查材料。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1999":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#复现并记录问题","content":"记录操作步骤、大致时间和可见错误。不要连续重试到旧任务输出被新任务淹没。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2000":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#启动收集","content":"打开“维护 → 诊断”，点击“收集诊断信息”。进度显示在实例管理器右下角；离开诊断页不会取消收集。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2001":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#检查完成状态","content":"收集完成后刷新诊断包列表。列表会显示文件名、创建时间、大小和采集问题数量；个别来源读取失败时，其他内容仍可能正常写入压缩包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2002":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#检查并导出","content":"点击“打开诊断包目录”找到原文件，或使用“另存副本”保存到指定位置。先自行解压检查，再发送给可信的维护者。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2003":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#检查并导出","content":"如果安装或启动失败，也可以直接从失败页面收集诊断。成功后工作区会询问是否另存副本。关闭提示后，原包仍可从“维护 → 诊断”的列表中找到。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2004":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#诊断包可能包含什么","content":"当前 WebUI 的环境收集结果；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2005":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#诊断包可能包含什么","content":"实例快照、持久化记录和组件路径；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2006":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#诊断包可能包含什么","content":"当前保留的实例任务、启动阶段和任务输出；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2007":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#诊断包可能包含什么","content":"热补丁持久化配置、有效配置、状态、事件和日志；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2008":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#诊断包可能包含什么","content":"支持排查所需的应用设置、身份和诊断信息；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2009":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#诊断包可能包含什么","content":"`manifest.json` 中的采集范围、问题、文件大小和 SHA-256。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2010":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#诊断包可能包含什么","content":"此页收集当前实例的诊断。需要同时排查多个实例时，打开“设置 → 诊断”，选择应用级收集范围。详见诊断设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2011":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#诊断包可能包含什么","content":"被收集的内容会按原值保留，可能包含凭据、令牌、环境变量、本地路径、命令参数和任务输出。虽然部分专门保存凭据的文件会整体排除，但不能据此认为压缩包可以公开分享。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2012":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-22","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#分享前检查","content":"诊断包没有自动过期或删除策略。页面当前不提供删除按钮，需要使用“打开诊断包目录”后自行管理磁盘文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2013":{"id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics-23","page_id":"/docs/instance-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-diagnostics#分享前检查","content":"<Card title=\"日志、诊断与求助\" href=\"/docs/troubleshooting-reporting\" description=\"选择诊断范围并提交可复现的问题报告。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2014":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","type":"page","content":"扩展管理","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-extensions","locale":"zh-CN"},"2015":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions","content":"安装、更新、启停、切换版本或卸载当前 WebUI 支持的扩展。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2016":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-extensions#安装扩展","content":"安装扩展","locale":"zh-CN"},"2017":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"管理本地扩展","locale":"zh-CN"},"2018":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-extensions#更新或切换版本","content":"更新或切换版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"2019":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions","content":"“扩展”页是否可用，以及提供哪些按钮，由当前 WebUI 的管理能力决定。页面通常包含“本地扩展”和“扩展市场”两个视图；不支持市场的实例仍可能允许管理已经安装的扩展。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2020":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#安装扩展","content":"市场搜索会在已加载的索引中匹配名称、描述、作者和标签。“本地扩展”的搜索则匹配已安装扩展的名称、来源地址和分支。刷新按钮只刷新当前标签页；有仓库链接的条目可在系统浏览器中打开查看。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2021":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"2022":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"2023":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"启用 / 停用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2024":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"修改扩展状态，通常在下次启动 WebUI 时生效","locale":"zh-CN"},"2025":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"更新","locale":"zh-CN"},"2026":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"拉取 Git 扩展的更新，或将 Comfy Registry 节点更新到最新发布版本。文件型扩展没有此按钮","locale":"zh-CN"},"2027":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"全部更新","locale":"zh-CN"},"2028":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"依次处理当前可以更新的扩展，失败项在任务中心中查看","locale":"zh-CN"},"2029":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"分支 / 提交","locale":"zh-CN"},"2030":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"将 Git 型扩展切换到指定分支或提交","locale":"zh-CN"},"2031":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"Registry 版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"2032":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"为支持 Registry 的 ComfyUI 节点选择已发布版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"2033":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"卸载","locale":"zh-CN"},"2034":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"删除扩展目录或由当前 WebUI 执行对应卸载操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"2035":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#管理本地扩展","content":"上次实例更新检查发现有更新时，页面显示待更新数量，对应的已安装扩展也会单独标记。Git 仓库通常支持切换分支和提交；Registry 节点使用发布版本选择器，本地文件扩展可用的操作较少。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2036":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#更新或切换版本","content":"卸载确认窗口明确表示扩展文件将从实例中删除。扩展自己的配置、模型或输出是否一并消失取决于它们实际存放的位置；卸载前应先检查并备份。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2037":{"id":"/docs/instance-extensions-22","page_id":"/docs/instance-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-extensions#更新或切换版本","content":"扩展下载失败时检查网络与代理和镜像；需要整体回退环境时使用快照管理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2038":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","type":"page","content":"热补丁","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","locale":"zh-CN"},"2039":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","content":"配置热补丁、控制正在运行的补丁和功能，并查看运行时日志。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2040":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#配置编辑方式","content":"配置编辑方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2041":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#保存和应用的区别","content":"保存和应用的区别","locale":"zh-CN"},"2042":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#运行时控制","content":"运行时控制","locale":"zh-CN"},"2043":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#修改热补丁","content":"修改热补丁","locale":"zh-CN"},"2044":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","content":"热补丁由当前 WebUI 提供，只有后端检测到配置或运行时能力时才会显示。在“热补丁”页可以编辑配置、查看日志，并在支持的实例上控制正在运行的补丁。运行状态摘要见实例信息的“热补丁运行时”区域。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2045":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#配置编辑方式","content":"表单根据当前热补丁目录生成。修改布尔值、整数、选项、列表或对象后，会在短暂合并连续输入后自动保存完整配置；“恢复默认值”在表单模式下也会自动保存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2046":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#配置编辑方式","content":"原始编辑器用于精确修改完整配置对象。输入必须是合法 JSON\n对象；修改只形成草稿，需要点击保存。半成品或格式错误的 JSON 不会写入实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2047":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#配置编辑方式","content":"“规范化”会让后端按照当前目录整理草稿，例如补齐、转换或拒绝不符合字段约束的值。它不等同于应用到正在运行的 WebUI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2048":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#保存和应用的区别","content":"操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"2049":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#保存和应用的区别","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"2050":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#保存和应用的区别","content":"保存配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2051":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#保存和应用的区别","content":"持久化当前实例的热补丁配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2052":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#保存和应用的区别","content":"应用到本地配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2053":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#保存和应用的区别","content":"让支持该操作的 WebUI 更新本地补丁配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2054":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#保存和应用的区别","content":"应用到运行时","locale":"zh-CN"},"2055":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#保存和应用的区别","content":"把规范化后的配置发送给当前正在运行的热补丁会话","locale":"zh-CN"},"2056":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#保存和应用的区别","content":"运行时未启动时，“应用到运行时”不可用。此时先保存配置，再启动 WebUI；运行时状态可以在“实例信息”中确认。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2057":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#运行时控制","content":"如果页面提供“运行时控制”标签，打开它可检测当前 WebUI 的热补丁器。“未运行”时先启动 WebUI，等待运行时连接。“无响应”时应用会在几秒后重试，也可点击“重新检测”。“不支持”表示热补丁器版本过旧，需要更新该 WebUI 的运行环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2058":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#运行时控制","content":"显示“可用”后，页面按本次会话支持的命令提供操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2059":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#运行时控制","content":"**补丁、补丁集和功能**。可以查看和卸载已加载的补丁或补丁集。功能拥有的补丁集需通过关闭对应功能来卸载。要加载新的补丁集，在“配置”中设置 `control.patch_sets` 后重启 WebUI。若某项功能提示更改需要导入代码或加载补丁集，也在“配置”中修改后重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2060":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#运行时控制","content":"**检查**。输入 Python 模块的导入名，可查看补丁说明、校验结果或补丁后的源码。模块名留空时，“校验”会检查所有已打补丁的模块。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2061":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-22","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#运行时控制","content":"**调试和连接**。可查看运行时事件、调整跟踪标签和严格模式。要在桌面端接收转发的事件，在“配置”中开启 `control.forward_events`。“连接”显示当前桌面连接的只读详情。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2062":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-23","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#运行时控制","content":"卸载补丁、切换功能等运行时操作会创建管理任务。可在任务中心查看执行结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2063":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-24","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#修改热补丁","content":"日志页会持续读取当前运行时会话的保留记录。“清空视图”只清除当前页面已经显示的日志，不修改配置，也不应被当作问题已经解决。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2064":{"id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch-25","page_id":"/docs/instance-hotpatch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-hotpatch#修改热补丁","content":"热补丁字段由当前 WebUI 和版本动态提供。直接粘贴其他类型或旧版本的完整 JSON\n可能导致校验失败；修改前可先保存当前配置副本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2065":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","type":"page","content":"启动配置","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-launch","locale":"zh-CN"},"2066":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch","content":"配置 WebUI 启动参数和实例环境变量，并处理启动前的参数检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2067":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-launch#两种参数编辑方式","content":"两种参数编辑方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2068":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-launch#配置启动参数","content":"配置启动参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"2069":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-launch#停止-webui","content":"停止 WebUI","locale":"zh-CN"},"2070":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-launch#编辑原始字符串","content":"编辑原始字符串","locale":"zh-CN"},"2071":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-launch#按需打开结构化编辑器","content":"按需打开结构化编辑器","locale":"zh-CN"},"2072":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-launch#检查重启提示","content":"检查重启提示","locale":"zh-CN"},"2073":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-launch#环境变量","content":"环境变量","locale":"zh-CN"},"2074":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-launch#启动时发现不兼容参数","content":"启动时发现不兼容参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"2075":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch","content":"“启动”页保存当前实例下次启动时使用的环境变量。提供启动参数的类型还可在这里编辑命令行。修改在下次启动 WebUI 时生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2076":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch","content":"扩展类型可以在「服务启动选项」中提供自己的字段，如监听地址、上下文长度或 GPU 层数。点击「保存」后会在下次启动相应服务时生效，无需重新安装实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2077":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#两种参数编辑方式","content":"编辑方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2078":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#两种参数编辑方式","content":"适合情况","locale":"zh-CN"},"2079":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#两种参数编辑方式","content":"保存与校验","locale":"zh-CN"},"2080":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#两种参数编辑方式","content":"原始参数字符串","locale":"zh-CN"},"2081":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#两种参数编辑方式","content":"已经知道参数写法，希望快速复制完整命令行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2082":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#两种参数编辑方式","content":"按命令行语法解析；未知参数会显示警告但不会被静默删除","locale":"zh-CN"},"2083":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#两种参数编辑方式","content":"结构化编辑器","locale":"zh-CN"},"2084":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#两种参数编辑方式","content":"希望从当前 WebUI 实际支持的参数中选择","locale":"zh-CN"},"2085":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#两种参数编辑方式","content":"检查参数数量、取值、重复、必填项和互斥组","locale":"zh-CN"},"2086":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#两种参数编辑方式","content":"原始参数只填写传给 WebUI 的参数，不要包含 Python 可执行文件或启动脚本。例如：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2087":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#两种参数编辑方式","content":"这只是命令行格式示例。参数是否存在、是否需要值以及允许的取值，都应以当前实例结构化编辑器加载到的目录为准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2088":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-22","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#停止-webui","content":"已运行的 WebUI 不会因为修改配置而自动重启。先停止实例可以避免忘记重新启动并误以为参数已经生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2089":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-23","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#编辑原始字符串","content":"按命令行方式输入参数；包含空格的单个值需要使用引号。提交后检查页面列出的解析错误和未知参数警告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2090":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-24","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#按需打开结构化编辑器","content":"点击“配置启动参数”，从参数目录启用选项并填写值。编辑器会随着修改保存；发现配置过期时，应重新加载后再编辑。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2091":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-25","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#检查重启提示","content":"页面出现“需要重启”时，返回“实例信息”启动 WebUI，并在启动任务中确认最终参数检查通过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2092":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-26","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#检查重启提示","content":"结构化目录无法读取时，页面会退回原始编辑模式。此时可以保留并保存参数，但自动校验能力较少；先检查管理 API 和 Core 环境，再使用“重试发现”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2093":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-27","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#检查重启提示","content":"在结构化编辑器中可以搜索参数，也可直接在命令行输入参数前缀。出现候选项时，用上下方向键选择，按 `Tab` 或 `Enter` 补全，按 `Esc` 关闭列表。编辑器会单列无法识别的参数及其值，可以逐组移除；需要保留的自定义参数可留在原处。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2094":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-28","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#环境变量","content":"环境变量只应用于当前实例的受管进程。每行需要唯一的变量名，值可以留空。名称重复或缺失时，页面会保留草稿，待修正后再保存。要删除变量，使用该行的移除按钮；要放弃尚未保存的编辑，可点“放弃更改”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2095":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-29","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#环境变量","content":"只添加当前 WebUI、扩展或脚本明确需要的变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2096":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-30","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#环境变量","content":"`PATH`、`PYTHONPATH`、`MAMBA_*` 和 `CONDA_*` 等受管环境值可能被应用保留或重新组合，不应依赖它们覆盖桌面运行环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2097":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-31","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#环境变量","content":"环境变量值会正常显示，也可能进入任务输出或诊断包；分享截图和诊断前先检查令牌等敏感内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2098":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-32","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#启动时发现不兼容参数","content":"保存阶段允许保留当前参数目录尚未识别的选项，以兼容分支、扩展或未来版本。真正启动时，后端会再次使用当前参数目录检查未知参数、孤立值和其他约束，并提供以下选择：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2099":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-33","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#启动时发现不兼容参数","content":"选择","locale":"zh-CN"},"2100":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-34","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#启动时发现不兼容参数","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"2101":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-35","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#启动时发现不兼容参数","content":"取消","locale":"zh-CN"},"2102":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-36","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#启动时发现不兼容参数","content":"不创建 WebUI 运行资源，返回配置页修改","locale":"zh-CN"},"2103":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-37","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#启动时发现不兼容参数","content":"仅本次忽略","locale":"zh-CN"},"2104":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-38","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#启动时发现不兼容参数","content":"本次继续使用原始参数，保存的配置不改变","locale":"zh-CN"},"2105":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-39","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#启动时发现不兼容参数","content":"移除不兼容项并启动","locale":"zh-CN"},"2106":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-40","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#启动时发现不兼容参数","content":"删除后端明确定位到的无效片段，保存清理后的完整参数并继续启动","locale":"zh-CN"},"2107":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-41","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#启动时发现不兼容参数","content":"仅本次忽略适合确认某个分支参数仍然有效的情况。如果启动仍然失败，应回到本页修正参数，而不是反复忽略同一警告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2108":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-42","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#启动时发现不兼容参数","content":"<Card title=\"实例启动与访问故障排查\" href=\"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start\" description=\"处理进程退出、端口冲突、没有地址和页面无法访问。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2109":{"id":"/docs/instance-launch-43","page_id":"/docs/instance-launch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-launch#启动时发现不兼容参数","content":"<Card title=\"WebUI 上游问题\" href=\"/docs/troubleshooting-webui\" description=\"处理模型、扩展、节点和生成阶段错误。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2110":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","type":"page","content":"实例维护","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-maintenance","locale":"zh-CN"},"2111":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance","content":"详细了解重命名、迁移、重装、仅删除记录和完整删除的文件影响。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2112":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#操作前准备","content":"操作前准备","locale":"zh-CN"},"2113":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#重命名","content":"重命名","locale":"zh-CN"},"2114":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#迁移实例","content":"迁移实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"2115":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#选择目标父目录","content":"选择目标父目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2116":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#阅读迁移预览","content":"阅读迁移预览","locale":"zh-CN"},"2117":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#开始并等待迁移","content":"开始并等待迁移","locale":"zh-CN"},"2118":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#验证迁移结果","content":"验证迁移结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"2119":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#重装实例","content":"重装实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"2120":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#删除实例或只删除记录","content":"删除实例或只删除记录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2121":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#失败和恢复","content":"失败和恢复","locale":"zh-CN"},"2122":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance","content":"“维护”页不依赖 WebUI 管理 API，可以在管理功能异常时继续打开。迁移、重装和删除属于实例生命周期操作：应用会先停止并确认相关运行资源，再执行文件或记录修改。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2123":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#操作前准备","content":"操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"2124":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#操作前准备","content":"对目录的影响","locale":"zh-CN"},"2125":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#操作前准备","content":"重命名","locale":"zh-CN"},"2126":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#操作前准备","content":"只更新显示名称","locale":"zh-CN"},"2127":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#操作前准备","content":"迁移实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"2128":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#操作前准备","content":"整体移动根目录，根目录外的组件留在原处","locale":"zh-CN"},"2129":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#操作前准备","content":"重装","locale":"zh-CN"},"2130":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#操作前准备","content":"尽量复用组件，强制重建会删除所选组件目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2131":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#操作前准备","content":"仅删除记录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2132":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#操作前准备","content":"保留全部目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2133":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-22","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#操作前准备","content":"删除实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"2134":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-23","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#操作前准备","content":"删除归实例所有的目录，包括配置在根目录外的自有组件；保留明确标记为外部的组件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2135":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-24","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#重命名","content":"重命名只改变 Hanafubuki 中显示的实例名称。实例 ID、身份、实例根目录和所有组件路径保持不变；提交相同名称不会产生新的配置修改。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2136":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-25","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#迁移实例","content":"迁移会移动完整实例根目录，而不是只修改路径设置。页面要求选择一个已经存在的目标父目录；后端会在其下追加当前实例目录名，并要求最终目录尚不存在。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2137":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-26","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#迁移实例","content":"实例根目录内的 Python、Core、模型和其他文件会随整个目录移动。位于根目录之外的组件留在原处。如果根目录本身是外部 Core，或其中包含标为外部的组件，迁移预览会拒绝移动该目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2138":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-27","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#选择目标父目录","content":"目标父目录必须存在，并且最终实例目录不能已存在。迁移不会合并或覆盖现有目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2139":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-28","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#阅读迁移预览","content":"应用会重新验证实例身份、配置、路径重叠和外部组件，并在确认窗口显示最终目录和警告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2140":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-29","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#开始并等待迁移","content":"确认后，应用依次停止 WebUI、管理服务、WebView 和实例终端，再移动文件并原子更新配置。跨磁盘迁移可能需要完整复制，因此时间取决于实例大小。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2141":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-30","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#验证迁移结果","content":"完成后重新打开实例，检查根目录和受管组件路径，再使用实例终端和一次实际启动验证环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2142":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-31","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#验证迁移结果","content":"迁移不会扫描和改写 `.pth`、脚本、环境变量或其他文件中的绝对路径。如果某个第三方组件记录了旧位置，需要在迁移后按该组件自己的方式修正。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2143":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-32","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#验证迁移结果","content":"出现“迁移需要恢复”时，实例会保持关闭以保护文件一致性。不要手动移动或删除源目录、目标目录或临时目录；选择原来的目标父目录并再次点击“迁移实例”继续恢复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2144":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-33","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#重装实例","content":"重装保留实例记录。页面会带入已保存的安装参数；允许编辑时，确认并开始重装会保存新参数，以后安装也沿用这些值。已有 Python 环境时，需启用“强制重建 Python”才能修改其环境参数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2145":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-34","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#重装实例","content":"就绪的扩展实例可以选择“重新安装”，不勾选重建组件会保留所有组件目录。支持更新的类型还提供独立的“更新”按钮，执行该类型的更新步骤。更新不删除组件目录。上次检查返回的版本、发布说明和各组件的状态会显示在维护页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2146":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-35","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#重装实例","content":"仅提供 `update-check` 的扩展类型由外部更新。重装此类实例的本地组件会保留上次检查的提示和组件明细，直到下一次检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2147":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-36","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#重装实例","content":"适合补齐缺失依赖或重新执行安装流程。现有 Python 和 Core\n会尽量复用，但安装器仍可能更新依赖或代码状态。Core\n位于实例根目录之外时，只要它仍是实例记录指向的同一个现有目录，普通重装也可以继续使用并更新它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2148":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-37","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#重装实例","content":"确认前核对开关旁显示的路径。强制重建会先永久删除所选的自有组件目录。配置在另一块磁盘上的自有\nCore 也可能被删除。明确标记为外部的组件，以及与实例根目录相同的\nCore，不能单独强制重建。安装器要求 Python 位于实例根目录内。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2149":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-38","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#删除实例或只删除记录","content":"只删除 Hanafubuki 中与当前实例身份绑定的记录，不检查、移动或删除任何文件。实例根目录、外部\nPython/Core 和其他配置路径全部保留，之后可以重新导入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2150":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-39","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#删除实例或只删除记录","content":"应用先删除确认窗口列出的目录，再移除记录。通常会删除整个实例根目录及其中的模型和输出，也会删除配置在其他位置、归该实例所有的组件。若根目录本身是标记为外部的\nCore，则保留根目录，只单独删除实例拥有的组件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2151":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-40","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#删除实例或只删除记录","content":"文件删除无法通过 Hanafubuki 撤销。若曾将 Core\n指向另一个磁盘上的现有项目，且希望保留它的文件，请使用“仅删除记录”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2152":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-41","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#失败和恢复","content":"维护操作在无法确认进程停止、文件状态或配置提交时，会保留原任务和恢复义务，而不是假装已经完成。此时：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2153":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-42","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#失败和恢复","content":"打开右下角失败项或任务中心查看准确阶段和错误；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2154":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-43","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#失败和恢复","content":"不要通过文件管理器手动完成剩余步骤；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2155":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-44","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#失败和恢复","content":"修复权限、磁盘或占用问题后，使用界面提供的同一操作重试；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2156":{"id":"/docs/instance-maintenance-45","page_id":"/docs/instance-maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-maintenance#失败和恢复","content":"实例仍被维护锁定时，不要创建同路径的新实例作为替代。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2157":{"id":"/docs/instance-management","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"page","content":"实例管理","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management","locale":"zh-CN"},"2158":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management","content":"了解实例管理入口、功能分区和任务状态，并找到对应的操作教程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2159":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"管理分区","locale":"zh-CN"},"2160":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management#完成一次管理操作","content":"完成一次管理操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"2161":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management#检查实例状态","content":"检查实例状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"2162":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management#打开对应分区","content":"打开对应分区","locale":"zh-CN"},"2163":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management#执行并跟踪任务","content":"执行并跟踪任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"2164":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management#验证结果","content":"验证结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"2165":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management#基础","content":"基础","locale":"zh-CN"},"2166":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management#运行","content":"运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2167":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management#资源","content":"资源","locale":"zh-CN"},"2168":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-management#维护","content":"维护","locale":"zh-CN"},"2169":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management","content":"实例管理用于查看和维护已经创建或导入的 WebUI。打开首页的实例管理器，选择一个实例后，右侧会显示管理导航和当前功能页面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2170":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management","content":"管理项由后端根据 WebUI 类型、安装状态和当前 API 能力决定。某个入口变灰时，将鼠标停留在入口上可以查看原因；实例尚未安装完成时，应先返回实例工作区完成安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2171":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"左侧列表按名称、类型 ID 或安装路径筛选实例，底部可以添加实例或扫描已有 WebUI。在实例列表中按上下方向键会切换右侧详情。在分区导航中用方向键选中图标，再按 `Enter` 打开。窄窗口只显示图标时，悬停或用键盘聚焦可看到名称；空间足够时可用导航底部的箭头保持展开或收起。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2172":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"扩展可以为自己的实例类型添加管理分区。类型未声明的功能不会列出。如果切换分区或实例时出现“离开前保存更改？”，选择“保存并离开”应用修改，选择“不保存并离开”放弃修改，按“取消”留在当前表单。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2173":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"分类","locale":"zh-CN"},"2174":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"主要内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"2175":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"基础","locale":"zh-CN"},"2176":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"实例信息、组件路径、版本、变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"2177":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2178":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"启动参数、终端、PyTorch","locale":"zh-CN"},"2179":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"资源","locale":"zh-CN"},"2180":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-22","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"扩展、模型、快照","locale":"zh-CN"},"2181":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-23","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"维护","locale":"zh-CN"},"2182":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-24","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#管理分区","content":"热补丁、诊断、迁移、重装与删除","locale":"zh-CN"},"2183":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-25","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#检查实例状态","content":"先打开“实例信息”，确认实例已经就绪。更新代码、重装环境或恢复快照前，建议先停止 WebUI，并等待已有任务结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2184":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-26","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#打开对应分区","content":"按管理导航选择功能。入口不可用通常表示当前 WebUI 不支持该功能、实例尚未就绪，或管理 API 没有提供所需能力。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2185":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-27","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#执行并跟踪任务","content":"保存配置等短操作显示在当前管理器右下角；安装、更新、恢复、迁移等长操作也会进入任务中心。切换分区不会取消后端任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2186":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-28","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#验证结果","content":"等待状态进入“已完成”后刷新当前分区，再到“实例信息”检查环境与运行状态。失败时先打开任务输出，不要连续启动相同操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2187":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-29","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#验证结果","content":"右下角状态区用于报告当前实例管理器发起的操作；任务中心保存跨页面任务、详细阶段和保留输出。状态仍为“运行中”时，关闭页面不等于任务结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2188":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-30","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#基础","content":"<Card title=\"实例信息\" href=\"/docs/instance-overview\" description=\"查看状态、服务、地址和最近错误。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2189":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-31","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#基础","content":"<Card title=\"组件路径\" href=\"/docs/instance-paths\" description=\"维护 Python 与 Core 目录引用。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2190":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-32","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#基础","content":"<Card title=\"版本\" href=\"/docs/instance-versions\" description=\"更新 WebUI 或切换分支、提交和版本。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2191":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-33","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#基础","content":"<Card title=\"WebUI 变体\" href=\"/docs/instance-variants\" description=\"切换预设仓库和分支。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2192":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-34","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#运行","content":"<Card title=\"启动配置\" href=\"/docs/instance-launch\" description=\"设置启动参数和环境变量。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2193":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-35","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#运行","content":"<Card title=\"实例终端\" href=\"/docs/instance-terminal\" description=\"在实例的受管环境中执行命令。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2194":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-36","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#运行","content":"<Card title=\"PyTorch\" href=\"/docs/instance-pytorch\" description=\"检查兼容性并重新安装设备构建。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2195":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-37","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#资源","content":"<Card title=\"扩展\" href=\"/docs/instance-extensions\" description=\"安装、更新、切换或卸载扩展。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2196":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-38","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#资源","content":"<Card title=\"模型\" href=\"/docs/instance-models\" description=\"导入、下载和整理模型资源。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2197":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-39","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#资源","content":"<Card title=\"快照\" href=\"/docs/instance-snapshots\" description=\"记录环境并预览、恢复状态。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2198":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-40","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#维护","content":"<Card title=\"热补丁\" href=\"/docs/instance-hotpatch\" description=\"保存补丁配置并查看运行日志。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2199":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-41","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#维护","content":"<Card title=\"实例诊断\" href=\"/docs/instance-diagnostics\" description=\"收集、检查并导出诊断包。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2200":{"id":"/docs/instance-management-42","page_id":"/docs/instance-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-management#维护","content":"<Card title=\"实例维护\" href=\"/docs/instance-maintenance\" description=\"重命名、迁移、重装或删除实例。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2201":{"id":"/docs/instance-models","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","type":"page","content":"模型管理","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-models","locale":"zh-CN"},"2202":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"使用文件浏览器、InvokeAI Registry 或内置模型库管理模型资源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2203":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-models#文件浏览器","content":"文件浏览器","locale":"zh-CN"},"2204":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-models#打开目标目录","content":"打开目标目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2205":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-models#选择条目","content":"选择条目","locale":"zh-CN"},"2206":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-models#执行文件操作","content":"执行文件操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"2207":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-models#导入并验证","content":"导入并验证","locale":"zh-CN"},"2208":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-models#invokeai-registry","content":"InvokeAI Registry","locale":"zh-CN"},"2209":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-models#内置模型库","content":"内置模型库","locale":"zh-CN"},"2210":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"模型页会按 WebUI 能力显示一种主要管理方式，并可能额外提供“内置模型库”：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2211":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"模式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2212":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"适用界面","locale":"zh-CN"},"2213":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"主要操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"2214":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"文件浏览器","locale":"zh-CN"},"2215":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"使用目录保存模型的 WebUI","locale":"zh-CN"},"2216":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"导入、下载、复制、移动、重命名和删除文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2217":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"InvokeAI Registry","locale":"zh-CN"},"2218":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"使用注册记录管理模型的 InvokeAI","locale":"zh-CN"},"2219":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"从 URL 安装、本地导入、取消注册或删除文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2220":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"内置模型库","locale":"zh-CN"},"2221":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"提供桌面模型目录的 WebUI","locale":"zh-CN"},"2222":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models","content":"搜索预设模型并安装到指定相对目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2223":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#打开目标目录","content":"双击文件夹进入目录，使用面包屑、后退、前进和上一级按钮导航。模型操作只针对后端提供的模型根目录及其子目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2224":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-22","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#选择条目","content":"单击选择一个条目；使用 `Ctrl`/`Cmd` 或 `Shift` 扩展选择。可以按名称、大小或修改时间调整排序。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2225":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-23","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#执行文件操作","content":"右键所选条目可复制、剪切或删除，单选时还可重命名。复制或剪切后，右键目标文件夹可直接粘贴到其中，也可进入目标目录后右键空白处粘贴。删除文件夹会连同内容一起删除。右键空白处还能新建文件夹、导入文件或目录、从 URL 下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2226":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-24","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#导入并验证","content":"也可以把桌面文件直接拖到列表中，导入到当前目录。等待任务完成后刷新列表，核对文件名、大小和目标位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2227":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-25","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#导入并验证","content":"列表获得焦点时，用方向键选择，按住 `Shift` 扩展选择，`Ctrl+A`（macOS 用 `Cmd+A`）全选，`Esc` 清空选择。`Enter` 打开单选的文件夹，`Delete` 打开删除确认。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2228":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-26","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#导入并验证","content":"工具栏的粘贴和下载按钮以当前目录为目标。从 URL 下载时，可以指定保存文件名，并在当前目录及其直接子目录中选择目标。右键某个文件夹发起下载时，窗口会预选该文件夹。复制、移动和导入大型模型可能耗时较长，可在任务中心跟踪进度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2229":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-27","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#invokeai-registry","content":"“从 URL 安装”让 InvokeAI 下载并注册模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2230":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-28","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#invokeai-registry","content":"“导入本地模型”或拖放会把本地文件交给 InvokeAI 注册流程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2231":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-29","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#invokeai-registry","content":"“取消注册”只删除 Registry 记录，模型文件保留在磁盘上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2232":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-30","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#invokeai-registry","content":"“删除”会同时移除 Registry 记录和对应文件，无法撤销。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2233":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-31","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#invokeai-registry","content":"如果只是不希望 InvokeAI 当前使用某个模型，但仍想保留文件，应选择“取消注册”。需要彻底释放空间时才选择删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2234":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-32","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#内置模型库","content":"模型库使用当前设置中的下载源和自动镜像策略。下载失败时检查镜像设置、网络与代理以及磁盘剩余空间。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2235":{"id":"/docs/instance-models-33","page_id":"/docs/instance-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-models#内置模型库","content":"文件浏览器中的删除和 InvokeAI\n的“删除模型和文件”都会修改真实磁盘内容。环境快照通常不包含模型文件，重要模型必须单独备份。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2236":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","type":"page","content":"实例信息与运行状态","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-overview","locale":"zh-CN"},"2237":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview","content":"查看实例身份、服务状态、启动阶段、WebUI 地址和最近错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2238":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"状态区域","locale":"zh-CN"},"2239":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-overview#打开实例目录和快捷路径","content":"打开实例目录和快捷路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"2240":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-overview#启动-webui","content":"启动 WebUI","locale":"zh-CN"},"2241":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-overview#检查就绪状态","content":"检查就绪状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"2242":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-overview#点击启动","content":"点击“启动”","locale":"zh-CN"},"2243":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-overview#处理启动决策","content":"处理启动决策","locale":"zh-CN"},"2244":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-overview#等待地址捕获","content":"等待地址捕获","locale":"zh-CN"},"2245":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-overview#停止和排查","content":"停止和排查","locale":"zh-CN"},"2246":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview","content":"“实例信息”是排查实例问题的起点。页面会自动刷新，并从后端读取实例身份、路径、环境、服务、热补丁运行状态、WebUI 地址和历史错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2247":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"区域","locale":"zh-CN"},"2248":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"主要用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"2249":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"身份信息","locale":"zh-CN"},"2250":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"确认实例名称、WebUI 类型、安装生命周期和运行状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"2251":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"2252":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"核对实例根目录、Core 和 Python 可执行文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2253":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"2254":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"查看 Python 版本和当前分支","locale":"zh-CN"},"2255":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"2256":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"查看管理 API、启动阶段、启动警告和浏览器连接状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"2257":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"热补丁运行时","locale":"zh-CN"},"2258":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"确认补丁运行时是否已随 WebUI 启动","locale":"zh-CN"},"2259":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-22","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"已捕获的 WebUI 地址","locale":"zh-CN"},"2260":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-23","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"查看应用实际捕获到的首选访问地址；有多个界面时为主界面的地址","locale":"zh-CN"},"2261":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-24","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"历史","locale":"zh-CN"},"2262":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-25","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"查看最近失败阶段、退出码和对应任务输出","locale":"zh-CN"},"2263":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-26","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#状态区域","content":"安装生命周期表示实例文件是否已经准备完成；运行状态表示 WebUI 进程当前是否启动。只有生命周期为“就绪”且 WebUI 未运行时，页面才允许开始新的启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2264":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-27","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#打开实例目录和快捷路径","content":"“路径”中每一行的文件夹按钮打开对应目录，可以直接进入实例根目录、Core 或其他组件。Python 可执行文件一行打开 Python 组件目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2265":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-28","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#打开实例目录和快捷路径","content":"若经常查看输出或共享模型目录，在“快捷路径”中点击“添加快捷路径…”，选好目录后点击卡片即可打开。拖动卡片图标可以排序，右键或打开卡片菜单可以重命名和删除。变更会自动保存，删除快捷路径会保留目标文件夹。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2266":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-29","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#检查就绪状态","content":"确认安装生命周期为“就绪”，该类型所需的组件目录存在，并且没有正在重装、恢复 PyTorch 或安装模型库的任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2267":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-30","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#点击启动","content":"启动任务会在任务中心打开。应用会检查环境、PyTorch、扩展冲突和启动参数；需要选择时会弹出启动决策窗口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2268":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-31","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#处理启动决策","content":"核对弹窗中的实例和冲突信息。按 `Esc` 等同于取消此次启动。每个按钮会改动什么，见启动决策。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2269":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-32","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#等待地址捕获","content":"内置 WebUI 会在启动时报告地址。对于扩展提供的实例类型，“服务”还可显示其他服务的名称、地址、可选标记和失败原因。声明了 WebUI 页面的服务就绪后，工作区即可打开该页面。有些类型只提供服务，不会显示地址捕获区。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2270":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-33","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#停止和排查","content":"点击“停止”后等待运行状态回到“未运行”，不要在停止过程中重复点击启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2271":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-34","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#停止和排查","content":"“查看启动任务”会打开本次启动的阶段和输出；历史错误中的“查看日志”会打开发生该错误的准确任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2272":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-35","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#停止和排查","content":"WebUI 已运行但没有地址时，检查启动输出中的监听地址、端口冲突和浏览器连接状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2273":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-36","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#停止和排查","content":"状态为“正在等待启动决策”时，应先处理当前决策，不要创建第二个启动任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2274":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-37","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#停止和排查","content":"进程进入运行状态后，WebUI\n仍可能正在加载模型或初始化服务。应以捕获到的地址和任务输出为准；只有进程存在但持续没有地址时，再按启动日志排查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2275":{"id":"/docs/instance-overview-38","page_id":"/docs/instance-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-overview#停止和排查","content":"需要修改运行参数时参阅启动配置；需要检查 Python 或 Git 时使用实例终端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2276":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","type":"page","content":"组件路径","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-paths","locale":"zh-CN"},"2277":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"理解实例根目录、Python 和 Core 的区别，并安全地修改组件引用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2278":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-paths#修改-python-或-core-路径","content":"修改 Python 或 Core 路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"2279":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-paths#停止相关操作","content":"停止相关操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"2280":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-paths#核对目标目录","content":"核对目标目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2281":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-paths#选择并应用","content":"选择并应用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2282":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-paths#处理过期提示","content":"处理过期提示","locale":"zh-CN"},"2283":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-paths#验证新环境","content":"验证新环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"2284":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-paths#应该使用哪个功能","content":"应该使用哪个功能","locale":"zh-CN"},"2285":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"每个实例有根目录和 Core。内置 WebUI 还有独立 Python，扩展提供的类型则按自身声明显示组件。组件可以位于实例根目录之外，完整删除时会检查每个组件的归属。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2286":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"2287":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"2288":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"“组件路径”页能否修改","locale":"zh-CN"},"2289":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"实例根目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2290":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"实例整体文件边界","locale":"zh-CN"},"2291":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"不能，需使用实例迁移","locale":"zh-CN"},"2292":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"Python 目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2293":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"独立 Python 与已安装软件包","locale":"zh-CN"},"2294":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"可以","locale":"zh-CN"},"2295":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"Core 目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2296":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"WebUI 代码、扩展和相关资源","locale":"zh-CN"},"2297":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"可以","locale":"zh-CN"},"2298":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths","content":"部分类型允许在“组件路径”中切换“由此实例安装”和“使用你已有的”。选择后者会将组件明确标记为外部，删除实例时会保留它。如果字段要求选择程序，请选择指定的可执行文件，应用会验证它并保存相应的组件目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2299":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-22","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#停止相关操作","content":"建议先停止 WebUI，并等待安装、版本、扩展、快照和模型任务结束。路径更新需要独占当前实例；应用也可能在更新前停止相关运行资源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2300":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-23","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#核对目标目录","content":"Python 目录必须是可用的独立 Python 环境；Core 目录必须符合当前 WebUI 类型。不要选择磁盘根目录、用户主目录或另一个实例正在使用的目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2301":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-24","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#选择并应用","content":"在“组件路径”中填写或选择新目录，确认所选类型列出的组件路径，再点击“应用”。后端会验证路径、实例重叠和组件类型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2302":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-25","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#处理过期提示","content":"如果页面提示实例配置已发生变化，点击“重新加载”，重新选择目录后再提交。不要用旧页面覆盖其他管理操作刚写入的配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2303":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-26","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#验证新环境","content":"返回“实例信息”检查 Python 版本和 Core 路径，再打开实例终端执行版本检查，最后重新启动 WebUI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2304":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-27","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#验证新环境","content":"应用只更新实例记录中的组件引用，不会把原目录复制或移动到新位置。需要搬迁整个实例时使用实例维护中的“迁移实例”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2305":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-28","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#应该使用哪个功能","content":"需求","locale":"zh-CN"},"2306":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-29","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#应该使用哪个功能","content":"正确操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"2307":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-30","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#应该使用哪个功能","content":"改为引用另一个现成 Python/Core","locale":"zh-CN"},"2308":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-31","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#应该使用哪个功能","content":"修改组件路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"2309":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-32","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#应该使用哪个功能","content":"把完整实例根目录搬到其他磁盘","locale":"zh-CN"},"2310":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-33","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#应该使用哪个功能","content":"迁移实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"2311":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-34","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#应该使用哪个功能","content":"修复缺失或损坏的 Python/Core","locale":"zh-CN"},"2312":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-35","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#应该使用哪个功能","content":"重装实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"2313":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-36","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#应该使用哪个功能","content":"只想恢复原来有效的目录引用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2314":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-37","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#应该使用哪个功能","content":"将组件路径改回原目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2315":{"id":"/docs/instance-paths-38","page_id":"/docs/instance-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-paths#应该使用哪个功能","content":"迁移会保留根目录外的组件位置。完整删除还会移除根目录外归实例所有的组件，强制重建也可能删除这样的 Core。若需要保留现有目录中的全部文件，移除实例时选择“仅删除记录”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2316":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","type":"page","content":"PyTorch 管理","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-pytorch","locale":"zh-CN"},"2317":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch","content":"检查当前 PyTorch 与设备的兼容性，并按自动或手动方案重新安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2318":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"理解检查结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"2319":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#重新安装-pytorch","content":"重新安装 PyTorch","locale":"zh-CN"},"2320":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#停止-webui","content":"停止 WebUI","locale":"zh-CN"},"2321":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#选择版本方式","content":"选择版本方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2322":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#决定是否强制重装","content":"决定是否强制重装","locale":"zh-CN"},"2323":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#确认并等待任务","content":"确认并等待任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"2324":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#验证结果","content":"验证结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"2325":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#失败处理","content":"失败处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"2326":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch","content":"“PyTorch”页会检查实例 Python 中的 Torch 组件、检测到的设备类型，并列出当前 WebUI 支持的安装组合。不同 WebUI、操作系统和硬件看到的选项可能不同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2327":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"2328":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"2329":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"兼容","locale":"zh-CN"},"2330":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"当前构建符合检测到的设备和 WebUI 规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"2331":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"不兼容","locale":"zh-CN"},"2332":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"已安装构建与设备或支持组合不匹配","locale":"zh-CN"},"2333":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"未安装","locale":"zh-CN"},"2334":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"实例环境中没有检测到所需 PyTorch 软件包","locale":"zh-CN"},"2335":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"无法检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"2336":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"Python、管理 API 或环境查询失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"2337":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#理解检查结果","content":"页面还会显示 Torch、TorchVision、TorchAudio、xFormers 等已检测版本，以及推荐设备构建。版本名称以页面当前目录为准，不要从其他 WebUI 的教程直接复制安装命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2338":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#停止-webui","content":"PyTorch 重装会修改正在使用的 Python 环境，因此需要先停止 WebUI。管理 API 会由应用协调，不需要手动结束它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2339":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-22","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#选择版本方式","content":"“自动选择”可用时，可让安装任务按硬件决定组合。若此项变灰，页面会切到“手动选择”。可输入构建名称或按设备筛选，再选择受支持的组合；“推荐”标记对应当前环境，标为不支持的构建无法选中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2340":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-23","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#决定是否强制重装","content":"当前状态已经兼容时，通常不勾选“即使当前版本正确也重新安装”。只有文件损坏、依赖异常或需要重新部署同一构建时才启用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2341":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-24","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#确认并等待任务","content":"点击“重新安装 PyTorch”，确认后在右下角状态区或任务中心查看依赖下载、安装和环境检查输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2342":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-25","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#验证结果","content":"展开“上次重新安装”，核对所选构建、执行状态和退出码。应用会重新启动实例 API，有重启后的兼容性结果或错误时也会列在这里。刷新本页确认已安装构建，再启动 WebUI 验证运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2343":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-26","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#失败处理","content":"自动选择失败时，先检查显卡驱动、操作系统支持和页面报告的检测设备，不要随意尝试多个 CUDA/ROCm 构建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2344":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-27","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#失败处理","content":"下载或解析软件包失败时，检查网络与代理和镜像。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2345":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-28","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#失败处理","content":"安装后仍不兼容时，打开最近任务输出，记录选择的构建、退出码和环境检查结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2346":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-29","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#失败处理","content":"启动时出现 PyTorch 决策窗口，可以取消并回到本页修复；“忽略并启动”只用于你能接受本次运行风险的情况。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2347":{"id":"/docs/instance-pytorch-30","page_id":"/docs/instance-pytorch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-pytorch#失败处理","content":"该操作会修改当前实例 Python 中的 PyTorch 及配套软件包。不要同时在实例终端手动安装\nTorch，也不要在任务完成前启动 WebUI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2348":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","type":"page","content":"快照管理","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-snapshots","locale":"zh-CN"},"2349":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots","content":"创建环境快照，预览恢复影响，并安全地恢复或删除快照。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2350":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#创建和查看快照","content":"创建和查看快照","locale":"zh-CN"},"2351":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"恢复选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"2352":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#预览并恢复","content":"预览并恢复","locale":"zh-CN"},"2353":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#做好恢复准备","content":"做好恢复准备","locale":"zh-CN"},"2354":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#打开恢复窗口","content":"打开恢复窗口","locale":"zh-CN"},"2355":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#阅读阻塞项","content":"阅读阻塞项","locale":"zh-CN"},"2356":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#核对计划变更","content":"核对计划变更","locale":"zh-CN"},"2357":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#确认恢复","content":"确认恢复","locale":"zh-CN"},"2358":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#完成后验证","content":"完成后验证","locale":"zh-CN"},"2359":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots","content":"快照记录 WebUI 类型、Core 提交、Python 软件包和扩展状态，用于在版本、依赖或扩展修改后恢复环境。创建快照时默认包含软件包信息。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2360":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots","content":"启用“每日创建实例快照”后，应用每天为已就绪的内置 WebUI 创建快照。扩展提供的实例类型不参加自动快照。同一天也启用了更新检查时，应用先为该实例创建快照，再检查更新。参见自动化。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2361":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots","content":"快照通常不包含模型、输出图片、任意用户文件或未提交代码的完整副本。执行高风险操作前，仍需单独备份这些内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2362":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#创建和查看快照","content":"格式错误的快照会显示解析错误，不能直接恢复。删除快照只会永久删除对应的快照文件，不会修改当前环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2363":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"2364":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"关闭时","locale":"zh-CN"},"2365":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"开启时","locale":"zh-CN"},"2366":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"清理额外软件包","locale":"zh-CN"},"2367":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"恢复记录的软件包，保留快照之后新增的软件包","locale":"zh-CN"},"2368":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"卸载快照中没有记录的软件包","locale":"zh-CN"},"2369":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"清理额外扩展","locale":"zh-CN"},"2370":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"恢复记录的扩展，保留快照之后新增的扩展","locale":"zh-CN"},"2371":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-22","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"删除快照中没有记录的扩展","locale":"zh-CN"},"2372":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-23","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"强制 Git 重置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2373":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-24","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"未提交修改可能成为恢复阻塞项","locale":"zh-CN"},"2374":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-25","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"丢弃 WebUI 和扩展仓库的未提交修改后切换到记录提交","locale":"zh-CN"},"2375":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-26","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#恢复选项","content":"某些快照会把选项标记为“必需”；不启用必需选项时，恢复不能开始。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2376":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-27","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#做好恢复准备","content":"建议停止 WebUI，等待版本、扩展、模型和 PyTorch 等管理任务结束，并备份未提交代码与重要文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2377":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-28","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#打开恢复窗口","content":"点击目标快照的“恢复”。选择清理和 Git 重置选项后，应用会自动生成与当前实例状态绑定的恢复预览。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2378":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-29","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#阅读阻塞项","content":"类型不匹配、Core 缺失、仓库存在未提交修改或其他无法解析的问题会阻止恢复。按提示处理或启用所需选项，然后等待预览自动重新分析。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2379":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-30","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#核对计划变更","content":"先看列表顶部的阻塞原因和警告，再核对仓库、Python 软件包和扩展的变化。跳过和无变化的项目默认收起，点击“显示 … 项无变化”可展开。预览生成失败时，可在同一个窗口点“重新分析”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2380":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-31","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#确认恢复","content":"只有当前预览可恢复时才能提交。任务接受后恢复窗口会关闭，后续阶段和输出在右下角状态区及任务中心查看。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2381":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-32","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#完成后验证","content":"刷新版本、扩展和 PyTorch 页面，再启动 WebUI。模型和用户文件需要按独立备份自行核对。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2382":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-33","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#完成后验证","content":"预览会绑定快照、恢复选项、管理 API 状态和实例配置。预览完成后如果修改了路径、启动配置或其他实例设置，旧预览会失效；关闭窗口并重新生成，不要尝试重复提交。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2383":{"id":"/docs/instance-snapshots-34","page_id":"/docs/instance-snapshots","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-snapshots#完成后验证","content":"“清理额外软件包”“清理额外扩展”和“强制 Git\n重置”都可能移除当前环境中快照没有保留的内容。只有在预览列表与独立备份都确认无误后再恢复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2384":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","type":"page","content":"实例终端","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-terminal","locale":"zh-CN"},"2385":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal","content":"在当前实例的 Python、Git 和受管环境中执行检查或维护命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2386":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-terminal#打开并检查环境","content":"打开并检查环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"2387":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"会话操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"2388":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-terminal#安全使用终端","content":"安全使用终端","locale":"zh-CN"},"2389":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal","content":"实例终端使用当前实例的环境。内置 WebUI 通常从 Core 目录打开，并使用实例的 Python 和受管 Git。扩展提供的实例类型使用该类型配置的工具，可能没有 Python。普通应用终端不自动绑定实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2390":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#打开并检查环境","content":"进入“运行 → 终端”时，应用会创建或重新订阅当前实例的终端会话，并恢复保留的输出。状态变为“运行中”后即可输入命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2391":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#打开并检查环境","content":"可以把系统文件管理器中的文件或文件夹拖入运行中的终端。应用按当前 Shell 的规则插入路径并处理空格，按下 `Enter` 才会执行命令。焦点在终端内时，`Tab` 和 `Esc` 也会传给终端程序；用 `Ctrl+Shift+Tab` 可将焦点移回应用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2392":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#打开并检查环境","content":"如果终端已打开但提示未注入受管环境变量，先核对当前缓存路径和所需的环境设置，再运行依赖这些设置的命令。使用 Python 的实例可先做以下只读检查：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2393":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#打开并检查环境","content":"还可以在 Core 仓库中使用 `git status` 检查未提交修改。路径显示方式和切换目录命令取决于 Windows、macOS 或 Linux 当前使用的 Shell。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2394":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"2395":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2396":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"离开分区","locale":"zh-CN"},"2397":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"取消当前界面订阅，但不应当被当作已结束进程","locale":"zh-CN"},"2398":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"重启终端","locale":"zh-CN"},"2399":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"结束当前 PTY，并为同一实例创建新的终端会话","locale":"zh-CN"},"2400":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"关闭终端","locale":"zh-CN"},"2401":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"确认终止并释放当前终端进程","locale":"zh-CN"},"2402":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"重新进入","locale":"zh-CN"},"2403":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"订阅已有会话，恢复保留输出并继续接收新输出","locale":"zh-CN"},"2404":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#会话操作","content":"终端状态为“已退出”时可以重启；状态为“关闭失败”时，后端仍保留原会话的清理义务，应再次使用“关闭终端进程”，不要连续创建替代会话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2405":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#安全使用终端","content":"执行安装、删除、移动或 Git 命令前，先确认当前目录和目标路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2406":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#安全使用终端","content":"不要在 WebUI、版本更新、快照恢复或重装任务修改同一环境时手动安装软件包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2407":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-22","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#安全使用终端","content":"优先使用 `python -m <模块>`，确保调用的是当前实例 Python 对应的模块。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2408":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-23","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#安全使用终端","content":"终端中的手动修改不会自动形成快照，也不保证能被 Hanafubuki 撤销。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2409":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-24","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#安全使用终端","content":"需要修改受支持的扩展、模型、版本或 PyTorch 时，优先使用对应管理页面，以便获得任务状态和错误输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2410":{"id":"/docs/instance-terminal-25","page_id":"/docs/instance-terminal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-terminal#安全使用终端","content":"实例终端不是模拟环境。删除目录、重置 Git\n或重装软件包会直接改变实例；重要操作前先创建快照，并单独备份模型、输出和自定义代码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2411":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","type":"page","content":"WebUI 变体","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-variants","locale":"zh-CN"},"2412":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants","content":"在支持的实例中切换预设仓库和分支，并同步重装配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2413":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-variants#切换变体","content":"切换变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"2414":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-variants#备份当前状态","content":"备份当前状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"2415":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-variants#停止-webui","content":"停止 WebUI","locale":"zh-CN"},"2416":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-variants#核对目标来源","content":"核对目标来源","locale":"zh-CN"},"2417":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-variants#点击切换并确认","content":"点击“切换”并确认","locale":"zh-CN"},"2418":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-variants#验证变体","content":"验证变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"2419":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-variants#只同步重装配置","content":"同步当前变体的重装配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2420":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants","content":"WebUI 变体是一组由当前 WebUI 提供的仓库、分支和子模块设置。它与普通“切换分支”不同：切换变体可能替换 Git 远程地址，并决定以后重装 Core 时使用哪个来源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2421":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants","content":"只有 Stable Diffusion WebUI、Fooocus 和 SD Trainer 提供变体；各类型可选的仓库和分支见支持的变体。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2422":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants","content":"页面会分别标记：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2423":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants","content":"“当前”：Core 仓库现在实际对应的变体；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2424":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants","content":"“重新安装”：实例记录中保存、以后重装时使用的变体。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2425":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants","content":"两者不一致时，页面会提示同步重装设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2426":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants#备份当前状态","content":"创建快照，并单独备份未提交代码、扩展配置和重要用户文件。变体切换可能强制切换工作树。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2427":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants#停止-webui","content":"变体切换要求 WebUI 已停止。等待“实例信息”中的运行状态回到“未运行”后再继续。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2428":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants#核对目标来源","content":"查看变体名称、仓库地址、分支和是否包含子模块。不要仅凭名称判断它是否与当前扩展或模型工作流兼容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2429":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants#点击切换并确认","content":"确认窗口会再次显示仓库和分支。接受后，应用会启动版本切换任务，并在成功后保存该变体作为重装配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2430":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants#验证变体","content":"刷新页面，确认“当前”和“重新安装”指向目标变体，再到版本页检查分支和提交，最后启动 WebUI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2431":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants#只同步重装配置","content":"如果你已经通过其他方式切换了 Core，而“当前”和“重新安装”指向不同的变体，可在当前变体上点“同步重新安装设置”。先保存未提交的修改并停止 WebUI。确认同步后，应用会从所示仓库再次检出目标分支，强制工作树回到该分支，未提交的修改可能丢失。任务成功后才会保存供以后重装使用的变体。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2432":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants#只同步重装配置","content":"变体切换可能更换远程仓库并强制切换到目标分支。界面确认不能替代备份；需要保留的改动应先提交到自己的仓库或导出补丁。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2433":{"id":"/docs/instance-variants-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-variants","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-variants#只同步重装配置","content":"只需要在同一仓库内更新或定位提交时，应使用WebUI 版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2434":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","type":"page","content":"WebUI 版本","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","实例管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-versions","locale":"zh-CN"},"2435":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-0","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions","content":"更新 WebUI，或在支持的实例中切换分支、提交和软件包版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2436":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-1","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-versions#git-型-webui","content":"Git 型 WebUI","locale":"zh-CN"},"2437":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-2","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-versions#创建快照和代码备份","content":"创建快照和代码备份","locale":"zh-CN"},"2438":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-3","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-versions#停止-webui","content":"停止 WebUI","locale":"zh-CN"},"2439":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-4","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-versions#选择操作","content":"选择操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"2440":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-5","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-versions#确认本地修改提示","content":"确认本地修改提示","locale":"zh-CN"},"2441":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-6","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-versions#跟踪并验证","content":"跟踪并验证","locale":"zh-CN"},"2442":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-7","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/instance-versions#invokeai-软件包版本","content":"InvokeAI 软件包版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"2443":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-8","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions","content":"“版本”页会根据 WebUI 类型显示不同界面。Stable Diffusion WebUI、ComfyUI、Fooocus、SD Trainer、Qwen TTS WebUI、RVC Next WebUI 和 Mizuoto TTS WebUI 等 Git 型实例显示仓库分支与提交；InvokeAI 显示已经安装和可以安装的软件包版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2444":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-9","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#git-型-webui","content":"页面会显示当前分支、提交、提交日期，以及相对远程分支领先或落后的数量。更新提示还可能汇总扩展和 PyTorch 的可用更新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2445":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-10","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#git-型-webui","content":"启用每日检查实例更新后，应用会检查已就绪的内置 WebUI。要立即检查某个实例，点击实例卡片上的刷新按钮。如果某个扩展类型也提供 Git 版本管理，可在这里切换分支或提交；该类型自身的更新从维护执行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2446":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-11","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#创建快照和代码备份","content":"先创建环境快照。自己修改过 Core 文件时，还应复制补丁、提交到个人分支或单独备份，因为快照恢复和某些切换会重置 Git 工作区。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2447":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-12","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#停止-webui","content":"普通版本操作不一定强制停止运行进程，但停止后再修改代码更容易保证下一次启动使用同一套文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2448":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-13","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#选择操作","content":"用“更新当前分支”获取并更新当前分支，或在提交列表选择一个具体提交。“切换分支”会先列出本地已有的引用，再获取远程分支。远程读取失败时仍可使用已列出的分支，或点击重新加载；选中另一分支后需确认再切换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2449":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-14","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#确认本地修改提示","content":"仓库存在未提交修改时，界面会要求确认。继续不代表这些修改一定能保留；如果无法接受丢失或冲突，应取消并先备份。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2450":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-15","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#跟踪并验证","content":"在右下角状态区或任务中心等待任务完成，刷新版本页确认新的分支和提交，再启动 WebUI 检查扩展与依赖兼容性。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2451":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-16","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#invokeai-软件包版本","content":"InvokeAI 的版本页显示当前版本、最新稳定版本、可用版本和预发布标记。选择具体版本会安装该版本；“升级”用于升级到当前规则下的目标版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2452":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-17","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#invokeai-软件包版本","content":"不需要测试新功能时优先选择最新稳定版本，不要选择带“预发布”标记的版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2453":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-18","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#invokeai-软件包版本","content":"软件包安装会修改实例 Python 环境，应先停止 WebUI，并在任务完成后检查 PyTorch 与启动状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2454":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-19","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#invokeai-软件包版本","content":"列表为空或刷新失败时，检查网络、PyPI 镜像和实例管理 API。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2455":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-20","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#invokeai-软件包版本","content":"Git\n操作只管理代码仓库，不能保护模型、输出、配置或未提交代码。执行切换前应同时准备环境快照和独立文件备份。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2456":{"id":"/docs/instance-versions-21","page_id":"/docs/instance-versions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/instance-versions#invokeai-软件包版本","content":"需要更换预设仓库和分支组合时，参阅WebUI 变体。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2457":{"id":"/docs/quick-start","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"page","content":"快速开始","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","开始"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start","locale":"zh-CN"},"2458":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-0","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start","content":"用最短流程创建并启动第一个 WebUI 实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2459":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-1","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#等待运行环境就绪","content":"等待运行环境就绪","locale":"zh-CN"},"2460":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-2","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#添加实例","content":"添加实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"2461":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-3","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#完成安装","content":"完成安装","locale":"zh-CN"},"2462":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-4","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#启动-webui","content":"启动 WebUI","locale":"zh-CN"},"2463":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-5","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#管理实例","content":"管理实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"2464":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-6","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#等待运行环境就绪","content":"首次启动时等待 Python、Micromamba 和 Git 准备完成。若顶部或首页出现运行环境错误，先前往“设置 → 运行环境”处理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2465":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-7","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#添加实例","content":"在首页选择“添加实例”。新用户通常选择“全新安装”；已有 WebUI 时选择“导入现有实例”或“扫描系统”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2466":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-8","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#完成安装","content":"选择 WebUI 类型和安装目录。保留默认 Python、PyTorch 与分支设置即可开始。安装进度会占据实例工作区，并提供任务输出、取消和失败重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2467":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-9","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#启动-webui","content":"安装完成后保持工作区打开，所需服务就绪时会自动启动 WebUI。以后打开已就绪实例的工作区也会自动启动。如果出现 PyTorch 或依赖冲突提示，按页面提示选择后继续。捕获到地址后即可打开 WebUI。要调整参数，进入“运行 → 启动”。多个 WebUI 之间可从标题栏的 WebUI 标签页切换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2468":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-10","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#管理实例","content":"从实例管理页维护版本、扩展、模型、快照和路径。长任务统一显示在右下角状态区，也可从标题栏打开任务中心查看输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2469":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-11","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#管理实例","content":"<Card title=\"安装方式\" href=\"/docs/webui-install\" description=\"比较全新安装、导入、扫描和快照恢复。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2470":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-12","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#管理实例","content":"<Card title=\"实例管理\" href=\"/docs/instance-management\" description=\"了解实例页面中的全部管理分区。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2471":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","type":"page","content":"关于与更新","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-about-updates","locale":"zh-CN"},"2472":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates","content":"查看应用版本、项目链接并检查更新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2473":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"检查更新","locale":"zh-CN"},"2474":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#安装签名更新","content":"安装签名更新","locale":"zh-CN"},"2475":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#便携版更新","content":"便携版更新","locale":"zh-CN"},"2476":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates","content":"“关于”页显示当前 Hanafubuki 版本，并提供项目仓库、作者和相关 WebUI 文档链接。外部链接会使用系统浏览器打开，不会替换应用窗口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2477":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"非便携模式会在后台大约每小时检查一次更新，可在自动化中关闭“自动检查应用更新”。无论是否开启，都可以在“关于”页点击“检查更新”立即检查。进度和结果显示在设置窗口右下角。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2478":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"更新可能出现三种结果：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2479":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"2480":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"后续操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"2481":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"签名更新可用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2482":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"应用已经下载并验证适用于当前安装类型的更新，可确认安装并重启","locale":"zh-CN"},"2483":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"手动安装包可用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2484":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"自动更新不可用或验证失败，选择当前平台的安装包并在浏览器下载","locale":"zh-CN"},"2485":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"已是最新或不可用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2486":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"无需操作，或根据错误检查网络、代理和更新来源","locale":"zh-CN"},"2487":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#检查更新","content":"Windows 的 NSIS 安装版、Linux 的 AppImage 和 macOS 的应用包支持签名更新。其他安装格式使用手动安装包列表。列表按当前平台筛选并标记推荐项，点击下载会在系统浏览器中打开发行地址。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2488":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-16","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#安装签名更新","content":"签名更新准备好后，主窗口也会显示“重启并立即更新”。如果继续工作并正常退出，应用会将更新留到下次启动，届时会重新检查并安装当前可用的签名更新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2489":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-17","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#安装签名更新","content":"如果自动安装失败，应用会尝试提供手动安装包。此时先完全退出应用，再按当前平台正常安装；不要同时运行旧程序和安装器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2490":{"id":"/docs/settings-about-updates-18","page_id":"/docs/settings-about-updates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-about-updates#便携版更新","content":"便携版由 Launcher 负责更新。完成当前任务并退出主应用后，从原目录重新打开 Launcher，保留旁边的 `.hanafubuki-launcher` 工作目录。Launcher 会检查自身和主应用的版本，按需下载或修复程序，再启动主应用。若发布服务不可用，Launcher 会尝试启动本地已有的程序。目录布局见安装指南。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2491":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","type":"page","content":"Agent 设置","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-agent","locale":"zh-CN"},"2492":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent","content":"配置模型、权限、记忆、网络工具、MCP 和 Skills。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2493":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-agent#推荐配置顺序","content":"推荐配置顺序","locale":"zh-CN"},"2494":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-agent#添加提供商并选择模型","content":"添加提供商并选择模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"2495":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-agent#选择权限模式","content":"选择权限模式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2496":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-agent#决定是否使用记忆","content":"决定是否使用记忆","locale":"zh-CN"},"2497":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-agent#配置内置网络工具","content":"配置内置网络工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"2498":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-agent#按需添加-mcp-和-skills","content":"按需添加 MCP 和 Skills","locale":"zh-CN"},"2499":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-agent#agent-插件和钩子","content":"Agent 插件和钩子","locale":"zh-CN"},"2500":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-agent#会话角色","content":"会话角色","locale":"zh-CN"},"2501":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-agent#保存与生效范围","content":"保存与生效范围","locale":"zh-CN"},"2502":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-agent#继续阅读","content":"继续阅读","locale":"zh-CN"},"2503":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent","content":"打开“设置 → Agent”，或在聊天中输入 `/config`。选择顶部分类后，点击条目进入详情。模型分类中可以管理提供商和默认模型，插件分类中可以查看扩展包请求的权限，独立的“技能”标签页可用于创建、编辑或安装 Skill。要开始对话，需要启用至少一个提供商并选好模型；也可以为单个会话另选模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2504":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent","content":"应用的代理、日志级别、外观、模块启停和桌面工作区仍由应用自己的设置管理。独立 Agent 的终端界面和配置分层选项不属于桌面宿主的配置目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2505":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#添加提供商并选择模型","content":"添加与服务端协议一致的 Provider，填写 API 地址和凭据并保存。启用 Provider 后，在独立的模型策略中选择默认 Provider 和模型，再配置推理强度、上下文窗口、图片输入和压缩策略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2506":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#选择权限模式","content":"全局设置分别控制工具审批方式和命令沙箱。在聊天中打开输入框旁的权限菜单，或输入 `/permissions`，可查看两者并为当前会话选择预设。“只读”禁止命令写入文件，“完全开放”关闭命令沙箱并放行常规审批。Windows 上若需要初始化沙箱，菜单会提供入口，也可输入 `/setup-default-sandbox` 打开设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2507":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#决定是否使用记忆","content":"跨会话记忆默认关闭。打开总开关后，读取已有记忆和从会话生成记忆默认都已开启，可以分别调整。“排除外部上下文”默认关闭；开启后，使用过网页或 MCP 工具输出的会话将不再贡献记忆。重置会清除已有记忆。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2508":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-16","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#配置内置网络工具","content":"在网络工具设置中选择搜索策略，再在插件选项中配置搜索引擎、服务端地址与密钥、研究模式及抓取回退。重排与嵌入共用上游提供的端点和密钥设置。字段由插件注册的配置定义提供，生效时间以字段旁的说明为准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2509":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-17","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#按需添加-mcp-和-skills","content":"只连接可信 MCP 服务器并为工具设置最小权限；安装 Skill 前检查其说明、脚本和资源。完成后创建测试会话验证实际能力。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2510":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-18","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#agent-插件和钩子","content":"在“插件 → 已安装插件”中，或从聊天输入 `/plugins`，可以用本地目录或 `插件名@市场名` 安装插件。使用市场时先在“插件市场”添加来源。打开已安装条目可启用、停用、更新或重试加载。“删除”卸载后保留插件数据，“清除”同时删除数据。“插件默认值”适用于没有单独启停设置的包；已停用市场中的插件也会停用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2511":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-19","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#agent-插件和钩子","content":"进程插件若提示等待权限，打开“插件 → 扩展包权限”，核对该包请求的网络访问、工作区读写范围及环境变量名称，再点“授予这些权限”确认整组请求。若提示钩子待信任，可从插件条目信任其钩子，或用 `/hooks` 查看各钩子的事件、命令和超时，再单独启用或信任。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2512":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-20","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#会话角色","content":"“模型 → 角色”列出可用角色及配置问题。可创建角色，指定继承的角色、要追加或替换的指令、模型、可用工具和权限上限；“可派生”控制其他代理能否按此角色启动。会话空闲时，输入 `/role` 选择当前会话使用的角色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2513":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-21","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#会话角色","content":"若角色来自只读来源，先在角色条目选择“复制为用户角色”再修改。需要编辑用户角色文件时，进入“模型 → 角色源文件”，可查看来源路径或新建自己的文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2514":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-22","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#保存与生效范围","content":"可用 `/warnings` 查看配置警告。每个设置分组和集合记录有各自的保存操作，不要在未保存时直接关闭窗口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2515":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-23","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#保存与生效范围","content":"字段会展示生效来源、生效时间和配置问题；恢复默认移除用户覆盖值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2516":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-24","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#保存与生效范围","content":"已保存的密钥默认遮盖，可用字段旁的按钮查看。只修改其他字段时，应用会保留原密钥。保存失败时，当前修改仍留在页面上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2517":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-25","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#保存与生效范围","content":"MCP 服务器、MCP 凭据和 Skills 使用各自的管理操作，不属于普通“恢复默认”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2518":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-26","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#保存与生效范围","content":"会话保留自己的模型选择。下一轮读取最新可用的 Skill，每个模型采样步骤使用开始时的工具清单。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2519":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-27","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#保存与生效范围","content":"提供商 Token、自定义认证头和 MCP\n凭据属于敏感信息。不要写入提示词、项目文件或截图。诊断会排除已知凭据文档，但诊断包不会对其他收集内容逐项脱敏，分享前仍须检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2520":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-28","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"Agent 快速开始\" href=\"/docs/agent\" description=\"完成第一次配置和会话。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2521":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-29","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"提供商与模型\" href=\"/docs/agent-providers-models\" description=\"理解协议、模型能力和上下文。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2522":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-30","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"会话管理\" href=\"/docs/agent-conversations\" description=\"管理历史、归档、删除和分叉。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2523":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-31","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"权限与审批\" href=\"/docs/agent-permissions\" description=\"选择权限模式并核对操作目标。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2524":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-32","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"MCP\" href=\"/docs/agent-mcp\" description=\"配置外部服务器、连接和工具策略。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2525":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-33","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"Skills\" href=\"/docs/agent-skills\" description=\"安装并为会话选择可复用流程。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2526":{"id":"/docs/settings-agent-34","page_id":"/docs/settings-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-agent#继续阅读","content":"<Card title=\"记忆\" href=\"/docs/agent-memory\" description=\"管理读取、生成、贡献和重置。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2527":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","type":"page","content":"API 服务器","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-api-servers","locale":"zh-CN"},"2528":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-api-servers","content":"查看应用和各实例的 API 服务器状态、健康检查与自动重启，并手动启动、重启或停止。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2529":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-api-servers#服务器列表","content":"服务器列表","locale":"zh-CN"},"2530":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-api-servers#状态与信息","content":"状态与信息","locale":"zh-CN"},"2531":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-api-servers#健康检查与自动重启","content":"健康检查与自动重启","locale":"zh-CN"},"2532":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-api-servers#手动操作","content":"手动操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"2533":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-api-servers#管理-mcp-服务器","content":"管理 MCP 服务器","locale":"zh-CN"},"2534":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-api-servers#排查建议","content":"排查建议","locale":"zh-CN"},"2535":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-api-servers","content":"应用和内置实例通过后台 API 服务器执行安装、版本切换、插件与模型管理等操作。任务长时间无响应时，可以在这里查看服务状态并进行健康检查。页面下方还有管理 MCP 服务器的连接设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2536":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-api-servers#服务器列表","content":"列表第一项是“应用”的服务器，后面是服务监管器已知的实例服务器。实例的控制服务器显示实例名称；如果其类型还声明了其他服务器，同一实例可以有多行，以“实例名 · 角色名”区分。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2537":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-api-servers#服务器列表","content":"服务器","locale":"zh-CN"},"2538":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-api-servers#服务器列表","content":"何时运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2539":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-api-servers#服务器列表","content":"应用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2540":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-api-servers#服务器列表","content":"应用运行期间保持运行，不会因空闲而停止","locale":"zh-CN"},"2541":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-api-servers#服务器列表","content":"实例控制服务器","locale":"zh-CN"},"2542":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-api-servers#服务器列表","content":"实例的操作需要时自动启动；使用中保持运行，空闲约 3 分钟后自动停止，之后按需重启","locale":"zh-CN"},"2543":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","tags":[