/docs/settings-api-servers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-api-servers#手动操作","content":"停止服务器","locale":"zh-CN"},"2606":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers-78","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-api-servers#手动操作","content":"点击“重启”时如果服务器仍有工作，会显示“等待重启”标签，并在当前工作完成后自动重启。等待期间，新的后台任务会被拒绝，需要在重启完成后重试；已经在进行的工作不受影响。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2607":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers-79","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-api-servers#手动操作","content":"服务器有进行中的工作时，“立即重启”和“停止”会先请求确认。被中断的任务无法继续，需要在重启后重新执行。没有明确原因时，优先使用“重启”，让它在工作完成后进行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2608":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers-80","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-api-servers#管理-mcp-服务器","content":"在 API 服务器下方，**管理 MCP 服务器** 卡片显示应用的 MCP 服务器是否在运行及其地址，**外部 MCP 客户端** 卡片则用于让其他 AI 工具连接到它。详见 MCP 服务器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2609":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers-81","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-api-servers#排查建议","content":"<Card title=\"应用与运行环境\" href=\"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime\" description=\"排查应用启动、Python、Micromamba 和 Git 问题。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2610":{"id":"/docs/settings-api-servers-82","page_id":"/docs/settings-api-servers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-api-servers#排查建议","content":"<Card title=\"日志、诊断与求助\" href=\"/docs/troubleshooting-reporting\" description=\"提取核心错误并准备可供维护者分析的材料。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2611":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","type":"page","content":"外观","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-appearance","locale":"zh-CN"},"2612":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance","content":"配置主题、主题色、壁纸和背景显示效果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2613":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-appearance#主题与主题色","content":"主题与主题色","locale":"zh-CN"},"2614":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-appearance#添加和选择壁纸","content":"添加和选择壁纸","locale":"zh-CN"},"2615":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-appearance#导入图片","content":"导入图片","locale":"zh-CN"},"2616":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-appearance#检查导入结果","content":"检查导入结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"2617":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-appearance#选择壁纸","content":"选择壁纸","locale":"zh-CN"},"2618":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-appearance#选择固定或随机","content":"选择固定或随机","locale":"zh-CN"},"2619":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"调整背景效果","locale":"zh-CN"},"2620":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance","content":"外观设置只影响界面显示，不会修改实例、模型或运行环境。主题和背景调整会立即应用，适合边修改边检查可读性。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2621":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#主题与主题色","content":"主题可以选择“跟随系统”“浅色”或“深色”。跟随系统会使用操作系统当前的明暗模式；固定主题适合系统主题经常变化但希望应用保持一致的情况。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2622":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#主题与主题色","content":"主题色用于按钮、选中状态和强调信息。可以点击预设色块，也可以打开“自定义颜色”，调整色相、饱和度和明度，或直接输入十六进制颜色（如 `#4c8df6`）并按 `Enter`。页面底部的“重置外观”恢复默认主题和背景设置，并保留壁纸库。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2623":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#导入图片","content":"点击“添加壁纸…”，选择一张或多张图片；也可以把系统文件管理器中的图片拖到壁纸区域。应用会将可用图片复制到自己的外观资源目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2624":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#检查导入结果","content":"等待缩略图和图片尺寸出现。部分文件失败时，页面会列出对应文件名和错误，其余成功图片仍会保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2625":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#选择壁纸","content":"点击缩略图将它设为选中壁纸，然后开启“显示背景图片”。如果资源已经丢失，条目会显示为缺失，不能作为有效背景使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2626":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#选择固定或随机","content":"显示背景图片且至少有两张可用壁纸时，可以开启“随机壁纸”。应用每次启动时随机选图，“正在显示”标记本次采用的图片。关闭随机后会使用你选中的壁纸。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2627":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#选择固定或随机","content":"删除单张壁纸或确认“全部移除”会删除应用保存的副本。最初导入位置的原图会保留，移动原图也不会影响已导入的副本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2628":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-16","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"没有设置壁纸时也可以调整界面不透明度和毛玻璃模糊。开启背景图片并有可显示的壁纸后，才可以调整图片的缩放方式和位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2629":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-17","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2630":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-18","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"建议","locale":"zh-CN"},"2631":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-19","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"界面不透明度","locale":"zh-CN"},"2632":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-20","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"范围为 40%–100%；越低，壁纸透出越多","locale":"zh-CN"},"2633":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-21","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"毛玻璃模糊","locale":"zh-CN"},"2634":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-22","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"范围为 0–32；设为 0 可关闭模糊","locale":"zh-CN"},"2635":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-23","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"覆盖","locale":"zh-CN"},"2636":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-24","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"填满窗口，可能裁剪图片边缘","locale":"zh-CN"},"2637":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-25","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"适应","locale":"zh-CN"},"2638":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-26","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"完整显示图片，图片比例不同时可能留白","locale":"zh-CN"},"2639":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-27","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"拉伸","locale":"zh-CN"},"2640":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-28","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"精确填满窗口，可能使图片变形；此时“图片位置”不再生效","locale":"zh-CN"},"2641":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-29","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"图片位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2642":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-30","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"决定覆盖裁剪或适应留白时优先保留的区域","locale":"zh-CN"},"2643":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-31","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"高对比度或细节复杂的壁纸应提高界面不透明度或模糊强度。设置后至少检查首页、设置窗口、实例管理和对话框中的文字、错误与状态提示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2644":{"id":"/docs/settings-appearance-32","page_id":"/docs/settings-appearance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-appearance#调整背景效果","content":"若壁纸显示失败，先确认条目没有“缺失”标记，再尝试重新导入。不要直接修改应用数据目录中的壁纸文件，否则资源记录可能仍在但文件已经不可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2645":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","type":"page","content":"自动化","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-automation","locale":"zh-CN"},"2646":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation","content":"选择应用自行运行哪些后台任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2647":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-automation#每日任务何时运行","content":"每日任务何时运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2648":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-automation#快照与更新检查相互等待","content":"快照与更新检查相互等待","locale":"zh-CN"},"2649":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation","content":"“设置 → 自动化”为应用自行运行的每项任务提供一个开关，四个开关默认全部开启。开关只停止自动运行：手动检查更新或手动创建快照不受影响。修改后约一分钟内生效，无需重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2650":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation","content":"开关","locale":"zh-CN"},"2651":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation","content":"自动运行的内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"2652":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation","content":"自动检查应用更新","locale":"zh-CN"},"2653":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation","content":"大约每小时检查一次应用自身是否有新版本。参见关于与更新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2654":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation","content":"每日检查实例更新","locale":"zh-CN"},"2655":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation","content":"检查已就绪的内置 WebUI 的内核、扩展和 PyTorch 更新，结果见实例卡片和版本管理。支持更新检查的扩展类型在扩展后端运行后参加检查，结果见“维护”中的“更新”操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2656":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation","content":"每日创建实例快照","locale":"zh-CN"},"2657":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation","content":"每天为已就绪的内置 WebUI 保存一次包含依赖包的快照。扩展提供的实例类型不参加自动快照。参见快照管理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2658":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation","content":"每日检查扩展更新","locale":"zh-CN"},"2659":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation","content":"每天检查一次发布了版本信息的已安装扩展是否有新版本，不会自动安装。参见扩展。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2660":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation","content":"便携版主应用跳过每小时的应用更新检查，改由 Launcher 在启动时检查更新。每日实例任务和扩展更新检查仍会运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2661":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation#每日任务何时运行","content":"每日任务在应用启动后不久开始，每个自然日运行一次。应用跨过午夜仍保持打开时，第二天的任务会自动开始。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2662":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-16","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation#每日任务何时运行","content":"每项任务分别记录进度：当天已完成的任务要到第二天才会再次运行；当天新开启的任务会在当天运行。每日任务运行期间关闭应用后，当天再次启动时会继续处理尚未处理的实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2663":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-17","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation#每日任务何时运行","content":"自动快照失败时，会和其他快照任务一样显示在任务中心，该实例当天的更新检查仍会照常进行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2664":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-18","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation#快照与更新检查相互等待","content":"同一实例上的更新检查和快照不会同时运行，后请求的一方会等待先开始的一方完成：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2665":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-19","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation#快照与更新检查相互等待","content":"两项每日任务都开启时，每个实例先创建快照，再检查更新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2666":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-20","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation#快照与更新检查相互等待","content":"实例正在创建快照时，从实例卡片发起的检查会等待快照完成；检查开始前，卡片显示“等待快照完成…”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2667":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-21","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation#快照与更新检查相互等待","content":"每日任务遇到正在创建快照或检查更新的实例时会先跳过，待该实例空闲后再回来处理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2668":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-22","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation#快照与更新检查相互等待","content":"不同实例之间互不等待。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2669":{"id":"/docs/settings-automation-23","page_id":"/docs/settings-automation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-automation#快照与更新检查相互等待","content":"已在某个实例上运行的任务会继续完成，尚未处理的实例将被跳过。快照不会中途停止，因此不会留下不完整的快照。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2670":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","type":"page","content":"诊断","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","locale":"zh-CN"},"2671":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","content":"生成、查看并导出应用级诊断包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2672":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#生成应用诊断","content":"生成应用诊断","locale":"zh-CN"},"2673":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#是否包含所有实例","content":"是否包含所有实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"2674":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#诊断包包含什么","content":"诊断包包含什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"2675":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","content":"应用诊断适合排查首次启动、运行时准备、跨实例任务、Agent 和平台问题。单个实例的环境或维护问题，优先从实例管理中的实例诊断生成范围更小的诊断包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2676":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#是否包含所有实例","content":"开启后，开始收集时会固定一份实例清单，再按顺序收集每个实例。收集期间新建的实例不会追加；某个实例无法访问、正在维护或已被替换时，会在诊断清单中记录问题，但不会丢弃已经收集的其他内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2677":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#是否包含所有实例","content":"关闭后，应用包只收集应用级配置、日志、状态、Agent 非凭据数据和应用任务等内容，生成速度更快、体积更小。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2678":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#诊断包包含什么","content":"应用诊断通常包含：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2679":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#诊断包包含什么","content":"当前全局设置和配置目录；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2680":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#诊断包包含什么","content":"文件日志与本次运行的内存日志；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2681":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#诊断包包含什么","content":"应用状态、任务活动和诊断状态；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2682":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#诊断包包含什么","content":"Agent 历史、记忆和非敏感 Skill 状态；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2683":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#诊断包包含什么","content":"开启实例收集时的实例快照、环境报告、任务和运行状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2684":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#诊断包包含什么","content":"模块异常时，可对照 `app/modules.json` 中的当前状态和 `app/module-faults.json` 中的故障记录。Agent 及其插件的状态分别在 `app/agent-status.json` 和 `app/agent-plugins.json`。提供诊断的扩展还可在 `app/extensions/<扩展 ID>/` 下写入自己的报告。某项收集失败时，`manifest.json` 会记录原因，其余成功收集的文件仍可查看。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2685":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#诊断包包含什么","content":"提供商凭据文档和 MCP 凭据文档会整体排除，但其余内容不会自动遮盖或改写。路径、环境变量、命令、输出、Token 或用户数据仍可能出现在其他原始来源中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2686":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#诊断包包含什么","content":"分享前解压 ZIP，检查\n`manifest.json`、日志、环境报告和任务输出，删除或遮盖不应公开的内容。只把诊断包发送给可信接收者。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2687":{"id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics-16","page_id":"/docs/settings-diagnostics","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-diagnostics#诊断包包含什么","content":"诊断 ZIP 没有自动保留期限，也不会随日志保留策略删除。确认不再需要后，应通过系统文件管理器清理应用诊断目录中的旧文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2688":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","type":"page","content":"环境工具","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","locale":"zh-CN"},"2689":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","content":"配置 uv、启动前环境检查和 CUDA 显存优化。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2690":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用-uv","content":"启用 uv","locale":"zh-CN"},"2691":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用环境检查","content":"启用环境检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"2692":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用-cuda-显存优化","content":"启用 CUDA 显存优化","locale":"zh-CN"},"2693":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#修改与验证","content":"修改与验证","locale":"zh-CN"},"2694":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","content":"环境工具决定安装流程和 WebUI 启动时怎样使用实例 Python。它们不会选择应用 Python 版本，也不会代替实例管理中的 PyTorch、扩展或版本操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2695":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用-uv","content":"开启后，支持的 Python 软件包安装使用 uv 代替 pip，通常速度更快。某些安装脚本或非标准软件包与 uv 不兼容时，可以临时关闭后重试同一个操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2696":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用-uv","content":"关闭 uv 不会卸载已经安装的软件包，也不会自动把环境恢复到之前状态；它只改变后续安装命令使用的工具。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2697":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用环境检查","content":"开启后，应用会在 WebUI 启动前检查并修复其依赖。首次启动、更新 Core、恢复快照或修改依赖后建议保持开启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2698":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用环境检查","content":"对于内置 WebUI，PyTorch 兼容性检查先于这一步执行。即使关闭环境检查，检测到不兼容时仍会请你决定是否继续启动；无法确定兼容性时，应用会记录警告并继续。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2699":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用-cuda-显存优化","content":"该选项在启动 WebUI 时请求 CUDA 异步显存分配器：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2700":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用-cuda-显存优化","content":"只在支持该能力的 NVIDIA 环境中生效；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2701":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用-cuda-显存优化","content":"AMD、Intel、Apple 或 CPU 环境会忽略；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2702":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用-cuda-显存优化","content":"某些旧驱动、旧版 CUDA 或特定 WebUI 组合可能不兼容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2703":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#启用-cuda-显存优化","content":"遇到启动阶段的 CUDA 分配器错误时，先关闭此项并重新启动实例进行对比，不要同时更换 PyTorch 和多个启动参数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2704":{"id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-environment-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-environment-tools#修改与验证","content":"环境工具属于应用级设置。修改后，之后执行相关流程的所有实例都可能受到影响，因此不要为解决单个实例问题长期关闭必要检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2705":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","type":"page","content":"扩展","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-extensions","locale":"zh-CN"},"2706":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions","content":"安装、开启、更新和卸载 Hanafubuki 扩展，了解权限、依赖、后端状态，以及扩展关闭后其实例会怎样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2707":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展能做什么","content":"扩展能做什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"2708":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展市场","content":"扩展市场","locale":"zh-CN"},"2709":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-extensions#安装扩展","content":"安装扩展","locale":"zh-CN"},"2710":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-extensions#确认页","content":"确认页","locale":"zh-CN"},"2711":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-extensions#权限","content":"权限","locale":"zh-CN"},"2712":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-extensions#开启和关闭","content":"开启和关闭","locale":"zh-CN"},"2713":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-extensions#状态","content":"状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"2714":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-extensions#依赖与兼容性","content":"依赖与兼容性","locale":"zh-CN"},"2715":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-extensions#更新","content":"更新","locale":"zh-CN"},"2716":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-extensions#检查更新","content":"检查更新","locale":"zh-CN"},"2717":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-extensions#卸载","content":"卸载","locale":"zh-CN"},"2718":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展的设置面板与视图","content":"扩展的设置、面板与视图","locale":"zh-CN"},"2719":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展关闭或卸载后其类型的实例会怎样","content":"扩展关闭或卸载后，其类型的实例会怎样","locale":"zh-CN"},"2720":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions","content":"扩展是安装到 Hanafubuki 本身的软件包，可以为应用添加新的实例类型、设置分区、界面面板和文字翻译，有的还会在应用旁边运行一个自己的程序（称为“后端”）。在设置窗口的“扩展”分区中安装和管理它们。“已安装”标签页列出本机安装的扩展；标签页顶部的一行（搜索框，以及旁边的“检查更新”和“安装扩展”）在列表滚动时保持不动，搜索框可以按名称、ID、发布者或描述查找扩展。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2721":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions","content":"本页介绍的是 Hanafubuki 应用的扩展。安装到某个 WebUI\n实例中的插件、节点等，请参阅扩展管理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2722":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-16","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展能做什么","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"2723":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-17","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展能做什么","content":"出现在哪里","locale":"zh-CN"},"2724":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-18","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展能做什么","content":"实例类型","locale":"zh-CN"},"2725":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-19","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展能做什么","content":"新建安装时可选的 WebUI 类型，安装、启动和管理方式由扩展描述","locale":"zh-CN"},"2726":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-20","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展能做什么","content":"安装预设","locale":"zh-CN"},"2727":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-21","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展能做什么","content":"新建安装时，选择对应类型下的预设即可预填参数，还可以继续修改","locale":"zh-CN"},"2728":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-22","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展能做什么","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2729":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-23","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展能做什么","content":"设置窗口中以扩展名称命名的分区，位于应用自带分区之后","locale":"zh-CN"},"2730":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-24","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展能做什么","content":"面板与视图","locale":"zh-CN"},"2731":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-25","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展能做什么","content":"设置窗口中的分区、该扩展类型实例的管理页面，或标题栏“扩展页面”菜单中的独立视图","locale":"zh-CN"},"2732":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-26","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展能做什么","content":"Agent 内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"2733":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-27","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展能做什么","content":"内置 Agent 中随扩展启用的 Skills 和 MCP 服务器，沿用 Agent 的工具审批设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2734":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-28","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展能做什么","content":"管理工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"2735":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-29","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展能做什么","content":"扩展可向 H