","content":"“安装”","locale":"zh-CN"},"2745":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-39","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展市场","content":"尚未安装。点击后应用下载软件包，并打开与其他安装方式相同的确认页（见下文）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2746":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-40","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展市场","content":"“已安装 v…”","locale":"zh-CN"},"2747":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-41","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展市场","content":"已安装该版本；上次检查发现新版本时还会显示“更新到 …”","locale":"zh-CN"},"2748":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-42","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展市场","content":"“已链接”","locale":"zh-CN"},"2749":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-43","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展市场","content":"以开发用链接文件夹的方式安装","locale":"zh-CN"},"2750":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-44","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展市场","content":"只有源代码链接","locale":"zh-CN"},"2751":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-45","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展市场","content":"注册表没有给出可安装的软件包，请到其源代码页面了解获取方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2752":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-46","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展市场","content":"市场条目提供更新源时，应用从中选择适合你系统和架构的最新软件包，有 SHA-256 时校验下载内容。更新源读取失败或没有兼容包时会显示错误。只有条目未指定更新源时，应用才使用条目中的固定下载地址。注册表中当前版本无法读取的条目不会显示，标签页会说明有多少条目被略过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2753":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-47","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#安装扩展","content":"安装时先选择来源并检查软件包，然后确认安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2754":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-48","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#安装扩展","content":"点击“检查”。应用在暂存区检查待安装的副本；选择“链接的文件夹”时会直接检查源目录。此时可以审阅清单和贡献，再决定是否安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2755":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-49","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#安装扩展","content":"阅读确认页列出的信息，确认无误后点击“安装”。点击“返回”或关闭对话框会丢弃已检查的软件包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2756":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-50","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#安装扩展","content":"来源","locale":"zh-CN"},"2757":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-51","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#安装扩展","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"2758":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-52","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#安装扩展","content":"文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"2759":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-53","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#安装扩展","content":"复制该文件夹的内容，而不是链接到它；文件夹内含有符号链接时会被拒绝","locale":"zh-CN"},"2760":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-54","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#安装扩展","content":"链接的文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"2761":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-55","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#安装扩展","content":"用于本地开发。选择含清单的目录，确认页显示该目录的路径。应用就地读取文件，修改后在卡片上点击“重新加载”。见开发时链接文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"2762":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-56","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#安装扩展","content":"压缩包","locale":"zh-CN"},"2763":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-57","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#安装扩展","content":"支持 `.zip`、`.tar`、`.tar.gz`、`.tar.xz` 和 `.tar.bz2`；可以包裹在一层目录中","locale":"zh-CN"},"2764":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-58","page_id":"/d