tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#权限","content":"实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"2774":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-68","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#权限","content":"`none`（默认）、`read`、`own-types`、`all`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2775":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-69","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#权限","content":"`read` 读取所有实例的基本信息；`own-types` 读取并跟踪自己类型的实例及其服务器状态；`all` 两者都有","locale":"zh-CN"},"2776":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-70","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#权限","content":"运行进程","locale":"zh-CN"},"2777":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-71","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#权限","content":"开或关","locale":"zh-CN"},"2778":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-72","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#权限","content":"通过应用运行进程、准备 Python、执行 Git 克隆和拉取","locale":"zh-CN"},"2779":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-73","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#权限","content":"网络","locale":"zh-CN"},"2780":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-74","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#权限","content":"主机名列表，可用 `*.example.com` 匹配子域名","locale":"zh-CN"},"2781":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-75","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#权限","content":"宿主 HTTP 请求、文件下载和远程 Git 操作可访问的主机，也约束扩展声明的 Agent HTTP MCP 服务器地址","locale":"zh-CN"},"2782":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-76","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#权限","content":"文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2783":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-77","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#权限","content":"`extension-data`（默认）、`own-instances`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2784":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-78","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#权限","content":"进程工作目录、Python 安装和 Git 操作可使用的目录。后一项还允许使用自己类型的实例目录。宿主的文件下载始终写入扩展数据目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2785":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-79","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#权限","content":"添加实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"2786":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-80","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#权限","content":"开或关","locale":"zh-CN"},"2787":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-81","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#权限","content":"扫描目录并登记找到的实例。直接导入指定类型还需实例权限：`own-types` 可导入自己的类型，`all` 可导入任意已注册类型","locale":"zh-CN"},"2788":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-82","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#权限","content":"管理工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"2789":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-83","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#权限","content":"`none`（默认）、`read`、`confirm`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2790":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-84","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#权限","content":"`read` 允许调用只读工具。`confirm` 还允许请求修改，每次修改需你在主窗口确认","locale":"zh-CN"},"2791":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-85","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#权限","content":"这些权限只限制扩展能请求 Hanafubuki\n做什么。带后端的扩展会以你的用户权限在电脑上运行程序，该程序本身可以直接访问网络和你的文件，不受上述权限约束。确认页会对每个带后端的扩展显示这一警告。仅在信任扩展时安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2792":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-86","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#开启和关闭","content":"每张扩展卡片右侧有一个开关。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2793":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-87","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#开启和关闭","content":"**开启**：应用会注册扩展的实例类型、设置和面板，并启动它的后端。依赖尚未满足时，扩展会保持开启但显示“无法运行”，所需条件满足后自动运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2794":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-88","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#开启和关闭","content":"**关闭**：依赖它的其他扩展会一并关闭；如果有使用其类型的实例正在运行，这些实例会先被停止。此时卡片中会先询问“关闭……？”，列出会被关闭的扩展和会被停止的实例，点击“关闭”后才执行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2795":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-89","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#状态","content":"卡片上的标签显示扩展当前的状态：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2796":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-90","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#状态","content":"状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"2797":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-91","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#状态","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"2798":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-92","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#状态","content":"已关闭","locale":"zh-CN"},"2799":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-93","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#状态","content":"扩展已安装但未开启","locale":"zh-CN"},"2800":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-94","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#状态","content":"正在启动","locale":"zh-CN"},"2801":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-95","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#状态","content":"正在注册内容并启动后端","locale":"zh-CN"},"2802":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-96","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#状态","content":"已开启","locale":"zh-CN"},"2803":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-97","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#状态","content":"正常运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2804":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-98","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#状态","content":"失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"2805":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-99","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#状态","content":"启动失败或运行中出错，卡片会显示原因","locale":"zh-CN"},"2806":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-100","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#状态","content":"正在重启","locale":"zh-CN"},"2807":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-101","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#状态","content":"出错后正在等待自动重启（依次等待 2、10、30 秒，10 分钟内最多 3 次）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2808":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-102","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#状态","content":"因反复崩溃已停止","locale":"zh-CN"},"2809":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-103","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#状态","content":"后端连续 3 次在稳定运行 30 秒之前就退出或启动失败，应用不再自动启动它，重启应用后也不会","locale":"zh-CN"},"2810":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-104","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#状态","content":"无法运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2811":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-105","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#状态","content":"扩展本身或其依赖不满足运行条件，卡片会显示原因（见依赖与兼容性）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2812":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-106","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#状态","content":"已损坏","locale":"zh-CN"},"2813":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-107","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#状态","content":"应用无法读取该扩展的安装记录或已安装的软件包，卡片会显示原因；通常需要卸载后重新安装","locale":"zh-CN"},"2814":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-108","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#状态","content":"扩展显示“正在重启”时，等待应用自动重启。若已“失败”或“因反复崩溃已停止”，排除原因后在卡片上点击“重试”。以链接文件夹安装的扩展使用“重新加载”，它会重新读取源目录。带后端的扩展可用“查看日志”读取最近的输出（最多最后 256 KiB），点击“刷新”重新读取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2815":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-109","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#依赖与兼容性","content":"扩展可以依赖其他扩展。开启的扩展在以下情况下显示“无法运行”，原因会写在卡片上：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2816":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-110","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#依赖与兼容性","content":"它声明的 Hanafubuki 版本范围不包含当前应用版本；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2817":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-111","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#依赖与兼容性","content":"它没有声明，或声明了当前应用不支持的扩展接口版本；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2818":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-112","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#依赖与兼容性","content":"它的后端没有为当前操作系统提供程序；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2819":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-113","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#依赖与兼容性","content":"它依赖的扩展未安装、版本不在要求的范围内、已关闭，或自身无法运行；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2820":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-114","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#依赖与兼容性","content":"它与其他扩展的依赖关系形成了循环。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2821":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-115","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#依赖与兼容性","content":"只有受影响的扩展（以及依赖它的扩展）无法运行，其他扩展和应用照常工作。关闭的扩展只会因为自身原因显示“无法运行”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2822":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-116","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#更新","content":"对于作者发布了版本信息的扩展，卡片上的“更新”只需点击一次：应用会立即检查该扩展，发现新版本时下载它、与作者发布的摘要比对，然后打开确认页；没有新版本时，卡片会显示已是最新，或检查失败的原因。处理期间，卡片上的按钮会暂时不可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2823":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-117","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#更新","content":"如果要从其他来源更新，或者扩展没有发布版本信息，请使用“更新”旁边的文件夹按钮“从文件或链接更新…”（没有发布版本信息的扩展，点击“更新”本身就会打开它）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2824":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-118","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#更新","content":"确认页会显示已安装版本和新版本。如果有使用其类型的实例正在运行，会提示“更新前会停止以下实例”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2825":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-119","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#更新","content":"安装与已安装版本相同的版本号会被拒绝。如果扩展原本是开启的，而新版本未能正常开启（启动失败或无法运行），应用会自动恢复到原来的版本并让它重新运行，更新显示失败及原因。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2826":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-120","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#检查更新","content":"作者发布了版本信息的扩展（见发布更新）可以检查是否有新版本：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2827":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-121","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#检查更新","content":"每张卡片会显示上次检查的时间和结果：“已是最新”、新的版本号、“检查失败”及原因，或者没有发布版本信息的扩展显示“没有更新源”。链接的文件夹从不检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2828":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-122","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#检查更新","content":"“已安装”标签页中的“检查更新”会立即检查所有扩展。检查、下载、安装和更新的进度与结果显示在设置窗口的右下角。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2829":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-123","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#检查更新","content":"开启“每日检查扩展更新”（设置 → 自动化，默认开启）后，应用每天检查一次。发现之前没有发现过的版本时，主页会显示“有 N 个扩展更新可用”；点击“查看”会打开本页面。有可用更新时，导航栏会显示其数量（悬停提示也会说明），页面标题旁也会显示提示标记。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2830":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-124","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#检查更新","content":"有更新的卡片会显示“有可用更新”，其更新按钮显示为“更新到”该版本；扩展市场中的条目也会显示同样的按钮。两者都会执行上面的一键更新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2831":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-125","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#检查更新","content":"未经你确认，扩展不会被更新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2832":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-126","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#卸载","content":"点击“卸载”后确认。卸载会先停止使用其类型且正在运行的实例，关闭扩展（以及依赖它的扩展），再删除它的文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2833":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-127","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#卸载","content":"默认情况下，扩展的设置和数据会保留，以便日后重新安装时继续使用。勾选“同时删除它的设置和数据”才会一并删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2834":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-128","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展的设置面板与视图","content":"扩展开启后，它提供的内容会出现在以下位置：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2835":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-129","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展的设置面板与视图","content":"**设置**：设置窗口中以扩展名称命名的分区。修改的值保存在扩展自己的存储中，不属于应用设置；只有扩展处于运行状态时可以读取和修改。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2836":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-130","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展的设置面板与视图","content":"**面板与视图**：根据扩展的声明，出现在设置窗口中，或出现在该扩展类型实例的管理页面中“扩展”分组下。管理页面中的分区只对该扩展自己类型的实例显示。视图无法加载或停止响应时显示“不可用”，点击“重新加载”可以重试，不影响其他分区。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2837":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-131","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展的设置面板与视图","content":"**操作**：扩展类型自定义的维护操作显示在实例管理页面的“操作”分区中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2838":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-132","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展的设置面板与视图","content":"如果扩展提供独立页面，主窗口标题栏会出现“扩展页面”菜单。选择页面名称即可打开，使用标题栏的返回按钮回到首页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2839":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-133","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展的设置面板与视图","content":"在带表单或列表的面板中，按页面提示填写字段，或点击对应行的操作按钮。有的操作会先显示确认提示；执行后面板会重新读取数据。实例管理页中的扩展视图还可以请求使用新参数重装当前实例。确认框会列出实例名称与参数变更，确认后这些参数也将用于之后的安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2840":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-134","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展关闭或卸载后其类型的实例会怎样","content":"扩展关闭、失败或被卸载后，使用其类型的实例仍保留在实例列表中，但会显示为不可用并附上原因。它们的记录和文件保持原样，不会被修改或删除；只能删除实例记录，无法安装、启动、管理或打开终端。扩展重新开启并正常运行后，这些实例自动恢复可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2841":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-135","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展关闭或卸载后其类型的实例会怎样","content":"由扩展后端提供的实例类型在后端出错或重启期间仍保持注册，实例依然列出且可用，但安装、启动等需要后端参与的操作会失败，并提示扩展后端不可用。后端恢复后即可重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2842":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-136","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展关闭或卸载后其类型的实例会怎样","content":"<Card title=\"扩展开发\" href=\"/docs/extension-dev\" description=\"了解扩展包的结构、清单字段和开发流程。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2843":{"id":"/docs/settings-extensions-137","page_id":"/docs/settings-extensions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-extensions#扩展关闭或卸载后其类型的实例会怎样","content":"<Card title=\"日志、诊断与求助\" href=\"/docs/troubleshooting-reporting\" description=\"整理扩展日志和错误信息，向发布者或维护者求助。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2844":{"id":"/docs/settings-language","page_id":"/docs/settings-language","type":"page","content":"语言","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-language","locale":"zh-CN"},"2845":{"id":"/docs/settings-language-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-language","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-language","content":"选择跟随系统、中文或英文界面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2846":{"id":"/docs/settings-language-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-language","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-language#切换语言","content":"切换语言","locale":"zh-CN"},"2847":{"id":"/docs/settings-language-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-language","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-language","content":"“设置 → 语言”控制 Hanafubuki 自己的界面语言，不会修改操作系统、WebUI 或终端中的语言。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2848":{"id":"/docs/settings-language-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-language","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-language","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"2849":{"id":"/docs/settings-language-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-language","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-language","content":"行为","locale":"zh-CN"},"2850":{"id":"/docs/settings-language-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-language","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-language","content":"自动（跟随系统）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2851":{"id":"/docs/settings-language-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-language","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-language","content":"系统语言为中文时使用中文，其他语言使用英文","locale":"zh-CN"},"2852":{"id":"/docs/settings-language-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-language","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-language","content":"中文","locale":"zh-CN"},"2853":{"id":"/docs/settings-language-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-language","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-language","content":"始终使用中文，不受系统语言变化影响","locale":"zh-CN"},"2854":{"id":"/docs/settings-language-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-language","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-language","content":"English","locale":"zh-CN"},"2855":{"id":"/docs/settings-language-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-language","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-language","content":"始终使用英文，不受系统语言变化影响","locale":"zh-CN"},"2856":{"id":"/docs/settings-language-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-language","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-language#切换语言","content":"选择“自动”后，如果之后修改了系统语言，需要重新启动 Hanafubuki 才能确保所有窗口都按新的系统语言加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2857":{"id":"/docs/settings-language-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-language","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-language#切换语言","content":"网站文档与应用界面是两套独立内容。切换应用语言不会自动切换浏览器中已经打开的文档。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2858":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","type":"page","content":"日志","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-logs","locale":"zh-CN"},"2859":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs","content":"控制日志级别、文件持久化、轮转大小和保留时间。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2860":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-logs#内存日志与文件日志","content":"内存日志与文件日志","locale":"zh-CN"},"2861":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-logs#字段说明","content":"字段说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"2862":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-logs#选择日志级别","content":"选择日志级别","locale":"zh-CN"},"2863":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-logs#推荐排查流程","content":"推荐排查流程","locale":"zh-CN"},"2864":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs","content":"日志用于排查应用、运行环境、任务和平台问题。日常使用建议保留默认的“信息”级别，只在能够稳定复现问题时临时提高详细程度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2865":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#内存日志与文件日志","content":"应用始终保留一个有容量限制的本次运行日志缓冲区，诊断包会把它导出为 `session.log`。关闭“保存日志到文件”只停止磁盘持久化，不会让本次运行的诊断日志消失。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2866":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#内存日志与文件日志","content":"开启文件持久化后，日志写入应用数据目录的 `logs` 文件夹：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2867":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#内存日志与文件日志","content":"当前文件为 `hanafubuki.log`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2868":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#内存日志与文件日志","content":"达到大小上限后，旧文件改为带 UTC 时间戳的名称，新文件继续记录；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2869":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#内存日志与文件日志","content":"超过保留天数的历史 `.log` 文件会被清理；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2870":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#内存日志与文件日志","content":"当前活动日志、目录和符号链接不会被保留策略删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2871":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#字段说明","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2872":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#字段说明","content":"范围或行为","locale":"zh-CN"},"2873":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#字段说明","content":"保存日志到文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2874":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#字段说明","content":"控制是否把日志持久化到磁盘","locale":"zh-CN"},"2875":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-16","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#字段说明","content":"日志文件大小上限","locale":"zh-CN"},"2876":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-17","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#字段说明","content":"1–512 MB；达到上限后轮转","locale":"zh-CN"},"2877":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-18","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#字段说明","content":"日志保留天数","locale":"zh-CN"},"2878":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-19","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#字段说明","content":"1–365 天；清理过期历史日志","locale":"zh-CN"},"2879":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-20","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#字段说明","content":"日志级别","locale":"zh-CN"},"2880":{"id"