ogs#选择日志级别","content":"只关注异常和潜在问题","locale":"zh-CN"},"2892":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-33","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#选择日志级别","content":"错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"2893":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-34","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#选择日志级别","content":"只记录失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"2894":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-35","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#选择日志级别","content":"关闭","locale":"zh-CN"},"2895":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-36","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#选择日志级别","content":"不输出普通日志，不适合排查问题","locale":"zh-CN"},"2896":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-37","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#选择日志级别","content":"`trace` 可能记录经过长度限制的 Agent\n请求、推理或工具内容，以及路径、环境和命令信息。仅在明确需要时短时间开启；复现完成后恢复“信息”，并在分享日志或诊断包前检查敏感内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2897":{"id":"/docs/settings-logs-38","page_id":"/docs/settings-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-logs#推荐排查流程","content":"<Card title=\"日志、诊断与求助\" href=\"/docs/troubleshooting-reporting\" description=\"提取核心错误并准备可供维护者分析的材料。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2898":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","type":"page","content":"MCP 服务器","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","locale":"zh-CN"},"2899":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","content":"让本机上的其他 AI 工具（如 Claude Code 或 Cursor）通过应用的 MCP 服务器管理你的实例，并为每个工具设定权限。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2900":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"服务器提供什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"2901":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/setti