-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","content":"应用运行着一个管理用的 **MCP 服务器**：内置助手使用的实例管理工具，任何 MCP 客户端都可以使用。它只监听本机，地址显示在 **设置 › API 服务器** 页面，只有持有有效令牌的客户端才能使用。内置助手会自动连接到它；在你允许之后，其他 AI 工具也可以连接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2913":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"客户端通过 `tools/list` 获取当前可用的工具及其参数。内置工具涵盖以下操作；已启用的桌面扩展也可以在同一端点发布工具。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2914":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"分组","locale":"zh-CN"},"2915":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-16","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"工具的作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2916":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-17","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"读取","locale":"zh-CN"},"2917":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-18","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"列出实例和可安装的类型、检查更新、浏览扩展市场、读取任务及其日志","locale":"zh-CN"},"2918":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-19","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"内嵌 WebUI 存储","locale":"zh-CN"},"2919":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-20","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"查看共享存储和各实例存储的磁盘占用，以及当前阻止清理的原因","locale":"zh-CN"},"2920":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-21","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"启动","locale":"zh-CN"},"2921":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-22","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"启动、停止和重启实例及其 API 服务器，收集诊断信息","locale":"zh-CN"},"2922":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-23","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"WebUI 插件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2923":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-24","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"在指定实例中安装、更新、启停或卸载插件，切换分支或版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"2924":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-25","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"桌面扩展","locale":"zh-CN"},"2925":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-26","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"列出已安装的 Hanafubuki 扩展、浏览市场、预览停用影响、检查更新、读取后端日志","locale":"zh-CN"},"2926":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-27","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"2927":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-28","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"更新 WebUI、切换分支、提交或变体、重装 PyTorch","locale":"zh-CN"},"2928":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-29","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"快照","locale":"zh-CN"},"2929":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-30","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"创建、预览、恢复和删除快照","locale":"zh-CN"},"2930":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-31","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"2931":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-32","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"浏览、下载或导入模型，创建目录，复制、移动、重命名或删除文件。InvokeAI 可选择只注销模型，也可同时删除文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2932":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-33","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"应用与运行环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"2933":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-34","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"查看运行时状态，重试准备，检查 API 服务器健康状态，安排或撤销平滑重启，收集应用诊断","locale":"zh-CN"},"2934":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-35","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2935":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-36","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"启动参数、环境变量、热补丁设置与运行状态、组件路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"2936":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-37","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"创建与维护","locale":"zh-CN"},"2937":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-38","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"管理用户预设，创建、导入、扫描、安装、重装、迁移和删除实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"2938":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-39","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"2939":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-40","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"列出应用的模块和扩展及其状态、重新启动其中之一、运行扩展的实例类型新增的操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"2940":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-41","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"内置工具及其作用列在工具参考中，服务器也会把它提供给客户端（见下文“给 Agent 的使用指南”）。安装等耗时操作会返回一个任务，客户端像你在任务中心中那样读取它的进度和日志。实例类型以其 id 命名（例如 `builtin:comfyui`），因此客户端可以创建你已有的任何类型的实例，包括扩展提供的类型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2941":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-42","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#服务器提供什么","content":"例如，询问“迁移运行时会移动哪些文件”时，客户端可先读取当前目录，再调用 `preview_runtime_storage_migration` 检查目标并列出组件的新位置。预览完成后，用户可在设置中发起实际迁移。排查应用更新时，`get_app_update_status` 读取已有结果，`check_app_update` 会重新检查，并可能下载和准备更新包。安装与重启在应用中完成。内置管理工具与参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"2942":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-43","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#内置助手","content":"内置助手使用自己的密钥连接服务器，每次服务器启动时都会更新。你不需要为它做任何配置，其他客户端也不会占用它的连接：无论它们做什么，内置助手都有自己独立的额度。它的连接是 Agent MCP 服务器列表中的 `hanafubuki` 一项；如何关闭这一项、调整其策略以及删除它会怎样，请见 MCP。在“模块”页面关闭 **management-mcp** 模块会关闭整个服务器，内置助手的实例工具也随之不可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2943":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-44","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#允许其他客户端连接","content":"外部访问默认**关闭**。在 **设置 › API 服务器** 的 **管理 MCP 服务器** 卡片中有 **允许已添加的客户端连接** 开关（模块页面中该模块的 **设置** 里也有相同的设置）。关闭时，客户端的令牌会像不存在一样被拒绝。开关立即生效，无需重启服务器；关闭时还会断开客户端已打开的连接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2944":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-45","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#允许其他客户端连接","content":"客户端可以读取你的实例及其任务。在你授予的权限内，它还可以启动、修改、安装到或删除实例。任何持有其令牌的程序都能使用它，请妥善保管，并且只添加你信任的工具。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2945":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-46","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#添加客户端","content":"点击 **创建**。客户端的令牌会显示出来并附有 **复制**\n按钮，下方是已包含该令牌的配置。请将其中一个复制到你的客户端中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2946":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-47","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#再次显示客户端的令牌","content":"点击客户端所在行的钥匙按钮（**显示令牌**）。应用会再次显示该令牌，并附有 **复制** 按钮和填好令牌的相同配置，方便你重新配置该客户端，或在其他工具中配置。应用只在该窗口打开期间读取令牌。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2947":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-48","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#再次显示客户端的令牌","content":"使用早期版本的应用添加的客户端（在应用开始保存令牌之前）只保存了令牌的指纹：其所在行会注明无法显示其令牌，**显示令牌** 会说明原因。它仍可使用已有的令牌正常连接。若要获得可再次显示的令牌，请撤销该客户端并重新添加。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2948":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-49","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#权限","content":"权限","locale":"zh-CN"},"2949":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-50","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#权限","content":"客户端可以做什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"2950":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-51","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#权限","content":"只读","locale":"zh-CN"},"2951":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-52","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#权限","content":"列出并读取实例、任务和日志，所有修改都会被拒绝","locale":"zh-CN"},"2952":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-53","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#权限","content":"管理，每次询问","locale":"zh-CN"},"2953":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-54","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#权限","content":"可以做任何事，但每项修改都要等你在主窗口中允许","locale":"zh-CN"},"2954":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-55","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#权限","content":"管理，无需询问","locale":"zh-CN"},"2955":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-56","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#权限","content":"修改无需询问即可执行；删除、恢复快照或替换内容时仍会询问","locale":"zh-CN"},"2956":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-57","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#权限","content":"管理，无需询问，包括删除","locale":"zh-CN"},"2957":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-58","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#权限","content":"允许直接删除。扩展工具和实例类型的自定义操作仍需确认","locale":"zh-CN"},"2958":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-59","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#权限","content":"完全访问","locale":"zh-CN"},"2959":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-60","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#权限","content":"可以直接调用所有管理工具，包括扩展工具和删除操作，无需 MCP 确认","locale":"zh-CN"},"2960":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-61","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#权限","content":"只读客户端可以查看扩展发布的工具。授予“完全访问”后，该客户端可以直接调用扩展工具和实例类型的自定义操作。修改操作仍会记入任务中心。开启或关闭模块永远不由客户端决定，只能由你在模块页面中操作。客户端不能重新启动它正在连接的服务器（**management-mcp** 模块），内置助手也不能重新启动它自己所在的模块。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2961":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-62","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#权限","content":"你可以随时在客户端所在行修改其权限或名称，新的权限从它的下一次请求起生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2962":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-63","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#连接客户端","content":"卡片中的 **如何连接客户端** 部分，以及填好令牌的令牌界面（点击 **创建** 之后，或通过 **显示令牌** 打开），都会显示配置：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2963":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-64","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#连接客户端","content":"**Claude Code**：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2964":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-65","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#连接客户端","content":"**Cursor** 等读取 `mcpServers` JSON 文件的客户端：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2965":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-66","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#连接客户端","content":"**VS Code**：如果编辑的是 `.vscode/mcp.json`，顶层键使用 `servers`。在其下创建 `hanafubuki` 条目，填写 `\"type\": \"http\"`，并使用卡片中的 `url` 和 `headers`。共享工作区配置可用输入变量提供令牌。VS Code MCP 配置参考","locale":"zh-CN"},"2966":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-67","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#连接客户端","content":"**Claude Desktop** 以程序方式启动其 MCP 服务器，因此它启动随应用安装的桥接程序 **hanafubuki-mcp**。用于 `claude_desktop_config.json` 的条目指定该桥接程序，并在其环境变量中提供令牌和应用的端点文件；卡片中会填入实际路径：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2967":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-68","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#连接客户端","content":"地址通常使用 43761 端口；**管理 MCP 服务器** 卡片上的 **端口** 字段可以更改它（设为 0 时每次启动由系统选择），服务器会立即在新端口上重新启动。如果该端口被占用，服务器会改用其他端口并显示在 API 服务器页面上，请相应更新 Claude Code、Cursor 或 VS Code 的配置。Claude Desktop 的配置无需更改：服务器每次启动时，应用都会把当前地址写入端点文件，而 Claude Desktop 每次启动桥接程序时，桥接程序都会读取它。桥接程序只在那时读取：如果服务器在 Claude Desktop 运行期间换了端口，请在 Claude Desktop 中重新启动该服务器（或重启 Claude Desktop），让桥接程序读取新地址。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2968":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-69","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#连接客户端","content":"桥接程序不会启动应用。如果应用未运行或外部访问已关闭，Claude Desktop 会显示“Hanafubuki is not\nrunning, or its external MCP access is off”；如果客户端已被撤销，则显示“the token was\nrefused”。请启动应用、打开外部访问，然后在 Claude Desktop\n中重新启动该服务器。端点文件（应用数据文件夹中的\n`data/mcp/endpoint.json`）只保存地址，从不保存令牌，并且仅在服务器运行且外部访问打开时存在。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2969":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-70","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#连接客户端","content":"应用以 AppImage 运行时，它的文件（包括桥接程序）仅在运行期间存在，因此 Claude Desktop\n没有可以启动的桥接程序。此时卡片中不会提供 Claude Desktop 配置；Claude Code、Cursor 和 VS Code\n照常连接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2970":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-71","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#确认","content":"当客户端请求需要你批准的修改时，主窗口会显示 **允许 Claude Code 执行此操作？**（显示客户端的名称），并说明它要做什么、针对哪个实例、使用哪个工具。具有破坏性的修改会附带警告，其 **允许** 按钮为红色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2971":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-72","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#确认","content":"**允许** 执行该操作；**拒绝** 或 Esc 拒绝它。焦点默认在 **拒绝** 上，因此误按的按键不会允许它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2972":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-73","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#确认","content":"你有 **60 秒** 时间。无人回应的请求会被拒绝，客户端会收到“未及时确认”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2973":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-74","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#确认","content":"多个请求会排队，对话框会显示还有多少个在等待。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2974":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-75","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#确认","content":"请求等待期间也会列在 **任务中心**，因此即使窗口被隐藏，你回来时也能看到。在任务中心取消它即表示拒绝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2975":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-76","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#确认","content":"如果主窗口没有打开，请求会被立即拒绝。未经你的同意，任何操作都不会被允许。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2976":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-77","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#任务中心中的记录","content":"客户端请求的每项修改都会以 **MCP 客户端** 类型出现在 **任务中心**，以客户端和它所做的事命名：已完成、失败（附带错误），或已取消（附带原因：被你拒绝、未及时确认，或其权限不允许）。应用运行期间，任务中心保留最近的 100 条这类记录；应用退出后不会保留。读取操作不会逐条列出；设置卡片中每个客户端所在行会显示它的上次使用时间。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2977":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-78","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#给-agent-的使用指南","content":"服务器附带一份为 AI Agent 编写的使用指南，即 `hanafubuki-webui-management` Skill：什么情况下用哪个工具、如何从 `list_instances` 获取 id 而不是猜测、如何通过任务和日志跟踪耗时操作，以及哪些工具需要格外小心。内置助手已把它安装为 Skill（见 Skills）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2978":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-79","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#给-agent-的使用指南","content":"外部客户端可以从服务器以 MCP 资源的形式读取同一份指南，服务器的说明也会让每个客户端去读它：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2979":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-80","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#给-agent-的使用指南","content":"`hanafubuki://skills/webui-management/SKILL.md`：使用指南；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2980":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-81","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#给-agent-的使用指南","content":"`hanafubuki://skills/webui-management/references/tools.md`：工具参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2981":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-82","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#给-agent-的使用指南","content":"能显示 MCP 资源的客户端可以把它们附加到对话中；否则，请让 Agent 在开始前先读取 `hanafubuki` 服务器的 `SKILL.md` 资源。如果你的 Agent 有自己的 Skill 系统（Claude Code、Codex 等都读取相同的 `SKILL.md` 格式），可以下载Skill 文件夹并解压到其中。指南把服务器称为 `hanafubuki`，与上面的配置所用的名称一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2982":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-83","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#撤销客户端","content":"点击客户端的 **撤销** 按钮并确认。其令牌立即失效，已打开的连接会关闭。若要再次连接，请重新添加并配置新令牌。应用无法从文件中读取的条目会显示为 **无法读取的客户端条目**，并提供 **移除** 按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2983":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-84","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#安全性说明","content":"**只在本机。** 服务器只监听本机，网络中的其他计算机无法访问它。它会拒绝来自网页的请求，因此你在浏览器中打开的网站也无法使用它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2984":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-85","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#安全性说明","content":"**没有令牌就无法使用。** 其他客户端只能在外部访问打开时连接，并且各自使用自己的令牌，你可以随时撤销。内置助手的密钥在服务器每次启动时都会更换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2985":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-86","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#安全性说明","content":"**修改由你掌控。** 除非你选择信任某个客户端，否则每项修改都要等你同意；除非你还选择了“包括删除”，否则删除操作也要等你同意。客户端所做的每项修改都会列在任务中心。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2986":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-87","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#安全性说明","content":"**像保管密码一样保管令牌。** 应用在其配置文件夹（`config/mcp/clients.json`）中保存每个令牌及其用于校验请求的指纹，以便你可以再次显示令牌。在 macOS 和 Linux 上只有你的账户能读取该文件；在 Windows 上它与你个人资料文件夹中的其他文件受到同样的保护。因此，能读取你配置文件夹的人也能读取这些令牌，就像能读取保存在那里的助手提供方密钥一样。诊断包从不包含该文件。客户端自己配置中的令牌副本由该客户端负责保护；应用无法收回已复制出去的令牌，只能撤销该客户端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2987":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-88","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#安全性说明","content":"**它不能防范什么。** 以你的身份运行的任何程序都能读取你的文件，包括保存客户端的文件和客户端的配置，因此令牌能防范其他用户和网页，但无法防范你账户中的恶意软件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2988":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-89","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#安全性说明","content":"<Card title=\"API 服务器\" href=\"/docs/settings-api-servers\" description=\"MCP 服务器地址和外部客户端卡片所在的页面。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2989":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-90","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#安全性说明","content":"<Card title=\"任务中心\" href=\"/docs/task-center\" description=\"跟踪客户端所做的修改以及等待你处理的请求。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2990":{"id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server-91","page_id":"/docs/settings-mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mcp-server#安全性说明","content":"<Card title=\"MCP\" href=\"/docs/agent-mcp\" description=\"内置助手的 hanafubuki 一项及其策略。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2991":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","type":"page","content":"镜像","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-mirrors","locale":"zh-CN"},"2992":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors","content":"配置 Micromamba、PyPI、GitHub、Hugging Face 和模型下载来源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2993":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"自动与手动模式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2994":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#推荐配置顺序","content":"推荐配置顺序","locale":"zh-CN"},"2995":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors","content":"镜像可以改善特定网络下的软件包和资源下载速度，但镜像内容可能延迟或缺失。普通用户建议先使用“自动选择镜像”，只有需要固定来源或排查问题时才改为手动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2996":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"开启“自动选择镜像”后，应用通过 Micromamba 准备受管 Git 时，会使用当前代理设置探测网络。探测成功时使用官方通道，探测失败或超时时使用镜像。Python 安装流程会自行选择它支持的软件源。自动模式会禁用手动开关和自定义地址，并保留已填写的值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2997":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"关闭自动选择后，可以分别控制：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2998":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2999":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"主要用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"3000":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"Micromamba 镜像","locale":"zh-CN"},"3001":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"Conda 环境、Git 等受管工具的包与通道","locale":"zh-CN"},"3002":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"PyPI 镜像","locale":"zh-CN"},"3003":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"WebUI Python 依赖安装","locale":"zh-CN"},"3004":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"GitHub 镜像","locale":"zh-CN"},"3005":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"Core、扩展和发布资源","locale":"zh-CN"},"3006":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"Hugging Face 镜像","locale":"zh-CN"},"3007":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"Hugging Face 仓库与文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"3008":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-16","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"模型下载源","locale":"zh-CN"},"3009":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-17","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"在 ModelScope 与 Hugging Face 之间选择","locale":"zh-CN"},"3010":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-18","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#自动与手动模式","content":"自定义 GitHub 或 Hugging Face 地址只有在关闭自动选择并启用对应手动镜像后才可填写。请使用包含 `http://` 或 `https://` 和主机名的完整地址。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3011":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-19","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#推荐配置顺序","content":"模型下载源只影响使用内置模型下载能力的操作，不会移动现有模型，也不会改变扩展从 Git 仓库下载的来源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3012":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-20","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#推荐配置顺序","content":"镜像可能缺少最新提交、返回不同文件或延迟同步。安装结果出现异常时，应使用官方来源重试并核对任务输出；不要通过关闭校验来接受不一致文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3013":{"id":"/docs/settings-mirrors-21","page_id":"/docs/settings-mirrors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-mirrors#推荐配置顺序","content":"如果所有来源都连接失败，优先检查系统时间、DNS、代理和防火墙；如果只有某一种资源失败，再检查对应镜像或切换模型下载源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3014":{"id":"/docs/settings-network","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","type":"page","content":"网络与代理","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-network","locale":"zh-CN"},"3015":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-network","content":"配置系统代理、手动代理或直接连接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3016":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-network#选择代理模式","content":"选择代理模式","locale":"zh-CN"},"3017":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-network#配置手动代理","content":"配置手动代理","locale":"zh-CN"},"3018":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-network","content":"代理设置控制后端下载、托管服务以及之后启动的任务和终端怎样访问网络。它与镜像设置相互独立：代理决定“怎样连接”，镜像决定“连接哪个来源”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3019":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-network#选择代理模式","content":"应用 API 服务器运行后，约每 30\n秒检测一次系统代理，页面下方显示当前生效的地址。系统报告未配置代理时使用直连。检测出错时，若本次代理设置已有成功检测的结果，应用会沿用该结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3020":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-network#选择代理模式","content":"所有相关网络操作使用你填写的代理 URL。适合系统代理无法被检测，或只希望 Hanafubuki\n使用指定代理的情况。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3021":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-network#选择代理模式","content":"忽略系统代理和手动代理，使用直接连接。可用于直连网络，也可用于判断失败是否由错误代理造成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3022":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-network#配置手动代理","content":"手动地址必须包含协议、主机和明确端口，例如：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3023":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-network#配置手动代理","content":"支持 `http`、`https`、`socks`、`socks4`、`socks4a`、`socks5` 和 `socks5h`。只填写 `127.0.0.1`、省略端口或使用 `ftp` 等协议都会被拒绝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3024":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-network#配置手动代理","content":"应用会把生效的代理同步到正在运行的应用和实例 API 服务器。新启动的子进程也会采用新设置。已经启动的 WebUI、命令或普通终端保留原来的环境，若需要使用新代理，请重新启动对应进程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3025":{"id":"/docs/settings-network-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-network#配置手动代理","content":"如果代理 URL\n包含用户名或密码，不要把完整地址复制到公开日志、截图或问题报告中。生成诊断包后也应先检查再分享。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3026":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","type":"page","content":"路径","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-paths","locale":"zh-CN"},"3027":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths","content":"管理产物缓存、默认安装目录和受管运行时存储。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3028":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-paths#缓存与默认安装目录","content":"缓存与默认安装目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"3029":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-paths#受管运行时存储","content":"受管运行时存储","locale":"zh-CN"},"3030":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-paths#迁移受管运行时","content":"迁移受管运行时","locale":"zh-CN"},"3031":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-paths#填写新目录","content":"填写新目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"3032":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-paths#预览组件位置","content":"预览组件位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"3033":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-paths#安排迁移","content":"安排迁移","locale":"zh-CN"},"3034":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-paths#正常退出并重新启动","content":"正常退出并重新启动","locale":"zh-CN"},"3035":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-paths#验证结果","content":"验证结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"3036":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths","content":"路径页包含两类位置：普通下载与实例默认路径，以及应用自己维护的运行时存储。它们用途不同，修改其中一个不会自动迁移其他目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3037":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#缓存与默认安装目录","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"3038":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#缓存与默认安装目录","content":"影响","locale":"zh-CN"},"3039":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#缓存与默认安装目录","content":"产物缓存目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"3040":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#缓存与默认安装目录","content":"后续安装和下载任务用于保存、复用下载产物的位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"3041":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#缓存与默认安装目录","content":"默认 WebUI 安装目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"3042":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#缓存与默认安装目录","content":"新建实例时预填的根目录；不会移动或改写已有实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"3043":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-16","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#缓存与默认安装目录","content":"WebUI 下载目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"3044":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-17","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#缓存与默认安装目录","content":"内嵌 WebUI 下载文件的保存位置，参阅 WebView","locale":"zh-CN"},"3045":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-18","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#缓存与默认安装目录","content":"这些字段必须手动保存。保存时后端会验证并准备目录，因此不要在输入尚未完成时按 `Enter`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3046":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-19","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#缓存与默认安装目录","content":"使用便携版时，Launcher 每次启动都会把这三个设置恢复为当前便携工作区的默认目录。已有实例仍使用各自登记的位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3047":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-20","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#缓存与默认安装目录","content":"修改产物缓存不会移动旧缓存，也不会删除原目录。确认新任务工作正常后，再通过系统文件管理器自行评估旧缓存是否可以清理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3048":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-21","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#受管运行时存储","content":"受管运行时存储是 Hanafubuki 自己维护的目录，包含：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3049":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-22","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#受管运行时存储","content":"应用 Standalone Python；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3050":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-23","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#受管运行时存储","content":"Micromamba 可执行文件；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3051":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-24","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#受管运行时存储","content":"Conda 根目录和包缓存；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3052":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-25","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#受管运行时存储","content":"已校验的 Launcher Python 代码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3053":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-26","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#受管运行时存储","content":"它不包含 WebUI 实例、模型、普通产物缓存或诊断包。若只是想改变新实例的位置，应修改“默认 WebUI 安装目录”，不要迁移受管运行时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3054":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-27","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#迁移受管运行时","content":"如果之前已迁移到自定义位置，点击“迁移到默认位置”会预览返回默认目录的计划。核对目标后再安排重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3055":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-28","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#填写新目录","content":"最终目标必须是一个尚不存在的新目录，不能与应用数据、已有实例或组件路径重叠，也不能经过符号链接。使用浏览按钮定位父目录后，可在输入框末尾补上新的子目录名。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3056":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-29","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#预览组件位置","content":"点击“迁移”，检查确认窗口列出的 Python、Micromamba、Conda 和 Launcher Code 目标位置。此时只生成计划，不会复制文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3057":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-30","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#安排迁移","content":"点击“下次重启时迁移”。页面会记录待迁移目标；如果还没有退出应用，可以点击“取消已安排的迁移”撤销计划。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3058":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-31","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#正常退出并重新启动","content":"先完成正在运行的实例、终端和维护任务，再通过正常方式退出应用。重新启动后，启动页会在加载其他功能前完成迁移。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3059":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-32","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#验证结果","content":"应用打开后回到“路径”和“运行环境”，确认当前运行时根目录以及 Python、Micromamba、Git 状态正常。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3060":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-33","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#验证结果","content":"迁移不会把运行时合并到已有目录。迁移期间不要移动源目录、预先创建目标目录或同时启动第二个\nHanafubuki 进程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3061":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-34","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#验证结果","content":"若迁移失败，应用会继续使用仍然有效的原位置，并显示需要恢复的记录。排除磁盘空间、权限或目标冲突后点击“下次重启时重试”，再正常退出和启动；不要直接删除源目录或目标暂存内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3062":{"id":"/docs/settings-paths-35","page_id":"/docs/settings-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-paths#验证结果","content":"若出现“托管运行时存储配置需要处理”，本次启动会暂用默认目录，并在提示中列出需要处理的配置文件。应用保留原文件并暂停迁移。文件损坏时可修复后重启；若它由更新版本的 Hanafubuki 写入，请用相应版本重新打开。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3063":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","type":"page","content":"运行环境","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-runtime","locale":"zh-CN"},"3064":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime","content":"检查并配置应用 Python、Micromamba 和 Git。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3065":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"阅读状态面板","locale":"zh-CN"},"3066":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择应用-python","content":"选择应用 Python","locale":"zh-CN"},"3067":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择-git-来源","content":"选择 Git 来源","locale":"zh-CN"},"3068":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-runtime#失败排查","content":"失败排查","locale":"zh-CN"},"3069":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime","content":"运行环境页显示 Hanafubuki 自己依赖的 Python、Micromamba 和 Git。它们属于应用级运行时，与每个 WebUI 实例自己的 Python 和 Core 相互独立。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3070":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"每个面板会显示当前状态、准备步骤、错误和已检测信息：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3071":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"面板","locale":"zh-CN"},"3072":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"重点信息","locale":"zh-CN"},"3073":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"应用运行环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"3074":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"Python 版本、可执行文件、Python 目录、Launcher Code 和应用 API","locale":"zh-CN"},"3075":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"Micromamba","locale":"zh-CN"},"3076":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"内置版本、检测版本、可执行文件和 SHA-256","locale":"zh-CN"},"3077":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"Git","locale":"zh-CN"},"3078":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"检测版本、可执行文件、安装任务和 Conda 根修复状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"3079":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#阅读状态面板","content":"状态为“准备中”时查看当前步骤，不要连续点击重试。状态为“失败”时先展开错误，记录失败阶段和详细信息；面板允许重试时再使用重试按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3080":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-16","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择应用-python","content":"“应用 Python 版本”支持当前界面列出的 Python 版本。修改会立即保存，但只在下次启动时切换应用运行时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3081":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-17","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择应用-python","content":"切换应用 Python 不会重装实例 Python，也不会改变实例选用的 Python 版本。实例环境问题应在对应实例的管理页处理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3082":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-18","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择-git-来源","content":"来源","locale":"zh-CN"},"3083":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-19","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择-git-来源","content":"行为","locale":"zh-CN"},"3084":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-20","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择-git-来源","content":"优先使用系统 Git","locale":"zh-CN"},"3085":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-21","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择-git-来源","content":"下次启动时检查系统 `PATH` 中的 Git；不可用时自动回退到 Micromamba Git","locale":"zh-CN"},"3086":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-22","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择-git-来源","content":"使用 Micromamba Git","locale":"zh-CN"},"3087":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-23","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择-git-来源","content":"跳过系统 Git，始终使用应用托管的 Git","locale":"zh-CN"},"3088":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-24","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#选择-git-来源","content":"Git 来源同样在下次应用启动时生效。系统已经安装可用 Git 时通常保留默认选择；需要固定、隔离的 Git 环境时再选择 Micromamba。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3089":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-25","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#失败排查","content":"Python 下载或校验失败：检查网络、代理、镜像、磁盘空间和受管运行时目录权限。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3090":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-26","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#失败排查","content":"Micromamba 失败：确认没有第二个应用进程占用运行时，并检查目标磁盘是否可写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3091":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-27","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#失败排查","content":"Git 等待 Micromamba：先让 Micromamba 完成准备，这不是独立的 Git 卡死。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3092":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-28","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#失败排查","content":"“无法读取状态”下方的“重试”会重新读取状态。若提示实时状态不可用，重新进入运行环境页可重新订阅并读取当前结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3093":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-29","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#失败排查","content":"要重新执行准备流程，使用对应运行时状态旁或错误详情里的“重试”。应用运行环境和 Micromamba 在空闲或失败时提供该操作，Git 在失败后提供。反复失败时可从诊断收集错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3094":{"id":"/docs/settings-runtime-30","page_id":"/docs/settings-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-runtime#失败排查","content":"不要从外部覆盖受管 Python、Micromamba、Conda 或 Launcher\nCode。应用会按自己的版本和校验规则准备这些组件，手动修改可能在下次检查时被判定为损坏。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3095":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","type":"page","content":"WebView","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-webview","locale":"zh-CN"},"3096":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-0","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview","content":"控制应用内 WebUI 页面的保留、各实例的浏览数据共用、新窗口处理，以及 WebView 数据的查看与清除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3097":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-1","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-webview#字段说明","content":"字段说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"3098":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-2","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-webview#离开工作区时保留-webui-页面","content":"离开工作区时保留 WebUI 页面","locale":"zh-CN"},"3099":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-3","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-webview#在实例之间共用缓存与-cookie","content":"在实例之间共用缓存与 Cookie","locale":"zh-CN"},"3100":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-4","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-webview#webui-打开新窗口时","content":"WebUI 打开新窗口时","locale":"zh-CN"},"3101":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-5","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-webview#在外部浏览器中打开-webui","content":"在外部浏览器中打开 WebUI","locale":"zh-CN"},"3102":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-6","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-webview#下载","content":"下载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3103":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-7","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-webview#webview-数据","content":"WebView 数据","locale":"zh-CN"},"3104":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-8","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings-webview#排查页面显示问题","content":"排查页面显示问题","locale":"zh-CN"},"3105":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-9","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview","content":"WebUI 启动后显示在应用内置的浏览器（WebView）中。这个设置页决定该浏览器的行为，并显示它保存在磁盘上的数据。这里的设置只影响页面如何显示，不会启动、停止或修改 WebUI 本身。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3106":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-10","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview","content":"WebView 使用系统提供的浏览器引擎：Windows 为 Microsoft Edge WebView2，Linux 为 WebKitGTK，macOS 为 WebKit。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3107":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-11","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#字段说明","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"3108":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-12","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#字段说明","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"3109":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-13","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#字段说明","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3110":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-14","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#字段说明","content":"离开工作区时保留 WebUI 页面","locale":"zh-CN"},"3111":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-15","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#字段说明","content":"开启","locale":"zh-CN"},"3112":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-16","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#字段说明","content":"切换到其他工作区或实例后，页面是否原样保留","locale":"zh-CN"},"3113":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-17","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#字段说明","content":"在实例之间共用缓存与 Cookie","locale":"zh-CN"},"3114":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-18","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#字段说明","content":"开启","locale":"zh-CN"},"3115":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-19","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#字段说明","content":"所有实例是否使用同一套浏览数据","locale":"zh-CN"},"3116":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-20","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#字段说明","content":"WebUI 打开新窗口时","locale":"zh-CN"},"3117":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-21","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#字段说明","content":"内置弹窗，并提供外部浏览器选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"3118":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-22","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#字段说明","content":"页面请求打开新窗口时如何处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"3119":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-23","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#字段说明","content":"GPU 加速（Linux）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3120":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-24","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#字段说明","content":"开启","locale":"zh-CN"},"3121":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-25","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#字段说明","content":"使用显卡绘制应用窗口和内嵌 WebUI","locale":"zh-CN"},"3122":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-26","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#字段说明","content":"这些设置会自动保存。在 Linux 上，如果窗口卡住或一片空白，可以关闭“GPU 加速”并重启 Hanafubuki，让 WebKitGTK 改用 CPU 绘制。这项设置只影响界面绘制，模型推理仍沿用实例自己的配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3123":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-27","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#离开工作区时保留-webui-页面","content":"开启时，再次进入工作区会看到离开时的页面，包括未提交的输入和滚动位置，不会重新加载。关闭后，离开工作区会关闭页面，再次进入时重新加载。无论是否开启，WebUI 本身都会继续运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3124":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-28","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#离开工作区时保留-webui-页面","content":"保留的页面在标题栏的 WebUI 标签页中列出和切换。在同一实例的多个界面之间切换不算离开工作区，始终保留，不受此设置影响。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3125":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-29","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#在实例之间共用缓存与-cookie","content":"开启时，所有实例使用同一份浏览数据。在其他实例访问同一站点时，该站点可以沿用已保存的登录状态。关闭后每个实例使用独立的缓存、Cookie 和站点数据。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3126":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-30","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#在实例之间共用缓存与-cookie","content":"修改后，已经打开的 WebUI 仍使用打开时的存储，重新打开后才会切换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3127":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-31","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#webui-打开新窗口时","content":"页面通过链接或脚本请求打开新窗口时（例如 `target=\"_blank\"` 链接或弹窗式登录），按以下选项处理：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3128":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-32","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#webui-打开新窗口时","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"3129":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-33","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#webui-打开新窗口时","content":"行为","locale":"zh-CN"},"3130":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-34","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#webui-打开新窗口时","content":"内置弹窗，并提供外部浏览器选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"3131":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-35","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#webui-打开新窗口时","content":"打开内置弹窗，同时在 WebUI 中提示“已在新窗口中打开”，可改用外部浏览器打开","locale":"zh-CN"},"3132":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-36","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#webui-打开新窗口时","content":"仅内置弹窗","locale":"zh-CN"},"3133":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-37","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#webui-打开新窗口时","content":"只打开内置弹窗，不显示提示","locale":"zh-CN"},"3134":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-38","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#webui-打开新窗口时","content":"外部浏览器","locale":"zh-CN"},"3135":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-39","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#webui-打开新窗口时","content":"拒绝页面的新窗口请求，改为在系统默认浏览器中打开目标地址","locale":"zh-CN"},"3136":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-40","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#webui-打开新窗口时","content":"内置弹窗与 WebUI 共用登录状态，弹窗式登录流程依赖这一点；但它没有工具栏，并且在 macOS 上无法下载文件。选择“外部浏览器”时，页面会被告知其窗口已被拦截，弹窗式登录会失败。此设置对之后打开的 WebUI 页面生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3137":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-41","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#webui-打开新窗口时","content":"保留默认的“内置弹窗，并提供外部浏览器选项”。需要登录时它可以正常工作；需要下载或完整浏览器功能时，点击提示中的“在外部浏览器中打开”即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3138":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-42","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#webui-打开新窗口时","content":"无论选择哪一项，应用都会拒绝不安全的目标地址，并显示“链接已被阻止”：只允许 HTTP 和 HTTPS 地址，不允许地址中包含凭据、缺少主机名或长度过长的目标。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3139":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-43","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#在外部浏览器中打开-webui","content":"工作区中的“在外部浏览器中打开”按钮会把当前 WebUI 地址交给系统默认浏览器，应用内的页面保持不变。实例有多个界面时，打开的是当前正在显示的那一个。无法启动浏览器时，应用会显示“无法打开浏览器”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3140":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-44","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#下载","content":"在 WebUI 中下载的文件保存到路径中的“WebUI 下载目录”，默认为应用数据目录下的 `downloads` 文件夹；已有同名文件时自动在文件名后添加序号，不会覆盖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3141":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-45","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#下载","content":"普通 HTTP 和 HTTPS 下载显示在任务中心的“下载”标签页中，可以查看进度、暂停、继续和取消，关闭 WebUI 页面后仍会继续。页面在浏览器内生成的文件（`blob:` 或 `data:` 地址）由浏览器引擎直接保存，只显示结果，不能暂停或取消。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3142":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-46","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#webview-数据","content":"字段下方的“WebView 数据”面板显示：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3143":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-47","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#webview-数据","content":"引擎名称和版本；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3144":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-48","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#webview-数据","content":"存储目录、总占用，以及每份共用或实例存储的占用。切换过共用模式时，两种存储都可能留在磁盘上；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3145":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-49","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#webview-数据","content":"“使用中”标记符合当前共用设置的存储。若已打开的页面占用了某份存储，该行还会显示占用说明。关闭标签页后，点击面板上的刷新按钮重新检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3146":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-50","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#webview-数据","content":"要清除单份存储，先关闭使用它的 WebUI 标签页，再点击该行的垃圾桶并核对确认框中的名称。使用其他存储的页面可以继续打开。清除“所有实例共用”会影响使用这份存储的所有实例。要清除整个列表，先关闭所有 WebUI 标签页，再点击总占用旁的“清除 WebView 数据”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3147":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-51","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#webview-数据","content":"清除会永久删除所选范围内的缓存、Cookie 和站点设置，之后可能需要重新登录。实例文件、模型和输出会保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3148":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-52","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#排查页面显示问题","content":"点击“在外部浏览器中打开”。外部浏览器也无法打开时，问题在 WebUI 服务本身，而不是 WebView。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3149":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-53","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#排查页面显示问题","content":"<Card title=\"WebUI 标签页\" href=\"/docs/webui-tabs\" description=\"切换、打开和关闭 WebUI 页面。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"3150":{"id":"/docs/settings-webview-54","page_id":"/docs/settings-webview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings-webview#排查页面显示问题","content":"<Card title=\"实例启动与访问\" href=\"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start\" description=\"区分 WebUI 服务、地址捕获和嵌入页面的问题。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"3151":{"id":"/docs/settings","page_id":"/docs/settings","type":"page","content":"设置","breadcrumbs":["Hanafubuki 文档","设置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings","locale":"zh-CN"},"3152":{"id":"/docs/settings-0","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings","content":"了解设置的保存方式，并按分区配置 Hanafubuki。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3153":{"id":"/docs/settings-1","page_id":"/docs/settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings#设置怎样保存","content":"设置怎样保存","locale":"zh-CN"},"3154":{"id":"/docs/settings-2","page_id":"/docs/settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings#模块","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"3155":{"id":"/docs/settings-3","page_id":"/docs/settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/settings#按分区查找","content":"按分区查找","locale":"zh-CN"},"3156":{"id":"/docs/settings-4","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings","content":"设置窗口管理对整个应用生效的选项。侧栏显示当前模块提供的设置分区。要修改某个实例的路径、启动参数或维护选项，请打开该实例的管理页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3157":{"id":"/docs/settings-5","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#设置怎样保存","content":"不同字段采用不同的保存方式：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3158":{"id":"/docs/settings-6","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#设置怎样保存","content":"字段类型","locale":"zh-CN"},"3159":{"id":"/docs/settings-7","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#设置怎样保存","content":"保存方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"3160":{"id":"/docs/settings-8","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#设置怎样保存","content":"开关、下拉框","locale":"zh-CN"},"3161":{"id":"/docs/settings-9","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#设置怎样保存","content":"选择后自动保存","locale":"zh-CN"},"3162":{"id":"/docs/settings-10","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#设置怎样保存","content":"文本、数字","locale":"zh-CN"},"3163":{"id":"/docs/settings-11","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#设置怎样保存","content":"按 `Enter` 或离开输入框时自动保存","locale":"zh-CN"},"3164":{"id":"/docs/settings-12","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#设置怎样保存","content":"路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"3165":{"id":"/docs/settings-13","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#设置怎样保存","content":"修改后点击页面底部的“保存”","locale":"zh-CN"},"3166":{"id":"/docs/settings-14","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#设置怎样保存","content":"保存进度和结果显示在设置窗口右下角。若保存被拒绝，输入内容会保留在页面中，先根据错误补全或修正字段；不想继续修改时点击“放弃”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3167":{"id":"/docs/settings-15","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#设置怎样保存","content":"“恢复默认”与“放弃”含义不同：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3168":{"id":"/docs/settings-16","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#设置怎样保存","content":"**恢复默认**：把本分区改为应用默认值；普通字段会立即保存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3169":{"id":"/docs/settings-17","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#设置怎样保存","content":"**放弃**：撤销当前尚未成功保存的编辑，回到已经持久化的值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3170":{"id":"/docs/settings-18","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#设置怎样保存","content":"**路径分区的恢复默认**：只把默认路径填入输入框，仍需点击“保存”，避免未经确认就创建目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3171":{"id":"/docs/settings-19","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#设置怎样保存","content":"恢复默认不会删除已经下载的文件、移回实例、撤销运行时迁移，也不会恢复已经清理的日志。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3172":{"id":"/docs/settings-20","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#模块","content":"“设置 → 模块”有“平台”“功能”和“扩展”三个标签页。卡片列出模块的状态和它提供的功能，例如实例类型、任务来源或诊断内容。平台模块是应用必需的，已安装扩展的启停开关位于扩展页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3173":{"id":"/docs/settings-21","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#模块","content":"在“功能”中关闭模块时，如果出现确认提示，它会列出哪些模块会停止运行、哪些仍然运行但部分操作会失败，以及哪些实例维护任务需要等模块重新开启后重试。可配置的模块还有可展开的“设置”。例如，“管理 MCP 服务器”可以在这里设置端口以及是否允许已添加的外部客户端连接。管理 MCP 设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"3174":{"id":"/docs/settings-22","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#模块","content":"模块失败时，卡片会显示错误详情。如果已安排自动重启，卡片会显示提示，也可以点击“重新启动”立即重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3175":{"id":"/docs/settings-23","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#按分区查找","content":"<Card title=\"语言\" href=\"/docs/settings-language\" description=\"选择跟随系统、中文或英文界面。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"3176":{"id":"/docs/settings-24","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#按分区查找","content":"<Card title=\"外观\" href=\"/docs/settings-appearance\" description=\"配置主题、主题色和壁纸。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"3177":{"id":"/docs/settings-25","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#按分区查找","content":"<Card title=\"路径\" href=\"/docs/settings-paths\" description=\"管理缓存、默认安装目录和受管运行时存储。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"3178":{"id":"/docs/settings-26","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#按分区查找","content":"<Card title=\"网络与代理\" href=\"/docs/settings-network\" description=\"选择系统、手动或禁用代理。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"3179":{"id":"/docs/settings-27","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#按分区查找","content":"<Card title=\"镜像\" href=\"/docs/settings-mirrors\" description=\"配置软件包、代码和模型下载来源。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"3180":{"id":"/docs/settings-28","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#按分区查找","content":"<Card title=\"运行环境\" href=\"/docs/settings-runtime\" description=\"检查应用 Python、Micromamba 和 Git。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"3181":{"id":"/docs/settings-29","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#按分区查找","content":"<Card title=\"环境工具\" href=\"/docs/settings-environment-tools\" description=\"配置 uv、环境检查和 CUDA 显存优化。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"3182":{"id":"/docs/settings-30","page_id":"/docs/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/settings#按分区查找","content":"<Card title=\"API 服务器\" hr