属于应用层","content":"首页提示应用 Python、Micromamba 或 Git 准备失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3324":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-14","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#判断是否属于应用层","content":"所有实例的安装和管理能力都同时不可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3325":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-15","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#判断是否属于应用层","content":"设置或实例列表无法读取，但尚未开始具体 WebUI 任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3326":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-16","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#判断是否属于应用层","content":"应用更新下载、安装或重启失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3327":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-17","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#判断是否属于应用层","content":"如果只有一个实例启动时报 `ModuleNotFoundError`、CUDA 或扩展错误，通常应改查实例环境，而不是应用 Python。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3328":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-18","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#launcher-errors","content":"如果主应用还没打开，先在 Launcher 的错误页点“打开日志”。它会打开本次启动的文件，位于 Launcher 旁的 `.hanafubuki-launcher/logs/`。如果失败发生在日志创建之前，这个按钮会置灰，此时请记录窗口显示的阶段和完整错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3329":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-19","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#launcher-errors","content":"处理错误中指出的问题后，点“重试”重新执行准备流程。需要维护者协助时，点“反馈问题”会在浏览器打开项目的 GitHub Issues；你可以自行选择附上哪些报错和日志片段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3330":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-20","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#运行环境准备失败","content":"不要从其他安装包复制 Python、Micromamba、Conda 或 Launcher Code 覆盖受管目录。应用会校验自己的组件集合，手动替换可能产生新的完整性错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3331":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-21","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用-python-或-git-切换后无变化","content":"应用 Python 版本和 Git 来源在下次启动生效：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3332":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-22","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用-python-或-git-切换后无变化","content":"等待正在运行的安装、管理和 Agent 任务结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3333":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-23","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用-python-或-git-切换后无变化","content":"保存新的版本或来源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3334":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-24","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用-python-或-git-切换后无变化","content":"正常退出所有 Hanafubuki 窗口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3335":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-25","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用-python-或-git-切换后无变化","content":"重新启动后返回运行环境页核对实际路径和版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3336":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-26","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用-python-或-git-切换后无变化","content":"修改这些设置不会重装实例 Python，也不会修复某个 WebUI 扩展的依赖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3337":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-27","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#windows-smartscreen-阻止应用启动","content":"当前 Windows 安装包与便携版尚未签名。首次启动安装程序、免安装版或 Launcher 时，如果系统显示 `Windows 已保护你的电脑。Microsoft Defender SmartScreen 阻止了无法识别的应用启动。运行此应用可能会导致你的电脑存在风险。`，请确认文件来自本站，然后点击“更多信息”，再点击“仍然运行”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3338":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-28","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#windows-smartscreen-阻止应用启动","content":"“仍然运行”只会在展开“更多信息”后显示。只对从本站下载并核对过名称与平台的文件执行此操作；第三方转载或来源不明的文件应删除并重新下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3339":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-29","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#macos-提示应用已损坏","content":"当前 macOS 安装包与便携版尚未签名。首次打开时如果系统提示 `“Hanafubuki” is damaged and can't be opened` 或 `“Hanafubuki Launcher” is damaged and can't be opened`，请不要移到废纸篓。确认文件来自本站后，按照安装 Hanafubuki 的 macOS 步骤对相应 `.app` 执行 `xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine`，然后重新打开。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3340":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-30","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#macos-提示应用已损坏","content":"只对从本站下载并核对过名称与平台的应用移除隔离属性；第三方转载或来源不明的文件应删除并重新下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3341":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-31","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用界面或窗口异常","content":"应用仍能操作时，先记录出现异常的页面。若只有内嵌 WebUI 显示异常，在显示该页面时点标题栏的“在外部浏览器中打开”，用同一地址比较结果。Linux 上如果是整个窗口空白或卡住，且设置仍可打开，可先关闭“设置 → WebView → GPU 加速”并重启应用。WebView 设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"3342":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-32","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用界面或窗口异常","content":"窗口无法打开、持续白屏或启动即退出时：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3343":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-33","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用界面或窗口异常","content":"记录操作系统、Hanafubuki 版本和发生时间。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3344":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-34","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用界面或窗口异常","content":"检查应用日志与操作系统崩溃记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3345":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime-35","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-app-runtime#应用界面或窗口异常","content":"不要