content":"确需手动处理时使用实例终端，并在操作前创建快照。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3396":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-32","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#取消清理和重试","content":"取消只是请求。点击取消后等待任务进入“已取消”或明确失败；只有界面出现“重试进程清理”时才执行清理。清理完成后再“重试安装”，不要同时创建同路径的新实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3397":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-33","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#取消清理和重试","content":"若实例记录已保存但任务尚未启动，重新打开该实例并点击“开始安装”，不需要删除记录或重新创建同名实例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3398":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-34","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#取消清理和重试","content":"安装完成并已经获得 WebUI 地址后，模型、扩展、节点和生成错误应进入 WebUI\n上游问题，而不是反复重装应用运行环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3399":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-35","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#取消清理和重试","content":"<Card title=\"安装进度与故障处理\" href=\"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting\" description=\"理解安装阶段、日志和重试按钮。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"3400":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-36","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#取消清理和重试","content":"<Card title=\"网络与代理\" href=\"/docs/settings-network\" description=\"验证系统代理、手动代理和直连。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"3401":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-37","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#取消清理和重试","content":"<Card title=\"镜像\" href=\"/docs/settings-mirrors\" description=\"检查软件包、代码和模型来源。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"3402":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-38","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#取消清理和重试","cont