":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#管理功能暂不可用","content":"管理功能暂不可用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3412":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-8","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","content":"启动问题需要区分三个阶段：进程是否创建、WebUI 是否完成初始化、应用是否捕获到可访问地址。看到“正在启动”不代表 WebUI 已经就绪。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3413":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-9","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"进入实例工作区查看启动进度，或在“实例信息”中查看实时启动阶段、警告和最近失败。下表适用于会报告访问地址的 WebUI。扩展类型如果通过服务提供页面，应在“服务”中检查对应服务的状态和端点；有些类型可以运行而没有网页。实例信息与运行状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"3414":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-10","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"现象","locale":"zh-CN"},"3415":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-11","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"3416":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-12","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"启动任务立即失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"3417":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-13","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"参数校验、Python、Core、依赖或进程创建失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"3418":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-14","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"日志持续输出但没有地址","locale":"zh-CN"},"3419":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-15","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"WebUI 仍在加载模型/扩展，或没有输出可识别的监听地址","locale":"zh-CN"},"3420":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-16","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"进程退出并有 Python traceback","locale":"zh-CN"},"3421":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-17","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"Core、扩展、依赖或 PyTorch 在初始化时失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"3422":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-18","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"已捕获地址但嵌入页面打不开","locale":"zh-CN"},"3423":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-19","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"地址监听、浏览器呈现、代理或 WebView 问题","locale":"zh-CN"},"3424":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-20","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"外部浏览器可以打开","locale":"zh-CN"},"3425":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-21","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#阅读启动状态","content":"WebUI 本身已运行，重点检查嵌入呈现而不是重装实例","locale":"zh-CN"},"3426":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-22","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#launch-decisions","content":"主窗口一次显示一个启动决定。如果同时启动了多个实例，先核对弹窗中的实例 ID，底部会显示后面还有几项等待处理。选择“取消”或在弹窗内按 `Esc` 会取消这一次启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3427":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-23","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#launch-decisions","content":"提示","locale":"zh-CN"},"3428":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-24","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#launch-decisions","content":"可选操作和影响","locale":"zh-CN"},"3429":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-25","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#launch-decisions","content":"环境检查未通过","locale":"zh-CN"},"3430":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-26","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#launch-decisions","content":"查看退出码，选择“仍然继续”尝试启动，或取消并检查环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3431":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-27","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#launch-decisions","content":"PyTorch 不兼容","locale":"zh-CN"},"3432":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-28","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#launch-decisions","content":"对照已安装的版本、检测到的 GPU 和兼容类型。可忽略本次检查，或选择“前往 PyTorch 管理”，取消此次启动并打开对应实例的重装页面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3433":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-29","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#launch-decisions","content":"ComfyUI 依赖冲突","locale":"zh-CN"},"3434":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-30","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#launch-decisions","content":"先查看涉及的包和组件。若列出了可禁用的组件，可按方案禁用并继续，也可依次安装依赖或跳过冲突。依次安装后仍可能有版本不兼容。选择“前往扩展管理”会取消此次启动，方便你自行调整。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3435":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-31","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#launch-decisions","content":"启动参数有误","locale":"zh-CN"},"3436":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-32","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#launch-decisions","content":"对照错误项，选择仅本次忽略，或自动移除不兼容参数后启动。自动移除会保存修改。详见启动配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3437":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-33","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#启动后立即退出","content":"如果日志明确来自某个扩展，先禁用、更新或回退该扩展；如果来自 Core 与扩展接口不兼容，应同时核对两者版本。不要先卸载所有 Python 包，这会破坏进一步定位所需的环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3438":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-34","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#启动参数和环境变量","content":"在“启动”页检查原始参数解析错误、未知参数和互斥选项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3439":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-35","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#启动参数和环境变量","content":"原始参数只填写传给 WebUI 的内容，不包含 Python 或启动脚本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3440":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-36","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#启动参数和环境变量","content":"“仅本次忽略”只适合确认当前分支仍接受该参数，不应长期跳过同一警告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3441":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-37","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#启动参数和环境变量","content":"修改参数或环境变量后必须重新启动 WebUI，刷新页面不会改变已运行进程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3442":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-38","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#启动参数和环境变量","content":"不要用自定义 `PATH`、`PYTHONPATH`、`MAMBA_*` 或 `CONDA_*` 覆盖受管环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3443":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-39","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#端口和地址","content":"出现端口占用或无法连接时：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3444":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-40","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#端口和地址","content":"从启动日志确认实际监听地址和端口，不要只假设为 `7860`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3445":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-41","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#端口和地址","content":"使用任务中心和系统工具确认是否有旧 WebUI 或其他服务占用端口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3446":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-42","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#端口和地址","content":"旧任务属于 Hanafubuki 时，先完成原任务停止和清理，不要直接杀进程后立即重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3447":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-43","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#端口和地址","content":"需要改端口时在实例启动参数中使用当前 WebUI 支持的端口选项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3448":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-44","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#端口和地址","content":"重启后确认日志、捕获地址和浏览器打开的端口一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3449":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-45","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#端口和地址","content":"监听 `127.0.0.1` 通常只允许本机访问；监听所有网卡或开放远程连接会扩大安全边界。不要为了排查本地页面而无条件开启远程访问。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3450":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-46","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#有地址但页面打不开","content":"依次检查：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3451":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-47","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#有地址但页面打不开","content":"WebUI 进程是否仍在运行，而不是启动后立刻退出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3452":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-48","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#有地址但页面打不开","content":"地址中的协议、主机和端口是否与日志一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3453":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-49","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#有地址但页面打不开","content":"使用系统浏览器打开捕获地址，区分 WebUI 服务和嵌入 WebView。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3454":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-50","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#有地址但页面打不开","content":"浏览器代理、翻译扩展、缓存或安全软件是否修改了本地页面请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3455":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-51","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#有地址但页面打不开","content":"WebUI 是否配置了认证、子路径或仅允许特定主机访问。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3456":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-52","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#有地址但页面打不开","content":"页面能打开但生成、模型或节点失败时，启动已经成功，应转到 WebUI 上游问题。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3457":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-53","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#管理功能暂不可用","content":"实例管理能力可能在 WebUI 尚未准备、管理 API 恢复中、维护操作占用或旧任务未清理时暂不可用。先查看“实例信息”的管理 API 和运行状态，等待恢复或使用界面提供的重试。维护页仍可用于查看和恢复实例生命周期操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3458":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-54","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start#管理功能暂不可用","content":"<Card title=\"启动配置\" href=\"/docs/instance-launch\" description=\"检查参数、环境变量和启动前校验。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"3459":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start-55","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-instance-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url