leshooting-task-cleanup#认识任务状态","content":"等待，不创建替代任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"3520":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-16","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#认识任务状态","content":"失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"3521":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-17","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#认识任务状态","content":"业务操作失败，进程可能已经或尚未清理","locale":"zh-CN"},"3522":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-18","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#认识任务状态","content":"展开错误和清理状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"3523":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-19","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#认识任务状态","content":"等待清理","locale":"zh-CN"},"3524":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-20","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#认识任务状态","content":"无法确认终止、缺席或元数据释放","locale":"zh-CN"},"3525":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-21","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#认识任务状态","content":"使用原任务提供的清理重试","locale":"zh-CN"},"3526":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-22","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#认识任务状态","content":"已取消/已完成","locale":"zh-CN"},"3527":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-23","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#认识任务状态","content":"任务进入终态","locale":"zh-CN"},"3528":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-24","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#认识任务状态","content":"再开始后续操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"3