":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-33","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#实例提示被占用","content":"不要创建同路径的新实例，也不要手动移动正在恢复的目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3538":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-34","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#实例提示被占用","content":"不同实例可以并行工作；如果所有实例都被阻止，继续检查应用运行环境或共享运行时，而不是把问题归因于单个实例锁。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3539":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-35","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#后台终端和长时间命令","content":"实例终端离开页面后仍可能保留，重新进入可恢复输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3540":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-36","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#后台终端和长时间命令","content":"Agent 后台终端使用 `/ps` 查看、使用 `/stop` 清理；它与停止当前 Agent 回答不同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3541":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-37","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#后台终端和长时间命令","content":"开发服务器和文件监听器可能没有新输出，但仍占用端口和文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3542":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-38","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#后台终端和长时间命令","content":"终端显示“清理失败”时应重试同一会话的关闭，不要连续创建新终端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3543":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-39","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#什么时候可以重试业务操作","content":"只有同时满足以下条件时再重试：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3544":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-40","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup#什么时候可以重试业务操作","content":"原任务已经进入完成、失败或取消终态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3545":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-task-cleanup-41","page_id":"/docs/troubleshoo