/webui-install-options-76","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-options#各类型可用选项","content":"分支与设备列表来自当前安装目录，因此具体选项可能随安装器和平台变化。RVC Next WebUI 和 Mizuoto TTS WebUI 会在首次使用时自行下载所需模型，因此安装时没有预下载选项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3808":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-options-77","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-options#python","content":"界面允许选择 Python 3.10 至 3.15，但并不表示每个 WebUI 的每个版本都兼容全部 Python 版本。“类型默认值”是当前项目经过配置的默认版本，通常最稳妥。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3809":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-options-78","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-options#python","content":"更换 Python 版本不会复用系统 Python；应用会在实例的 Python 目录中准备独立运行时。导入现有实例时，所选 Python 目录也必须包含可正常执行的独立 Python。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3810":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-options-79","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-options#pytorch-构建与设备系列","content":"Stable Diffusion WebUI、ComfyUI、Fooocus、SD Trainer、Qwen TTS、RVC Next 和 Mizuoto TTS 使用“PyTorch 构建”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3811":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-options-80","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-options#pytorch-构建与设备系列","content":"InvokeAI 使用更高层的“设备系列”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3812":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-options-81","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-options#pytorch-构建与设备系列","content":"选择“自动”表示不固定构建，让当前安装器按环境决定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3813":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-options-82","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-options#pytorch-构建与设备系列","content":"只有明确知道显卡驱动、CUDA、ROCm 或 CPU 需求时，才手动固定选项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3814":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-options-83","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-options#pytorch-构建与设备系列","content":"手动选择不匹配的构建可能导致安装成功但启动时无法使用显卡。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3815":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-options-84","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-options#分支","content":"Stable Diffusion WebUI、Fooocus 和 SD Trainer 可以选择安装目录返回的分支预设。Stable Diffusion WebUI 的“默认分支”为 `sd_webui_forge_neo`；Fooocus 和 SD Trainer 的“默认分支”不写入额外覆盖。指定分支会成为实例后续重装和版本管理的基准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3816":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-options-85","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-options#分支","content":"每个预设对应的仓库、分支和子模块见支持的变体。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3817":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-options-86","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-options#预下载模型与扩展","content":"每个预下载选项有三种状态：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3818":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-options-87","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-options#预下载模型与扩展","content":"选择","locale":"zh-CN"},"3819":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-options-88","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-options#预下载模型与扩展","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"3820":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-options-89","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-options#预下载模型与扩展","content":"使用安装器默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"3821":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-options-90","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-options#预下载模型与扩展","content":"不强制启用或禁用，由当前 WebUI 安装器决定","locale":"zh-CN"},"3822":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-options-91","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-options#预下载模型与扩展","content":"启用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3823":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-options-92","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-options","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-options#预下载模型与扩展","content":"明确要求安装器执行预下载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3824":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-options-93","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-options","ta