ntent":"安装诊断可能包含环境变量、本地路径、命令输出、凭据或令牌。分享前先解压检查并脱敏，详见实例诊断。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3860":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#请求取消","content":"运行中且允许取消时，点击“取消安装”。取消是一个请求；应等待界面进入“已取消”或失败状态，不要立即删除目录或退出进程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3861":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#检查清理状态","content":"如果子进程已经确认结束，界面会释放本次安装的所有权。如果终止或检查失败，错误中会保留待处理的清理义务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3862":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#重试进程清理","content":"只有界面显示“重试进程清理”时才使用它。该操作只确认并释放残留进程状态，不会重新安装 Python 或 Core。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3863":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#重新安装","content":"清理完成后点击“重试安装”。应用会创建新的安装操作，并从当前实例状态重新执行需要的步骤。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3864":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-35","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#重新安装","content":"不要通过任务管理器强行结束后立刻重复创建同一路径的实例；后端仍可能保留需要确认的进程和实例状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3865":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-36","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#按错误类型处理","content":"如果需要换一组安装选项，先在尚未安装的提示页或失败后的工作区选择“修改参数…”。返回会放弃本页修改；选择“使用这些参数安装”或“使用这些参数重试”后，新参数也会用于之后的安装。如果选择了强制重建，应用会在删除所选组件目录前再次确认。重装与目录归属","locale":"zh-CN"},"3866":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-37","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#按错误类型处理","content":"现象或错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"3867":{"id":"/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-38","page_id":"/docs/webui-install-