covery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery#恢复前兼容性检查","content":"CPython，且主次版本属于应用支持范围","locale":"zh-CN"},"4143":{"id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery-26","page_id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery#恢复前兼容性检查","content":"平台","locale":"zh-CN"},"4144":{"id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery-27","page_id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery#恢复前兼容性检查","content":"Windows、macOS 或 Linux 平台必须与当前系统兼容","locale":"zh-CN"},"4145":{"id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery-28","page_id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery#恢复前兼容性检查","content":"快照不会自动跨平台转换 Python 环境，也不会替换成另一种 WebUI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4146":{"id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery-29","page_id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery#选择快照恢复","content":"在首页点击“添加实例”，将来源切换为“从快照恢复”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4147":{"id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery-30","page_id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery#选择-webui-类型","content":"选择快照原本所属的内置 WebUI。向导在此模式下只列出支持从快照创建实例的类型。若已有安装的类型仅支持扫描挂载，请改用扫描系统。提交时应用还会核对 JSON 中的类型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4148":{"id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery-31","page_id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery#设置名称与根目录","content":"名称可以留空。推荐将安装根目录留空或选择一个新的专用目录；手动选择的目录就是最终实例根目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4149":{"id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery-32","page_id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery#确认-python-和-core","content":"标准恢复保留默认的 `<实例根目录>/python` 和 `<实例根目录>/core`。不要把包含重要未备份修改的现有 Core 作为恢复目标。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4150":{"id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery-33","page_id":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/webui-snapshot-recovery#选择快照-json","content":"在“快照 JSON 文件”中选择原实例 `snapshots` 目录里的文件。原始