/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#cancel-clean-up-and-retry","content":"Cancel, clean up, and retry","locale":"en"},"7695":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-6","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","content":"Installation prepares the instance Python, Core, dependencies, and optional resources in sequence. The progress percentage is based on stages, not downloaded bytes. If a stage takes a long time, first check whether the log is still producing output.","locale":"en"},"7696":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-7","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#locate-the-failing-stage-first","content":"Expand the log in the installation workspace and record the current stage and the last normal\noutput.","locale":"en"},"7697":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-8","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#locate-the-failing-stage-first","content":"Start reading at the first `error`, exception, or non-zero exit instead of looking only at the\nfinal **Installation failed** message.","locale":"en"},"7698":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-9","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#locate-the-failing-stage-first","content":"Open the same installation activity in Task Center and copy the retained output. If you see a\ntruncation marker, save the evidence promptly.","locale":"en"},"7699":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-10","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#locate-the-failing-stage-first","content":"Change only one relevant setting for the error category below, then retry the same installation\noperation.","locale":"en"},"7700":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-11","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"Symptom","locale":"en"},"7701":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-12","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"Check first","locale":"en"},"7702":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-13","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"Connection timeout, reset, or DNS failure","locale":"en"},"7703":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-14","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"Current network, proxy mode, proxy port, and firewall","locale":"en"},"7704":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-15","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"SSL or certificate error","locale":"en"},"7705":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-16","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"System time, HTTPS inspection software, proxy method, and target certificate","locale":"en"},"7706":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-17","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"Only GitHub, Hugging Face, or PyPI fails","locale":"en"},"7707":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-18","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"Availability of the corresponding mirror or target site","locale":"en"},"7708":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-19","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"File checksum or size mismatch","locale":"en"},"7709":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-20","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"Mirror cache or interrupted download; switch back to the official source and download again","locale":"en"},"7710":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-21","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"HTTP 401 or 403","locale":"en"},"7711":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-22","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"Whether the address requires authentication, token permissions, rate limits, or regional policies","locale":"en"},"7712":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-23","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"A proxy determines *how to connect*; a mirror determines *which source to connect to*. First compare proxy and direct connections, then adjust the relevant mirror. Changing several settings at once makes the result impossible to interpret.","locale":"en"},"7713":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-24","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#network-proxy-and-mirrors","content":"Installation child processes that have already started retain their old environment after proxy settings change. Let the old task reach a failed, canceled, or completed terminal state before creating another task.","locale":"en"},"7714":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-25","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#paths-permissions-and-disk-space","content":"Use a separate, writable instance root that does not overlap another instance.","locale":"en"},"7715":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-26","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#paths-permissions-and-disk-space","content":"If the path does not exist, overlaps a dangerous location, passes through a symbolic link, or contains conflicting files, choose a new directory as instructed by the interface.","locale":"en"},"7716":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-27","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#paths-permissions-and-disk-space","content":"Check both the system drive and the drive containing the instance. Python package installation and extraction may also use temporary space.","locale":"en"},"7717":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-28","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#paths-permissions-and-disk-space","content":"For access-denied errors, check whether the file is in use by WebUI, a terminal, an editor, security software, or another application process.","locale":"en"},"7718":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-29","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#paths-permissions-and-disk-space","content":"Do not disable integrity checks or manually merge files from unknown sources merely to pass validation.","locale":"en"},"7719":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-30","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#dependency-and-pytorch-installation-failures","content":"`No module named`, compilation failures, and package version conflicts usually originate in the instance environment:","locale":"en"},"7720":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-31","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#dependency-and-pytorch-installation-failures","content":"Record the exact package name, required version, and earliest installation error.","locale":"en"},"7721":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-32","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#dependency-and-pytorch-installation-failures","content":"Confirm that the installation options match the current WebUI type and operating system.","locale":"en"},"7722":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-33","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#dependency-and-pytorch-installation-failures","content":"If PyTorch installation fails, restore **Automatic** or the type's default option and verify the GPU driver.","locale":"en"},"7723":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-34","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#dependency-and-pytorch-installation-failures","content":"If an extension dependency fails, first confirm that it belongs to an optional extension; do not immediately rebuild the entire Core.","locale":"en"},"7724":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-35","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#dependency-and-pytorch-installation-failures","content":"If manual intervention is truly necessary, use the instance terminal and create a snapshot first.","locale":"en"},"7725":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-36","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#cancel-clean-up-and-retry","content":"Cancellation is only a request. After selecting cancel, wait until the task reaches **Canceled** or a definite failure. Run cleanup only when the interface offers **Retry process cleanup**. Once cleanup completes, select **Retry installation**; do not create another instance at the same path at the same time.","locale":"en"},"7726":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-37","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#cancel-clean-up-and-retry","content":"If the instance record was saved but the task did not start, reopen that instance and select **Start installation**. You do not need to delete the record or recreate an instance with the same name.","locale":"en"},"7727":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-38","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network#cancel-clean-up-and-retry","content":"After installation completes and a WebUI address is available, model, extension, node, and\ngeneration errors belong under Upstream WebUI issues, not in\nrepeated application-runtime reinstalls.","locale":"en"},"7728":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-install-network-39","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshoo