he-issue-by-symptom","content":"Extension, dependency, and version corresponding to the error path","locale":"en"},"7913":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-19","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"Missing or red ComfyUI nodes","locale":"en"},"7914":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-20","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"Whether custom nodes are installed and imported successfully, plus inputs and upstream-node parameters","locale":"en"},"7915":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-21","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"Compressed WebUI layout, broken buttons, or models cannot be switched","locale":"en"},"7916":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-22","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"Browser translation, cache, extension frontend scripts, and WebUI version","locale":"en"},"7917":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-23","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"Generate button does nothing while the process remains active","locale":"en"},"7918":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-24","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#narrow-the-issue-by-symptom","content":"Browser console, WebUI terminal log, and queue state","locale":"en"},"7919":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-25","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#use-hanafubuki-for-minimal-diagnosis","content":"Create an environment snapshot and record the current Core, extensions, PyTorch, and model\nstate.","locale":"en"},"7920":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-26","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#use-hanafubuki-for-minimal-diagnosis","content":"Determine whether the error occurs only with a particular model, workflow, node, or extension.","locale":"en"},"7921":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-27","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#use-hanafubuki-for-minimal-diagnosis","content":"Inspect the traceback path. Disable or update the extension directly named there first; do not\nuninstall every extension at once.","locale":"en"},"7922":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-28","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#use-hanafubuki-for-minimal-diagnosis","content":"Use the **Versions**, **Extensions**, **PyTorch**, and **Models** pages for managed operations,\nreproducing the same scenario after each change.","locale":"en"},"7923":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-29","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#use-hanafubuki-for-minimal-diagnosis","content":"When package-inspection commands are necessary, run them in the instance terminal. Do not modify\nthe instance environment from the generic application terminal.","locale":"en"},"7924":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-30","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#sd-note-knowledge-base","content":"SD Note collects many common SD WebUI and ComfyUI errors and explains how to extract errors from the console. Once you confirm that the issue is upstream in WebUI, choose the relevant WebUI type:","locale":"en"},"7925":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-31","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#sd-note-knowledge-base","content":"<Card title=\"SD Note help overview\" href=\"https://sdnote.netlify.app/help/\" description=\"Learn how to find errors, search, and prepare support information.\" />","locale":"en"},"7926":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-32","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#sd-note-knowledge-base","content":"<Card title=\"Common SD WebUI issues\" href=\"https://sdnote.netlify.app/help/sd_webui/\" description=\"Look up SD WebUI, Forge, model, and extension errors.\" />","locale":"en"},"7927":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-33","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#sd-note-knowledge-base","content":"<Card title=\"Common ComfyUI issues\" href=\"https://sdnote.netlify.app/help/comfyui/\" description=\"Look up node, workflow, dependency, and custom-node errors.\" />","locale":"en"},"7928":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-34","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#sd-note-knowledge-base","content":"Some SD Note instructions target the Huishi Launcher. The root cause and upstream remedy may still\nbe relevant, but version, extension, PyTorch, terminal, proxy, and environment operations must be\nperformed on the corresponding Hanafubuki pages. Do not copy another launcher's managed\ndirectories or directly run its launcher-specific repair commands.","locale":"en"},"7929":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-35","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#sd-note-knowledge-base","content":"If SD Note does not cover the issue, search official repository issues using the exception type, final-line description, WebUI name, and extension name. Prefer guidance from Core or extension authors, and check which versions and operating systems a solution applies to.","locale":"en"},"7930":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-36","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"Scope","locale":"en"},"7931":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-37","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"Recommended recipient","locale":"en"},"7932":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-38","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"Hanafubuki cannot install, start, or manage an instance","locale":"en"},"7933":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-39","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"Hanafubuki maintainers","locale":"en"},"7934":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-40","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"WebUI Core reproduces in a standalone environment","locale":"en"},"7935":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-41","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"The corresponding official WebUI repository","locale":"en"},"7936":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-42","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"The issue appears only after enabling one extension or node","locale":"en"},"7937":{"id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui-43","page_id":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/troubleshooting-webui#who-should-receive-the-report","content":"Extension or node