ntent":"Installing Python","locale":"en"},"8187":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#understand-installation-stages","content":"Downloading, extracting, and checking the instance's standalone Python","locale":"en"},"8188":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#understand-installation-stages","content":"Running install steps","locale":"en"},"8189":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#understand-installation-stages","content":"Executing the steps declared by the extension type. Open the log for their output.","locale":"en"},"8190":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#understand-installation-stages","content":"Installing Core","locale":"en"},"8191":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#understand-installation-stages","content":"Downloading or restoring WebUI, then installing dependencies, models, and extension options","locale":"en"},"8192":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#understand-installation-stages","content":"Removing Python / Core","locale":"en"},"8193":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#understand-installation-stages","content":"Removing managed components selected during reinstallation","locale":"en"},"8194":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#understand-installation-stages","content":"Completed","locale":"en"},"8195":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#understand-installation-stages","content":"The instance is ready; the workspace continues by preparing services and starting WebUI","locale":"en"},"8196":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#understand-installation-stages","content":"Failed / Canceled","locale":"en"},"8197":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#understand-installation-stages","content":"The installation task has ended; you can inspect errors, clean up, or retry","locale":"en"},"8198":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#understand-installation-stages","content":"The progress percentage is based on completed stages, not downloaded bytes or file count. If a stage remains at one percentage for a long time, it may simply be downloading or installing a large dependency. Expand **View log** to confirm whether output continues.","locale":"en"},"8199":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#inspect-and-preserve-output","content":"Select **View log** to expand a read-only terminal on the current page.","locale":"en"},"8200":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#inspect-and-preserve-output","content":"Select **Open in Task Center** to view the same task's complete state and retained output.","locale":"en"},"8201":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#inspect-and-preserve-output","content":"Use the copy button to preserve the current log. Long-retained task output may be truncated by capacity limits.","locale":"en"},"8202":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#inspect-and-preserve-output","content":"On failure, the log expands automatically and shows diagnostic, cleanup, and retry actions.","locale":"en"},"8203":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#inspect-and-preserve-output","content":"Installation diagnostics may contain environment variables, local paths, command output,\ncredentials, or tokens. Extract, inspect, and redact the bundle before sharing. See Instance\nDiagnostics.","locale":"en"},"8204":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#request-cancellation","content":"While a running task permits cancellation, select **Cancel installation**. Cancellation is a request; wait for the interface to enter a canceled or failed state instead of immediately deleting directories or exiting processes.","locale":"en"},"8205":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#check-cleanup-state","content":"Once the child process is confirmed stopped, the interface releases ownership for this installation. If termination or inspection fails, the error retains the unresolved cleanup obligation.","locale":"en"},"8206":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#retry-process-cleanup","content":"Use **Retry process cleanup** only when the interface displays it. This action only confirms and releases lingering process state; it does not reinstall Python or Core.","locale":"en"},"8207":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#reinstall","content":"After cleanup completes, select **Retry installation**. The application creates a new installation operation and repeats the necessary steps based on the current instance state.","locale":"en"},"8208":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-35","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#reinstall","content":"Do not force-end a process in the system task manager and immediately create another instance at the same path. The backend may still retain process and instance state that must be confirmed.","locale":"en"},"8209":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-36","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#resolve-by-error-type","content":"To try different installation options, choose **Change parameters…** from the prompt before installation or the workspace after a failed install. **Back** discards the edits. **Install with these parameters** or **Retry with these parameters** applies them to this and subsequent installs. If you select a forced rebuild, the app asks for confirmation before deleting the selected component directories. Reinstallation and directory ownership","locale":"en"},"8210":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-37","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#resolve-by-error-type","content":"Symptom or error","locale":"en"},"8211":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-38","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#resolve-by-error-type","content":"Address first","locale":"en"},"8212":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-39","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#resolve-by-error-type","content":"Installation options fail to load","locale":"en"},"8213":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-40","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#resolve-by-error-type","content":"Select **Reload options**, then check the application runtime and management service","locale":"en"},"8214":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-41","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#resolve-by-error-type","content":"Root is dangerous, overlaps another path, or passes through a symbolic link","locale":"en"},"8215":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-42","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#resolve-by-error-type","content":"Choose a new dedicated instance root and retain the default Python/Core subdirectories","locale":"en"},"8216":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-43","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#resolve-by-error-type","content":"Python download, extraction, or verification fails","locale":"en"},"8217":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-44","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#resolve-by-error-type","content":"Check the network, proxy, mirrors, disk space, and **Settings → Runtime**","locale":"en"},"8218":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-45","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#resolve-by-error-type","content":"Git or Core download fails","locale":"en"},"8219":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-46","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#resolve-by-error-type","content":"Check Git status, the GitHub mirror, directory permissions, and conflicting files in the target directory","locale":"en"},"8220":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-47","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#resolve-by-error-type","content":"PyTorch or dependency installation fails","locale":"en"},"8221":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-48","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#resolve-by-error-type","content":"Restore **Automatic** or the type default, then confirm the GPU driver and package sources","locale":"en"},"8222":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-49","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#resolve-by-error-type","content":"Snapshot type or platform mismatch","locale":"en"},"8223":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-50","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#resolve-by-error-type","content":"Select the WebUI type recorded by the snapshot and restore on a compatible operating system","locale":"en"},"8224":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-51","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#resolve-by-error-type","content":"Another installation still owns the operation","locale":"en"},"8225":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-52","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#resolve-by-error-type","content":"Wait for the old task to finish; if a cleanup action appears, retry process cleanup first","locale":"en"},"8226":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-53","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#resolve-by-error-type","content":"Installation completes but WebUI fails to start","locale":"en"},"8227":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-54","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#resolve-by-error-type","content":"Inspect the subsequent startup stage, arguments, port, PyTorch decision, and dependency conflicts","locale":"en"},"8228":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-55","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#the-record-exists-but-the-task-did-not-start","content":"Creation and snapshot restoration have two separate actions: saving the instance record, then starting the installation task. If the second action fails, the application still opens the instance workspace and retains the instance card. Reopen the instance and select **Start installation**. You do not need to create another instance with the same name or manually delete its directory.","locale":"en"},"8229":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-56","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#the-record-exists-but-the-task-did-not-start","content":"<Card title=\"Runtime\" href=\"/docs/settings-runtime\" description=\"Check application Python, Micromamba, and Git.\" />","locale":"en"},"8230":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-57","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#the-record-exists-but-the-task-did-not-start","content":"<Card title=\"Paths and storage\" href=\"/docs/settings-paths\" description=\"Check caches, the default installation directory, and managed-runtime storage.\" />","locale":"en"},"8231":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-58","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#the-record-exists-but-the-task-did-not-start","content":"<Card title=\"Network and proxy\" href=\"/docs/settings-network\" description=\"Resolve direct and proxy connection issues.\" />","locale":"en"},"8232":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-59","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#the-record-exists-but-the-task-did-not-start","content":"<Card title=\"Mirrors\" href=\"/docs/settings-mirrors\" description=\"Resolve package, source-code, and model origin issues.\" />","locale":"en"},"8233":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting-60","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-install-troubleshooting#the-record-exists-but-the-task-did-not-start","content":"<Card title=\"Installation and network troubleshooting\" href=\"/docs/troubleshooting-install-network\" description=\"Continue narrowing the issue by error type, network, path, and d