,"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-tabs#open-the-tab-manager","content":"“Open in a separate window” in the panel's title bar detaches the manager into its own window, which is useful for keeping it on another screen. Select “Return to the main window” in that window to dock it again.","locale":"en"},"8524":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-tabs-13","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-tabs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-tabs#the-tab-list","content":"Each row is one tab, showing the instance name, WebUI type, address, and current state:","locale":"en"},"8525":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-tabs-14","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-tabs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-tabs#the-tab-list","content":"State","locale":"en"},"8526":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-tabs-15","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-tabs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-tabs#the-tab-list","content":"Meaning","locale":"en"},"8527":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-tabs-16","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-tabs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-tabs#the-tab-list","content":"Showing","locale":"en"},"8528":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-tabs-17","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-tabs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-tabs#the-tab-list","content":"The page currently shown in the workspace","locale":"en"},"8529":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-tabs-18","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-tabs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-tabs#the-tab-list","content":"Background","locale":"en"},"8530":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-tabs-19","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-tabs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-tabs#the-tab-list","content":"The page is loaded and kept in the background; switching back does not reload it","locale":"en"},"8531":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-tabs-20","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-tabs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-tabs#the-tab-list","content":"Not opened","locale":"en"},"8532":{"id":"/en/docs/webui-tabs-21","page_id":"/en/docs/webui-tabs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/webui-tabs#the-tab-list","content":