unning. Save the configuration first and then launch the WebUI. Confirm runtime status in “Instance Information.”"],[6666,"“Clean Extra Packages,” “Clean Extra Extensions,” and “Force Git Reset” can all remove content\nfrom the current environment that the snapshot does not preserve. Restore only after checking both\nthe preview lists and your independent backups."],[6706,"“Current”: the variant that actually matches the Core repository now;"],[6510,"“Delete” removes both the Registry record and the associated file and cannot be undone."],[4018,"“Fooocus”变体基于 lllyasviel 的原版 Fooocus，但使用 licyk 维护的分叉仓库。"],[6374,"“Ignore Once” is appropriate when you have confirmed that a branch-specific argument is still\nvalid. If the launch still fails, return to this page and correct the arguments instead of\nrepeatedly ignoring the same warning."],[6508,"“Import Local Model,” or drag and drop, passes a local file to the InvokeAI registration workflow."],[6507,"“Install from URL” asks InvokeAI to download and register the model."],[6527,"“Instance Information” is the starting point for diagnosing instance problems. The page refreshes automatically and reads instance identity, paths, environment, services, hotpatch runtime status, WebUI addresses, and error history from the backend."],[6309,"“Normalize” asks the backend to reconcile the draft with the current catalog, such as filling in, converting, or rejecting values that violate field constraints. It is not the same as applying the configuration to a running WebUI."],[5626,"\"Not set\" is a value to choose, labelled by `unsetLabel`"],[7533,"“Open in a separate window” in the panel's title bar detaches Task Center into its own window, so you can watch output while you work. Select “Return to the main window” in that window to dock it again."],[8523,"“Open in a separate window” in the panel's title bar detaches the manager into its own window, which is useful for keeping it on another screen. Select “Return to the main window” in that window to dock it again."],[2326,"“PyTorch”页会检查实例 Python 中的 Torch 组件、检测到的设备类型，并列出当前 WebUI 支持的安装组合。不同 WebUI、操作系统和硬件看到的选项可能不同。"],[6707,"“Reinstallation”: the variant saved in the instance record and used for future reinstalls."],[6509,"“Unregister” removes only the Registry record; the model file remains on disk."],[6552,"“View Launch Task” opens the phases and output of the current launch. “View Logs” in error history opens the exact task in which that error occurred."],[3276,"“下载”标签页列出 WebUI 页面中发起的文件下载。下载属于应用而不是某个页面，关闭 WebUI 标签页后仍会继续。"],[3440,"“仅本次忽略”只适合确认当前分支仍接受该参数，不应长期跳过同一警告。"],[3338,"“仍然运行”只会在展开“更多信息”后显示。只对从本站下载并核对过名称与平台的文件执行此操作；第三方转载或来源不明的文件应删除并重新下载。"],[2229,"“从 URL 安装”让 InvokeAI 下载并注册模型。"],[3215,"“任务”标签页左侧是任务列表，右侧是所选任务的详情。"],[3145,"“使用中”标记符合当前共用设置的存储。若已打开的页面占用了某份存储，该行还会显示占用说明。关闭标签页后，点击面板上的刷新按钮重新检查。"],[209,"“使用记忆”控制当前模型能否读取已有记忆。"],[349,"“允许一次”只授权当前请求。部分工具还提供“在此对话中允许”，这会让同一工具在该对话中后续执行时免于再次询问，直至 Agent 重启。始终要求人工决定的请求只提供单次选择。选择“拒绝”后，Agent 会收到拒绝结果。"],[2476,"“关于”页显示当前 Hanafubuki 版本，并提供项目仓库、作者和相关 WebUI 文档链接。外部链接会使用系统浏览器打开，不会替换应用窗口。"],[2232,"“删除”会同时移除 Registry 记录和对应文件，无法撤销。"],[2231,"“取消注册”只删除 Registry 记录，模型文件保留在磁盘上。"],[4059,"“另存为预设”会保存当前安装选项，密钥字段留待下次填写。你可以删除自己保存的预设。已不适用于所选类型的预设会显示原因。删除预设不会改变已有实例；若实例类型由扩展提供，仍需启用该扩展才能使用实例。"],[2075,"“启动”页保存当前实例下次启动时使用的环境变量。提供启动参数的类型还可在这里编辑命令行。修改在下次启动 WebUI 时生效。"],[135,"“启用”是持久配置，“连接”是当前运行状态。服务器可能处于已禁用、启动中、就绪、刷新中、停止中或失败。修改配置后应查看运行态是否已经使用新的连接和目录版本。"],[2744,"“安装”"],[3650,"“实例信息”中可以看到 WebUI 运行阶段或捕获到的地址。"],[2246,"“实例信息”是排查实例问题的起点。页面会自动刷新，并从后端读取实例身份、路径、环境、服务、热补丁运行状态、WebUI 地址和历史错误。"],[4061,"“实例名称”用于首页和实例管理中的显示，可以留空。留空时，应用会根据 WebUI 产品名生成带随机后缀的名称。"],[3484,"“实例管理 → 维护 → 诊断”"],[2230,"“导入本地模型”或拖放会把本地文件交给 InvokeAI 注册流程。"],[2746,"“已安装 v…”"],[2828,"“已安装”标签页中的“检查更新”会立即检查所有扩展。检查、下载、安装和更新的进度与结果显示在设置窗口的右下角。"],[3492,"“已经尝试”应写明修改了什么以及错误是否变化，不要只写“网上的方法都试过”。如果运行过删除、重装依赖或 Git 重置，也必须说明，否则维护者可能基于已经改变的环境给出错误判断。"],[2748,"“已链接”"],[3080,"“应用 Python 版本”支持当前界面列出的 Python 版本。修改会立即保存，但只在下次启动时切换应用运行时。"],[2423,"“当前”：Core 仓库现在实际对应的变体；"],[3167,"“恢复默认”与“放弃”含义不同："],[2741,"“扩展”分区的“扩展市场”标签页列出扩展注册表中发布的扩展。应用经过网络与代理设置先从 GitHub 读取注册表，读取或解析失败时会自动尝试 Gitee 镜像。两处均失败时，页面才提示加载失败。读到的列表会保留一段时间：两分钟内再次打开该标签页会直接显示它，不会重新读取；点击页面顶部的“刷新”会立即重新读取。标签页顶部的搜索框在列表滚动时保持不动，可以按名称、ID、作者或描述搜索。每个条目显示 ID、作者、源代码链接（在浏览器中打开）和描述，以及它在本机的情况："],[2019,"“扩展”页是否可用，以及提供哪些按钮，由当前 WebUI 的管理能力决定。页面通常包含“本地扩展”和“扩展市场”两个视图；不支持市场的实例仍可能允许管理已经安装的扩展。"],[3092,"“无法读取状态”下方的“重试”会重新读取状态。若提示实时状态不可用，重新进入运行环境页可重新订阅并读取当前结果。"],[2271,"“查看启动任务”会打开本次启动的阶段和输出；历史错误中的“查看日志”会打开发生该错误的准确任务。"],[2512,"“模型 → 角色”列出可用角色及配置问题。可创建角色，指定继承的角色、要追加或替换的指令、模型、可用工具和权限上限；“可派生”控制其他代理能否按此角色启动。会话空闲时，输入 `/role` 选择当前会话使用的角色。"],[2383,"“清理额外软件包”“清理额外扩展”和“强制 Git\n重置”都可能移除当前环境中快照没有保留的内容。只有在预览列表与独立备份都确认无误后再恢复。"],[2443,"“版本”页会根据 WebUI 类型显示不同界面。Stable Diffusion WebUI、ComfyUI、Fooocus、SD Trainer、Qwen TTS WebUI、RVC Next WebUI 和 Mizuoto TTS WebUI 等 Git 型实例显示仓库分支与提交；InvokeAI 显示已经安装和可以安装的软件包版本。"],[210,"“生成记忆”控制符合条件的会话能否成为新记忆来源。"],[90,"“移至项目…”只改变已有对话在侧栏的分组。修改项目的文件夹会作用于之后新建的对话。移除项目会将对话移回“最近”，已有对话保留各自的工作区和消息。"],[2740,"“纯数据”表示扩展没有常驻后端。使用它的实例类型时，应用仍可能按描述文件运行安装命令或启动服务器；它贡献的 stdio MCP 服务器也可由 Agent 启动。"],[2288,"“组件路径”页能否修改"],[2122,"“维护”页不依赖 WebUI 管理 API，可以在管理功能异常时继续打开。迁移、重装和删除属于实例生命周期操作：应用会先停止并确认相关运行资源，再执行文件或记录修改。"],[397,"“自动”会在模型支持时发送图片；“禁用”会阻止图片输入"],[2339,"“自动选择”可用时，可让安装任务按硬件决定组合。若此项变灰，页面会切到“手动选择”。可输入构建名称或按设备筛选，再选择受支持的组合；“推荐”标记对应当前环境，标为不支持的构建无法选中。"],[2047,"“规范化”会让后端按照当前目录整理草稿，例如补齐、转换或拒绝不符合字段约束的值。它不等同于应用到正在运行的 WebUI。"],[3172,"“设置 → 模块”有“平台”“功能”和“扩展”三个标签页。卡片列出模块的状态和它提供的功能，例如实例类型、任务来源或诊断内容。平台模块是应用必需的，已安装扩展的启停开关位于扩展页。"],[2649,"“设置 → 自动化”为应用自行运行的每项任务提供一个开关，四个开关默认全部开启。开关只停止自动运行：手动检查更新或手动创建快照不受影响。修改后约一分钟内生效，无需重启。"],[3487,"“设置 → 诊断”"],[2847,"“设置 → 语言”控制 Hanafubuki 自己的界面语言，不会修改操作系统、WebUI 或终端中的语言。"],[2264,"“路径”中每一行的文件夹按钮打开对应目录，可以直接进入实例根目录、Core 或其他组件。Python 可执行文件一行打开 Python 组件目录。"],[2424,"“重新安装”：实例记录中保存、以后重装时使用的变体。"],[1890,"“问题反馈”会在系统浏览器打开项目的问题列表。需要附日志时，先按日志、诊断与求助保存相关输出。"],[525,"“默认”模式适合直接分析和执行；“Plan”模式只进行调查、提问和方案设计。权限模式决定工具操作是直接执行、自动审查还是等待人工审批。"],[4230,"**“新建标签页”中找不到实例**：已经有标签页的实例不会再列出；未安装完成的实例显示为不可选。"],[5830,"**`ContextMenu` and `BaseColorPickerPopover`** stay mounted and take `open`; you place the menu with `x` and `y` (a `contextmenu` event's `clientX` and `clientY`)."],[1584,"**`ContextMenu` 和 `BaseColorPickerPopover`** 保持挂载，通过 `open` 控制；菜单的位置由你用 `x` 和 `y` 给出（`contextmenu` 事件的 `clientX` 和 `clientY`）。"],[5828,"**`CornerStatusStack`** docks to the bottom-end corner of its nearest positioned ancestor: give the region it reports for `position: relative`."],[1582,"**`CornerStatusStack`** 停靠在最近的已定位祖先元素的右下角：请给它所报告的区域设置 `position: relative`。"],[5829,"**`NativeTooltipHost`** is mounted once per page; from then on every `title` attribute in it is drawn as the application's tooltip."],[1583,"**`NativeTooltipHost`** 每个页面挂载一次；此后页面中所有 `title` 属性都会显示为应用的提示框。"],[8576,"**A page shows “Not opened” but will not open**: its service may not be ready or may have exited. Confirm the WebUI is still running under Instance Information."],[5825,"**A Settings section that looks like the application's** is a `SettingsGroup` of `SettingsRow`s, each with its control (`SettingsSwitch` for a boolean). A row stacks its control under its text when a container named `panel` is narrower than 480px: declare `container: panel / inline-size` on what holds the rows. `PanelHeader` and `BaseTabs` narrow the same way inside any container you declare."],[8455,"**Access warning**: A subdirectory could not be read; scanning continues with other directories."],[4703,"**Adopted this turn** — the running turn read it and is following it."],[4590,"**Allow once** authorizes only the current request. Some tools also offer **Allow for this conversation**. Later calls to that tool in the same conversation then proceed without another prompt until the Agent restarts. Requests that always need a human decision offer only a one-time choice. **Deny** sends the rejection to the Agent."],[7277,"**Allow** runs it; **Deny** or Escape refuses it. Focus starts on **Deny**, so a key you meant for something else cannot allow it."],[8574,"**An instance is missing from “New tab”**: instances that already have a tab are not listed, and instances that are not fully installed cannot be selected."],[7397,"**Application Python version** supports the Python versions listed in the current interface. A change saves immediately but switches the application runtime only on the next startup."],[4377,"**Approval.** The application sets read-only tools to **Allow** and tools that make changes to **Ask** by default. You can change individual policies in MCP settings. When approval is required, the card shows the tool name and arguments."],[7068,"**Asks for** lists what an extension requests beyond the defaults:"],[4640,"**Auto** sends images when the model supports them; **Disabled** blocks image input"],[8156,"**Automatic** leaves the build unpinned so that the current installer can choose for the environment."],[4702,"**Available now** — enabled, and offered to the next turn."],[4836,"**Both directions**: either side may call the other at any time; a backend handling a call may call the host API and wait for the answer. Unknown members of params are ignored and missing ones take their defaults; params that do not read fail their call with `INVALID_PARAMS`."],[4838,"**Bounds**: the application's calls to a backend (hooks aside) have a 30 s bound. A call past it fails alone; three in a row are a fault."],[5230,"**Branch variants.**"],[8408,"**Branch** appears only for WebUIs that support branch presets. Most users should select **Default branch**. Switch only when you specifically need a prerelease or variant. See Supported variants for each variant's repository and branch."],[5559,"**Can't run**: the card says why; most often `engines.api` is missing or there is no program for this operating system."],[7590,"**Cancel**: shown only when the task can be cancelled."],[7128,"**Check for Updates**, on the **Installed** tab, checks every extension now. Its progress and result show in the bottom-right corner of the Settings window, as do downloads, installs and updates."],[7269,"**Claude Code**:"],[2963,"**Claude Code**："],[7272,"**Claude Desktop** starts its MCP servers as programs, so it starts **hanafubuki-mcp**, the bridge program installed with the application. Its entry for `claude_desktop_config.json` names the bridge, with the token and the application's endpoint file in its environment; the card fills in the real paths:"],[2966,"**Claude Desktop** 以程序方式启动其 MCP 服务器，因此它启动随应用安装的桥接程序 **hanafubuki-mcp**。用于 `claude_desktop_config.json` 的条目指定该桥接程序，并在其环境变量中提供令牌和应用的端点文件；卡片中会填入实际路径："],[4837,"**Concurrency**: the application answers at most 16 of one backend's calls at once; another fails with `BUSY`."],[7589,"**Copy log** and **Export log to file**: copy or save all output currently retained, for reporting a problem."],[4691,"**Create or install.** Select **Add a Skill**. To create one, enter its name and purpose. For **Install a folder**, check the preview for the name, destination folder, and resource count. If that folder already exists, the action changes to **Replace**."],[5519,"**Create**: the application checks the values against the type's form, then asks `provider.validateSpec`, which refuses a greeting over 200 characters."],[7270,"**Cursor** and other clients that read an `mcpServers` JSON file:"],[2964,"**Cursor** 等读取 `mcpServers` JSON 文件的客户端："],[6323,"**Debug** shows runtime events and lets you adjust trace tags and strict mode. Enable `control.forward_events` in **Configuration** to receive forwarded events. **Connection** shows read-only details of the current desktop connection."],[8345,"**Default branch** in the installation wizard is Forge-Neo. Development branches change frequently and may be incompatible with extensions or model workflows; the AMDGPU variant targets AMD graphics cards."],[4770,"**Default** mode is for direct analysis and execution. **Plan** mode is limited to investigation, questions, and solution design. The permission mode determines whether tool operations run directly, receive automatic review, or await manual approval."],[7489,"**Discard**: Reverts edits that have not been saved successfully and returns to the persisted values."],[4373,"**Enabled** is persistent configuration; **Connected** is current runtime state. A server can be disabled, starting, ready, refreshing, stopping, or failed. After editing its configuration, check that the runtime is using the new connection and catalog version."],[4815,"**Environment**: starts empty and takes only these variables from the application's environment, when they are set and are text: `PATH`, `HOME`, `USER`, `LOGNAME`, `SHELL`, `TMPDIR`, `LANG`, `LANGUAGE`, `LC_*`, `TZ`, `XDG_RUNTIME_DIR`, and on Windows `USERPROFILE`, `SYSTEMROOT`, `SYSTEMDRIVE`, `WINDIR`, `COMSPEC`, `PATHEXT`, `TEMP`, `TMP`, `APPDATA`, `LOCALAPPDATA`, `PROGRAMDATA`, `PROGRAMFILES`, `NUMBER_OF_PROCESSORS`, `PROCESSOR_ARCHITECTURE`. Plus:"],[4376,"**Exposure.** Common tools such as `list_instances`, `list_tasks`, and `read_task_log`, plus the tools to start, stop, and restart an instance, are available directly by default. The model discovers the others through tool search as needed, including some read-only tools."],[4692,"**Find and edit.** Search by name, description, or directory. Open a Skill's overview to see its directory, required MCP servers, and any reason it is unavailable. The file list opens `SKILL.md` and its resources. In a user copy, you can add, save, and delete resource files. Removing `SKILL.md` requires deleting the whole Skill."],[4834,"**Framing**: as in the Language Server Protocol: header lines `Name: value`, each ending in `\\r\\n`, an empty line, then a body of exactly `Content-Length` bytes of UTF-8 JSON. `Content-Length` is required and matched without case; other headers are ignored. Headers take at most 1 KiB, a body at most 4 MiB."],[4448,"**Generate memories** controls whether eligible sessions can become sources of new memory."],[5831,"**Icons.** The bundle exports no icons. An `icon` prop takes a component of your own that renders an `<svg>` and accepts `size`."],[7773,"**Ignore this time** is suitable only for confirming that the current branch still accepts an argument. Do not use it to bypass the same warning indefinitely."],[7463,"**In use** marks stores that match the current sharing setting. If an open page holds a store, its row also explains why clearing is blocked. After closing the tab, use **Refresh** to check again."],[6322,"**Inspect** accepts a Python module's import name to explain its patches, verify them, or show the patched source. Leave the name blank and select **Verify** to check every patched module."],[7041,"**Install**"],[5520,"**Install**: `provider.installPlan` answers one `write-file` step, `{component.core}/greeting.txt` from `{param.greeting}`. The application resolves the placeholders and keeps the step inside `core`."],[7043,"**Installed v…**"],[7994,"**Instance information** shows a WebUI runtime stage or a captured address."],[7820,"**Instance Management → Maintenance → Diagnostics**"],[8405,"**Instance name** is shown on Home and in Instance Management. You may leave it blank, in which case the application generates a name from the WebUI product name with a random suffix."],[8454,"**Invalid Python**: A possible Python was found, but it could not execute or its version could not be parsed."],[7292,"**Keep tokens like passwords.** The application keeps each token, with a fingerprint it checks requests against, in its configuration folder (`config/mcp/clients.json`), so that you can show it again. On macOS and Linux only your account can read that file; on Windows it is protected like the rest of your profile folder. Anyone who can read your configuration folder can therefore read the tokens, as they can the assistant's provider keys stored there. Diagnostic bundles never include the file. A copy of a token in a client's own configuration is that client's to protect; the application cannot take a copy back, only revoke the client."],[7045,"**Linked**"],[5827,"**Links.** A click on a `MarkdownDocument`'s link never navigates the frame and opens nothing by itself: pass `openLink` to `frameUi` to handle the address (http, https, or mailto). For HTTP(S) links, call the frame client's `openExternal(url)` to open the system browser. HTML in the Markdown source is shown as text. The Copy button on a code block writes the clipboard, which a sandboxed frame may be refused; the button then stays as it is. An image in the source does not load: the frame's policy only loads images from your package."],[4378,"**Memory.** Tools on the built-in server follow the same external-context setting as tools from other MCP servers."],[6798,"**Models → Roles** lists roles and any configuration problems. Create a role to choose a base role, append or replace inherited instructions, select a model, limit tools, or set a permission ceiling. The spawnable setting controls whether other agents can start a child in that role. When the conversation is idle, type `/role` to choose the role it will use."],[4325,"**Move to project…** changes where an existing conversation appears in the sidebar. Editing the project's folders affects conversations created afterward. Removing a project moves its conversations to **Recent** and preserves their individual workspaces and messages."],[4375,"**Names.** The Agent sees each tool as `mcp__hanafubuki__<tool>`, such as `mcp__hanafubuki__start_instance`."],[5861,"**No application interface**: the frame has no Tauri script or invoke key and reaches no command of the application; it speaks only to its host component through the frame client."],[5858,"**No inline script**: scripts are files of the package; inline styles are allowed."],[5857,"**No network**: `connect-src 'none'` blocks `fetch`, XHR, and WebSockets; ask the backend for data through `call`."],[8575,"**No page rows under an instance**: the WebUI announced a single page, which is normal for most WebUIs."],[5860,"**No popups or dialogs**: the sandbox opens no new windows and allows no `alert`, `confirm`, or `prompt`, and no form submission. The folder dialog is the application's, through `pickDirectory`."],[7290,"**Nothing without a token.** Other clients get in only while external access is on, each with a token of its own that you can revoke at any time. The built-in assistant's key changes every time the server starts."],[4937,"**Notifications to the backend**: `event` (`topic` and `data`), `process.output` (`taskId`, `stream`, `data`), and `process.exit` (`taskId`, `status` of `exited`, `failed`, or `cancelled`, `exitCode`, `error`)."],[7093,"**Off**: the extensions that depend on it are turned off too, and running instances of its types are stopped first. In that case the card first asks **Turn off …?**, listing the extensions that will be turned off and the instances that will be stopped, and acts only after you click **Turn off**."],[7092,"**On**: the application registers the extension's instance types, settings, and panels, and starts its backend. If its dependencies are not met yet, the extension stays on but shows **Can't run**, and it runs by itself once they are."],[5859,"**Only its own package's resources**: images may also be `data:` and `blob:`."],[7289,"**Only this computer.** The server listens on this computer only; other computers on your network cannot reach it. It refuses requests from web pages, so a site you open in a browser cannot use it either."],[7826,"**Open log** on the Launcher's error screen. See Launcher troubleshooting."],[7137,"**Operations**: maintenance operations of the extension's own types appear in an **Operations** section of the instance's management page."],[4819,"**Output**: stdout is the protocol's alone; write nothing else there. stderr goes to the extension's log, `backend.log` (rotated past 1 MiB), which `log.write` appends to as well. Users see its last 256 KiB through **View log** on the extension's card."],[7587,"**Output**: the task's terminal output, updated live while it runs."],[7136,"**Panels and views**: as the extension declares, in the Settings window, or under the **Extensions** group of the management page of its types' instances. A management section is listed only for instances of the extension's own types. A view that does not load or stops responding shows **Unavailable**; **Reload** tries again without affecting other sections."],[6321,"**Patches, Patch sets, and Features** let you inspect and unload active patches and sets. To unload a set owned by a feature, turn off the feature. To load a new set, edit `control.patch_sets` in **Configuration** and restart the WebUI. Features that require importing code or loading a patch set also need a configuration change and a restart."],[8453,"**Path conflict**: The candidate root, Python, or Core overlaps an existing instance."],[6100,"**Pin a version or list the source.** Set only `download_url` to install directly from that archive. Omit both URLs to list just the source link."],[8402,"**Preset** at the top lists the presets of the selected type: those an installed extension contributes and those you saved. Choosing one fills the form below with its values, which you can still change; **None** puts back the type's defaults. A preset can also set launch arguments, shown under the list, which the new instance starts with."],[8457,"**Processing failure**: Path safety, instance-record, or lifecycle-commit steps did not complete."],[4110,"**Python 无效**：找到了疑似 Python，但无法执行或解析版本。"],[5557,"**Read the log**: what the backend writes to stderr, and `log.write`, go to the extension's log; click **View log** on its card. Never write to stdout: that breaks the protocol's frames and the backend is treated as faulted."],[6101,"**Registry format.** The published document uses `schema: 1`. The app reads the `extensions` array and ignores other top-level fields, including `schema`. It skips malformed entries and keeps the first accepted entry for each id."],[5562,"**Repeated crashes of a linked extension**: **Reload** clears the crash marker as **Retry** does, so a backend that still crashes stops again after three starts."],[5560,"**Repeated crashes**: a backend that exits before it has run for 30 seconds three times in a row is not started again by itself. Fix it, then click **Retry**."],[4832,"**Repeated crashes**: each start counts one before it spawns; the count clears once the backend has run for 30 seconds, when it is stopped in order, or on **Retry**. At three, the extension shows **Stopped after repeated crashes** and is not started again, in this run or the next, until the user clicks **Retry**."],[6136,"**Report an issue** opens the project's issue list in your system browser. To include relevant logs, follow Logs, diagnostics, and reporting issues."],[7490,"**Restore defaults in a path section**: Places the default path in the input, but still requires **Save**, preventing an unconfirmed directory from being created."],[7487,"**Restore defaults** and **Discard** have different meanings:"],[7488,"**Restore defaults**: Changes the current section to application defaults; ordinary fields save immediately."],[7410,"**Retry** under a status read error reads the status again. If live updates are unavailable, leave the Runtime page and reopen it to subscribe again and read the current result."],[8456,"**Root failure**: The selected scan root itself could not be read. The entire scan fails if every root fails."],[8403,"**Save as preset** keeps the current install options and leaves secret fields for you to fill in again. You can delete presets you saved yourself. A preset that no longer fits its type shows why it is unavailable. Removing a preset leaves existing instances as configured. Instances of an extension-provided type still need that extension enabled."],[5826,"**Schema forms.** `SchemaFormFields` lays out the same fields a schema panel declares, as `FormField`s inside your `.form-grid`, and evaluates `visibleWhen` and `disabledWhen`. Write texts as `{ kind: \"literal\", text: { en, zh } }`: a `{ kind: \"key\" }` text only finds the application's `common` messages. Your backend validates the values. A `path` field picks folders only."],[6937,"**Settings → Automation** has one switch for each job the application runs on its own. All four are on by default. A switch stops only the automatic run: checking for updates or creating a snapshot yourself works the same either way. A change takes effect within about a minute, without restarting."],[7823,"**Settings → Diagnostics**"],[7147,"**Settings → Language** controls the language of Hanafubuki's own interface. It does not change the language of the operating system, a WebUI, or a terminal."],[7492,"**Settings → Modules** has three tabs, **Platform**, **Features**, and **Extensions**. Each card shows its state and what it contributes, such as instance types, Task Center entries, or diagnostic reports. Platform modules are required. The switches for installed extensions are on the Extensions page."],[7135,"**Settings**: a section of the Settings window named after the extension. Its values are stored with the extension, not in the application's settings, and can be read and changed only while the extension runs."],[5228,"**Snapshots**, including creating an instance from one."],[5521,"**Start**: `provider.launchPlan` answers `[<the program>, \"serve\", \"--port\", \"{port}\", \"--signature\", <setting>]`, the signature being the extension setting read with `settings.get`. A plan is a template, so the backend doubles every brace in text it did not write. The application starts it in `core` on the port it allocated, and opens the role in the embedded browser once `/health` answers."],[5137,"**Step paths** (`to`, `unpackTo`, `archive`, `into`, `dir`, `cwd` and `path`) start with `{component.<name>}`, optionally followed by `/` and a path inside the component, such as `{component.core}/bin/server`. A step whose resolved path would leave its component is refused. Entries in `environment.path` may also start with `{instance.root}`."],[5522,"**The frame**: `ui/status.html` calls `status`, which the backend answers with `servers.status` for the instance (so it needs `permissions.instances = \"own-types\"`)."],[5229,"**The hotpatch, launch arguments, and the launch checks.** Your servers start from your own commands."],[5558,"**The install fails**: the error lists each problem with its place, such as `types/greeter.toml: servers[0].readiness`; compare it with Manifest keys and Instance types."],[5227,"**The kernel update and its update summary.** Your type's `update` is its update, and an `update-check` is its check. A found update shows beside the Update action in Maintenance."],[8573,"**The list is empty**: no WebUI is open yet. Select “New tab” to choose an instance."],[6102,"**The registry does not update an installed extension**: its updates come from its own manifest's `[update] url`."],[5523,"**The UI state**: the backend's state is the greetings sent, `{ \"greetings\": { \"rows\": [...] } }`. **Greet** in the **Greetings** panel sends `ui.panel.action`; the backend keeps the greeting and pushes the new state with `emit_state`, and the panel's table, whose block names `\"source\": \"state\"` and `\"path\": \"greetings\"`, changes without a query. The frame follows the same state with `state()` and `onState()`."],[6099,"**Track the latest release.** Set `update_url` to the latest release's `latest.json`. You can omit `download_url` from the registry entry. The Marketplace downloads the highest version for the user's platform and architecture from the feed and checks its `sha256` when provided. It ignores any old archive URL in the registry entry and reports an error if the feed fails or has no compatible package."],[4833,"**Transport**: JSON-RPC 2.0; the application writes to the backend's stdin, the backend to its stdout."],[4380,"**Turning it off.** Turn the entry off with its **Enabled** switch. If you delete it instead, the application adds it again, with the default policies, the next time the Agent starts. Turning off the **management-mcp** module on the Modules page stops the server itself: the entry then shows as failed and reconnects once the module runs again."],[5561,"**Updating what is installed**: an installed extension is a copy in the application's store, so editing the source files does not change it. Updating to the same version is refused, so either raise `version` and use **Update**, or uninstall (keeping settings and data) and install again. While iterating, link the folder instead and press **Reload**."],[4447,"**Use memories** controls whether the current model can read existing memory."],[4835,"**Version**: protocol version `1`, carried both ways by `initialize`."],[7271,"**VS Code**: If you are editing `.vscode/mcp.json`, use the top-level key `servers`. Add a `hanafubuki` entry with `\"type\": \"http\"` and the `url` and `headers` from the card. For shared workspace configuration, an input variable can supply the token. VS Code MCP configuration reference"],[2965,"**VS Code**：如果编辑的是 `.vscode/mcp.json`，顶层键使用 `servers`。在其下创建 `hanafubuki` 条目，填写 `\"type\": \"http\"`，并使用卡片中的 `url` 和 `headers`。共享工作区配置可用输入变量提供令牌。VS Code MCP 配置参考"],[7588,"**Warnings and errors**: warnings the task recorded appear above the output, and the final error below it."],[7293,"**What it does not protect against.** Any program running under your own account can read your files, the clients file and client configurations included, so the tokens protect against other users and web pages, not against malware on your account."],[4379,"**What the application keeps up to date.** Whenever the Agent starts or the server restarts, the application rewrites the entry's address and credential, and gives a default policy to any tool that has none. Everything else is yours and stays as you set it: the **Enabled** switch, the per-tool policies you changed, the enabled and disabled tool lists, the timeouts and the concurrency limits."],[4814,"**Working directory**: the package root. A copied install runs in `extensions/<id>/<version>/`; a development link runs in the folder the user linked. Read bundled assets relative to that root. Write persistent files under `HANAFUBUKI_EXTENSION_DATA` (also returned by `storage.path`)."],[7291,"**You stay in charge of changes.** Unless you chose to trust a client, every change waits for you, and deletions wait for you unless you also chose \"even to delete\". Every change a client makes is listed in the Task Center."],[1579,"**与应用外观一致的设置分区**是由 `SettingsRow` 组成的 `SettingsGroup`，每行带一个控件（布尔值用 `SettingsSwitch`）。当名为 `panel` 的容器窄于 480px 时，行会把控件放到文字下方：请在包含这些行的元素上声明 `container: panel / inline-size`。`PanelHeader` 和 `BaseTabs` 在你声明的任意容器内也会同样收窄。"],[588,"**传输**：JSON-RPC 2.0，应用写入后端的标准输入，后端写入标准输出。"],[2985,"**修改由你掌控。** 除非你选择信任某个客户端，否则每项修改都要等你同意；除非你还选择了“包括删除”，否则删除操作也要等你同意。客户端所做的每项修改都会列在任务中心。"],[2986,"**像保管密码一样保管令牌。** 应用在其配置文件夹（`config/mcp/clients.json`）中保存每个令牌及其用于校验请求的指纹，以便你可以再次显示令牌。在 macOS 和 Linux 上只有你的账户能读取该文件；在 Windows 上它与你个人资料文件夹中的其他文件受到同样的保护。因此，能读取你配置文件夹的人也能读取这些令牌，就像能读取保存在那里的助手提供方密钥一样。诊断包从不包含该文件。客户端自己配置中的令牌副本由该客户端负责保护；应用无法收回已复制出去的令牌，只能撤销该客户端。"],[2971,"**允许** 执行该操作；**拒绝** 或 Esc 拒绝它。焦点默认在 **拒绝** 上，因此误按的按键不会允许它。"],[2794,"**关闭**：依赖它的其他扩展会一并关闭；如果有使用其类型的实例正在运行，这些实例会先被停止。此时卡片中会先询问“关闭……？”，列出会被关闭的扩展和会被停止的实例，点击“关闭”后才执行。"],[142,"**关闭它。** 用这一项的“启用”开关关闭它。如果改为删除它，Agent 下次启动时应用会以默认策略重新添加。在“模块”页面关闭 **management-mcp** 模块会停止服务器本身：这一项随后显示为失败，模块再次运行后会重新连接。"],[982,"**内核更新及其更新摘要。** 类型自己的 `update` 就是它的更新，`update-check` 就是它的检查。发现的更新显示在“维护”中“更新”操作旁边。"],[589,"**分帧**：与 Language Server Protocol 相同：若干 `Name: value` 头部行（以 `\\r\\n` 结尾），一个空行，然后是恰好 `Content-Length` 字节的 UTF-8 JSON。`Content-Length` 必填，名称不区分大小写，其他头部被忽略。头部最多 1 KiB，消息体最多 4 MiB。"],[985,"**分支变体。**"],[4229,"**列表为空**：还没有打开任何 WebUI。点击“新建标签页”选择实例。"],[448,"**创建或安装**。打开“添加 Skill”。创建时填写名称和用途。选择“安装文件夹”后，先核对预览的名称、目标文件夹和资源数。目标已有同名文件夹时，按钮会变为“替换”。"],[591,"**双向调用**：双方都可以随时调用对方。后端处理某个调用时可以调用宿主接口并等待结果。参数中未知的成员会被忽略，缺失的成员取默认值；参数无法读取时调用以 `INVALID_PARAMS` 失败。"],[1316,"**反复崩溃**：后端连续 3 次在稳定运行 30 秒前退出后不再自动启动。修复后点击“重试”。"],[587,"**反复崩溃**：每次启动前计数加一；后端稳定运行 30 秒、被正常停止或用户点击“重试”后清零。计数达到 3 时，扩展显示“因反复崩溃已停止”，在本次运行和之后的运行中都不再启动，直到用户点击“重试”。"],[692,"**发给后端的通知**：`event`（`topic` 和 `data`）、`process.output`（`taskId`、`stream`、`data`）和 `process.exit`（`taskId`、`status` 为 `exited`、`failed` 或 `cancelled`、`exitCode`、`error`）。"],[3270,"**取消**：仅在任务可以取消时出现。"],[2983,"**只在本机。** 服务器只监听本机，网络中的其他计算机无法访问它。它会拒绝来自网页的请求，因此你在浏览器中打开的网站也无法使用它。"],[1613,"**只能加载自己软件包中的资源**：图片另外允许 `data:` 和 `blob:`。"],[137,"**名称。** Agent 看到的每个工具名为 `mcp__hanafubuki__<工具>`，例如 `mcp__hanafubuki__start_instance`。"],[1277,"**启动**：`provider.launchPlan` 返回 `[<程序路径>, \"serve\", \"--port\", \"{port}\", \"--signature\", <设置值>]`，其中签名是用 `settings.get` 读到的扩展设置。计划是模板，后端会把非自己写的文本中的花括号加倍。应用在 `core` 中以分配的端口启动它，`/health` 返回 200 后在内置浏览器中打开该角色。"],[1854,"**固定版本或仅展示源码**。只填 `download_url` 时，市场直接下载该地址的压缩包。两个地址都省略时，条目只显示源码链接。"],[1585,"**图标。** 组件包不导出图标。`icon` 属性接受你自己的组件：它渲染一个 `<svg>` 并接受 `size`。"],[4113,"**处理失败**：路径安全、实例记录或生命周期提交等步骤未完成。"],[3269,"**复制日志**、**导出日志到文件**：复制或保存当前保留的全部输出，用于反馈问题；"],[2987,"**它不能防范什么。** 以你的身份运行的任何程序都能读取你的文件，包括保存客户端的文件和客户端的配置，因此令牌能防范其他用户和网页，但无法防范你账户中的恶意软件。"],[1276,"**安装**：`provider.installPlan` 返回一个 `write-file` 步骤，把 `{param.greeting}` 写入 `{component.core}/greeting.txt`。应用替换占位符，并把步骤限制在 `core` 组件内。"],[1314,"**安装失败**：错误信息列出每个问题的位置，如 `types/greeter.toml: servers[0].readiness`，对照清单字段和实例类型修改。"],[4231,"**实例下方没有界面行**：该 WebUI 只公布了一个界面，这是大多数 WebUI 的正常情况。"],[139,"**审批。** 应用给内置只读工具预设“允许”，给会修改内容的工具预设“询问”。可以在 MCP 设置中单独调整每个工具。需要确认时，审批卡片会显示工具名称和参数。"],[569,"**工作目录**为扩展包根目录。安装副本位于 `extensions/<id>/<version>/`，开发链接则使用用户选中的源目录。按包根目录读取随包资源，通过 `HANAFUBUKI_EXTENSION_DATA` 或 `storage.path` 获取持久化文件的写入目录。"],[1682,"**带后端的扩展**在 `[backend]` 中声明一个程序：每个操作系统一个可执行文件，或一个在应用受管 Python 上运行的脚本。后端在扩展开启期间运行，可以为面板和视图提供数据、调用应用的宿主接口，并为 `provider = \"backend\"` 的实例类型规划安装步骤和启动命令。"],[592,"**并发**：应用同时最多回答同一后端的 16 个调用，超出的以 `BUSY` 失败。"],[141,"**应用会自动更新的内容。** Agent 每次启动或服务器每次重启时，应用都会改写这一项的地址和凭据，并为还没有策略的工具设置默认策略。其他设置都归你所有，会保持你设定的样子：“启用”开关、你修改过的单个工具策略、启用和停用的工具列表、超时以及并发限制。"],[2793,"**开启**：应用会注册扩展的实例类型、设置和面板，并启动它的后端。依赖尚未满足时，扩展会保持开启但显示“无法运行”，所需条件满足后自动运行。"],[459,"**当前可用**——已启用，会提供给下一个 turn。"],[983,"**快照**，包括从快照创建实例。"],[3168,"**恢复默认**：把本分区改为应用默认值；普通字段会立即保存。"],[2837,"**操作**：扩展类型自定义的维护操作显示在实例管理页面的“操作”分区中。"],[3169,"**放弃**：撤销当前尚未成功保存的编辑，回到已经持久化的值。"],[1275,"**新建**：应用先用类型的表单检查参数值，再调用 `provider.validateSpec`，后端拒绝超过 200 个字符的问候语。"],[1315,"**无法运行**：卡片上显示原因，常见的是缺少 `engines.api` 或没有当前系统的程序。"],[593,"**时限**：应用对后端的调用（钩子除外）时限为 30 秒，单次超时只影响该调用，连续三次超时视为故障。"],[138,"**暴露。** 默认直接提供常用工具，如 `list_instances`、`list_tasks`、`read_task_log`，以及启动、停止和重启实例的工具。其他工具按需通过工具搜索发现，包括部分只读工具。"],[1317,"**更新已安装的版本**：扩展安装时被复制到应用的存储中，修改源文件不会影响已安装的副本。更新到相同版本号会被拒绝，因此要么提高 `version` 后使用“更新”，要么卸载（保留设置和数据）后重新安装。迭代时可以改为链接文件夹，然后点击“重新加载”。"],[460,"**本 turn 已采用**——运行中的 turn 已读取并正在遵循它。"],[449,"**查找和编辑**。可按名称、说明或目录搜索。打开条目后，“概览”显示来源目录、所需 MCP 服务器和不可用原因。左侧文件列表可查看 `SKILL.md` 和资源。用户副本可添加、保存、删除资源文件；`SKILL.md` 需随整个 Skill 一起删除。"],[4112,"**根目录失败**：指定扫描根目录本身无法读取；所有根都失败时整个扫描失败。"],[2060,"**检查**。输入 Python 模块的导入名，可查看补丁说明、校验结果或补丁后的源码。模块名留空时，“校验”会检查所有已打补丁的模块。"],[1580,"**模式表单。** `SchemaFormFields` 把模式面板声明的同一种字段排成 `FormField`，放在你的 `.form-grid` 中，并计算 `visibleWhen` 和 `disabledWhen`。文字请写成 `{ kind: \"literal\", text: { en, zh } }`：`{ kind: \"key\" }` 的文字只能找到应用的 `common` 消息。值由你的后端校验。`path` 字段只能选择文件夹。"],[892,"**步骤的路径字段**（`to`、`unpackTo`、`archive`、`into`、`dir`、`cwd`、`path`）以 `{component.<name>}` 开头，之后可以用 `/` 接组件内的路径，例如 `{component.core}/bin/server`。如果解析后的路径会离开组件，该步骤会被拒绝。`environment.path` 的条目还可以从 `{instance.root}` 开始。"],[2984,"**没有令牌就无法使用。** 其他客户端只能在外部访问打开时连接，并且各自使用自己的令牌，你可以随时撤销。内置助手的密钥在服务器每次启动时都会更换。"],[1612,"**没有内联脚本**：脚本必须是软件包中的文件；内联样式可以使用。"],[1615,"**没有应用接口**：视图中没有 Tauri 的脚本或调用密钥，无法调用应用的任何命令；它只能通过视图客户端与宿主组件通信。"],[1614,"**没有弹窗和对话框**：沙箱不允许打开新窗口，也不允许 `alert`、`confirm`、`prompt`；不允许提交表单。文件夹对话框由应用通过 `pickDirectory` 打开。"],[1611,"**没有网络**：`connect-src 'none'` 禁止 `fetch`、XHR 和 WebSocket；需要的数据通过 `call` 交给后端获取。"],[1856,"**注册表不会用来更新已安装的扩展**：扩展的更新只来自其清单中的 `[update] url`。"],[1855,"**注册表格式。** 发布的文档使用 `schema: 1`。应用读取 `extensions` 数组，忽略其他顶层字段，包括 `schema`。无效条目会被跳过，同一 ID 保留首个通过检查的条目。"],[984,"**热补丁、启动参数和启动检查。** 你的服务器由你自己的命令启动。"],[590,"**版本**：协议版本 `1`，由 `initialize` 双向确认。"],[570,"**环境变量**：从干净的环境开始，只传入应用环境中以下存在且为文本的变量：`PATH`、`HOME`、`USER`、`LOGNAME`、`SHELL`、`TMPDIR`、`LANG`、`LANGUAGE`、`LC_*`、`TZ`、`XDG_RUNTIME_DIR`，以及 Windows 上的 `USERPROFILE`、`SYSTEMROOT`、`SYSTEMDRIVE`、`WINDIR`、`COMSPEC`、`PATHEXT`、`TEMP`、`TMP`、`APPDATA`、`LOCALAPPDATA`、`PROGRAMDATA`、`PROGRAMFILES`、`NUMBER_OF_PROCESSORS`、`PROCESSOR_ARCHITECTURE`。另外设置："],[4232,"**界面显示“未打开”但点击后打不开**：对应的服务可能尚未就绪或已经退出，在实例信息中确认 WebUI 仍在运行。"],[1279,"**界面状态**：后端的状态是已发送的问候，`{ \"greetings\": { \"rows\": [...] } }`。在“问候记录”面板中点击“问候”会发送 `ui.panel.action`；后端记下这条问候并用 `emit_state` 推送新状态，面板中写了 `\"source\": \"state\"` 和 `\"path\": \"greetings\"` 的表格随之更新，无需查询。视图用 `state()` 和 `onState()` 跟随同一份状态。"],[1313,"**看日志**：后端写到标准错误的内容和 `log.write` 都进入扩展的日志，在扩展卡片上点击“查看日志”。不要写到标准输出，那会破坏协议帧并使后端被判定为故障。"],[1278,"**视图**：`ui/status.html` 调用 `status`，后端用 `servers.status` 查询该实例的服务器并返回（因此需要 `permissions.instances = \"own-types\"`）。"],[2059,"**补丁、补丁集和功能**。可以查看和卸载已加载的补丁或补丁集。功能拥有的补丁集需通过关闭对应功能来卸载。要加载新的补丁集，在“配置”中设置 `control.patch_sets` 后重启 WebUI。若某项功能提示更改需要导入代码或加载补丁集，也在“配置”中修改后重启。"],[140,"**记忆。** 内置服务器的工具与其他 MCP 工具遵循相同的外部上下文设置。"],[2835,"**设置**：设置窗口中以扩展名称命名的分区。修改的值保存在扩展自己的存储中，不属于应用设置；只有扩展处于运行状态时可以读取和修改。"],[4111,"**访问警告**：某个子目录无权读取，扫描会继续处理其他目录。"],[2061,"**调试和连接**。可查看运行时事件、调整跟踪标签和严格模式。要在桌面端接收转发的事件，在“配置”中开启 `control.forward_events`。“连接”显示当前桌面连接的只读详情。"],[3268,"**警告和错误**：任务记录的警告显示在输出上方，最终错误显示在输出下方；"],[4109,"**路径冲突**：候选根目录、Python 或 Core 与现有实例重叠。"],[3170,"**路径分区的恢复默认**：只把默认路径填入输入框，仍需点击“保存”，避免未经确认就创建目录。"],[3267,"**输出**：任务的终端输出。运行中的任务会实时更新；"],[574,"**输出**：标准输出只用于协议，不能写入其他内容。标准错误写入扩展的日志 `backend.log`（超过 1 MiB 时轮转），`log.write` 也写入这里。用户在扩展卡片上点击“查看日志”可以看到最后 256 KiB。"],[1581,"**链接。** 点击 `MarkdownDocument` 中的链接不会让视图跳转，本身也不会打开任何东西：向 `frameUi` 传入 `openLink` 即可处理地址（http、https 或 mailto）。HTTP(S) 链接可交给视图客户端的 `openExternal(url)`，由系统浏览器打开。Markdown 源文本中的 HTML 会显示为文字。代码块上的复制按钮写入剪贴板，沙盒视图可能被拒绝，此时按钮保持不变。源文本中的图片不会加载：视图的策略只加载你的包内的图片。"],[1318,"**链接的扩展反复崩溃**：“重新加载”与“重试”一样会清除崩溃标记，因此仍然崩溃的后端在启动三次后会再次停止。"],[1853,"**随发布版本更新**。将 `update_url` 指向最新发布版的 `latest.json`，即可省略市场条目中的 `download_url`。安装时会从中选择适合当前平台和架构的最高版本，使用该版本的下载地址，并在提供 `sha256` 时校验压缩包。即使市场条目中还留着旧地址，安装也只使用 `latest.json`。读取失败或没有兼容包时会显示错误。"],[2836,"**面板与视图**：根据扩展的声明，出现在设置窗口中，或出现在该扩展类型实例的管理页面中“扩展”分组下。管理页面中的分区只对该扩展自己类型的实例显示。视图无法加载或停止响应时显示“不可用”，点击“重新加载”可以重试，不影响其他分区。"],[5801,"`__hanafubuki/ui-components.css`: their own styles; link it after `ui.css`."],[1555,"`__hanafubuki/ui-components.css`：组件自己的样式，在 `ui.css` 之后引入。"],[1071,"`__hanafubuki/ui.css` 提供的类，按组列出，并给出修饰类、属性和示例标记。"],[5800,"`__hanafubuki/ui.js`: the components. It imports only `./vue.js`, so import Vue from `../__hanafubuki/vue.js` too and the page has one Vue."],[1554,"`__hanafubuki/ui.js`：组件。它只导入 `./vue.js`，因此你的页面也从 `../__hanafubuki/vue.js` 导入 Vue，页面中就只有一个 Vue。"],[5799,"`__hanafubuki/vue.js`: Vue's runtime. It has no template compiler and the frame's policy allows no `eval`, so render with `h()`, or ship templates your own build compiled."],[1553,"`__hanafubuki/vue.js`：Vue 运行时。它不含模板编译器，视图的安全策略也不允许 `eval`，因此请用 `h()` 渲染，或提供由你自己的构建编译好的模板。"],[5839,"`--accent-fill`, `--accent-fill-hover`, `--accent-fill-pressed`, `--accent-text`"],[1593,"`--accent-fill`、`--accent-fill-hover`、`--accent-fill-pressed`、`--accent-text`"],[5853,"`--control-height-sm`, `--control-height-md`"],[1607,"`--control-height-sm`、`--control-height-md`"],[5845,"`--danger`, `--success`, `--warning`, `--info`"],[1599,"`--danger`、`--success`、`--warning`、`--info`"],[5841,"`--fill-card`, `--fill-layer`, `--fill-control`, `--fill-control-hover`, `--fill-control-pressed`, `--fill-subtle-hover`, `--fill-well`"],[1595,"`--fill-card`、`--fill-layer`、`--fill-control`、`--fill-control-hover`、`--fill-control-pressed`、`--fill-subtle-hover`、`--fill-well`"],[5849,"`--font-text`, `--font-mono`, `--font-size-caption`, `--font-size-body`, `--font-size-s