tains it on failure. For static types, `[[update.steps]]` run when a ready instance is updated (`install.steps` when none are declared). They run in order, and the first that fails fails the operation. The install progress names the current step and counts the finished ones."],[1285,"`[backend].command` 中每个系统的路径都有对应的程序，Linux 和 macOS 上的程序保留可执行权限；"],[1637,"`[backend]`"],[5883,"`[backend]`"],[1639,"`[contributes]`"],[5885,"`[contributes]`"],[1636,"`[dependencies]`"],[5882,"`[dependencies]`"],[1635,"`[engines]`"],[5881,"`[engines]`"],[5197,"`[environment]` applies to the type's `run` steps, its servers, and its terminal:"],[952,"`[environment]` 作用于类型的 `run` 步骤、服务器和终端："],[5275,"`[install]` sets fields of the base type's install form. The user's edits take precedence. A field the preset leaves out keeps the type's default, and the user fills any remaining required fields. Leave `secret` fields for the user to enter. Naming one in a preset makes that preset unusable, and **Save as preset** omits secret fields."],[1030,"`[install]` 设置基础类型安装表单的字段，用户的修改优先。预设未设置的字段保留类型的默认值，其余必填字段由用户填写。`secret` 字段留给用户输入。预设中填入这类字段会让该预设不可用，“另存为预设”也会跳过这类字段。"],[5276,"`[launch.values]` sets declared nonsecret launch fields for a new instance, e.g. `threads = 4`. Changing the preset affects future instances only."],[1031,"`[launch.values]` 为新实例指定非秘密的启动字段，例如 `threads = 4`。更改预设只影响之后创建的实例。"],[5277,"`[launch] arguments` replaces the type's default argument of the same name (`true` passes the option alone, a number or text passes it with that value, `false` removes it) and appends the others. Only built-in types take launch arguments."],[1032,"`[launch] arguments` 会替换类型中同名的默认参数（`true` 只传入该选项，数字或文本会连同该值一起传入，`false` 会移除它），其他参数追加在后面。只有内置类型接受启动参数。"],[5199,"`[management] operations` lists the management operations an instance offers beyond the standard lifecycle. A declarative type can declare `update` and `terminal`. With `update`, updating a ready instance runs `update.steps` (or `install.steps`); without it, its instances cannot be updated. With `terminal`, its instances offer a terminal in `core` with the type's environment."],[954,"`[management] operations` 列出实例提供的标准操作之外的管理操作。声明式类型可以声明 `update` 和 `terminal`。声明 `update` 后，已就绪实例的“更新”会执行 `update.steps`（或 `install.steps`）；不声明则不能更新。声明 `terminal` 后，实例提供以 `core` 为目录、带有类型环境的终端。"],[1638,"`[permissions]`"],[5884,"`[permissions]`"],[1640,"`[update]`"],[5886,"`[update]`"],[1412,"`{ \"lines\": [\"…\"] }`"],[5658,"`{ \"lines\": [\"…\"] }`"],[5655,"`{ \"rows\": [{ \"<column key>\": value }] }`"],[1409,"`{ \"rows\": [{ \"<列 key>\": 值 }] }`"],[5670,"`{ \"rows\": [{ \"id\": \"…\", \"title\": \"…\", \"description\": \"…\", \"status\": { \"label\": \"…\", \"severity\": \"success\" }, \"actions\": [\"<action id>\"] }] }`"],[1424,"`{ \"rows\": [{ \"id\": \"…\", \"title\": \"…\", \"description\": \"…\", \"status\": { \"label\": \"…\", \"severity\": \"success\" }, \"actions\": [\"<操作 id>\"] }] }`"],[1406,"`{ \"rows\": [{ \"label\": …, \"value\": … }] }`"],[5652,"`{ \"rows\": [{ \"label\": …, \"value\": … }] }`"],[5667,"`{ \"severity\": \"warning\", \"title\": \"…\", \"message\": \"…\" }`: `info`, `success`, `warning`, or `error`"],[1421,"`{ \"severity\": \"warning\", \"title\": \"…\", \"message\": \"…\" }`：`info`、`success`、`warning` 或 `error`"],[5679,"`{ \"text\": \"…\" }`: a spinner"],[1433,"`{ \"text\": \"…\" }`：加载指示"],[1427,"`{ \"text\": \"## Markdown\" }`"],[5673,"`{ \"text\": \"## Markdown\" }`"],[5676,"`{ \"title\": \"…\", \"text\": \"…\" }`: the \"nothing here\" state"],[1430,"`{ \"title\": \"…\", \"text\": \"…\" }`：“暂无内容”状态"],[5664,"`{ \"value\": 0.42, \"label\": \"…\" }`: `value` from 0 to 1; without a number the bar sweeps"],[1418,"`{ \"value\": 0.42, \"label\": \"…\" }`：`value` 从 0 到 1；不是数字时进度条显示为不确定"],[5177,"`{ allocate = true }` (the default), `{ fixed = 8080 }`, `{ param = \"<numeric install field>\" }`, or `{ launch = \"<numeric launch field>\" }`"],[932,"`{ allocate = true }`（默认，自动分配）、`{ fixed = 8080 }`、`{ param = \"<数值安装字段