e switches below as its input) and `pypi`, `github`, `huggingface`, each `{ enabled, custom }` (`custom` the user's own mirror URL or `null`; PyPI has none). Use `download.fetch` with an explicit `source` to apply the host mirror policy; `direct` keeps the supplied URL. A script doing its own networking must apply its own policy. `settings.get` answers the extension's settings values; `settings.patch {patch}` updates only its declared fields and returns canonical `{values}`; `storage.path` its data directory."],[680,"`host.info` 返回应用版本、协议版本、语言、平台（`linux`、`macos`、`windows`）、`instancesDir`（新实例默认所在的文件夹）和 `mirrors`（用户当前在设置中选择的下载镜像）：`automatic`（用户将镜像交给 `sd_webui_all_in_one` 自动检测，即其 `auto_mirror`，下面的开关作为它的输入）以及 `pypi`、`github`、`huggingface`，每项为 `{ enabled, custom }`（`custom` 为用户自己的镜像地址或 `null`；PyPI 没有自定义镜像）。通过 `download.fetch` 的显式 `source` 使用宿主镜像策略；`direct` 保留原始 URL。自行联网的脚本仍需自行应用策略。`settings.get` 返回扩展的设置值；`settings.patch {patch}` 只修改自身已声明字段并返回 canonical `{values}`；`storage.path` 返回数据目录。"],[4898,"`host.info`, `host.preferences`, `runtime.status`, `log.write`, `settings.get`, `settings.patch`, `storage.path`, `ui.notify`, `ui.progress`, `ui.prompt`, the notifications `ui.frame.emit` and `ui.emit`"],[653,"`host.info`、`host.preferences`、`runtime.status`、`log.write`、`settings.get`、`settings.patch`、`storage.path`、`ui.notify`、`ui.progress`、`ui.prompt`，以及通知 `ui.frame.emit` 和 `ui.emit`"],[1159,"`Host.initialize_params`"],[5403,"`Host.initialize_params`"],[5401,"`Host.notify`, `Host.log(level, message)`, `Host.emit_frame(frame, event, payload)`, `Host.emit_state(state)`"],[1157,"`Host.notify`、`Host.log(level, message)`、`Host.emit_frame(frame, event, payload)`、`Host.emit_state(state)`"],[4974,"`host.preferences {}` returns `{locale, instancesDir, mirrors, network}` without extra permission. Locale, the native instance directory, and mirrors have the same meanings and null defaults as `host.info`; `network` contains only `proxyMode` (`system`, `manual`, `disabled`) and `proxyConfigured`. Configured does not mean reachable or active. The snapshot contains no proxy URL or credentials and cannot change application settings."],[729,"`host.preferences {}` 无需额外权限，返回 `{locale, instancesDir, mirrors, network}`。语言、native 实例目录与镜像沿用 `host.info` 的含义及 null 默认值；`network` 仅包含 `proxyMode`（`system`、`manual`、`disabled`）和 `proxyConfigured`。已配置不代表代理有效或可达。快照不含代理 URL 或凭据，也不能修改应用设置。"],[1120,"`Host`"],[5364,"`Host`"],[5731,"`http://hfext.localhost/<extension id>/<path>`"],[1485,"`http://hfext.localhost/<扩展 ID>/<路径>`"],[4930,"`http.request` performs bounded UTF-8 HTTP through the host proxy. It accepts `url`, `method` (default `GET`; also `HEAD`, `POST`, `PUT`, `PATCH`, `DELETE`, `OPTIONS`), `headers` as repeated `{name, value}` entries, optional text `body`, `maxBytes`, and `timeoutMs`. Bounds can only reduce the host defaults shown in the generated reference. The response is `{status, headers, body}`; even HTTP 404/500 returns a normal response. Invalid input is `INVALID_PARAMS`, denied hosts are `PERMISSION_DENIED`, and transport, size or UTF-8 failures are `REQUEST_FAILED`. Binary files belong in `download.fetch`. No host credentials are automatically added."],[685,"`http.request` 通过宿主代理执行有界 UTF-8 HTTP。参数为 `url`、`method`（默认 `GET`，另支持 `HEAD`、`POST`、`PUT`、`PATCH`、`DELETE`、`OPTIONS`）、可重复的 `{name, value}` headers 列表、可选文本 `body`、`maxBytes` 和 `timeoutMs`。限额只能缩小生成参考中展示的宿主默认值。返回 `{status, headers, body}`；HTTP 404/500 也正常返回状态。无效输入为 `INVALID_PARAMS`，未授权主机为 `PERMISSION_DENIED`，网络、大小或 UTF-8 失败为 `REQUEST_FAILED`。二进制文件使用 `download.fetch`；请求不会自动注入宿主凭据。"],[4908,"`http.request`, `download.fetch`"],[663,"`http.request`、`download.fetch`"],[7064,"`http` or `https` only, with no user name or password in it; the download goes through the application's network and proxy settings"],[1693,"`id`"],[1783,"`id`"],[1832,"`id`"],[5939,"`id`"],[6029,"`id`"],[6078,"`id`"],[7911,"`ImportError`, `No module named`, or extension load failure"],[3572,"`ImportError`、`No module named`、扩展加载失败"],[5794,"`info-bar` with `data-severity` `error`, `warning`, `success`, or none for information, holding `info-bar__icon` (a 20px glyph of your own), `info-bar__text` (`info-bar__title`, `info-bar__message`), `info-bar__action`, and `info-bar__dismiss`; `progress-bar` (`role=\"progressbar\"`) holding `progress-bar__fill` whose `width` is the percentage, with `data-size=\"lg\"`, `data-tone` (`success`, `warning`, `danger`, `muted`), `indeterminate`, and `stepped`"],[1548,"`info-bar`，用 `data-severity` 取 `error`、`warning`、`success`，不设则为信息，内含 `info-bar__icon`（自备的 20px 图标）、`info-bar__text`（`info-bar__title`、`info-bar__message`）、`info-bar__action` 和 `info-bar__dismiss`；`progress-bar`（`role=\"progressbar\"`），内含 `progress-bar__fill`，其 `width` 为百分比，可加 `data-size=\"lg\"`、`data-tone`（`success`、`warning`、`danger`、`muted`）、`indeterminate` 和 `stepped`"],[1404,"`info`"],[5650,"`info`"],[1435,"`info` 只保留含 `label` 的行，`list` 只保留含 `title` 的行。`table` 接受对象行，按声明的列取值，缺列留空。每块最多保留前 500 行，日志保留最后 500 行。单元格中的 `null` 显示为空白，其他非文本值显示为 JSON，每格最多 2048 个字符。Markdown 最多 65536 个字符。进度值会限制到 0–1，非数字显示为不确定进度。未知的 severity 按 `info` 显示。"],[5819,"`InfoBar`, `InfoBarDetails`, `StatusBadge`, `ProgressBar`, `CornerStatusStack`, `RemovableTokenGroups`, `UpdateDot`, `UpdateHint`, `IconSwap`"],[1573,"`InfoBar`、`InfoBarDetails`、`StatusBadge`、`ProgressBar`、`CornerStatusStack`、`RemovableTokenGroups`、`UpdateDot`、`UpdateHint`、`IconSwap`"],[1131,"`initialize(host, params)`"],[5375,"`initialize(host, params)`"],[1160,"`initialize` 的参数"],[1079,"`initialize` 结果中的已知 hooks 从方法 registry 自动收集，包含 `diagnostics`。展开 `diagnostics.collect` 可查看文档字段及调用时限、数量和字节限制；运行时工具方法位于上方宿主接口。用法见 SDK 示例。"],[5666,"`inline`: `true` shows a badge beside the message instead of a bar"],[1420,"`inline`：为 `true` 时在消息旁显示徽标，而不是消息条"],[1175,"`install_plan(host, type_id, kind, values, instance, *, recreate_components)`"],[5419,"`install_plan(host, type_id, kind, values, instance, *, recreate_components)`"],[1084,"`install.steps` 和 `update.steps` 中每种步骤的键。"],[793,"`install`"],[5038,"`install`"],[4903,"`instances = \"own-types\"` or `\"all\"`; its own types' instances only"],[658,"`instances = \"own-types\"` 或 `\"all\"`；只涉及自己类型的实例"],[4901,"`instances = \"read\"` or `\"all\"`"],[656,"`instances = \"read\"` 或 `\"all\"`"],[675,"`instances.import`"],[4920,"`instances.import`"],[4927,"`instances.list` and `instances.get` answer read-only instances: `id`, `name`, `type`, `path`, `running`, and `components` (by name, each `{ path, external }`: the folder as the platform writes it, and whether it is a folder of the user's; empty when the instance's components cannot be resolved). Read them from `instances.get` in a frame's or panel's call, which names only the instance: they follow the user's Paths changes. `servers.status` answers each server role's `instanceId`, `role`, `status` (`stopped`, `starting`, `running`, `restarting`, `stopping`, `failed`), and `endpoint`."],[4900,"`instances.list`, `instances.get`"],[655,"`instances.list`、`instances.get`"],[682,"`instances.list`、`instances.get` 返回只读的实例信息：`id`、`name`、`type`、`path`、`running` 和 `components`（按组件名，每个为 `{ path, external }`：平台原生形式的文件夹，以及它是否为用户自己的文件夹；实例的组件无法解析时为空）。框架或面板的调用只带实例 id，请在其中通过 `instances.get` 读取组件：它们会跟随用户在“路径”中的修改。`servers.status` 返回每个服务器角色的 `instanceId`、`role`、`status`（`stopped`、`starting`、`running`、`restarting`、`stopping`、`failed`）和 `endpoint`。"],[4902,"`instances.ofType`, `instances.configuration`, `servers.status`"],[657,"`instances.ofType`、`instances.configuration`、`servers.status`"],[673,"`instances.scan`"],[4918,"`instances.scan`"],[4932,"`instances.scan` takes an absolute `path` and runs the application's instance discovery on that folder, as **Scan** does: it attaches the WebUI layouts it knows and every registered type's discovery signatures, and answers `attached` (the new instances' ids) and `warnings` (every result but a complete new instance, such as a folder that is already an instance, or a WebUI found without its Python, which is added but still needs installing; r