pes' instances and their servers; `all` both"],[2790,"`read` 允许调用只读工具。`confirm` 还允许请求修改，每次修改需你在主窗口确认"],[2775,"`read` 读取所有实例的基本信息；`own-types` 读取并跟踪自己类型的实例及其服务器状态；`all` 两者都有"],[933,"`readiness`"],[5178,"`readiness`"],[1491,"`ready()`"],[5737,"`ready()`"],[1841,"`reference`"],[6087,"`reference`"],[674,"`registerInstances = true`"],[4919,"`registerInstances = true`"],[4921,"`registerInstances = true`, and `instances = \"own-types\"` (its own types only) or `\"all\"` (any type); with `none` or `read` it is denied"],[676,"`registerInstances = true`，并且 `instances = \"own-types\"`（只能是自己的类型）或 `\"all\"`（任意类型）；为 `none` 或 `read` 时拒绝"],[1749,"`registerInstances`"],[5995,"`registerInstances`"],[619,"`REQUEST_FAILED`"],[4864,"`REQUEST_FAILED`"],[1137,"`request(host, method, params)`"],[1205,"`request(host, method, params)`"],[5381,"`request(host, method, params)`"],[5449,"`request(host, method, params)`"],[837,"`required`"],[941,"`required`"],[5082,"`required`"],[5186,"`required`"],[5627,"`required`, `default`"],[1381,"`required`、`default`"],[851,"`requiredWhen`"],[5096,"`requiredWhen`"],[1727,"`requirements`"],[5973,"`requirements`"],[937,"`restart`"],[5182,"`restart`"],[925,"`role`"],[5170,"`role`"],[1161,"`RpcError(code, message)`"],[5405,"`RpcError(code, message)`"],[1116,"`run_on(handler, reader, writer)`"],[5360,"`run_on(handler, reader, writer)`"],[1114,"`run(handler)`"],[1151,"`run(handler)`"],[5358,"`run(handler)`"],[5395,"`run(handler)`"],[909,"`run`"],[5154,"`run`"],[5361,"`run` over any pair of streams, for tests"],[5204,"`runtime = { kind = \"python\" }` and the `control` role: the management API serves the sections;"],[959,"`runtime = { kind = \"python\" }` 并声明 `control` 角色：这些管理页由管理 API 提供；"],[4978,"`runtime.resolve {tool}` requires `processes = true`. It waits for the host's existing preparation and returns `{tool, path, version}`; an unavailable module or failed preparation returns the real reason. Backend stop cancels the wait. SDK calls have no short client timer that truncates preparation. Use the returned native executable path with `process.run`; no tool deletion or runtime configuration API is exposed."],[733,"`runtime.resolve {tool}` 要求 `processes = true`。它等待宿主已有的准备流程，返回 `{tool, path, version}`；模块不可用或准备失败时返回实际原因。后端停止会取消等待。SDK 不用较短的客户端计时器截断准备。将返回的 native 可执行文件路径传给 `process.run` 即可使用工具；不开放删除工具或修改运行时配置的接口。"],[659,"`runtime.resolve`"],[4904,"`runtime.resolve`"],[4977,"`runtime.status {tool?}` reads the existing readiness snapshot without starting preparation. Omitting `tool` lists `python`, `git` and `micromamba`. Each item has `tool`, `status` (`notReady`, `preparing`, `ready`, `failed`, `unavailable`) and optional native `path`, verified `version`/command output and `error`. Reading needs no extra permission. A version is not guaranteed to be a semantic-version string."],[732,"`runtime.status {tool?}` 读取现有 readiness 快照，不启动准备。不传 `tool` 时列出 `python`、`git` 和 `micromamba`。每项包含 `tool`、`status`（`notReady`、`preparing`、`ready`、`failed`、`unavailable`），以及可选的 native `path`、已验证的版本或版本命令输出 `version`、`error`。读取无需额外权限，`version` 不保证是语义化版本字符串。"],[790,"`runtime`"],[5035,"`runtime`"],[1690,"`schema`"],[5936,"`schema`"],[6024,"`schema` (a panel) or `frame`"],[1778,"`schema`（面板）或 `frame`（视图）"],[4812,"`sdWebuiAllInOne = true` (optional) puts the application's own `sd_webui_all_in_one` library between the SDK and the requirements, so the script can `import sd_webui_all_in_one` (its downloader, archive extraction and the rest). The library is the application's integration code, not a stable SDK: pin the application versions you tested against with `engines.hanafubuki`."],[567,"`sdWebuiAllInOne = true`（可选）把应用自己的 `sd_webui_all_in_one` 库放在 SDK 和依赖目录之间，脚本因此可以 `import sd_webui_all_in_one`（使用它的下载器、解压等功能）。这个库是应用的集成代码，不是稳定的 SDK：请用 `engines.hanafubuki` 限定测试过的应用版本。"],[1729,"`sdWebuiAllInOne`"],[5975,"`sdWebuiAllInOne`"],[219,"`search_agent_memories`"],[4457,"`search_agent_memories`"],[861,"`secret` 字段只是在界面上隐藏输入内容，它的值与其他参数一起以文本形式保存在实例的记录中。"],[1374,"`select