`、`surface-layer`"],[1407,"`table`"],[5653,"`table`"],[5525,"`target/release/greeter` (`greeter.exe` on Windows) is both the backend and the instance's server. The package is `package/`: copy the program to `package/bin/`, then pack the contents of `package/` so that `hanafubuki-extension.toml` sits at the archive's root or inside its one directory. Either the folder or the archive installs from **Settings → Extensions**."],[1281,"`target/release/greeter`（Windows 上为 `greeter.exe`）既是后端，也是实例服务器。软件包是 `package/`：把程序复制到 `package/bin/`，再把 `package/` 的内容打包，使清单 `hanafubuki-extension.toml` 位于压缩包根目录或唯一的一层目录中。文件夹形式和压缩包都可以在设置窗口的“扩展”分区中安装。"],[1270,"`tests/greeter.rs`"],[5514,"`tests/greeter.rs`"],[5788,"`text-input` (on an `<input>`, a `<textarea>`, or a box wrapping one), `form-grid` (`span-all` for a full row), `field-help`, `field-error`, `panel-actions` (a row of buttons for a form), `checkbox` (on `<input type=\"checkbox\">`) in a `check-row` beside its words"],[1542,"`text-input`（用于 `<input>`、`<textarea>` 或包裹它们的容器）、`form-grid`（整行用 `span-all`）、`field-help`、`field-error`、`panel-actions`（表单底部的按钮行）、`checkbox`（用于 `<input type=\"checkbox\">`），与说明文字一起放在 `check-row` 中"],[616,"`TIMED_OUT`"],[4861,"`TIMED_OUT`"],[1522,"`timeout`"],[5768,"`timeout`"],[1785,"`title`"],[6031,"`title`"],[4934,"`tools.list` lists the management tools with the `management` level each needs; `tools.call` takes a tool's `name` and `arguments` and answers the tool's own result (Interface Reference lists them all). A change asks the user in the application's window (up to a minute) naming the extension, and is recorded in the Task Center, so call it from a thread of your own, never inside a frame or panel call the application waits on. It cannot restart the extension's own row or one it depends on. Check each tool’s `builtInOnly` flag. Tools in the versions, extensions, models, and environment sections also work on extension types that adopt the relevant built-in management section. `install_extension` installs an add-on inside a WebUI instance. `list_host_extensions` lists desktop extensions installed in Hanafubuki."],[689,"`tools.list` 列出管理工具及每个工具所需的 `management` 级别；`tools.call` 接受工具的 `name` 和 `arguments`，回答工具本身的结果（全部工具见接口参考）。修改会在应用窗口中以扩展的名义询问用户（最长一分钟），并记录到任务中心，因此请在自己的线程中调用，不要在应用等待的视图或面板调用中调用。它不能重启扩展自己的行或其依赖的扩展。按工具的 `builtInOnly` 标记判断适用范围。扩展实例类型采用内置管理能力并声明相应分区后，也能使用版本、扩展、模型和环境分区的工具。`install_extension` 给 WebUI 实例安装插件，`list_host_extensions` 列出 Hanafubuki 已安装的桌面扩展。"],[4922,"`tools.list`, `tools.call`"],[677,"`tools.list`、`tools.call`"],[7198,"`trace` may record length-limited Agent requests, reasoning or tool content, as well as path,\nenvironment, and command information. Enable it briefly only when explicitly needed. Restore\n**Info** after reproducing the problem, and inspect logs or diagnostic bundles for sensitive\ncontent before sharing."],[2896,"`trace` 可能记录经过长度限制的 Agent\n请求、推理或工具内容，以及路径、环境和命令信息。仅在明确需要时短时间开启；复现完成后恢复“信息”，并在分享日志或诊断包前检查敏感内容。"],[5187,"`true` by default. A required role that fails fails the start; an optional one that fails leaves the instance running degraded"],[5987,"`true` or `false`"],[5996,"`true` or `false`: it may add instances with `instances.scan` and `instances.import`"],[1741,"`true` 或 `false`"],[1750,"`true` 或 `false`：可以用 `instances.scan` 和 `instances.import` 添加实例"],[5028,"`true`: an instance only comes from discovery attaching an existing installation; the type is not offered for creation, and creating or importing one by hand is refused"],[4949,"`type`, `instance`"],[4946,"`type`, `kind` (`install`: a first install or a retry; `reinstall`: repeat installation; `update`: a ready instance's update), `recreateComponents` (selected component names), `values`, `instance`"],[4958,"`type`, `operation`, `instance`, `values` (validated form values, including defaults)"],[4952,"`type`, `role`, `port`, `values`, `launchValues`, `instance`"],[4955,"`type`, `values` (the instance's parameter values), `instance`"],[4943,"`type`, `values` (the parameter