`"],[5441,"`ui.state`; overriding it or `ui_call` announces the hook `ui`"],[1197,"`ui.state`；覆盖它或 `ui_call` 即声明 `ui` 钩子"],[1133,"`ui()`"],[5377,"`ui()`"],[643,"`ui`"],[1766,"`ui`"],[4888,"`ui`"],[6012,"`ui`"],[1122,"`Ui`"],[5366,"`Ui`"],[1772,"`ui` 中的每一项："],[5310,"`uiApiVersion` is the version of the components a frame may use (the component bundle, UI API). Within a version, components and optional props are only added; removing or renaming one raises it."],[1066,"`uiApiVersion` 是视图可用组件（组件包，UI API）的版本。同一版本内只会增加组件和可选属性；删除或重命名会提升版本。"],[1520,"`unavailable`"],[5766,"`unavailable`"],[622,"`UNAVAILABLE`"],[4867,"`UNAVAILABLE`"],[640,"`uninstall`"],[4885,"`uninstall`"],[900,"`unpack`"],[5145,"`unpack`"],[5166,"`unpack` and `download` with `unpackTo` also accept `replace = true`. Use it when an update archive should remove files left by the old version. The host extracts beside the target and swaps in the completed directory. It refuses replacement if the target contains another instance component. Without `replace`, unpacking into an existing directory keeps unrelated entries."],[921,"`unpack` 和指定 `unpackTo` 的 `download` 还支持 `replace = true`。当更新需要清除旧版本独有的文件时，可以使用该选项。宿主先在目标目录旁完成解包，再整体替换目标目录。如果其中包含实例的其他组件，宿主会拒绝替换。省略 `replace` 时，解包到已有目录会保留与本次解包无关的条目。"],[5198,"`unset` removes inherited variables by exact name or by prefix with a trailing `*`. Windows matches variable names without regard to case. An explicitly supplied variable can set the name again. The instance's own variables take precedence over `vars` and a step's or server's `env`. Each `path` entry starts at a component or the instance root. Use `{port}` only in the role's command or environment."],[953,"`unset` 按完整名称或带末尾 `*` 的前缀移除继承的变量。Windows 匹配变量名时忽略大小写。显式设置的同名变量仍会生效，实例自己的环境变量优先于 `vars` 以及步骤或服务器的 `env`。`path` 的每一项都从组件或实例根目录开始。`{port}` 仅用于服务器角色的命令或环境变量。"],[1850,"`update_url`"],[6096,"`update_url`"],[5248,"`update-check` puts its instances in the application's update check: the card's \"check for updates\" and the daily check ask the backend `provider.checkUpdate`, even while the instance runs, and an update it finds shows on the card and in Maintenance. It is not an operation of its own: the instance's management lists no button for it. Any type in an extension with a backend can declare it independently of `update`, including one with static install steps and server commands."],[1003,"`update-check` 让实例参与应用的更新检查：卡片上的“检查更新”和每日检查会调用后端的 `provider.checkUpdate`（实例运行时也会调用），发现的更新显示在卡片上，以及实例管理的“维护”页。它不是自己的操作：实例管理中不会为它列出按钮。有后端的扩展可以单独声明这项能力，同时可以保留静态安装步骤和服务命令。"],[796,"`update`"],[5041,"`update`"],[1507,"`updateInstance(values, mode?)`"],[5753,"`updateInstance(values, mode?)`"],[1790,"`url`"],[6036,"`url`"],[5149,"`url`, `into`, optional `branch`"],[5143,"`url`, `sha256`, and one of `to` or `unpackTo`"],[5164,"`url`, optional `timeoutSeconds` (60 by default)"],[919,"`url`，可选 `timeoutSeconds`（默认 60）"],[904,"`url`、`into`，可选 `branch`"],[898,"`url`、`sha256`，以及 `to` 或 `unpackTo` 之一"],[1172,"`validate_spec(host, type_id, values, *, instance=None)`"],[5416,"`validate_spec(host, type_id, values, *, instance=None)`"],[5239,"`values` are checked against your install parameters at registration: an unknown parameter or a required one without value or default is an issue at `discovery[<index>].values`. The others take their defaults."],[994,"`values` 在注册时按安装参数检查：未知参数，或既无值也无默认值的必填参数，都会在 `discovery[<序号>].values` 处报告问题。其余参数取默认值。"],[1699,"`version`"],[1810,"`version`"],[5945,"`version`"],[6056,"`version`"],[965,"`versions`"],[5210,"`versions`"],[849,"`visibleWhen`"],[5094,"`visibleWhen`"],[860,"`visibleWhen` 不成立的字段会丢失其值；必填（或 `requiredWhen` 成立）且显示的字段没有值时会被拒绝。"],[5629,"`visibleWhen`, `requiredWhen`, `disabledWhen`, `disabledReason`"],[1383,"`visibleWhen`、`requiredWhen`、`disabledWhen`、`disabledReason`"],[939,"`webview`"],[5184,"`webview`"],[6063,"`windows`, `linux`, `macos`, or `any`"],[1817,"`windows`、`linux`、`macos` 或 `any`"],[915,"`write-file`"],[5160,"`write-file`"],[6065,"`x86_64`, `aarch64`, or `any`