orresponding typed methods:"],[5470,"Rust implements `Diagnostics::collect(&self, host) -> Result<DiagnosticsCollectResult, RpcError>` and returns `Some(self)` from `Handler::diagnostics()`. The SDK adds the hook even with a custom initialize result and dispatches collection to the trait. Without a provider, the method follows the ordinary request handler. Document names are single filenames; return only your own diagnostic text and no credentials. The host enforces the limits shown in the generated reference."],[5463,"Rust reads with `host.settings()` and writes with `host.settings_patch(&SettingsPatchParams { patch })`. Python uses `host.settings_get()` and `host.settings_patch({\"patch\": {...}})`. Both return `{values}`. No extension id or extra permission is accepted: the host binds the caller to its own settings."],[5465,"Rust uses `host.host_preferences() -> Result<HostPreferences, RpcError>`; Python uses `host.host_preferences() -> HostPreferences`. `HostPreferences` is also the `preferences` event's data type. These are read-only projections; a custom frame continues to use the existing theme/locale notifications."],[1217,"Rust 使用 `Host::http_request(&HttpRequestParams)`、`download_fetch(&DownloadFetchParams)`、`process_run(&ProcessRunParams)`；类型由 `protocol` 重导出。Python 的同名方法使用 `hanafubuki_extension.protocol` 中的 typed dict 参数和结果。省略可选字段可使用宿主默认值；SDK 不复制宿主校验。"],[1221,"Rust 使用 `host.host_preferences() -> Result<HostPreferences, RpcError>`；Python 使用 `host.host_preferences() -> HostPreferences`。`HostPreferences` 也是 `preferences` 事件的 data 类型。这是只读投影；自定义 frame 继续使用已有 theme/locale 通知。"],[1226,"Rust 实现 `Diagnostics::collect(&self, host) -> Result<DiagnosticsCollectResult, RpcError>`，并从 `Handler::diagnostics()` 返回 `Some(self)`。即使自定义 initialize 结果，SDK 也会加入该 hook，并把采集交给 trait；没有 provider 时仍交给普通 request handler。文档名只能是单个文件名，只返回自己的诊断文本，不含凭据。宿主执行生成参考展示的限制。"],[1223,"Rust 提供 `host.runtime_status(&RuntimeStatusParams { tool: None })` 与 `host.runtime_resolve(&RuntimeResolveParams { tool: RuntimeTool::Python })`，结果分别为 `RuntimeStatusResult` 和 `RuntimeResolveResult`。Python 使用对应的 typed 方法："],[1219,"Rust 用 `host.settings()` 读取，用 `host.settings_patch(&SettingsPatchParams { patch })` 写入。Python 用 `host.settings_get()` 和 `host.settings_patch({\"patch\": {...}})`。两者都返回 `{values}`。不接受扩展 ID，也不需要额外权限：宿主将调用者绑定到自己的设置。"],[3795,"RVC Next WebUI"],[3948,"RVC Next WebUI"],[8139,"RVC Next WebUI"],[8292,"RVC Next WebUI"],[4721,"Safely cleaning up background commands"],[7479,"Save behavior"],[6312,"Save Configuration"],[7175,"Save logs to files"],[7486,"Save progress and results appear in the lower-right corner of the settings window. If saving is rejected, the input remains on the page. Complete or correct the field according to the error; click **Discard** if you do not want to continue editing."],[7520,"Save the log"],[7658,"Save the new version or source."],[6303,"Save versus apply"],[6802,"Saved secrets are masked by default. Use the control beside a field to reveal its value. Editing other fields preserves the saved secret. A failed save keeps the draft."],[7481,"Saves automatically after selection"],[7483,"Saves automatically when you press `Enter` or leave the input"],[6945,"Saves one snapshot with packages per day for each ready built-in WebUI. Extension-provided types do not take part in automatic snapshots. See Snapshot Management."],[6787,"Saving and scope of effect"],[6346,"Saving and validation"],[7086,"Scan a directory and register discovered instances. Importing a particular type also requires `own-types` for the extension's types or `all` for any registered type."],[8416,"Scan for Existing WebUIs"],[8419,"Scan steps"],[8261,"Scan system"],[8417,"Scan the computer or a selected folder to discover and attach existing WebUIs automatically."],[8436,"Scanning and attachment only read existing files and write instance records. Installing an\ninstance that is **Awaiting installation** runs the complete installer against the discovered Core\nand may downlo