e the manual installer list. The list shows packages for your platform and marks the recommended option. Clicking Download opens the release address in your system browser."],[8284,"Simplified image-generation flow"],[8562,"Situation"],[6112,"Skill and server ids use ASCII letters, digits, dots, underscores and hyphens and must be unique within their contribution kind. Exclude `.` and `..`, and start Skill ids with a character other than a dot. The host generates a linked package under the extension's managed `agent-package` directory. Its package id is `hanafubuki-extension-<extension-id>@hanafubuki-extensions` and MCP server ids are `hanafubuki-extension-<extension-id>-<local-id>`. The complete MCP server id must fit in 128 bytes. Conflicts with a package owned by the user are refused. The Agent retains its normal tool approval and exposure rules."],[456,"Skill 中的说明和脚本可以引导 Agent\n执行命令、修改文件或调用外部工具。只安装可信来源，并在更新后重新检查差异和依赖。"],[361,"Skill 可以建议或调用工具，但不会继承超出当前权限的能力。"],[429,"Skill 可以指导 Agent 处理特定任务，但不会绕过会话模式、工具策略和权限审批。"],[1866,"Skill 和服务器的 ID 由 ASCII 字母、数字、点、下划线或连字符组成，各自在同类贡献中唯一。`.` 和 `..` 不可用，Skill ID 的首字符也不能是点。宿主在扩展托管的 `agent-package` 目录生成链接包。包 ID 为 `hanafubuki-extension-<extension-id>@hanafubuki-extensions`，MCP 服务器 ID 为 `hanafubuki-extension-<extension-id>-<local-id>`，完整服务器 ID 最长 128 字节。遇到用户拥有的同名包会拒绝覆盖。Agent 原有的工具审批和可见性规则继续生效。"],[428,"Skill 是一个包含 `SKILL.md` 的目录，其 YAML frontmatter 给出名称，并说明何时使用它。目录中的其他内容——引用资料、脚本、资源、许可证——都是支持材料。这就是全部格式，与 Claude 和 Codex 读取的格式一致，因此能在那里安装的包也能在这里安装。"],[421,"Skill 来自哪里"],[419,"Skills"],[4662,"Skills"],[7030,"Skills and MCP servers for the built-in Agent, subject to the Agent's tool approval settings"],[5921,"Skills and MCP servers made available to the built-in Agent"],[4687,"Skills supplied by enabled Agent packages, including those contributed by desktop extensions"],[7405,"Skip system Git and always use the application-managed Git"],[8449,"Skipped"],[8481,"Snapshot format"],[6629,"Snapshot Management"],[8222,"Snapshot type or platform mismatch"],[7234,"Snapshots"],[6936,"Snapshots and update checks wait for each other"],[6642,"Snapshots usually do not include models, generated images, arbitrary user files, or a complete\ncopy of uncommitted code. Back up this content separately before high-risk operations."],[6995,"Some older drivers, CUDA versions, or particular WebUI combinations may be incompatible."],[7928,"Some SD Note instructions target the Huishi Launcher. The root cause and upstream remedy may still\nbe relevant, but version, extension, PyTorch, terminal, proxy, and environment operations must be\nperformed on the corresponding Hanafubuki pages. Do not copy another launcher's managed\ndirectories or directly run its launcher-specific repair commands."],[6658,"Some snapshots mark an option as “Required.” Restoration cannot begin until every required option is enabled."],[8506,"Some system and environment information"],[6579,"Some types offer **Installed by this instance** and **An existing one of yours** under Component Paths. Selecting the latter marks the component as external so deleting the instance preserves it. If the field asks for a program, select the specified executable. The app verifies it and records the corresponding component directory."],[8553,"Some WebUIs serve more than one page on separate ports. SD Trainer Next, for example, has a separate training monitor alongside its main page. Such an instance is still one tab, and its pages are listed beneath it:"],[7055,"Source"],[7400,"Source"],[7551,"Source"],[8249,"Source"],[8273,"Source"],[5850,"Spacing"],[7704,"SSL or certificate error"],[3375,"SSL 或证书错误"],[3759,"Stable Diffusion WebUI"],[3930,"Stable Diffusion WebUI"],[8103,"Stable Diffusion WebUI"],[8274,"Stable Diffusion WebUI"],[8240,"Stable Diffusion WebUI variants"],[3896,"Stable Diffusion WebUI 变体"],[8154,"Stable Diffusion WebUI, ComfyUI, Fooocus, SD Trainer, Qwen TTS, RVC Next, and Mizuoto TTS use **PyTorch build**."],[8159,"Stable Diffusion WebUI, Fooocus, and SD Traine