duces the same error and adds cleanup work."],[8304,"Submodules"],[8349,"Submodules"],[8366,"Submodules"],[4975,"Subscribe to the `preferences` topic with `events.subscribe`, then read the current snapshot with `host.preferences`. Each matching `event` carries the complete same typed snapshot in `params.data`. A successful related host settings change publishes it; a proxy address change also publishes when the public fields are unchanged. An unrelated or failed settings save does not. Restarted backends subscribe and read again; there is no replay. `settings` continues to refer only to the extension's own settings."],[6686,"Subscribe to the existing session, restore retained output, and continue receiving new output"],[6188,"Suitable for managed deployment; does not participate in in-app updates"],[4892,"Supplies documents when the user collects diagnostics, through `diagnostics.collect`"],[7334,"Supported protocols are `http`, `https`, `socks`, `socks4`, `socks4a`, `socks5`, and `socks5h`. An address containing only `127.0.0.1`, no port, or a protocol such as `ftp` is rejected."],[8239,"Supported variants"],[8238,"Supported WebUIs"],[5789,"Surfaces"],[6938,"Switch"],[8539,"Switch"],[6288,"Switch a Git-based extension to a specified branch or commit"],[8511,"Switch between, open, and close WebUIs from the tab manager in the title bar, and move between the pages of one instance."],[6695,"Switch preset repositories and branches on supported instances, and synchronize reinstallation configuration."],[4266,"Switch to a subagent or inspect background agents and terminals"],[8515,"Switch to another page"],[4555,"Switch to Default mode or use **Implement plan** when the solution is clear and you want it carried out."],[6696,"Switch variants"],[7480,"Switch, dropdown"],[8566,"Switching between pages of the same instance"],[7146,"Switching languages"],[8564,"Switching to another instance or workspace"],[6715,"Switching variants may replace the remote repository and forcibly