,"When enabled, the application freezes an instance list at the start of collection and processes each instance in order. Instances created during collection are not appended. If an instance is inaccessible, undergoing maintenance, or has been replaced, the diagnostic manifest records the issue without discarding other content already collected."],[7168,"When file persistence is enabled, logs are written to the `logs` folder in the application data directory:"],[6976,"When instance collection is enabled, instance snapshots, environment reports, tasks, and runtime state."],[6422,"When it finishes, check launch arguments, versions, extensions, and PyTorch before launching the\nWebUI."],[7170,"When it reaches the size limit, it is renamed with a UTC timestamp and a new file continues recording."],[6824,"When it runs"],[7443,"When on, all instances use a shared store. Visiting the same site from another instance can reuse its saved sign-in. When off, each instance has its own cache, cookies, and site data."],[7441,"When on, returning to the workspace finds the page exactly as you left it, including unsubmitted input and scroll position, without reloading. When off, leaving the workspace closes the page and returning reloads it. The WebUI itself keeps running either way."],[7923,"When package-inspection commands are necessary, run them in the instance terminal. Do not modify\nthe instance environment from the generic application terminal."],[8518,"When pages are kept or closed"],[5549,"When reloading a linked folder, keep the following in mind."],[7813,"When searching, combine the exception description, WebUI name, extension name, and version.\nPreserve the complete traceback when asking for help."],[6426,"When selecting **Delete instance**, check every directory listed for deletion and any external\ncomponents listed to be kept."],[6554,"When status is “Awaiting Launch Decision,” handle the current decision before creating another launch task."],[7275,"When the applicat